# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><blockquote><p>
#: build/html/eintr/About-the-Author.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Robert J. Chassell (1946&ndash;2017) started working with GNU Emacs in "
"1985.  He wrote and edited, taught Emacs and Emacs Lisp, and spoke "
"throughout the world on software freedom.  Chassell was a founding Director "
"and Treasurer of the Free Software Foundation, Inc.  He was co-author of the "
"<cite class=\"cite\">Texinfo</cite> manual, and edited more than a dozen "
"other books.  He graduated from Cambridge University, in England.  He had an "
"abiding interest in social and economic history and flew his own airplane."
msgstr ""
"ロバート・J・チャセル（1946&ndash;2017）は、1985年にGNU Emacsに携わり始めた。"
"執筆や編集を行い、EmacsおよびEmacs Lispを教え、ソフトウェアの自由について世界"
"各地で講演した。チャセルはフリーソフトウェア財団（Free Software Foundation, "
"Inc.）の創設理事兼会計責任者を務めた。<cite class=\"cite\">Texinfo</cite>マ"
"ニュアルの共著者であり、他にも12冊以上の書籍を編集した。イングランドのケンブ"
"リッジ大学を卒業した。社会史および経済史に深い関心を持ち、自家用機を操縦して"
"いた。"

