# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Accumulate.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Another recursive pattern is called the <code class=\"code\">accumulate</"
"code> pattern.  In the <code class=\"code\">accumulate</code> recursive "
"pattern, an action is performed on every element of a list and the result of "
"that action is accumulated with the results of performing the action on the "
"other elements."
msgstr ""
"もう一つの再帰パターンは、<code class=\"code\">accumulate</code> パターンと呼"
"ばれます。<code class=\"code\">accumulate</code> 再帰パターンでは、リストの各"
"要素に対して処理が行われ、その処理結果が他の要素に対する処理結果と累積されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Accumulate.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This is very like the <code class=\"code\">every</code> pattern using <code "
"class=\"code\">cons</code>, except that <code class=\"code\">cons</code> is "
"not used, but some other combiner."
msgstr ""
"これは、<code class=\"code\">cons</code>を用いた<code class=\"code\">every</"
"code>パターンに非常によく似ていますが、<code class=\"code\">cons</code>ではな"
"く別のコンバイナーが使われている点が異なります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Accumulate.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The pattern is:"
msgstr "パターンは以下の通りです："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Accumulate.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "If a list be empty, return zero or some other constant."
msgstr "リストが空の場合は、0またはその他の定数を返す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Accumulate.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Else, act on the beginning of the list (the <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> "
"of the list),"
msgstr ""
"そうでない場合は、リストの先頭（リストの<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>）に対"
"して処理を行います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Accumulate.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"and combine that acted-on element, using <code class=\"code\">+</code> or "
"some other combining function, with"
msgstr ""
"そして、その適用済み要素を <code class=\"code\">+</code> やその他の結合関数を"
"用いて、～と結合します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Accumulate.html build/html/eintr/Keep.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"a recursive call by the function on the rest (the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</"
"small>) of the list."
msgstr ""
"関数によるリストの残り部分（<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>）への再帰呼び出"
"し。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
