"<span>C.4.5 Another Bug &hellip; Most Insidious<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Another-Bug-_2026-Most-Insidious\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>C.4.5 別のバグ &hellip; 最も陰湿な<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Another-Bug-_2026-Most-Insidious\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Another-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Bug_002c-most-insidious-type\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Insidious-type-of-bug\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Bug_002c-most-insidious-type\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Insidious-type-of-bug\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Another-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"I said &ldquo;almost ready to print&rdquo;! Of course, there is a bug in the "
"<code class=\"code\">print-graph</code> function &hellip; It has a <code "
"class=\"code\">vertical-step</code> option, but not a <code "
"class=\"code\">horizontal-step</code> option.  The <code class=\"code\">top-"
"of-range</code> scale goes from 10 to 300 by tens.  But the <code "
"class=\"code\">print-graph</code> function will print only by ones."
msgstr ""
"「ほぼ印刷できる状態だ」って言っただろ！もちろん、<code class=\"code\">print-"
"graph</code>関数にはバグがあって……<code class=\"code\">vertical-step</code>オ"
"プションはあるけど、<code class=\"code\">horizontal-step</code>オプションはな"
"いんだ。<code class=\"code\">top-of-range</code>スケールは10刻みで10から300ま"
"でだ。でも<code class=\"code\">print-graph</code>関数は1刻みでしか印刷しな"
"い。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Another-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This is a classic example of what some consider the most insidious type of "
"bug, the bug of omission.  This is not the kind of bug you can find by "
"studying the code, for it is not in the code; it is an omitted feature.  "
"Your best actions are to try your program early and often; and try to "
"arrange, as much as you can, to write code that is easy to understand and "
"easy to change.  Try to be aware, whenever you can, that whatever you have "
"written, <em class=\"emph\">will</em> be rewritten, if not soon, "
"eventually.  A hard maxim to follow."
msgstr ""
"これは、一部で最も陰湿なバグの種類とされる「記載漏れ」というバグの典型的な例"
"です。これはコードを精査しても見つかる類のものではなく、コードの中に存在する"
"のではなく、機能が書き漏らされているためです。最善の策は、プログラムを早い段"
"階から頻繁にテストすること、そして可能な限り、理解しやすく変更しやすいコード"
"を書くよう心がけることです。また、書き上げたものは何であれ、すぐにではなくと"
"もいずれは<em class=\"emph\">書き直されることになる</em>ということを、可能な"
"限り意識するようにしてください。守るのが難しい格言です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Another-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"It is the <code class=\"code\">print-X-axis-numbered-line</code> function "
"that needs the work; and then the <code class=\"code\">print-X-axis</code> "
"and the <code class=\"code\">print-graph</code> functions need to be "
"adapted.  Not much needs to be done; there is one nicety: the numbers ought "
"to line up under the tic marks.  This takes a little thought."
msgstr ""
"修正が必要なのは<code class=\"code\">print-X-axis-numbered-line</code>関数"
"で、その上で<code class=\"code\">print-X-axis</code>と<code "
"class=\"code\">print-graph</code>関数も調整する必要があります。大がかりな作業"
"は必要ありませんが、一点だけ細かい注意点があります。数値を目盛りの下に合わせ"
"ることです。これには少し工夫が必要です。"

