#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/eintr/Args-as-Variable-or-List.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>1.8.2 An Argument as the Value of a Variable or List<a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#An-Argument-as-the-Value-of-a-Variable-or-"
"List\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>1.8.2 変数またはリストの値としての引数<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#An-Argument-as-the-Value-of-a-Variable-or-List\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Args-as-Variable-or-List.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"An argument can be a symbol that returns a value when it is evaluated.  For "
"example, when the symbol <code class=\"code\">fill-column</code> by itself "
"is evaluated, it returns a number.  This number can be used in an addition."
msgstr ""
"引数は、評価時に値を返すシンボルである場合があります。例えば、シンボル <code "
"class=\"code\">fill-column</code> を単独で評価すると、数値が返されます。この"
"数値は加算に使用できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Args-as-Variable-or-List.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Position the cursor after the following expression and type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd>:"
msgstr ""
"次の式の後にカーソルを置き、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd> と入力します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Args-as-Variable-or-List.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(+ 2 fill-column)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Args-as-Variable-or-List.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The value will be a number two more than what you get by evaluating <code "
"class=\"code\">fill-column</code> alone.  For me, this is 74, because my "
"value of <code class=\"code\">fill-column</code> is 72."
msgstr ""
"その値は、<code class=\"code\">fill-column</code> だけを評価して得られる値よ"
"り 2 大きい数値になります。私の場合、<code class=\"code\">fill-column</code> "
"の値が 72 なので、これは 74 になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Args-as-Variable-or-List.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"As we have just seen, an argument can be a symbol that returns a value when "
"evaluated.  In addition, an argument can be a list that returns a value when "
"it is evaluated.  For example, in the following expression, the arguments to "
"the function <code class=\"code\">concat</code> are the strings <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;The&nbsp;&quot;</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;&nbsp;red&nbsp;foxes.&quot;</code> and the list <code "
"class=\"code\">(number-to-string (+ 2 fill-column))</code>."
msgstr ""
"先ほど見たように、引数は評価時に値を返すシンボルである場合があります。また、"
"引数は評価時に値を返すリストである場合もあります。例えば、次の式では、関数 "
"<code class=\"code\">concat</code> の引数は文字列 <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;The&nbsp;&quot;</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;&nbsp;red&nbsp;foxes.&quot;</code>、およびリスト <code "
"class=\"code\">(number-to-string (+ 2 fill-column))</code> です。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Args-as-Variable-or-List.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(concat &quot;The &quot; (number-to-string (+ 2 fill-column)) &quot; red foxes.&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Args-as-Variable-or-List.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If you evaluate this expression&mdash;and if, as with my Emacs, <code "
"class=\"code\">fill-column</code> evaluates to 72&mdash;<code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;The 74 red foxes.&quot;</code> will appear in the echo "
"area.  (Note that you must put spaces after the word &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">The</samp>&rsquo; and before the word &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">red</samp>&rsquo; so they will appear in the final string.  "
"The function <code class=\"code\">number-to-string</code> converts the "
"integer that the addition function returns to a string.  <code "
"class=\"code\">number-to-string</code> is also known as <code "
"class=\"code\">int-to-string</code>.)"
msgstr ""
"この式を評価すると――私のEmacsと同様に <code class=\"code\">fill-column</"
"code> が 72 と評価される場合――エコーエリアに <code class=\"code\">&quot;The "
"74 red foxes.&quot;</code> が表示されます。（なお、最終的な文字列に含めるに"
"は、単語 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">The</samp>&rsquo; の後と単語 &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">red</samp>&rsquo; の前にスペースを入れる必要がある点に注"
"意してください。関数 <code class=\"code\">number-to-string</code> は、加算関"
"数が返す整数を文字列に変換します。<code class=\"code\">number-to-string</"
"code> は <code class=\"code\">int-to-string</code> としても知られています。）"

