# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/eintr/Body-of-current_002dkill.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>The Body of <code class=\"code\">current-kill</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-Body-of-current_002dkill\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span><code class=\"code\">current-kill</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#The-Body-of-current_002dkill\"> &para;</a> の本文</span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Body-of-current_002dkill.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The body of the function definition is a <code class=\"code\">let</code> "
"expression, which itself has a body as well as a <var class=\"var\">varlist</"
"var>."
msgstr ""
"関数定義の本体は<code class=\"code\">let</code>式であり、この式自体も本体と"
"<var class=\"var\">varlist</var>を持っています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Body-of-current_002dkill.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">let</code> expression declares a variable that will "
"be only usable within the bounds of this function.  This variable is called "
"<code class=\"code\">interprogram-paste</code> and is for copying to another "
"program.  It is not for copying within this instance of GNU Emacs.  Most "
"window systems provide a facility for interprogram pasting.  Sadly, that "
"facility usually provides only for the last element.  Most windowing systems "
"have not adopted a ring of many possibilities, even though Emacs has "
"provided it for decades."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">let</code> という式は、この関数の範囲内でのみ使用可能な"
"変数を宣言します。この変数は <code class=\"code\">interprogram-paste</code> "
"と呼ばれ、別のプログラムへコピーするためのものです。この GNU Emacs のインスタ"
"ンス内でコピーするためのものではありません。ほとんどのウィンドウシステムに"
"は、プログラム間での貼り付け機能が備わっています。残念ながら、その機能は通"
"常、最後の要素に対してのみ提供されています。Emacs が数十年にわたって提供して"
"きたにもかかわらず、ほとんどのウィンドウシステムは、多様な選択肢を備えたリン"
"グ方式を採用していません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Body-of-current_002dkill.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">if</code> expression has two parts, one if there "
"exists <code class=\"code\">interprogram-paste</code> and one if not."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">if</code> 式は、<code class=\"code\">interprogram-"
"paste</code> が存在する場合と存在しない場合の2つの部分から構成されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Body-of-current_002dkill.html
msgid ""
"Let us consider the else-part of the <code class=\"code\">current-kill</"
"code> function.  (The then-part uses the <code class=\"code\">kill-new</"
"code> function, which we have already described.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"kill_002dnew-function.html\">The <code class=\"code\">kill-new</code> "
"function</a>.)"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">current-kill</code> 関数の else 部分について考えてみま"
"しょう。（then 部分では、すでに説明した <code class=\"code\">kill-new</code> "
"関数を使用しています。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"kill_002dnew-"
"function.html\"><code class=\"code\">kill-new</code> 関数</a>を参照してくださ"
"い。）"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Body-of-current_002dkill.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(or kill-ring (error &quot;Kill ring is empty&quot;))\n"
"(let ((ARGth-kill-element\n"
"       (nthcdr (mod (- n (length kill-ring-yank-pointer))\n"
"                    (length kill-ring))\n"
"               kill-ring)))\n"
"  (or do-not-move\n"
"      (setq kill-ring-yank-pointer ARGth-kill-element))\n"
"  (car ARGth-kill-element))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Body-of-current_002dkill.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The code first checks whether the kill ring has content; otherwise it "
"signals an error."
msgstr ""
"コードはまず、キルリングに内容があるかを確認し、ない場合はエラーを通知しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Body-of-current_002dkill.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Note that the <code class=\"code\">or</code> expression is very similar to "
"testing length with an <code class=\"code\">if</code>:"
msgstr ""
"なお、<code class=\"code\">or</code> 式は、<code class=\"code\">if</code> で"
"長さを判定する場合と非常によく似ています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Body-of-current_002dkill.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-zerop\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-error\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-zerop\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-error\"></a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Body-of-current_002dkill.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(if (zerop (length kill-ring))          ; <span class=\"r\">if-part</span>\n"
"    (error &quot;Kill ring is empty&quot;))       ; <span class=\"r\">then-part</span>\n"
"  ;; No else-part\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Body-of-current_002dkill.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If there is not anything in the kill ring, its length must be zero and an "
"error message sent to the user: &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Kill ring is "
"empty</samp>&rsquo;.  The <code class=\"code\">current-kill</code> function "
"uses an <code class=\"code\">or</code> expression which is simpler.  But an "
"<code class=\"code\">if</code> expression reminds us what goes on."
msgstr ""
"キルリングに何も入っていない場合、その長さは0でなければならず、ユーザーにエ"
"ラーメッセージ &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Kill ring is empty</samp>&rsquo; "
"が送信されます。<code class=\"code\">current-kill</code> 関数では、よりシンプ"
"ルな <code class=\"code\">or</code> 式が使用されています。しかし、<code "
"class=\"code\">if</code> 式を見れば、どのような処理が行われているかが分かりま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Body-of-current_002dkill.html
msgid ""
"This <code class=\"code\">if</code> expression uses the function <code "
"class=\"code\">zerop</code> which returns true if the value it is testing is "
"zero.  When <code class=\"code\">zerop</code> tests true, the then-part of "
"the <code class=\"code\">if</code> is evaluated.  The then-part is a list "
"starting with the function <code class=\"code\">error</code>, which is a "
"function that is similar to the <code class=\"code\">message</code> function "
"(see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"message.html\">The <code "
"class=\"code\">message</code> Function</a>) in that it prints a one-line "
"message in the echo area.  However, in addition to printing a message, <code "
"class=\"code\">error</code> also stops evaluation of the function within "
"which it is embedded.  This means that the rest of the function will not be "
"evaluated if the length of the kill ring is zero."
msgstr ""
"この <code class=\"code\">if</code> 式は、判定対象の値が 0 の場合に true を返"
"す関数 <code class=\"code\">zerop</code> を使用しています。<code "
"class=\"code\">zerop</code> が true と判定されると、<code class=\"code\">if</"
"code> の then 部分が評価されます。then 部分は関数 <code "
"class=\"code\">error</code> から始まるリストであり、この関数はエコー領域に1行"
"のメッセージを出力するという点で <code class=\"code\">message</code> 関数"
"（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"message.html\"><code class=\"code\">message</"
"code> 関数</a> を参照）に似ています。ただし、<code class=\"code\">error</"
"code> はメッセージを出力するだけでなく、自身が埋め込まれている関数の評価も停"
"止させます。つまり、キルリングの長さが 0 の場合、その関数の残りの部分は評価さ"
"れません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Body-of-current_002dkill.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Then the <code class=\"code\">current-kill</code> function selects the "
"element to return.  The selection depends on the number of places that <code "
"class=\"code\">current-kill</code> rotates and on where <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-ring-yank-pointer</code> points."
msgstr ""
"次に、<code class=\"code\">current-kill</code>関数が返す要素を選択します。選"
"択は、<code class=\"code\">current-kill</code>が回転する箇所の数と、<code "
"class=\"code\">kill-ring-yank-pointer</code>が指す位置によって決まります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Body-of-current_002dkill.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Next, either the optional <code class=\"code\">do-not-move</code> argument "
"is true or the current value of <code class=\"code\">kill-ring-yank-pointer</"
"code> is set to point to the list.  Finally, another expression returns the "
"first element of the list even if the <code class=\"code\">do-not-move</"
"code> argument is true."
msgstr ""
"次に、オプションの <code class=\"code\">do-not-move</code> 引数が true である"
"か、あるいは <code class=\"code\">kill-ring-yank-pointer</code> の現在の値が"
"リストを指すように設定されています。最後に、別の式によって、<code "
"class=\"code\">do-not-move</code> 引数が true であってもリストの最初の要素が"
"返されます。"

