# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Body-of-mark_002dwhole_002dbuffer.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The body of the <code class=\"code\">mark-whole-buffer</code> function "
"consists of three lines of code:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">mark-whole-buffer</code> 関数の本体は、3行のコードで構成"
"されています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Body-of-mark_002dwhole_002dbuffer.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(push-mark (point))\n"
"(push-mark (point-max) nil t)\n"
"(goto-char (point-min))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Body-of-mark_002dwhole_002dbuffer.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The first of these lines is the expression, <code class=\"code\">(push-mark "
"(point))</code>."
msgstr ""
"これらの行の1行目は、<code class=\"code\">(push-mark (point))</code>という式"
"です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Body-of-mark_002dwhole_002dbuffer.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This line does exactly the same job as the first line of the body of the "
"<code class=\"code\">simplified-beginning-of-buffer</code> function, which "
"is written <code class=\"code\">(push-mark)</code>.  In both cases, the Lisp "
"interpreter sets a mark at the current position of the cursor."
msgstr ""
"この行は、<code class=\"code\">simplified-beginning-of-buffer</code> 関数の本"
"体の1行目（<code class=\"code\">(push-mark)</code> と記述されている）とまった"
"く同じ役割を果たします。いずれの場合も、Lispインタプリタはカーソルの現在位置"
"にマークを設定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Body-of-mark_002dwhole_002dbuffer.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"I don&rsquo;t know why the expression in <code class=\"code\">mark-whole-"
"buffer</code> is written <code class=\"code\">(push-mark (point))</code> and "
"the expression in <code class=\"code\">beginning-of-buffer</code> is written "
"<code class=\"code\">(push-mark)</code>.  Perhaps whoever wrote the code did "
"not know that the arguments for <code class=\"code\">push-mark</code> are "
"optional and that if <code class=\"code\">push-mark</code> is not passed an "
"argument, the function automatically sets mark at the location of point by "
"default.  Or perhaps the expression was written so as to parallel the "
"structure of the next line.  In any case, the line causes Emacs to determine "
"the position of point and set a mark there."
msgstr ""
"なぜ <code class=\"code\">mark-whole-buffer</code> の式が <code "
"class=\"code\">(push-mark (point))</code> と記述され、<code "
"class=\"code\">beginning-of-buffer</code> の式が <code class=\"code\">(push-"
"mark)</code> と記述されているのかは分かりません。おそらく、コードを書いた人"
"が <code class=\"code\">push-mark</code> の引数が省略可能であることや、<code "
"class=\"code\">push-mark</code> に引数が渡されない場合、関数がデフォルトで "
"point の位置にマークを設定することを知らなかったのでしょう。あるいは、次の行"
"の構造に合わせて式が記述されたのかもしれません。いずれにせよ、この行によって "
"Emacs は point の位置を判定し、そこにマークを設定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Body-of-mark_002dwhole_002dbuffer.html
msgid ""
"In earlier versions of GNU Emacs, the next line of <code class=\"code\">mark-"
"whole-buffer</code> was <code class=\"code\">(push-mark (point-max))</"
"code>.  This expression sets a mark at the point in the buffer that has the "
"highest number.  This will be the end of the buffer (or, if the buffer is "
"narrowed, the end of the accessible portion of the buffer.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Narrowing-_0026-Widening.html\">Narrowing and "
"Widening</a>, for more about narrowing.)  After this mark has been set, the "
"previous mark, the one set at point, is no longer set, but Emacs remembers "
"its position, just as all other recent marks are always remembered.  This "
"means that you can, if you wish, go back to that position by typing <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-u C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> twice."
msgstr ""
"GNU Emacsの旧バージョンでは、<code class=\"code\">mark-whole-buffer</code> の"
"次の行は <code class=\"code\">(push-mark (point-max))</code> でした。この式"
"は、バッファ内で最大の数値を持つポイントにマークを設定します。これはバッファ"
"の末尾（あるいは、バッファが狭められている場合は、アクセス可能な部分の末尾）"
"となります。狭め方についての詳細は、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Narrowing-_0026-"
"Widening.html\">狭めと広げ</a> を参照してください。このマークが設定されると、"
"ポイントに設定されていた直前のマークは設定されなくなりますが、他の最近のマー"
"クが常に記憶されるのと同様に、Emacsはその位置を記憶します。つまり、必要に応じ"
"て <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> を2回入力する"
"ことで、その位置に戻ることができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Body-of-mark_002dwhole_002dbuffer.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In GNU Emacs 22, the <code class=\"code\">(point-max)</code> is slightly "
"more complicated.  The line reads"
msgstr ""
"GNU Emacs 22では、<code class=\"code\">(point-max)</code>はわずかに複雑になっ"
"ています。その行は次のようになっています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Body-of-mark_002dwhole_002dbuffer.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(push-mark (point-max) nil t)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Body-of-mark_002dwhole_002dbuffer.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The expression works nearly the same as before.  It sets a mark at the "
"highest numbered place in the buffer that it can.  However, in this version, "
"<code class=\"code\">push-mark</code> has two additional arguments.  The "
"second argument to <code class=\"code\">push-mark</code> is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  This tells the function it <em "
"class=\"emph\">should</em> display a message that says &ldquo;Mark "
"set&rdquo; when it pushes the mark.  The third argument is <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>.  This tells <code class=\"code\">push-mark</code> "
"to activate the mark when Transient Mark mode is turned on.  Transient Mark "
"mode highlights the currently active region.  It is often turned off."
msgstr ""
"この式は以前とほぼ同様に動作します。バッファ内で可能な限り高い番号の位置に"
"マークを設定します。ただし、このバージョンでは <code class=\"code\">push-"
"mark</code> に2つの追加引数があります。<code class=\"code\">push-mark</code> "
"の第2引数は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> です。これにより、マークをプッ"
"シュする際に「Mark set」というメッセージを表示<em class=\"emph\">すべき</em>"
"であることが関数に伝えられます。第3引数は <code class=\"code\">t</code> で"
"す。これにより、一時マークモードが有効なときにマークを有効化するよう <code "
"class=\"code\">push-mark</code> に指示します。一時マークモードは、現在アク"
"ティブな領域をハイライトします。このモードは通常オフになっています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Body-of-mark_002dwhole_002dbuffer.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Finally, the last line of the function is <code class=\"code\">(goto-char "
"(point-min)))</code>.  This is written exactly the same way as it is written "
"in <code class=\"code\">beginning-of-buffer</code>.  The expression moves "
"the cursor to the minimum point in the buffer, that is, to the beginning of "
"the buffer (or to the beginning of the accessible portion of the buffer).  "
"As a result of this, point is placed at the beginning of the buffer and mark "
"is set at the end of the buffer.  The whole buffer is, therefore, the region."
msgstr ""
"最後に、関数の最終行は <code class=\"code\">(goto-char (point-min)))</code> "
"です。これは <code class=\"code\">beginning-of-buffer</code> と全く同じ書き方"
"になっています。この式は、カーソルをバッファ内の最小点、すなわちバッファの先"
"頭（またはバッファのアクセス可能な部分の先頭）に移動させます。その結果、"
"point はバッファの先頭に、mark はバッファの末尾に設定されます。したがって、"
"バッファ全体がリージョンとなります。"

