"In Emacs, the current position of the cursor is called <em "
"class=\"dfn\">point</em>.  The expression <code class=\"code\">(point)</"
"code> returns a number that tells you where the cursor is located as a count "
"of the number of characters from the beginning of the buffer up to point."
msgstr ""
"Emacsでは、カーソルの現在位置を<em class=\"dfn\">point</em>と呼びます。式"
"<code class=\"code\">(point)</code>は、バッファの先頭からpointまでの文字数と"
"して、カーソルがどこにあるかを示す数値を返します。"

