msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Comments-in-Lisp-code\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Comments-in-Lisp-code\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Change-a-defun.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The comment follows a semicolon, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">;</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  In Lisp, everything on a line that follows a semicolon is a "
"comment.  The end of the line is the end of the comment.  To stretch a "
"comment over two or more lines, begin each line with a semicolon."
msgstr ""
"コメントはセミコロンに続き、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">;</samp>&rsquo;と記述"
"します。Lispでは、セミコロン以降の行にあるすべてがコメントとなります。行末が"
"コメントの終端となります。コメントを2行以上にわたって記述する場合は、各行の先"
"頭にセミコロンを付けてください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Change-a-defun.html
msgid ""
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Beginning-init-File.html\">Beginning a <samp "
"class=\"file\">.emacs</samp> File</a>, and <a data-manual=\"elisp\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/"
"Comments.html#Comments\">Comments</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs "
"Lisp Reference Manual</cite>, for more about comments."
msgstr ""
"コメントの詳細については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Beginning-init-"
"File.html\"><samp class=\"file\">.emacs</samp> ファイルの先頭</a>、および "
"<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite> の <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Comments.html#Comments\">コメント</a> を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Change-a-defun.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"You can install this version of the <code class=\"code\">multiply-by-seven</"
"code> function by evaluating it in the same way you evaluated the first "
"function: place the cursor after the last parenthesis and type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"このバージョンの<code class=\"code\">multiply-by-seven</code>関数は、最初の関"
"数を評価したときと同様に評価することでインストールできます。最後の括弧の後に"
"カーソルを置き、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd>と入力してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
