# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/eintr/Code-for-current_002dkill.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>The code for <code class=\"code\">current-kill</code><a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-code-for-current_002dkill\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span><code class=\"code\">current-kill</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#The-code-for-current_002dkill\"> &para;</a>のコード</span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Code-for-current_002dkill.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">current-kill</code> function is used by <code "
"class=\"code\">yank</code> and by <code class=\"code\">yank-pop</code>.  "
"Here is the code for <code class=\"code\">current-kill</code>:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">current-kill</code> 関数は、<code class=\"code\">yank</"
"code> と <code class=\"code\">yank-pop</code> で使用されています。以下は "
"<code class=\"code\">current-kill</code> のコードです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Code-for-current_002dkill.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun current-kill (n &amp;optional do-not-move)\n"
"  &quot;Rotate the yanking point by N places, and then return that kill.\n"
"If N is zero and `interprogram-paste-function' is set to a\n"
"function that returns a string or a list of strings, and if that\n"
"function doesn't return nil, then that string (or list) is added\n"
"to the front of the kill ring and the string (or first string in\n"
"the list) is returned as the latest kill.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Code-for-current_002dkill.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If N is not zero, and if `yank-pop-change-selection' is\n"
"non-nil, use `interprogram-cut-function' to transfer the\n"
"kill at the new yank point into the window system selection.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Code-for-current_002dkill.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If optional arg DO-NOT-MOVE is non-nil, then don't actually\n"
"move the yanking point; just return the Nth kill forward.&quot;\n"
"\n"
"  (let ((interprogram-paste (and (= n 0)\n"
"                                 interprogram-paste-function\n"
"                                 (funcall interprogram-paste-function))))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Code-for-current_002dkill.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    (if interprogram-paste\n"
"        (progn\n"
"          ;; Disable the interprogram cut function when we add the new\n"
"          ;; text to the kill ring, so Emacs doesn't try to own the\n"
"          ;; selection, with identical text.\n"
"          (let ((interprogram-cut-function nil))\n"
"            (if (listp interprogram-paste)\n"
"              (mapc 'kill-new (nreverse interprogram-paste))\n"
"              (kill-new interprogram-paste)))\n"
"          (car kill-ring))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Code-for-current_002dkill.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      (or kill-ring (error &quot;Kill ring is empty&quot;))\n"
"      (let ((ARGth-kill-element\n"
"             (nthcdr (mod (- n (length kill-ring-yank-pointer))\n"
"                          (length kill-ring))\n"
"                     kill-ring)))\n"
"        (unless do-not-move\n"
"          (setq kill-ring-yank-pointer ARGth-kill-element)\n"
"          (when (and yank-pop-change-selection\n"
"                     (&gt; n 0)\n"
"                     interprogram-cut-function)\n"
"            (funcall interprogram-cut-function (car ARGth-kill-element))))\n"
"        (car ARGth-kill-element)))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Code-for-current_002dkill.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Remember also that the <code class=\"code\">kill-new</code> function sets "
"<code class=\"code\">kill-ring-yank-pointer</code> to the latest element of "
"the kill ring, which means that all the functions that call it set the value "
"indirectly: <code class=\"code\">kill-append</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">copy-region-as-kill</code>, <code class=\"code\">kill-ring-"
"save</code>, <code class=\"code\">kill-line</code>, and <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-region</code>."
msgstr ""
"また、<code class=\"code\">kill-new</code> 関数が <code class=\"code\">kill-"
"ring-yank-pointer</code> にキルリングの最新要素を設定するため、これを呼び出す"
"すべての関数（<code class=\"code\">kill-append</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">copy-region-as-kill</code>、<code class=\"code\">kill-ring-"
"save</code>、<code class=\"code\">kill-line</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">kill-region</code>）は間接的にその値を設定することになる点にも"
"留意してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Code-for-current_002dkill.html
msgid ""
"Here is the line in <code class=\"code\">kill-new</code>, which is explained "
"in <a class=\"ref\" href=\"kill_002dnew-function.html\">The <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-new</code> function</a>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">kill-new</code> の行がこちらで、<a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"kill_002dnew-function.html\"><code class=\"code\">kill-new</code> 関数"
