# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><h3>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>Printing the Columns of a Graph<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Printing-the-Columns-of-a-Graph\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>グラフの列の印刷<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Printing-the-"
"Columns-of-a-Graph\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Since Emacs is designed to be flexible and work with all kinds of terminals, "
"including character-only terminals, the graph will need to be made from one "
"of the typewriter symbols.  An asterisk will do; as we enhance the graph-"
"printing function, we can make the choice of symbol a user option."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは柔軟性を重視し、文字専用端末を含むあらゆる種類の端末で動作するように設"
"計されているため、グラフはタイプライター記号のいずれかを用いて作成する必要が"
"あります。アスタリスクで十分でしょう。グラフ出力機能を拡充していく過程で、記"
"号の選択をユーザーオプションにすることも可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"We can call this function <code class=\"code\">graph-body-print</code>; it "
"will take a <code class=\"code\">numbers-list</code> as its only argument.  "
"At this stage, we will not label the graph, but only print its body."
msgstr ""
"この関数を <code class=\"code\">graph-body-print</code> と呼びます。唯一の引"
"数として <code class=\"code\">numbers-list</code> を受け取ります。現時点では"
"グラフにラベルは付けず、その本体のみを出力します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">graph-body-print</code> function inserts a vertical "
"column of asterisks for each element in the <code class=\"code\">numbers-"
"list</code>.  The height of each line is determined by the value of that "
"element of the <code class=\"code\">numbers-list</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">graph-body-print</code> 関数は、<code "
"class=\"code\">numbers-list</code> の各要素に対してアスタリスクの縦列を挿入し"
"ます。各行の高さは、<code class=\"code\">numbers-list</code> のその要素の値に"
"よって決定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Inserting columns is a repetitive act; that means that this function can be "
"written either with a <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop or recursively."
msgstr ""
"列の挿入は繰り返し処理となるため、この関数は<code class=\"code\">while</code>"
"ループを用いるか、あるいは再帰的に記述することができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Our first challenge is to discover how to print a column of asterisks.  "
"Usually, in Emacs, we print characters onto a screen horizontally, line by "
"line, by typing.  We have two routes we can follow: write our own column-"
"insertion function or discover whether one exists in Emacs."
msgstr ""
"最初の課題は、アスタリスクの列を出力する方法を見つけることです。通常、Emacsで"
"は、文字を入力することで、画面上に1行ずつ水平に出力します。取り得る方法は2つ"
"あります。独自の列挿入関数を自作するか、あるいはEmacsにそのような関数が存在す"
"るかを確認するかです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"To see whether there is one in Emacs, we can use the <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"apropos</kbd> command.  This command is like the <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h a</"
"kbd> (<code class=\"code\">command-apropos</code>)  command, except that the "
"latter finds only those functions that are commands.  The <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x apropos</kbd> command lists all symbols that match a "
"regular expression, including functions that are not interactive.  <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-apropos\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"Emacsにそのようなものがあるかを確認するには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x apropos</"
"kbd>コマンドを使用できます。このコマンドは<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h a</kbd>"
"（<code class=\"code\">command-apropos</code>）コマンドと同様ですが、後者はコ"
"マンドである関数のみを検索します。<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x apropos</kbd>コマン"
"ドは、インタラクティブでない関数も含め、正規表現に一致するすべてのシンボルを"
"一覧表示します。<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-apropos\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"What we want to look for is some command that prints or inserts columns.  "
"Very likely, the name of the function will contain either the word "
"&ldquo;print&rdquo; or the word &ldquo;insert&rdquo; or the word "
"&ldquo;column&rdquo;.  Therefore, we can simply type <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x "
"apropos <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> print\\|insert\\|column <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> and look at the result.  On my system, this "
"command once took quite some time, and then produced a list of 79 functions "
"and variables.  Now it does not take much time at all and produces a list of "
"211 functions and variables.  Scanning down the list, the only function that "
"looks as if it might do the job is <code class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"探したいのは、列を出力または挿入する何らかのコマンドです。おそらく、関数名に"
"は「print」、「insert」、あるいは「column」という単語のいずれかが含まれている"
"はずです。したがって、単に <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x apropos <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd> print\\|insert\\|column <kbd class=\"key\">RET</"
"kbd></kbd> と入力して結果を確認すればよいでしょう。私の環境では、このコマンド"
"はかつてかなりの時間を要し、79個の関数と変数のリストを出力していました。今で"
"はほとんど時間がかからず、211個の関数と変数のリストが出力されます。リストを"
"ざっと見たところ、目的を果たせそうな唯一の関数は <code class=\"code\">insert-"
"rectangle</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Indeed, this is the function we want; its documentation says:"
msgstr ""
"確かに、これが求める関数です。そのドキュメントには次のように記載されていま"
"す："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"insert-rectangle:\n"
"Insert text of RECTANGLE with upper left corner at point.\n"
"RECTANGLE's first line is inserted at point,\n"
"its second line is inserted at a point vertically under point, etc.\n"
"RECTANGLE should be a list of strings.\n"
"After this command, the mark is at the upper left corner\n"
"and point is at the lower right corner.\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "We can run a quick test, to make sure it does what we expect of it."
msgstr "期待通りに動作するか確認するため、簡単なテストを行ってみましょう。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Here is the result of placing the cursor after the <code "
"class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</code> expression and typing <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-u C-x C-e</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">eval-last-sexp</"
"code>).  The function inserts the strings &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&quot;first&quot;</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&quot;second&quot;</samp>&rsquo;, and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&quot;third&quot;</samp>&rsquo; at and below point.  Also the "
"function returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</code> 式の後にカーソルを置き、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-u C-x C-e</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">eval-last-sexp</code>) "
"と入力した結果がこちらです。この関数は、ポイントの位置およびそれより下に文字"
"列 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;first&quot;</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&quot;second&quot;</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&quot;third&quot;</samp>&rsquo; を挿入します。また、この関数"
"は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(insert-rectangle '(&quot;first&quot; &quot;second&quot; &quot;third&quot;))first\n"
"                                              second\n"
"                                              thirdnil\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Of course, we won&rsquo;t be inserting the text of the <code "
"class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</code> expression itself into the buffer in "
"which we are making the graph, but will call the function from our program.  "
"We shall, however, have to make sure that point is in the buffer at the "
"place where the <code class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</code> function will "
"insert its column of strings."
msgstr ""
"もちろん、<code class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</code>式のテキスト自体をグラ"
"フ作成用のバッファに挿入するのではなく、プログラムから関数を呼び出すことにし"
"ます。ただし、<code class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</code>関数が文字列の列を"
"挿入する位置に、その点がバッファ内に存在するようにしておく必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If you are reading this in Info, you can see how this works by switching to "
"another buffer, such as the <samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> buffer, "
"placing point somewhere in the buffer, typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-:</kbd>, "
"typing the <code class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</code> expression into the "
"minibuffer at the prompt, and then typing <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>.  "
"This causes Emacs to evaluate the expression in the minibuffer, but to use "
"as the value of point the position of point in the <samp "
"class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> buffer.  (<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-:</kbd> is "
"the key binding for <code class=\"code\">eval-expression</code>.  Also, "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> does not appear in the <samp "
"class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> buffer since the expression is evaluated in "
"the minibuffer.)"
msgstr ""
"Infoでこれを読んでいる場合は、<samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp>バッファな"
"ど別のバッファに切り替え、バッファ内のどこかにポイントを置き、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-:</kbd>と入力し、プロンプトのあるミニバッファに<code "
"class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</code>式を入力してから<kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd>と入力することで、この仕組みを確認できます。これによ"
"り、Emacsはミニバッファ内の式を評価しますが、ポイントの値としては<samp "
"class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp>バッファにおけるポイントの位置を使用します。"
"（<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-:</kbd>は<code class=\"code\">eval-expression</code>の"
"キーバインドです。また、式はミニバッファで評価されるため、<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>は<samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp>バッファには"
"表示されません。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"We find when we do this that point ends up at the end of the last inserted "
"line&mdash;that is to say, this function moves point as a side-effect.  If "
"we were to repeat the command, with point at this position, the next "
"insertion would be below and to the right of the previous insertion.  We "
"don&rsquo;t want this! If we are going to make a bar graph, the columns need "
"to be beside each other."
msgstr ""
"このように操作すると、ポイントが最後に挿入された行の末尾に移動することがわか"
"ります。つまり、この関数は副作用としてポイントを移動させているのです。もしポ"
"イントがこの位置にある状態で同じコマンドを繰り返すと、次の挿入は前回の挿入箇"
"所の下かつ右側になります。これでは困ります！棒グラフを作成するのであれば、列"
"は横に並ぶ必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"So we discover that each cycle of the column-inserting <code "
"class=\"code\">while</code> loop must reposition point to the place we want "
"it, and that place will be at the top, not the bottom, of the column.  "
"Moreover, we remember that when we print a graph, we do not expect all the "
"columns to be the same height.  This means that the top of each column may "
"be at a different height from the previous one.  We cannot simply reposition "
"point to the same line each time, but moved over to the right&mdash;or "
"perhaps we can&hellip;"
msgstr ""
"そこで、列挿入の<code class=\"code\">while</code>ループの各サイクルにおいて、"
"ポインタを目的の位置に再配置する必要があること、そしてその位置は列の最下部で"
"はなく最上部になることがわかります。さらに、グラフを出力する際、すべての列が"
"同じ高さになるとは想定していないことも念頭に置く必要があります。つまり、各列"
"の最上部は、前の列とは異なる高さになる可能性があるということです。単に毎回同"
"じ行にポインタを再配置するのではなく、右へ移動させる――あるいは、もしかすると"
"できるのかもしれませんが……"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"We are planning to make the columns of the bar graph out of asterisks.  The "
"number of asterisks in the column is the number specified by the current "
"element of the <code class=\"code\">numbers-list</code>.  We need to "
"construct a list of asterisks of the right length for each call to <code "
"class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</code>.  If this list consists solely of the "
"requisite number of asterisks, then we will have to position point the right "
"number of lines above the base for the graph to print correctly.  This could "
"be difficult."
msgstr ""
"棒グラフの列をアスタリスクで構成する予定です。列に含まれるアスタリスクの数"
"は、<code class=\"code\">numbers-list</code>の現在の要素で指定された数となり"
"ます。<code class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</code>が呼び出されるたびに、適切"
"な長さのアスタリスクのリストを作成する必要があります。このリストが必要な数の"
"アスタリスクのみで構成されている場合、グラフを正しく出力するには、基点から適"
"切な行数分だけ上にポイントを配置しなければなりません。これは難しい作業になる"
"かもしれません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if we can figure out some way to pass <code "
"class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</code> a list of the same length each time, "
"then we can place point on the same line each time, but move it over one "
"column to the right for each new column.  If we do this, however, some of "
"the entries in the list passed to <code class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</"
"code> must be blanks rather than asterisks.  For example, if the maximum "
"height of the graph is 5, but the height of the column is 3, then <code "
"class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</code> requires an argument that looks like "
"this:"
msgstr ""
"あるいは、<code class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</code> に毎回同じ長さのリスト"
"を渡す方法が見つかれば、毎回同じ直線上に点を配置しつつ、新しい列ごとに右へ1列"
"分ずらすことができます。ただし、この方法をとる場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</code> に渡されるリストの一部の要素は、アスタ"
"リスクではなく空白である必要があります。例えば、グラフの最大高さが5で、列の高"
"さが3である場合、<code class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</code> には次のような"
"形式の引数が必要になります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(&quot; &quot; &quot; &quot; &quot;*&quot; &quot;*&quot; &quot;*&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This last proposal is not so difficult, so long as we can determine the "
"column height.  There are two ways for us to specify the column height: we "
"can arbitrarily state what it will be, which would work fine for graphs of "
"that height; or we can search through the list of numbers and use the "
"maximum height of the list as the maximum height of the graph.  If the "
"latter operation were difficult, then the former procedure would be easiest, "
"but there is a function built into Emacs that determines the maximum of its "
"arguments.  We can use that function.  The function is called <code "
"class=\"code\">max</code> and it returns the largest of all its arguments, "
"which must be numbers.  Thus, for example,"
msgstr ""
"この最後の提案は、列の高さを決定できればそれほど難しくありません。列の高さを"
"指定する方法は2つあります。任意に高さを指定する方法で、その高さのグラフであれ"
"ば問題ありません。あるいは、数値のリストを検索し、そのリストの最大値をグラフ"
"の最大高さとして用いる方法です。もし後者の操作が困難であれば、前者の手順が最"
"も簡単になりますが、Emacsには引数の最大値を求める組み込み関数があります。その"
"関数を利用できます。この関数は<code class=\"code\">max</code>と呼ばれ、すべて"
"の引数（数値である必要があります）のうち最大のものを返します。したがって、例"
"えば、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(max  3 4 6 5 7 3)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"returns 7.  (A corresponding function called <code class=\"code\">min</code> "
"returns the smallest of all its arguments.)  <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-max\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-min\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"7を返します。  （<code class=\"code\">min</code> という対応する関数は、すべて"
"の引数のうち最小のものを返します。）  <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"max\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-min\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"However, we cannot simply call <code class=\"code\">max</code> on the <code "
"class=\"code\">numbers-list</code>; the <code class=\"code\">max</code> "
"function expects numbers as its argument, not a list of numbers.  Thus, the "
"following expression,"
msgstr ""
"しかし、<code class=\"code\">numbers-list</code> に対して単純に <code "
"class=\"code\">max</code> を呼び出すことはできません。<code "
"class=\"code\">max</code> 関数は引数として数値を期待しており、数値のリストを"
"期待しているわけではないからです。したがって、次の式は、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(max  '(3 4 6 5 7 3))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "produces the following error message;"
msgstr "以下のエラーメッセージが表示されます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "Wrong type of argument:  number-or-marker-p, (3 4 6 5 7 3)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-apply\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-apply\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"We need a function that passes a list of arguments to a function.  This "
"function is <code class=\"code\">apply</code>.  This function applies its "
"first argument (a function) to its remaining arguments, the last of which "
"may be a list."
msgstr ""
"引数のリストを関数に渡す関数が必要です。その関数が <code "
"class=\"code\">apply</code> です。この関数は、第1引数（関数）を残りの引数に適"
"用します。なお、残りの引数の最後はリストであっても構いません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html
#: build/html/eintr/Counting-function-definitions.html
#: build/html/eintr/Review.html build/html/eintr/mapcar.html
#: build/html/eintr/save_002drestriction.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "For example,"
msgstr "例えば、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(apply 'max 3 4 7 3 '(4 8 5))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "returns 8."
msgstr "8を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(Incidentally, I don&rsquo;t know how you would learn of this function "
"without a book such as this.  It is possible to discover other functions, "
"like <code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</code>, by guessing at a part of their names "
"and then using <code class=\"code\">apropos</code>.  Even though its base in "
"metaphor is clear&mdash;apply its first argument to the rest&mdash;I doubt a "
"novice would come up with that particular word when using <code "
"class=\"code\">apropos</code> or other aid.  Of course, I could be wrong; "
"after all, the function was first named by someone who had to invent it.)"
msgstr ""
"（ちなみに、このような本なしに、どうすればこの関数について知ることができるの"
"だろうか。<code class=\"code\">search-forward</code>や<code "
"class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</code>といった他の関数は、名前の一部を推測し"
"て<code class=\"code\">apropos</code>を用いることで見つけ出すことも可能だ。比"
"喩的な根拠――第1引数を残りの部分に適用する――は明確だが、初心者が<code "
"class=\"code\">apropos</code>やその他の手がかりを使う際に、わざわざその特定の"
"言葉を思いつくとは考えにくい。もちろん、私の考えが間違っているかもしれない。"
"何しろ、この関数を最初に名付けたのは、それを考案せざるを得なかった人物なのだ"
"から。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The second and subsequent arguments to <code class=\"code\">apply</code> are "
"optional, so we can use <code class=\"code\">apply</code> to call a function "
"and pass the elements of a list to it, like this, which also returns 8:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">apply</code> への2つ目以降の引数は省略可能であるため、"
"<code class=\"code\">apply</code> を使って関数を呼び出し、次のようにリストの"
"要素を渡すことができます。この場合も 8 が返されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(apply 'max '(4 8 5))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This latter way is how we will use <code class=\"code\">apply</code>.  The "
"<code class=\"code\">recursive-lengths-list-many-files</code> function "
"returns a numbers&rsquo; list to which we can apply <code "
"class=\"code\">max</code> (we could also apply <code class=\"code\">max</"
"code> to the sorted numbers&rsquo; list; it does not matter whether the list "
"is sorted or not.)"
msgstr ""
"後者の方法で、<code class=\"code\">apply</code> を使用します。<code "
"class=\"code\">recursive-lengths-list-many-files</code> 関数は数値のリストを"
"返し、そこに <code class=\"code\">max</code> を適用できます（ソート済みの数値"
"リストに <code class=\"code\">max</code> を適用することも可能です。リストが"
"ソートされているかどうかは問いません）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Hence, the operation for finding the maximum height of the graph is this:"
msgstr "したがって、グラフの最大高さを求める操作は次の通りである。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(setq max-graph-height (apply 'max numbers-list))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Now we can return to the question of how to create a list of strings for a "
"column of the graph.  Told the maximum height of the graph and the number of "
"asterisks that should appear in the column, the function should return a "
"list of strings for the <code class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</code> command "
"to insert."
msgstr ""
"それでは、グラフの列に用いる文字列リストをどのように作成するかという問題に戻"
"りましょう。グラフの最大高さと、その列に表示すべきアスタリスクの数が与えられ"
"たとき、この関数は<code class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</code>コマンドで挿入"
"するための文字列リストを返す必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Each column is made up of asterisks or blanks.  Since the function is passed "
"the value of the height of the column and the number of asterisks in the "
"column, the number of blanks can be found by subtracting the number of "
"asterisks from the height of the column.  Given the number of blanks and the "
"number of asterisks, two <code class=\"code\">while</code> loops can be used "
"to construct the list:"
msgstr ""
"各列はアスタリスクまたは空白で構成されています。関数には列の高さと列内のアス"
"タリスクの数が渡されるため、空白の数は、列の高さからアスタリスクの数を引くこ"
"とで求められます。空白の数とアスタリスクの数が与えられた場合、2つの<code "
"class=\"code\">while</code>ループを用いてリストを構築できます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";;; <span class=\"r\">First version.</span>\n"
"(defun column-of-graph (max-graph-height actual-height)\n"
"  &quot;Return list of strings that is one column of a graph.&quot;\n"
"  (let ((insert-list nil)\n"
"        (number-of-top-blanks\n"
"         (- max-graph-height actual-height)))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ;; <span class=\"r\">Fill in asterisks.</span>\n"
"    (while (&gt; actual-height 0)\n"
"      (setq insert-list (cons &quot;*&quot; insert-list))\n"
"      (setq actual-height (1- actual-height)))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ;; <span class=\"r\">Fill in blanks.</span>\n"
"    (while (&gt; number-of-top-blanks 0)\n"
"      (setq insert-list (cons &quot; &quot; insert-list))\n"
"      (setq number-of-top-blanks\n"
"            (1- number-of-top-blanks)))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ;; <span class=\"r\">Return whole list.</span>\n"
"    insert-list))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If you install this function and then evaluate the following expression you "
"will see that it returns the list as desired:"
msgstr ""
"この関数をインストールした上で、以下の式を評価すると、期待通りにリストが返さ"
"れることがわかります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(column-of-graph 5 3)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "returns"
msgstr "戻り値"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"As written, <code class=\"code\">column-of-graph</code> contains a major "
"flaw: the symbols used for the blank and for the marked entries in the "
"column are hard-coded as a space and asterisk.  This is fine for a "
"prototype, but you, or another user, may wish to use other symbols.  For "
"example, in testing the graph function, you may want to use a period in "
"place of the space, to make sure the point is being repositioned properly "
"each time the <code class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</code> function is "
"called; or you might want to substitute a &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">+</"
"samp>&rsquo; sign or other symbol for the asterisk.  You might even want to "
"make a graph-column that is more than one display column wide.  The program "
"should be more flexible.  The way to do that is to replace the blank and the "
"asterisk with two variables that we can call <code class=\"code\">graph-"
"blank</code> and <code class=\"code\">graph-symbol</code> and define those "
"variables separately."
msgstr ""
"現状の記述では、<code class=\"code\">column-of-graph</code> に重大な欠陥があ"
"ります。列内の空白およびマーク付き項目に使用される記号が、スペースとアスタリ"
"スクとしてハードコードされている点です。プロトタイプとしてはこれで問題ありま"
"せんが、あなたや他のユーザーが別の記号を使用したい場合もあるでしょう。例え"
"ば、グラフ関数のテストにおいて、<code class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</code> "
"関数が呼び出されるたびに点が適切に再配置されることを確認するため、スペースの"
"代わりにピリオドを使用したい場合があるかもしれません。あるいは、アスタリスク"
"を &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">+</samp>&rsquo; 記号やその他の記号に置き換えた"
"い場合もあるでしょう。さらに、グラフ列の幅を1つの表示列より広くしたい場合もあ"
"るかもしれません。プログラムはより柔軟であるべきです。それを実現するには、空"
"白とアスタリスクを <code class=\"code\">graph-blank</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">graph-symbol</code> と呼ぶ2つの変数に置き換え、それらの変数を"
"個別に定義すればよいでしょう。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Also, the documentation is not well written.  These considerations lead us "
"to the second version of the function:"
msgstr ""
"また、ドキュメントの記述も不十分です。こうした点を踏まえ、関数の第2版を以下の"
"ように作成しました。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defvar graph-symbol &quot;*&quot;\n"
"  &quot;String used as symbol in graph, usually an asterisk.&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defvar graph-blank &quot; &quot;\n"
"  &quot;String used as blank in graph, usually a blank space.\n"
"graph-blank must be the same number of columns wide\n"
"as graph-symbol.&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html
msgid ""
"(For an explanation of <code class=\"code\">defvar</code>, see <a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"defvar.html\">Initializing a Variable with <code "
"class=\"code\">defvar</code></a>.)"
msgstr ""
"（<code class=\"code\">defvar</code>の解説については、<a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"defvar.html\"><code class=\"code\">defvar</code>による変数の初期化</a>"
"を参照してください。）"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";;; <span class=\"r\">Second version.</span>\n"
"(defun column-of-graph (max-graph-height actual-height)\n"
"  &quot;Return MAX-GRAPH-HEIGHT strings; ACTUAL-HEIGHT are graph-symbols.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The graph-symbols are contiguous entries at the end\n"
"of the list.\n"
"The list will be inserted as one column of a graph.\n"
"The strings are either graph-blank or graph-symbol.&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (let ((insert-list nil)\n"
"        (number-of-top-blanks\n"
"         (- max-graph-height actual-height)))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ;; <span class=\"r\">Fill in <code class=\"code\">graph-symbols</code>.</span>\n"
"    (while (&gt; actual-height 0)\n"
"      (setq insert-list (cons graph-symbol insert-list))\n"
"      (setq actual-height (1- actual-height)))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ;; <span class=\"r\">Fill in <code class=\"code\">graph-blanks</code>.</span>\n"
"    (while (&gt; number-of-top-blanks 0)\n"
"      (setq insert-list (cons graph-blank insert-list))\n"
"      (setq number-of-top-blanks\n"
"            (1- number-of-top-blanks)))\n"
"\n"
"    ;; <span class=\"r\">Return whole list.</span>\n"
"    insert-list))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If we wished, we could rewrite <code class=\"code\">column-of-graph</code> a "
"third time to provide optionally for a line graph as well as for a bar "
"graph.  This would not be hard to do.  One way to think of a line graph is "
"that it is no more than a bar graph in which the part of each bar that is "
"below the top is blank.  To construct a column for a line graph, the "
"function first constructs a list of blanks that is one shorter than the "
"value, then it uses <code class=\"code\">cons</code> to attach a graph "
"symbol to the list; then it uses <code class=\"code\">cons</code> again to "
"attach the top blanks to the list."
msgstr ""
"必要であれば、<code class=\"code\">column-of-graph</code>を3度目に書き換える"
"ことで、棒グラフだけでなく折れ線グラフも任意に提供できるようにできます。これ"
"はそれほど難しいことではありません。折れ線グラフの捉え方の一つは、各棒の上部"
"より下の部分が空白になっているだけの棒グラフであるということです。折れ線グラ"
"フ用の列を作成するには、関数はまず値より1つ短い空白のリストを作成し、次に"
"<code class=\"code\">cons</code>を用いてそのリストにグラフ記号を付加します。"
"その後、再び<code class=\"code\">cons</code>を用いて上部の空白をリストに付加"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Columns-of-a-graph.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"It is easy to see how to write such a function, but since we don&rsquo;t "
"need it, we will not do it.  But the job could be done, and if it were done, "
"it would be done with <code class=\"code\">column-of-graph</code>.  Even "
"more important, it is worth noting that few changes would have to be made "
"anywhere else.  The enhancement, if we ever wish to make it, is simple."
msgstr ""
"このような関数をどう書けばよいかは容易に分かりますが、必要ないため、ここでは"
"行いません。とはいえ、実現は可能ですし、もし実現するのであれば <code "
"class=\"code\">column-of-graph</code> で行えるでしょう。さらに重要なのは、他"
"の箇所で変更を加える必要がほとんどないという点です。もし将来的に機能拡張を行"
"いたいと考えたとしても、その手順は単純です。"

