# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Complete-forward_002dsentence.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Here is the code for <code class=\"code\">forward-sentence</code>:"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">forward-sentence</code>のコードは以下の通りです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Complete-forward_002dsentence.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun forward-sentence (&amp;optional arg)\n"
"  &quot;Move forward to next end of sentence.  With argument, repeat.\n"
"With negative argument, move backward repeatedly to start of sentence.\n"
"\n"
"The variable `sentence-end' is a regular expression that matches ends of\n"
"sentences.  Also, every paragraph boundary terminates sentences as well.&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Complete-forward_002dsentence.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (interactive &quot;p&quot;)\n"
"  (or arg (setq arg 1))\n"
"  (let ((opoint (point))\n"
"        (sentence-end (sentence-end)))\n"
"    (while (&lt; arg 0)\n"
"      (let ((pos (point))\n"
"            (par-beg (save-excursion (start-of-paragraph-text) (point))))\n"
"       (if (and (re-search-backward sentence-end par-beg t)\n"
"                (or (&lt; (match-end 0) pos)\n"
"                    (re-search-backward sentence-end par-beg t)))\n"
"           (goto-char (match-end 0))\n"
"         (goto-char par-beg)))\n"
"      (setq arg (1+ arg)))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Complete-forward_002dsentence.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    (while (&gt; arg 0)\n"
"      (let ((par-end (save-excursion (end-of-paragraph-text) (point))))\n"
"       (if (re-search-forward sentence-end par-end t)\n"
"           (skip-chars-backward &quot; \\t\\n&quot;)\n"
"         (goto-char par-end)))\n"
"      (setq arg (1- arg)))\n"
"    (constrain-to-field nil opoint t)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Complete-forward_002dsentence.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The function looks long at first sight and it is best to look at its "
"skeleton first, and then its muscle.  The way to see the skeleton is to look "
"at the expressions that start in the left-most columns:"
msgstr ""
"この関数は一見すると長く見えますが、まずはその骨格を確認し、その後に詳細な仕"
"組みを見るのが最善です。骨格を確認するには、最も左側の列から始まる式に注目し"
"てください："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Complete-forward_002dsentence.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun forward-sentence (&amp;optional arg)\n"
"  &quot;<var class=\"var\">documentation</var>...&quot;\n"
"  (interactive &quot;p&quot;)\n"
"  (or arg (setq arg 1))\n"
"  (let ((opoint (point)) (sentence-end (sentence-end)))\n"
"    (while (&lt; arg 0)\n"
"      (let ((pos (point))\n"
"            (par-beg (save-excursion (start-of-paragraph-text) (point))))\n"
"       <var class=\"var\">rest-of-body-of-while-loop-when-going-backwards</var>\n"
"    (while (&gt; arg 0)\n"
"      (let ((par-end (save-excursion (end-of-paragraph-text) (point))))\n"
"       <var class=\"var\">rest-of-body-of-while-loop-when-going-forwards</var>\n"
"    <var class=\"var\">handle-forms-and-equivalent</var>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Complete-forward_002dsentence.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This looks much simpler! The function definition consists of documentation, "
"an <code class=\"code\">interactive</code> expression, an <code "
"class=\"code\">or</code> expression, a <code class=\"code\">let</code> "
"expression, and <code class=\"code\">while</code> loops."
msgstr ""
"こちらの方がずっとシンプルですね！関数定義は、ドキュメント、<code "
"class=\"code\">interactive</code>式、<code class=\"code\">or</code>式、<code "
"class=\"code\">let</code>式、そして<code class=\"code\">while</code>ループで"
"構成されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Complete-forward_002dsentence.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Let&rsquo;s look at each of these parts in turn."
msgstr "これらの各部分について、順に見ていきましょう。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Complete-forward_002dsentence.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "We note that the documentation is thorough and understandable."
msgstr "ドキュメントが網羅的で分かりやすい点に注目しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Complete-forward_002dsentence.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The function has an <code class=\"code\">interactive &quot;p&quot;</code> "
"declaration.  This means that the processed prefix argument, if any, is "
"passed to the function as its argument.  (This will be a number.)  If the "
"function is not passed an argument (it is optional) then the argument <code "
"class=\"code\">arg</code> will be bound to 1."
msgstr ""
"この関数には <code class=\"code\">interactive &quot;p&quot;</code> という宣言"
"があります。これは、処理済みの接頭辞引数（もしあれば）が、関数の引数として渡"
"されることを意味します。（これは数値になります。）関数に引数が渡されない場合"
"（省略可能な場合）、引数 <code class=\"code\">arg</code> には 1 がバインドさ"
"れます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Complete-forward_002dsentence.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"When <code class=\"code\">forward-sentence</code> is called non-"
"interactively without an argument, <code class=\"code\">arg</code> is bound "
"to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  The <code class=\"code\">or</code> "
"expression handles this.  What it does is either leave the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">arg</code> as it is, but only if <code class=\"code\">arg</"
"code> is bound to a value; or it sets the value of <code class=\"code\">arg</"
"code> to 1, in the case when <code class=\"code\">arg</code> is bound to "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">forward-sentence</code> が引数なしで非対話的に呼び出され"
"た場合、<code class=\"code\">arg</code> は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> に"
"バインドされます。<code class=\"code\">or</code> 式がこれを処理します。この式"
"は、<code class=\"code\">arg</code> が値にバインドされている場合に限り <code "
"class=\"code\">arg</code> の値をそのまま保持するか、あるいは <code "
"class=\"code\">arg</code> が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> にバインドされて"
"いる場合に <code class=\"code\">arg</code> の値を 1 に設定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Complete-forward_002dsentence.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Next is a <code class=\"code\">let</code>.  That specifies the values of two "
"local variables, <code class=\"code\">opoint</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">sentence-end</code>.  The local value of point, from before "
"the search, is used in the <code class=\"code\">constrain-to-field</code> "
"function which handles forms and equivalents.  The <code "
"class=\"code\">sentence-end</code> variable is set by the <code "
"class=\"code\">sentence-end</code> function."
msgstr ""
"次は <code class=\"code\">let</code> です。これは2つのローカル変数、<code "
"class=\"code\">opoint</code> と <code class=\"code\">sentence-end</code> の値"
