msgid ""
"<span>The Complete <code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code> Implementation<a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-Complete-zap_002dto_002dchar-"
"Implementation\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span><code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code>の完全な実装<a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#The-Complete-zap_002dto_002dchar-Implementation\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Complete-zap_002dto_002dchar.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code> function removes the text in the "
"region between the location of the cursor (i.e., of point) up to and "
"including the next occurrence of a specified character.  The text that <code "
"class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code> removes is put in the kill ring; and it "
"can be retrieved from the kill ring by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-y</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">yank</code>).  If the command is given an argument, it "
"removes text through that number of occurrences.  Thus, if the cursor were "
"at the beginning of this sentence and the character were &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">s</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Thus</"
"samp>&rsquo; would be removed.  If the argument were two, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Thus, if the curs</samp>&rsquo; would be removed, up to and "
"including the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">s</samp>&rsquo; in &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">cursor</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code> 関数は、カーソル（すなわちポイント）"
"の位置から、指定された文字の次の出現箇所まで（その出現箇所を含む）の範囲にあ"
"るテキストを削除します。<code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code> が削除したテ"
"キストはキルリングに格納され、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-y</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">yank</code>) と入力することでキルリングから復元できます。コマ"
"ンドに引数が指定された場合は、その出現回数分までのテキストが削除されます。し"
"たがって、カーソルがこの文の先頭にあり、文字が &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">s</samp>&rsquo; である場合、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Thus</"
"samp>&rsquo; が削除されます。引数が 2 であれば、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">cursor</samp>&rsquo; 内の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">s</"
"samp>&rsquo; まで（その出現箇所を含む）の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Thus, "
"if the curs</samp>&rsquo; が削除されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Complete-zap_002dto_002dchar.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If the specified character is not found, <code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</"
"code> will say &ldquo;Search failed&rdquo;, tell you the character you "
"typed, and not remove any text."
msgstr ""
"指定した文字が見つからない場合、<code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code>は"
"「Search failed」と表示し、入力した文字を知らせるだけで、テキストは一切削除し"
"ません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Complete-zap_002dto_002dchar.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In order to determine how much text to remove, <code class=\"code\">zap-to-"
"char</code> uses a search function.  Searches are used extensively in code "
"that manipulates text, and we will focus attention on them as well as on the "
"deletion command."
msgstr ""
"削除するテキスト量を決定するため、<code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code>は検"
"索機能を利用します。テキストを操作するコードでは検索機能が多用されており、本"
"稿では削除コマンドと併せて、検索機能についても詳しく見ていきます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Complete-zap_002dto_002dchar.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Here is the complete text of the version 22 implementation of the function:"
msgstr "関数のバージョン22の実装の全文は以下の通りです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Complete-zap_002dto_002dchar.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun zap-to-char (arg char)\n"
"  &quot;Kill up to and including ARG'th occurrence of CHAR.\n"
"Case is ignored if `case-fold-search' is non-nil in the current buffer.\n"
"Goes backward if ARG is negative; error if CHAR not found.&quot;\n"
"  (interactive &quot;p\\ncZap to char: &quot;)\n"
"  (if (char-table-p translation-table-for-input)\n"
"      (setq char (or (aref translation-table-for-input char) char)))\n"
"  (kill-region (point) (progn\n"
"                         (search-forward (char-to-string char)\n"
"                                         nil nil arg)\n"
"                         (point))))\n"
msgstr ""

