msgstr ""
"<span>C.2.1 サイドトリップ：剰余の計算<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Side-Trip_003a-Compute-a-Remainder\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Compute-a-Remainder.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_0025-_0028remainder-"
"function_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Remainder-"
"function_002c-_0025\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_0025-_0028remainder-"
"function_0029\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Remainder-"
"function_002c-_0025\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Compute-a-Remainder.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In Lisp, the function for computing a remainder is <code class=\"code\">%</"
"code>.  The function returns the remainder of its first argument divided by "
"its second argument.  As it happens, <code class=\"code\">%</code> is a "
"function in Emacs Lisp that you cannot discover using <code "
"class=\"code\">apropos</code>: you find nothing if you type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x apropos <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> remainder <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd>.  The only way to learn of the existence of "
"<code class=\"code\">%</code> is to read about it in a book such as this or "
"in the Emacs Lisp sources."
msgstr ""
"Lispにおいて、剰余を計算する関数は <code class=\"code\">%</code> です。  この"
"関数は、第1引数を第2引数で割ったときの剰余を返します。  たまたま、<code "
"class=\"code\">%</code> は Emacs Lisp の関数であり、<code "
"class=\"code\">apropos</code> を使って見つけることはできません。<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x apropos <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> remainder <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd></kbd> と入力しても、何も見つからないからです。  "
"<code class=\"code\">%</code> の存在を知る唯一の方法は、このような書籍や "
"Emacs Lisp のソースコードでそれについて読むことです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Compute-a-Remainder.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"You can try the <code class=\"code\">%</code> function by evaluating the "
"following two expressions:"
msgstr ""
"以下の2つの式を評価することで、<code class=\"code\">%</code>関数を試すことが"
"できます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Compute-a-Remainder.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(% 7 5)\n"
"\n"
"(% 10 5)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Compute-a-Remainder.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The first expression returns 2 and the second expression returns 0."
msgstr "1つ目の式は2を返し、2つ目の式は0を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Compute-a-Remainder.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"To test whether the returned value is zero or some other number, we can use "
"the <code class=\"code\">zerop</code> function.  This function returns <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> if its argument, which must be a number, is zero."
msgstr ""
"戻り値が0かそれ以外の数値かを判定するには、<code class=\"code\">zerop</code>"
"関数を使用できます。この関数は、数値である必要がある引数が0の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">t</code>を返します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Compute-a-Remainder.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(zerop (% 7 5))\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
"\n"
"(zerop (% 10 5))\n"
"     &rArr; t\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Compute-a-Remainder.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Thus, the following expression will return <code class=\"code\">t</code> if "
"the height of the graph is evenly divisible by five:"
msgstr ""
"したがって、グラフの高さが5で割り切れる場合、次の式は<code class=\"code\">t</"
"code>を返します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Compute-a-Remainder.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(zerop (% height 5))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Compute-a-Remainder.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(The value of <code class=\"code\">height</code>, of course, can be found "
"from <code class=\"code\">(apply 'max numbers-list)</code>.)"
msgstr ""
"（<code class=\"code\">height</code>の値は、もちろん<code "
"class=\"code\">(apply 'max numbers-list)</code>から求めることができます。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Compute-a-Remainder.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"On the other hand, if the value of <code class=\"code\">height</code> is not "
"a multiple of five, we want to reset the value to the next higher multiple "
"of five.  This is straightforward arithmetic using functions with which we "
"are already familiar.  First, we divide the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">height</code> by five to determine how many times five goes "
"into the number.  Thus, five goes into twelve twice.  If we add one to this "
"quotient and multiply by five, we will obtain the value of the next multiple "
"of five that is larger than the height.  Five goes into twelve twice.  Add "
"one to two, and multiply by five; the result is fifteen, which is the next "
"multiple of five that is higher than twelve.  The Lisp expression for this "
"is:"
msgstr ""
"一方で、<code class=\"code\">height</code> の値が5の倍数でない場合は、値を次"
"の大きい5の倍数にリセットしたいと考えます。これは、すでに馴染みのある関数を用"
"いた単純な算術処理です。まず、<code class=\"code\">height</code> の値を5で割"
"り、その数に5が何回入るかを算出します。したがって、12を5で割ると2になります。"
"この商に1を足して5を掛ければ、高さよりも大きい次の5の倍数が得られます。12を5"
"で割ると2になります。2に1を足して5を掛けると、結果は15となり、これが12より大"
"きい次の5の倍数となります。これを表すLispの式は以下の通りです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Compute-a-Remainder.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(* (1+ (/ height 5)) 5)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Compute-a-Remainder.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "For example, if you evaluate the following, the result is 15:"
msgstr "例えば、以下を評価すると、結果は15になります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Compute-a-Remainder.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(* (1+ (/ 12 5)) 5)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Compute-a-Remainder.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"All through this discussion, we have been using 5 as the value for spacing "
"labels on the Y axis; but we may want to use some other value.  For "
"generality, we should replace 5 with a variable to which we can assign a "
"value.  The best name I can think of for this variable is <code "
"class=\"code\">Y-axis-label-spacing</code>."
msgstr ""
"これまでの議論では、Y軸の間隔ラベルの値として5を使用してきましたが、別の値を"
"使いたい場合もあるでしょう。汎用性を持たせるため、5を値を代入できる変数に置き"
"換えるべきです。この変数に付ける名前として考えられる最善のものは、<code "
"class=\"code\">Y-axis-label-spacing</code>です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Compute-a-Remainder.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Using this term, and an <code class=\"code\">if</code> expression, we "
"produce the following:"
msgstr "この用語と<code class=\"code\">if</code>式を用いて、以下を生成します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Compute-a-Remainder.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(if (zerop (% height Y-axis-label-spacing))\n"
"    height\n"
"  ;; <span class=\"r\">else</span>\n"
"  (* (1+ (/ height Y-axis-label-spacing))\n"
"     Y-axis-label-spacing))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Compute-a-Remainder.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This expression returns the value of <code class=\"code\">height</code> "
"itself if the height is an even multiple of the value of the <code "
"class=\"code\">Y-axis-label-spacing</code> or else it computes and returns a "
"value of <code class=\"code\">height</code> that is equal to the next higher "
"multiple of the value of the <code class=\"code\">Y-axis-label-spacing</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"この式は、高さが<code class=\"code\">Y-axis-label-spacing</code>の値の偶数倍"
"である場合は<code class=\"code\">height</code>の値そのものを返し、そうでない"
"場合は<code class=\"code\">Y-axis-label-spacing</code>の値の次の上位倍数に等"
"しい<code class=\"code\">height</code>の値を計算して返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Compute-a-Remainder.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"We can now include this expression in the <code class=\"code\">let</code> "
"expression of the <code class=\"code\">print-graph</code> function (after "
"first setting the value of <code class=\"code\">Y-axis-label-spacing</"
"code>): <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"Y_002daxis_002dlabel_002dspacing\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"これで、この式を（まず<code class=\"code\">Y-axis-label-spacing</code>の値を"
"設定した後で）<code class=\"code\">print-graph</code>関数の<code "
"class=\"code\">let</code>式に組み込むことができます：<a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-Y_002daxis_002dlabel_002dspacing\"></a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Compute-a-Remainder.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defvar Y-axis-label-spacing 5\n"
"  &quot;Number of lines from one Y axis label to next.&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Compute-a-Remainder.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"...\n"
"(let* ((height (apply 'max numbers-list))\n"
"       (height-of-top-line\n"
"        (if (zerop (% height Y-axis-label-spacing))\n"
"            height\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Compute-a-Remainder.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"          ;; <span class=\"r\">else</span>\n"
"          (* (1+ (/ height Y-axis-label-spacing))\n"
"             Y-axis-label-spacing)))\n"
"       (symbol-width (length graph-blank))))\n"
"...\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Compute-a-Remainder.html
msgid ""
"(Note use of the <code class=\"code\">let*</code> function: the initial "
"value of height is computed once by the <code class=\"code\">(apply 'max "
"numbers-list)</code> expression and then the resulting value of <code "
"class=\"code\">height</code> is used to compute its final value.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"fwd_002dpara-let.html\">The <code class=\"code\">let*</"
"code> expression</a>, for more about <code class=\"code\">let*</code>.)"
msgstr ""
"（<code class=\"code\">let*</code> 関数の使用に注意してください。height の初"
"期値は <code class=\"code\">(apply 'max numbers-list)</code> 式によって一度計"
"算され、その後、<code class=\"code\">height</code> の計算結果を用いて最終的な"
"値が算出されます。<code class=\"code\">let*</code> の詳細については、<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"fwd_002dpara-let.html\"><code class=\"code\">let*</"
"code> 式</a>を参照してください。）"

