#, no-wrap
msgid "(4 3 2 1)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Counting-function-definitions.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Note that the <code class=\"code\">nreverse</code> function is "
"destructive&mdash;that is, it changes the list to which it is applied; this "
"contrasts with the <code class=\"code\">car</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">cdr</code> functions, which are non-destructive.  In this "
"case, we do not want the original <code class=\"code\">defuns-per-range-"
"list</code>, so it does not matter that it is destroyed.  (The <code "
"class=\"code\">reverse</code> function provides a reversed copy of a list, "
"leaving the original list as is.)  <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"reverse\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"なお、<code class=\"code\">nreverse</code> 関数は破壊的です&mdash;つまり、適"
"用先のリストを変更します。これは、非破壊的な <code class=\"code\">car</code> "
"や <code class=\"code\">cdr</code> 関数とは対照的です。この場合、元の <code "
"class=\"code\">defuns-per-range-list</code> は不要であるため、それが破壊され"
"ても問題ありません。（<code class=\"code\">reverse</code> 関数はリストの逆順"
"コピーを返し、元のリストはそのまま保持します。）  <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-reverse\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Counting-function-definitions.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Put all together, the <code class=\"code\">defuns-per-range</code> looks "
"like this:"
msgstr ""
"これらをまとめると、<code class=\"code\">defuns-per-range</code>は次のように"
"なります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Counting-function-definitions.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun defuns-per-range (sorted-lengths top-of-ranges)\n"
"  &quot;SORTED-LENGTHS defuns in each TOP-OF-RANGES range.&quot;\n"
"  (let ((top-of-range (car top-of-ranges))\n"
"        (number-within-range 0)\n"
"        defuns-per-range-list)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Counting-function-definitions.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ;; <span class=\"r\">Outer loop.</span>\n"
"    (while top-of-ranges\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Counting-function-definitions.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      ;; <span class=\"r\">Inner loop.</span>\n"
"      (while (and\n"
"              ;; <span class=\"r\">Need number for numeric test.</span>\n"
"              (car sorted-lengths)\n"
"              (&lt; (car sorted-lengths) top-of-range))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Counting-function-definitions.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ;; <span class=\"r\">Count number of definitions within current range.</span>\n"
"        (setq number-within-range (1+ number-within-range))\n"
"        (setq sorted-lengths (cdr sorted-lengths)))\n"
"\n"
"      ;; <span class=\"r\">Exit inner loop but remain within outer loop.</span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Counting-function-definitions.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      (setq defuns-per-range-list\n"
"            (cons number-within-range defuns-per-range-list))\n"
"      (setq number-within-range 0)      ; <span class=\"r\">Reset count to zero.</span>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Counting-function-definitions.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      ;; <span class=\"r\">Move to next range.</span>\n"
"      (setq top-of-ranges (cdr top-of-ranges))\n"
"      ;; <span class=\"r\">Specify next top of range value.</span>\n"
"      (setq top-of-range (car top-of-ranges)))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Counting-function-definitions.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ;; <span class=\"r\">Exit outer loop and count the number of defuns larger than</span>\n"
"    ;; <span class=\"r\">  the largest top-of-range value.</span>\n"
"    (setq defuns-per-range-list\n"
"          (cons\n"
"           (length sorted-lengths)\n"
"           defuns-per-range-list))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Counting-function-definitions.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ;; <span class=\"r\">Return a list of the number of definitions within each range,</span>\n"
"    ;; <span class=\"r\">  smallest to largest.</span>\n"
"    (nreverse defuns-per-range-list)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
