#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "instead of like this:"
msgstr "こんな風にではなく："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Counting-function-definitions.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(&lt; (car sorted-lengths) top-of-range)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Counting-function-definitions.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The purpose of the test is to determine whether the first item in the <code "
"class=\"code\">sorted-lengths</code> list is less than the value of the top "
"of the range."
msgstr ""
"このテストの目的は、<code class=\"code\">sorted-lengths</code> リストの最初の"
"項目が範囲の上限値よりも小さいかどうかを判定することです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Counting-function-definitions.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The simple version of the test works fine unless the <code "
"class=\"code\">sorted-lengths</code> list has a <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> value.  In that case, the <code class=\"code\">(car sorted-lengths)</"
"code> expression function returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  The "
"<code class=\"code\">&lt;</code> function cannot compare a number to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, which is an empty list, so Emacs signals an error "
"and stops the function from attempting to continue to execute."
msgstr ""
"テストの簡易版は、<code class=\"code\">sorted-lengths</code> リストに <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の値が含まれていない限り正常に動作します。その場"
"合、<code class=\"code\">(car sorted-lengths)</code> 式関数は <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。<code class=\"code\">&lt;</code> 関数"
"は、数値を空リストである <code class=\"code\">nil</code> と比較できないため、"
"Emacs はエラーを通知し、関数が実行を継続しようとするのを阻止します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Counting-function-definitions.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">sorted-lengths</code> list always becomes <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> when the counter reaches the end of the list.  "
"This means that any attempt to use the <code class=\"code\">defuns-per-"
"range</code> function with the simple version of the test will fail."
msgstr ""
"カウンターがリストの末尾に達すると、<code class=\"code\">sorted-lengths</"
"code> リストは常に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> になります。つまり、テスト"
"の簡易版で <code class=\"code\">defuns-per-range</code> 関数を使用しようとし"
"ても、失敗することになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Counting-function-definitions.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"We solve the problem by using the <code class=\"code\">(car sorted-lengths)</"
"code> expression in conjunction with the <code class=\"code\">and</code> "
"expression.  The <code class=\"code\">(car sorted-lengths)</code> expression "
"returns a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value so long as the list has "
"at least one number within it, but returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"if the list is empty.  The <code class=\"code\">and</code> expression first "
"evaluates the <code class=\"code\">(car sorted-lengths)</code> expression, "
"and if it is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, returns false <em "
"class=\"emph\">without</em> evaluating the <code class=\"code\">&lt;</code> "
"expression.  But if the <code class=\"code\">(car sorted-lengths)</code> "
"expression returns a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value, the <code "
"class=\"code\">and</code> expression evaluates the <code class=\"code\">&lt;"
"</code> expression, and returns that value as the value of the <code "
"class=\"code\">and</code> expression."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(car sorted-lengths)</code>式を<code "
"class=\"code\">and</code>式と組み合わせて使用することで、この問題を解決しま"
"す。<code class=\"code\">(car sorted-lengths)</code>式は、リスト内に少なくと"
"も1つの数値が含まれている限り<code class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の値を返し、"
"リストが空の場合は<code class=\"code\">nil</code>を返します。<code "
"class=\"code\">and</code>式はまず<code class=\"code\">(car sorted-lengths)</"
"code>式を評価し、それが<code class=\"code\">nil</code>であれば、<code "
"class=\"code\">&lt;</code>式を評価<em class=\"emph\">せずに</em>falseを返しま"
"す。ただし、<code class=\"code\">(car sorted-lengths)</code>式が<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>以外の値を返す場合、<code class=\"code\">and</code>"
"式は<code class=\"code\">&lt;</code>式を評価し、その値を<code "
"class=\"code\">and</code>式の値として返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
