# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Dec-Example-altogether.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"We can put these expressions together to create a function definition that "
"works.  However, on examination, we find that one of the local variables is "
"unneeded!"
msgstr ""
"これらの式を組み合わせることで、動作する関数定義を作成できます。しかし、詳し"
"く見てみると、ローカル変数の一つが不要であることがわかります！"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Dec-Example-altogether.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The function definition looks like this:"
msgstr "関数の定義は次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Dec-Example-altogether.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";;; <span class=\"r\">First subtractive version.</span>\n"
"(defun triangle (number-of-rows)\n"
"  &quot;Add up the number of pebbles in a triangle.&quot;\n"
"  (let ((total 0)\n"
"        (number-of-pebbles-in-row number-of-rows))\n"
"    (while (&gt; number-of-pebbles-in-row 0)\n"
"      (setq total (+ total number-of-pebbles-in-row))\n"
"      (setq number-of-pebbles-in-row\n"
"            (1- number-of-pebbles-in-row)))\n"
"    total))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Dec-Example-altogether.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "As written, this function works."
msgstr "記述通り、この関数は動作します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Dec-Example-altogether.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"However, we do not need <code class=\"code\">number-of-pebbles-in-row</code>."
msgstr ""
"ただし、<code class=\"code\">number-of-pebbles-in-row</code>は不要です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Dec-Example-altogether.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
