msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Argument-as-local-variable\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Dec-Example-altogether.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"When the <code class=\"code\">triangle</code> function is evaluated, the "
"symbol <code class=\"code\">number-of-rows</code> will be bound to a number, "
"giving it an initial value.  That number can be changed in the body of the "
"function as if it were a local variable, without any fear that such a change "
"will effect the value of the variable outside of the function.  This is a "
"very useful characteristic of Lisp; it means that the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">number-of-rows</code> can be used anywhere in the function "
"where <code class=\"code\">number-of-pebbles-in-row</code> is used."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">triangle</code> 関数が評価される際、シンボル <code "
"class=\"code\">number-of-rows</code> には数値が束縛され、初期値が与えられま"
"す。その数値は、あたかもローカル変数であるかのように関数本体内で変更でき、そ"
"のような変更が関数外の変数の値に影響を与える心配はありません。これは Lisp の"
"非常に有用な特性であり、変数 <code class=\"code\">number-of-rows</code> を、"
"<code class=\"code\">number-of-pebbles-in-row</code> が使用されている関数内の"
"あらゆる箇所で使用できることを意味します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Dec-Example-altogether.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Here is a second version of the function written a bit more cleanly:"
msgstr "こちらが、もう少しすっきりと記述した関数の別バージョンです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Dec-Example-altogether.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun triangle (number)                ; <span class=\"r\">Second version.</span>\n"
"  &quot;Return sum of numbers 1 through NUMBER inclusive.&quot;\n"
"  (let ((total 0))\n"
"    (while (&gt; number 0)\n"
"      (setq total (+ total number))\n"
"      (setq number (1- number)))\n"
"    total))\n"
msgstr ""

