#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/eintr/Dec-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>The parts of the function definition<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#The-parts-of-the-function-definition-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>関数定義の構成要素<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-parts-of-the-"
"function-definition-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Dec-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"We start with three variables: the total number of rows in the triangle; the "
"number of pebbles in a row; and the total number of pebbles, which is what "
"we want to calculate.  These variables can be named <code "
"class=\"code\">number-of-rows</code>, <code class=\"code\">number-of-pebbles-"
"in-row</code>, and <code class=\"code\">total</code>, respectively."
msgstr ""
"まず、3つの変数を用意します。三角形の行の総数、1行あたりの小石の数、そして計"
"算したい小石の総数です。これらの変数には、それぞれ <code "
"class=\"code\">number-of-rows</code>、<code class=\"code\">number-of-pebbles-"
"in-row</code>、<code class=\"code\">total</code> という名前を付けることができ"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Dec-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Both <code class=\"code\">total</code> and <code class=\"code\">number-of-"
"pebbles-in-row</code> are used only inside the function and are declared "
"with <code class=\"code\">let</code>.  The initial value of <code "
"class=\"code\">total</code> should, of course, be zero.  However, the "
"initial value of <code class=\"code\">number-of-pebbles-in-row</code> should "
"be equal to the number of rows in the triangle, since the addition will "
"start with the longest row."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">total</code> と <code class=\"code\">number-of-pebbles-"
"in-row</code> はいずれも関数内でのみ使用され、<code class=\"code\">let</"
"code> とともに宣言されます。  <code class=\"code\">total</code> の初期値は、"
"当然ながら 0 であるべきです。  ただし、加算は最も長い行から始まるため、<code "
"class=\"code\">number-of-pebbles-in-row</code> の初期値は三角形の行数と等しく"
"なる必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Dec-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This means that the beginning of the <code class=\"code\">let</code> "
"expression will look like this:"
msgstr "つまり、<code class=\"code\">let</code> 式の冒頭は次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Dec-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((total 0)\n"
"      (number-of-pebbles-in-row number-of-rows))\n"
"  <var class=\"var\">body</var>...)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Dec-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The total number of pebbles can be found by repeatedly adding the number of "
"pebbles in a row to the total already found, that is, by repeatedly "
"evaluating the following expression:"
msgstr ""
"小石の総数は、ある行にある小石の数をすでに求めた合計に繰り返し加算すること、"
"すなわち、次の式を繰り返し評価することで求めることができます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Dec-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(setq total (+ total number-of-pebbles-in-row))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Dec-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"After the <code class=\"code\">number-of-pebbles-in-row</code> is added to "
"the <code class=\"code\">total</code>, the <code class=\"code\">number-of-"
"pebbles-in-row</code> should be decremented by one, since the next time the "
"loop repeats, the preceding row will be added to the total."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">total</code>に<code class=\"code\">number-of-pebbles-in-"
"row</code>が追加された後、<code class=\"code\">number-of-pebbles-in-row</"
"code>を1減じる必要があります。次回ループが繰り返される際、直前の行が合計に加"
"算されるためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Dec-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The number of pebbles in a preceding row is one less than the number of "
"pebbles in a row, so the built-in Emacs Lisp function <code class=\"code\">1-"
"</code> can be used to compute the number of pebbles in the preceding row.  "
"This can be done with the following expression:"
msgstr ""
"前の行にある小石の数は、現在の行の数より1つ少ないため、Emacs Lispの組み込み関"
"数 <code class=\"code\">1-</code> を使って前の行の小石の数を計算できます。こ"
"れは、以下の式で行えます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Dec-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq number-of-pebbles-in-row\n"
"      (1- number-of-pebbles-in-row))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Dec-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Finally, we know that the <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop should stop "
"making repeated additions when there are no pebbles in a row.  So the test "
"for the <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop is simply:"
msgstr ""
"最後に、<code class=\"code\">while</code>ループは、小石が一列に並んでいない場"
"合に繰り返し加算を行うのを止める必要があります。したがって、<code "
"class=\"code\">while</code>ループの判定は単純に次のようになります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Dec-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(while (&gt; number-of-pebbles-in-row 0)\n"
msgstr ""

