# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Design-count_002dwords_002dexample.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"First, we will implement the word count command with a <code "
"class=\"code\">while</code> loop, then with recursion.  The command will, of "
"course, be interactive."
msgstr ""
"まず、単語数カウントコマンドを<code class=\"code\">while</code>ループで、次に"
"再帰で実装します。もちろん、このコマンドは対話型となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Design-count_002dwords_002dexample.html
