# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Design-count_002dwords_002dexample.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "What we need to do is fill in the slots."
msgstr "私たちがすべきことは、空欄を埋めることです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Design-count_002dwords_002dexample.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The name of the function should be self-explanatory and easy to remember.  "
"<code class=\"code\">count-words-region</code> is the obvious choice.  Since "
"that name is used for the standard Emacs command to count words, we will "
"name our implementation <code class=\"code\">count-words-example</code>."
msgstr ""
"関数名は自明で覚えやすいものであるべきです。<code class=\"code\">count-words-"
"region</code>が当然の選択肢でしょう。その名称は単語数を数えるEmacsの標準コマ"
"ンドに使われているため、我々の実装名は<code class=\"code\">count-words-"
"example</code>とします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Design-count_002dwords_002dexample.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The function counts words within a region.  This means that the argument "
"list must contain symbols that are bound to the two positions, the beginning "
"and end of the region.  These two positions can be called &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">beginning</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">end</"
"samp>&rsquo; respectively.  The first line of the documentation should be a "
"single sentence, since that is all that is printed as documentation by a "
"command such as <code class=\"code\">apropos</code>.  The interactive "
"expression will be of the form &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">(interactive "
"&quot;r&quot;)</samp>&rsquo;, since that will cause Emacs to pass the "
"beginning and end of the region to the function&rsquo;s argument list.  All "
"this is routine."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、領域内の単語数をカウントします。つまり、引数リストには、領域の開"
"始位置と終了位置という2つの位置に束縛されたシンボルが含まれている必要がありま"
"す。これら2つの位置は、それぞれ &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">beginning</"
"samp>&rsquo; および &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">end</samp>&rsquo; と呼ぶこと"
"ができます。ドキュメントの1行目は単一の文であるべきです。というのも、<code "
"class=\"code\">apropos</code> のようなコマンドによってドキュメントとして出力"
"されるのはそれだけだからです。インタラクティブな式は &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">(interactive &quot;r&quot;)</samp>&rsquo; という形式になりま"
"す。これにより、Emacs が領域の開始位置と終了位置を関数の引数リストに渡すよう"
"になるためです。これらはすべて定型的な処理です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Design-count_002dwords_002dexample.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The body of the function needs to be written to do three tasks: first, to "
"set up conditions under which the <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop can "
"count words, second, to run the <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop, and "
"third, to send a message to the user."
msgstr ""
"関数本体は、3つの処理を行うように記述する必要があります。具体的には、まず、"
"<code class=\"code\">while</code>ループが単語をカウントできる条件を整えるこ"
"と、次に、<code class=\"code\">while</code>ループを実行すること、そして最後"
"に、ユーザーにメッセージを送信することです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Design-count_002dwords_002dexample.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"When a user calls <code class=\"code\">count-words-example</code>, point may "
"be at the beginning or the end of the region.  However, the counting process "
"must start at the beginning of the region.  This means we will want to put "
"point there if it is not already there.  Executing <code "
"class=\"code\">(goto-char beginning)</code> ensures this.  Of course, we "
"will want to return point to its expected position when the function "
"finishes its work.  For this reason, the body must be enclosed in a <code "
"class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> expression."
msgstr ""
"ユーザーが <code class=\"code\">count-words-example</code> を呼び出す際、"
"point は領域の先頭または末尾にある可能性があります。ただし、カウント処理は領"
"域の先頭から開始しなければなりません。つまり、point がまだそこにない場合は、"
"そこに配置する必要があります。<code class=\"code\">(goto-char beginning)</"
"code> を実行することで、これが保証されます。もちろん、関数の処理が完了した際"
"には、point を想定通りの位置に戻す必要があります。このため、本体は <code "
"class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> 式で囲む必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Design-count_002dwords_002dexample.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The central part of the body of the function consists of a <code "
"class=\"code\">while</code> loop in which one expression jumps point forward "
"word by word, and another expression counts those jumps.  The true-or-false-"
"test of the <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop should test true so long "
"as point should jump forward, and false when point is at the end of the "
"region."
msgstr ""
"関数本体の中核部分は、一方の式がポインタを単語単位で前方へジャンプさせ、もう"
"一方の式がそのジャンプ回数をカウントする<code class=\"code\">while</code>ルー"
"プで構成されている。<code class=\"code\">while</code>ループの真偽判定は、ポイ"
"ンタが前方へジャンプすべき限りtrueとなり、ポインタが領域の終端にあるときは"
"falseとなるべきである。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Design-count_002dwords_002dexample.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"We could use <code class=\"code\">(forward-word 1)</code> as the expression "
"for moving point forward word by word, but it is easier to see what Emacs "
"identifies as a &ldquo;word&rdquo; if we use a regular expression search."
msgstr ""
"単語単位でポイントを移動させる式として <code class=\"code\">(forward-word "
"1)</code> を使うこともできますが、正規表現検索を使えば、Emacsが何を「単語」と"
"して認識しているのかがより分かりやすくなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Design-count_002dwords_002dexample.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"A regular expression search that finds the pattern for which it is searching "
"leaves point after the last character matched.  This means that a succession "
"of successful word searches will move point forward word by word."
msgstr ""
"検索対象のパターンが見つかる正規表現検索では、マッチした最後の文字の後にポイ"
"ントが置かれます。つまり、単語検索が連続して成功すると、ポイントは単語ごとに"
"前方へ移動していきます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Design-count_002dwords_002dexample.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"As a practical matter, we want the regular expression search to jump over "
"whitespace and punctuation between words as well as over the words "
"themselves.  A regexp that refuses to jump over interword whitespace would "
"never jump more than one word! This means that the regexp should include the "
"whitespace and punctuation that follows a word, if any, as well as the word "
"itself.  (A word may end a buffer and not have any following whitespace or "
"punctuation, so that part of the regexp must be optional.)"
msgstr ""
"実用上、正規表現による検索では、単語間の空白や句読点だけでなく、単語自体もス"
"キップさせたいと考えます。単語間の空白をスキップしない正規表現では、決して2単"
"語以上をスキップすることはできません！つまり、正規表現には、単語自体に加え"
"て、その後に続く空白や句読点（もしあれば）も含める必要があります。（単語が"
"バッファの末尾となり、その後に空白や句読点が続かない場合もあるため、正規表現"
"のその部分は省略可能である必要があります。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Design-count_002dwords_002dexample.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Thus, what we want for the regexp is a pattern defining one or more word "
"constituent characters followed, optionally, by one or more characters that "
"are not word constituents.  The regular expression for this is:"
msgstr ""
"したがって、正規表現に求めるのは、1つ以上の単語構成文字を定義し、その後に（任"
"意で）1つ以上の単語構成文字ではない文字が続くパターンです。これに対応する正規"
"表現は以下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Design-count_002dwords_002dexample.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\w+\\W*\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Design-count_002dwords_002dexample.html
msgid ""
"The buffer&rsquo;s syntax table determines which characters are and are not "
"word constituents.  For more information about syntax, see <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Syntax-Tables.html#Syntax-Tables\">Syntax Tables</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"バッファの構文テーブルによって、どの文字が単語構成要素であり、どの文字がそう"
"でないかが決まります。構文の詳細については、<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU "
"Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>の<a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Syntax-Tables.html#Syntax-"
"Tables\">構文テーブル</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Design-count_002dwords_002dexample.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The search expression looks like this:"
msgstr "検索式は次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Design-count_002dwords_002dexample.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(re-search-forward &quot;\\\\w+\\\\W*&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Design-count_002dwords_002dexample.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(Note that paired backslashes precede the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">w</"
"samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">W</samp>&rsquo;.  A single "
"backslash has special meaning to the Emacs Lisp interpreter.  It indicates "
"that the following character is interpreted differently than usual.  For "
"example, the two characters, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\n</samp>&rsquo;, "
"stand for &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">newline</samp>&rsquo;, rather than for "
"a backslash followed by &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">n</samp>&rsquo;.  Two "
"backslashes in a row stand for an ordinary, unspecial backslash, so Emacs "
"Lisp interpreter ends of seeing a single backslash followed by a letter.  So "
"it discovers the letter is special.)"
msgstr ""
"（なお、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">w</samp>&rsquo;および&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">W</samp>&rsquo;の前には、ペアになったバックスラッシュが置かれ"
"ています。単一のバックスラッシュは、Emacs Lispインタプリタにおいて特別な意味"
"を持ちます。これは、後続の文字が通常とは異なる方法で解釈されることを示しま"
"す。例えば、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\n</samp>&rsquo;という2つの文字は、"
"バックスラッシュに続いて&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">n</samp>&rsquo;が来るので"
"はなく、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">newline</samp>&rsquo;を表します。バックス"
"ラッシュが2つ連続している場合は、通常の特別な意味を持たないバックスラッシュと"
"なるため、Emacs Lispインタプリタは、単一のバックスラッシュに続いて文字がある"
"のを検知した時点で、その文字が特別なものであることを判断します。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Design-count_002dwords_002dexample.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"We need a counter to count how many words there are; this variable must "
"first be set to 0 and then incremented each time Emacs goes around the <code "
"class=\"code\">while</code> loop.  The incrementing expression is simply:"
msgstr ""
"単語数をカウントするためのカウンタが必要です。この変数はまず0に設定し、Emacs"
"が<code class=\"code\">while</code>ループを1周するごとにインクリメントする必"
"要があります。インクリメント式は単純に以下の通りです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Design-count_002dwords_002dexample.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(setq count (1+ count))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Design-count_002dwords_002dexample.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Finally, we want to tell the user how many words there are in the region.  "
"The <code class=\"code\">message</code> function is intended for presenting "
"this kind of information to the user.  The message has to be phrased so that "
"it reads properly regardless of how many words there are in the region: we "
"don&rsquo;t want to say that &ldquo;there are 1 words in the region&rdquo;.  "
"The conflict between singular and plural is ungrammatical.  We can solve "
"this problem by using a conditional expression that evaluates different "
"messages depending on the number of words in the region.  There are three "
"possibilities: no words in the region, one word in the region, and more than "
"one word.  This means that the <code class=\"code\">cond</code> special form "
"is appropriate."
msgstr ""
"最後に、領域内に単語がいくつあるかをユーザーに伝えたいと考えます。<code "
"class=\"code\">message</code> 関数は、このような情報をユーザーに提示するため"
"のものです。メッセージは、領域内の単語数に関わらず適切に読めるように表現する"
"必要があります。「領域内に1つの単語があります」とは言いたくないからです。単数"
"形と複数形の混在は文法的に正しくありません。この問題は、領域内の単語数に応じ"
"て異なるメッセージを評価する条件式を用いることで解決できます。可能性は、「領"
"域内に単語がない」、「領域内に1つの単語がある」、「2つ以上の単語がある」の3通"
"りです。つまり、<code class=\"code\">cond</code> 特殊形式が適切ということにな"
"ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Design-count_002dwords_002dexample.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "All this leads to the following function definition:"
msgstr "これらすべてから、次のような関数定義が導かれます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Design-count_002dwords_002dexample.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";;; <span class=\"r\">First version; has bugs!</span>\n"
"(defun count-words-example (beginning end)\n"
"  &quot;Print number of words in the region.\n"
"Words are defined as at least one word-constituent\n"
"character followed by at least one character that\n"
"is not a word-constituent.  The buffer's syntax\n"
"table determines which characters these are.&quot;\n"
"  (interactive &quot;r&quot;)\n"
"  (message &quot;Counting words in region ... &quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Design-count_002dwords_002dexample.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";;; <span class=\"r\">1. Set up appropriate conditions.</span>\n"
"  (save-excursion\n"
"    (goto-char beginning)\n"
"    (let ((count 0))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Design-count_002dwords_002dexample.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";;; <span class=\"r\">2. Run the</span> while <span class=\"r\">loop.</span>\n"
"      (while (&lt; (point) end)\n"
"        (re-search-forward &quot;\\\\w+\\\\W*&quot;)\n"
"        (setq count (1+ count)))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
