# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/eintr/Determining-the-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>Determining the Element<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Determining-"
"the-Element-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>要素の決定<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Determining-the-"
"Element-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Determining-the-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Among other actions, the else-part of the <code class=\"code\">if</code> "
"expression sets the value of <code class=\"code\">kill-ring-yank-pointer</"
"code> to <code class=\"code\">ARGth-kill-element</code> when the kill ring "
"has something in it and the value of <code class=\"code\">do-not-move</code> "
"is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"その他の動作に加え、<code class=\"code\">if</code> 式の else 部分は、キルリン"
"グに内容があり、かつ <code class=\"code\">do-not-move</code> の値が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合に、<code class=\"code\">kill-ring-yank-"
"pointer</code> の値を <code class=\"code\">ARGth-kill-element</code> に設定し"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Determining-the-Element.html
#: build/html/eintr/Small-buffer-case.html
#: build/html/eintr/X-Axis-Tic-Marks.html
#: build/html/eintr/count_002dwords_002din_002ddefun.html
#: build/html/eintr/yank.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The code looks like this:"
msgstr "コードはこんな感じです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Determining-the-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(nthcdr (mod (- n (length kill-ring-yank-pointer))\n"
"             (length kill-ring))\n"
"        kill-ring)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Determining-the-Element.html
msgid ""
"This needs some examination.  Unless it is not supposed to move the pointer, "
"the <code class=\"code\">current-kill</code> function changes where <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-ring-yank-pointer</code> points.  That is what the <code "
"class=\"code\">(setq&nbsp;kill-ring-yank-pointer&nbsp;ARGth-kill-element))</"
"code> expression does.  Also, clearly, <code class=\"code\">ARGth-kill-"
"element</code> is being set to be equal to some <small class=\"sc\">CDR</"
"small> of the kill ring, using the <code class=\"code\">nthcdr</code> "
"function that is described in an earlier section.  (See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"copy_002dregion_002das_002dkill.html\"><code class=\"code\">copy-"
"region-as-kill</code></a>.)  How does it do this?"
msgstr ""
"これについては検証が必要です。ポインタを移動させない仕様でない限り、<code "
"class=\"code\">current-kill</code> 関数は <code class=\"code\">kill-ring-"
"yank-pointer</code> が指す先を変更します。<code "
"class=\"code\">(setq&nbsp;kill-ring-yank-pointer&nbsp;ARGth-kill-element))</"
"code> 式が行っているのはまさにこの動作です。また、明らかに <code "
"class=\"code\">ARGth-kill-element</code> は、前のセクションで説明されている "
"<code class=\"code\">nthcdr</code> 関数を用いて、キルリング内の何らかの "
"<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> と等しくなるように設定されています。（<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"copy_002dregion_002das_002dkill.html\"><code "
"class=\"code\">copy-region-as-kill</code></a> を参照してください。）これはど"
"のようにして実現されているのでしょうか。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Determining-the-Element.html
msgid ""
"As we have seen before (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"nthcdr.html\"><code "
"class=\"code\">nthcdr</code></a>), the <code class=\"code\">nthcdr</code> "
"function works by repeatedly taking the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of a "
"list&mdash;it takes the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of the <small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> &hellip;"
msgstr ""
"これまで見てきたように（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"nthcdr.html\"><code "
"class=\"code\">nthcdr</code></a>参照）、<code class=\"code\">nthcdr</code>関"
"数はリストの<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>を繰り返し取得することで動作します"
"&mdash;<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>の<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>の"
"<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>を取得し&hellip;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Determining-the-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The two following expressions produce the same result:"
msgstr "以下の2つの式は同じ結果になります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Determining-the-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq kill-ring-yank-pointer (cdr kill-ring))\n"
"\n"
"(setq kill-ring-yank-pointer (nthcdr 1 kill-ring))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Determining-the-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"However, the <code class=\"code\">nthcdr</code> expression is more "
"complicated.  It uses the <code class=\"code\">mod</code> function to "
"determine which <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> to select."
msgstr ""
"しかし、<code class=\"code\">nthcdr</code> 式はより複雑です。これは <code "
"class=\"code\">mod</code> 関数を用いて、どの <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> "
"を選択するかを決定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Determining-the-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(You will remember to look at inner functions first; indeed, we will have to "
"go inside the <code class=\"code\">mod</code>.)"
msgstr ""
"（まずは内部関数を確認することを忘れないでください。実際、<code "
"class=\"code\">mod</code>の内部まで踏み込む必要があります。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Determining-the-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">mod</code> function returns the value of its first "
"argument modulo the second; that is to say, it returns the remainder after "
"dividing the first argument by the second.  The value returned has the same "
"sign as the second argument."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">mod</code> 関数は、第1引数の値を第2引数で割った余りを返"
"します。つまり、第1引数を第2引数で割ったときの余りを返します。返される値は、"
"第2引数と同じ符号を持ちます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Determining-the-Element.html build/html/eintr/lambda.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Thus,"
msgstr "したがって、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Determining-the-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(mod 12 4)\n"
"  &rArr; 0  ;; <span class=\"r\">because there is no remainder</span>\n"
"(mod 13 4)\n"
"  &rArr; 1\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Determining-the-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In this case, the first argument is often smaller than the second.  That is "
"fine."
msgstr ""
"この場合、第1引数は第2引数よりも小さいことが多いです。それで問題ありません。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Determining-the-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(mod 0 4)\n"
"  &rArr; 0\n"
"(mod 1 4)\n"
"  &rArr; 1\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Determining-the-Element.html
msgid ""
"We can guess what the <code class=\"code\">-</code> function does.  It is "
"like <code class=\"code\">+</code> but subtracts instead of adds; the <code "
"class=\"code\">-</code> function subtracts its second argument from its "
"first.  Also, we already know what the <code class=\"code\">length</code> "
"function does (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"length.html\">Find the Length "
"of a List: <code class=\"code\">length</code></a>).  It returns the length "
"of a list."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">-</code> 関数がどのような動作をするかは推測できます。"
"<code class=\"code\">+</code> と同様ですが、加算ではなく減算を行います。"
"<code class=\"code\">-</code> 関数は、第1引数から第2引数を減算します。また、"
"<code class=\"code\">length</code> 関数がどのような動作をするかは既に分かって"
"います（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"length.html\">リストの長さを求める: <code "
"class=\"code\">length</code></a> を参照）。これはリストの長さを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Determining-the-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"And <code class=\"code\">n</code> is the name of the required argument to "
"the <code class=\"code\">current-kill</code> function."
msgstr ""
"また、<code class=\"code\">n</code>は<code class=\"code\">current-kill</code>"
"関数の必須引数の名前です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Determining-the-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"So when the first argument to <code class=\"code\">nthcdr</code> is zero, "
"the <code class=\"code\">nthcdr</code> expression returns the whole list, as "
"you can see by evaluating the following:"
msgstr ""
"したがって、<code class=\"code\">nthcdr</code> の第1引数が 0 の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">nthcdr</code> 式はリスト全体を返します。これは、以下を評価すれ"
"ば分かります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Determining-the-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; kill-ring-yank-pointer <span class=\"r\">and</span> kill-ring <span class=\"r\">have a length of four</span>\n"
";; <span class=\"r\">and</span> (mod (- 0 4) 4) &rArr; 0\n"
"(nthcdr (mod (- 0 4) 4)\n"
"        '(&quot;fourth line of text&quot;\n"
"          &quot;third line&quot;\n"
"          &quot;second piece of text&quot;\n"
"          &quot;first some text&quot;))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Determining-the-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"When the first argument to the <code class=\"code\">current-kill</code> "
"function is one, the <code class=\"code\">nthcdr</code> expression returns "
"the list without its first element."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">current-kill</code> 関数の第1引数が 1 の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">nthcdr</code> 式は先頭要素を除いたリストを返します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Determining-the-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(nthcdr (mod (- 1 4) 4)\n"
"        '(&quot;fourth line of text&quot;\n"
"          &quot;third line&quot;\n"
"          &quot;second piece of text&quot;\n"
"          &quot;first some text&quot;))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Determining-the-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-global-variable-defined\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-variable_002c-global_002c-defined\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-global-variable-defined\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-variable_002c-global_002c-defined\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Determining-the-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Incidentally, both <code class=\"code\">kill-ring</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-ring-yank-pointer</code> are <em class=\"dfn\">global "
"variables</em>.  That means that any expression in Emacs Lisp can access "
"them.  They are not like the local variables set by <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> or like the symbols in an argument list.  Local "
"variables can only be accessed within the <code class=\"code\">let</code> "
"that defines them or the function that specifies them in an argument list "
"(and within expressions called by them)."
msgstr ""
"ちなみに、<code class=\"code\">kill-ring</code> と <code class=\"code\">kill-"
"ring-yank-pointer</code> はどちらも <em class=\"dfn\">グローバル変数</em> で"
"す。つまり、Emacs Lisp のあらゆる式からこれらにアクセスできます。これらは、"
"<code class=\"code\">let</code> で設定されるローカル変数や、引数リスト内のシ"
"ンボルとは異なります。ローカル変数は、それを定義する <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> 内、あるいは引数リストで指定する関数内（およびそれ"
"らから呼び出される式内）でしかアクセスできません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Determining-the-Element.html
msgid ""
"(See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Prevent-confusion.html\"><code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> Prevents Confusion</a>, and <a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"defun.html\">The <code class=\"code\">defun</code> Macro</a>.)"
msgstr ""
