#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Digression-into-C.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">copy-region-as-kill</code> function (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"copy_002dregion_002das_002dkill.html\"><code "
"class=\"code\">copy-region-as-kill</code></a>) uses the <code "
"class=\"code\">filter-buffer-substring</code> function, which in turn uses "
"the <code class=\"code\">delete-and-extract-region</code> function.  It "
"removes the contents of a region and you cannot get them back."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Digression-into-C.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Unlike the other code discussed here, the <code class=\"code\">delete-and-"
"extract-region</code> function is not written in Emacs Lisp; it is written "
"in C and is one of the primitives of the GNU Emacs system.  Since it is very "
"simple, I will digress briefly from Lisp and describe it here."
msgstr ""
"ここで扱う他のコードとは異なり、<code class=\"code\">delete-and-extract-"
"region</code> 関数は Emacs Lisp で書かれているわけではなく、C で書かれてお"
"り、GNU Emacs システムのプリミティブの一つです。非常にシンプルなので、Lisp か"
"ら少し脱線して、ここで説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Digression-into-C.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Like many of the other Emacs primitives, <code class=\"code\">delete-and-"
"extract-region</code> is written as an instance of a C macro, a macro being "
"a template for code.  The complete macro looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"他の多くのEmacsプリミティブと同様に、<code class=\"code\">delete-and-extract-"
"region</code>はCマクロのインスタンスとして記述されます。マクロとは、コードの"
"テンプレートのことです。完全なマクロは以下のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Digression-into-C.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"DEFUN (&quot;delete-and-extract-region&quot;, Fdelete_and_extract_region,\n"
"       Sdelete_and_extract_region, 2, 2, 0,\n"
"       doc: /* Delete the text between START and END and return it.  */)\n"
"  (Lisp_Object start, Lisp_Object end)\n"
"{\n"
"  validate_region (&amp;start, &amp;end);\n"
"  if (XFIXNUM (start) == XFIXNUM (end))\n"
"    return empty_unibyte_string;\n"
"  return del_range_1 (XFIXNUM (start), XFIXNUM (end), 1, 1);\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Digression-into-C.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Without going into the details of the macro writing process, let me point "
"out that this macro starts with the word <code class=\"code\">DEFUN</code>.  "
"The word <code class=\"code\">DEFUN</code> was chosen since the code serves "
"the same purpose as <code class=\"code\">defun</code> does in Lisp.  (The "
"<code class=\"code\">DEFUN</code> C macro is defined in <samp "
"class=\"file\">emacs/src/lisp.h</samp>.)"
msgstr ""
"マクロの記述プロセスの詳細には触れませんが、このマクロは <code "
"class=\"code\">DEFUN</code> という単語から始まる点を指摘しておきます。<code "
"class=\"code\">DEFUN</code> という単語を選んだのは、このコードが Lisp におけ"
"る <code class=\"code\">defun</code> と同じ役割を果たすためです。（C のマク"
"ロ <code class=\"code\">DEFUN</code> は <samp class=\"file\">emacs/src/"
"lisp.h</samp> で定義されています。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Digression-into-C.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The word <code class=\"code\">DEFUN</code> is followed by seven parts inside "
"of parentheses:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">DEFUN</code> という単語の後には、括弧内に7つの部分が続い"
"ています："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Digression-into-C.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The first part is the name given to the function in Lisp, <code "
"class=\"code\">delete-and-extract-region</code>."
msgstr ""
"前半は、Lispにおける関数に付けられた名前、<code class=\"code\">delete-and-"
"extract-region</code>です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Digression-into-C.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The second part is the name of the function in C, <code "
"class=\"code\">Fdelete_and_extract_region</code>.  By convention, it starts "
"with &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">F</samp>&rsquo;.  Since C does not use "
"hyphens in names, underscores are used instead."
msgstr ""
"後半部分はC言語における関数名、<code "
"class=\"code\">Fdelete_and_extract_region</code>です。慣習として、&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">F</samp>&rsquo;から始まります。C言語では名前にハイフンを"
"使用しないため、代わりにアンダースコアが用いられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Digression-into-C.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The third part is the name for the C constant structure that records "
"information on this function for internal use.  It is the name of the "
"function in C but begins with an &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">S</samp>&rsquo; "
"instead of an &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">F</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"第3部は、内部利用のためにこの関数に関する情報を記録するC言語の定数構造体の名"
"称です。これはC言語における関数名ですが、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">F</"
"samp>&rsquo;ではなく&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">S</samp>&rsquo;で始まります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Digression-into-C.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The fourth and fifth parts specify the minimum and maximum number of "
"arguments the function can have.  This function demands exactly 2 arguments."
msgstr ""
"第4部と第5部では、関数が受け取り得る引数の最小数と最大数が規定されています。"
"この関数は、ちょうど2つの引数を必要とします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Digression-into-C.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The sixth part is nearly like the argument that follows the <code "
"class=\"code\">interactive</code> declaration in a function written in Lisp: "
"a letter followed, perhaps, by a prompt.  The only difference from Lisp is "
"when the macro is called with no arguments.  Then you write a <code "
"class=\"code\">0</code> (which is a null string), as in this macro."
msgstr ""
"第6部は、Lispで記述された関数における<code class=\"code\">interactive</code>"
"宣言に続く引数の記述にほぼ似ています。つまり、文字の後に、おそらくプロンプト"
"が続くという形式です。Lispとの唯一の違いは、マクロが引数なしで呼び出される場"
"合です。その際は、このマクロのように、<code class=\"code\">0</code>（空文字"
"列）を記述します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Digression-into-C.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If you were to specify arguments, you would place them between quotation "
"marks.  The C macro for <code class=\"code\">goto-char</code> includes <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;NGoto char: &quot;</code> in this position to indicate "
"that the function expects a raw prefix, in this case, a numerical location "
"in a buffer, and provides a prompt."
msgstr ""
"引数を指定する場合は、引用符で囲みます。<code class=\"code\">goto-char</"
"code> 用の C マクロでは、この位置に <code class=\"code\">&quot;NGoto char: "
"&quot;</code> を含めることで、関数が生のプレフィックス（この場合はバッファ内"
"の数値位置）を期待していることを示し、プロンプトを提供しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Digression-into-C.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The seventh part is a documentation string, just like the one for a function "
"written in Emacs Lisp.  This is written as a C comment.  (When you build "
"Emacs, the program <code class=\"command\">lib-src/make-docfile</code> "
"extracts these comments and uses them to make the documentation.)"
msgstr ""
"第7部分はドキュメント文字列で、Emacs Lispで書かれた関数のものと同じです。これ"
"はC言語のコメントとして記述されます。（Emacsをビルドする際、プログラム <code "
"class=\"command\">lib-src/make-docfile</code> がこれらのコメントを抽出し、ド"
"キュメントの作成に利用します。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Digression-into-C.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In a C macro, the formal parameters come next, with a statement of what kind "
"of object they are, followed by the body of the macro.  For <code "
"class=\"code\">delete-and-extract-region</code> the body consists of the "
"following four lines:"
msgstr ""
"Cのマクロでは、次に仮引数が続き、それがどのようなオブジェクトであるかが記述さ"
"れ、その後にマクロの本体が続きます。<code class=\"code\">delete-and-extract-"
"region</code>の場合、本体は以下の4行で構成されています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Digression-into-C.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"validate_region (&amp;start, &amp;end);\n"
"if (XFIXNUM (start) == XFIXNUM (end))\n"
"  return empty_unibyte_string;\n"
"return del_range_1 (XFIXNUM (start), XFIXNUM (end), 1, 1);\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Digression-into-C.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">validate_region</code> function checks whether the "
"values passed as the beginning and end of the region are the proper type and "
"are within range.  If the beginning and end positions are the same, then "
"return an empty string."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">validate_region</code> 関数は、領域の開始位置および終了"
"位置として渡された値が適切な型であり、かつ範囲内にあるかを判定します。開始位"
"置と終了位置が同一の場合は、空文字列を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Digression-into-C.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">del_range_1</code> function actually deletes the "
"text.  It is a complex function we will not look into.  It updates the "
"buffer and does other things.  However, it is worth looking at the two "
"arguments passed to <code class=\"code\">del_range_1</code>.  These are "
"<code class=\"code\">XFIXNUM&nbsp;(start)</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">XFIXNUM&nbsp;(end)</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">del_range_1</code> 関数は、実際にはテキストを削除しま"
"す。これは複雑な関数であるため、ここでは詳しく見ません。バッファを更新した"
"り、その他の処理を行ったりします。とはいえ、<code "
"class=\"code\">del_range_1</code> に渡される2つの引数については見ておく価値が"
"あります。それが <code class=\"code\">XFIXNUM&nbsp;(start)</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">XFIXNUM&nbsp;(end)</code> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Digression-into-C.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"As far as the C language is concerned, <code class=\"code\">start</code> and "
"<code class=\"code\">end</code> are two opaque values that mark the "
"beginning and end of the region to be deleted.  More precisely, and "
"requiring more expert knowledge to understand, the two values are of type "
"<code class=\"code\">Lisp_Object</code>, which might be a C pointer, a C "
"integer, or a C <code class=\"code\">struct</code>; C code ordinarily should "
"not care how <code class=\"code\">Lisp_Object</code> is implemented."
msgstr ""
"C言語の観点から言えば、<code class=\"code\">start</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">end</code> は、削除対象領域の開始と終了を示す2つの不透明な値で"
"ある。より正確に言えば――理解にはより高度な専門知識を要するが――これら2つの値"
"は <code class=\"code\">Lisp_Object</code> 型であり、Cのポインタ、Cの整数、あ"
"るいはCの <code class=\"code\">struct</code> のいずれかとなり得る。通常、C"
"コードは <code class=\"code\">Lisp_Object</code> がどのように実装されているか"
"を気にする必要はない。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Digression-into-C.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">Lisp_Object</code> widths depend on the machine, and "
"are typically 32 or 64 bits.  A few of the bits are used to specify the type "
"of information; the remaining bits are used as content."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">Lisp_Object</code> 幅はマシンによって異なり、通常は32"
"ビットまたは64ビットです。ビットの一部は情報の種類を指定するために使用され、"
"残りのビットはコンテンツとして使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Digression-into-C.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">XFIXNUM</samp>&rsquo; is a C macro that extracts "
"the relevant integer from the longer collection of bits; the type bits are "
"discarded."
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">XFIXNUM</samp>&rsquo;は、より長いビット列から該当"
"する整数を抽出するCマクロであり、型ビットは破棄されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
