#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Digression-into-C.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"It deletes the region between the beginning position, <code "
"class=\"code\">start</code>, and the ending position, <code "
