# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Divide-and-Conquer.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Described in one phrase, the histogram project is daunting; but divided into "
"numerous small steps, each of which we can take one at a time, the project "
"becomes less fearsome.  Let us consider what the steps must be:"
msgstr ""
"一言でいえば、ヒストグラムのプロジェクトは気が遠くなるほど大変です。しかし、"
"数多くの小さなステップに分け、一つひとつ順に取り組んでいけば、そのハードルは"
"低くなっていきます。では、どのようなステップを踏むべきか考えてみましょう。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Divide-and-Conquer.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"First, write a function to count the words in one definition.  This includes "
"the problem of handling symbols as well as words."
msgstr ""
"まず、1つの定義に含まれる単語数を数える関数を作成してください。これには、単語"
"だけでなく記号の処理という問題も含まれます。"

