#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/eintr/Evaluating-Inner-Lists.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>1.6.1 Evaluating Inner Lists<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Evaluating-Inner-Lists-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>1.6.1 内部リストの評価<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Evaluating-"
"Inner-Lists-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Evaluating-Inner-Lists.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Inner-list-evaluation\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Evaluating-inner-lists\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Inner-list-evaluation\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Evaluating-inner-lists\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Evaluating-Inner-Lists.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If evaluation applies to a list that is inside another list, the outer list "
"may use the value returned by the first evaluation as information when the "
"outer list is evaluated.  This explains why inner expressions are evaluated "
"first: the values they return are used by the outer expressions."
msgstr ""
"評価が別のリスト内にあるリストに適用される場合、外側のリストは、自身が評価さ"
"れる際の情報として、最初の評価で返された値を利用することがあります。これが、"
"内側の式が先に評価される理由です。それらが返す値が、外側の式で使用されるため"
"です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Evaluating-Inner-Lists.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"We can investigate this process by evaluating another addition example.  "
"Place your cursor after the following expression and type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd>:"
msgstr ""
"別の加算例を評価することで、この過程を調べることができます。次の式の後にカー"
"ソルを置き、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd>と入力してください："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Evaluating-Inner-Lists.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(+ 2 (+ 3 3))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Evaluating-Inner-Lists.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The number 8 will appear in the echo area."
msgstr "エコーエリアに数字の8が表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Evaluating-Inner-Lists.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"What happens is that the Lisp interpreter first evaluates the inner "
"expression, <code class=\"code\">(+ 3 3)</code>, for which the value 6 is "
"returned; then it evaluates the outer expression as if it were written <code "
"class=\"code\">(+ 2 6)</code>, which returns the value 8.  Since there are "
"no more enclosing expressions to evaluate, the interpreter prints that value "
"in the echo area."
msgstr ""
"具体的には、Lispインタプリタはまず内側の式 <code class=\"code\">(+ 3 3)</"
"code> を評価して値 6 を返し、次に外側の式をあたかも <code class=\"code\">(+ "
"2 6)</code> と書かれているかのように評価して値 8 を返します。これ以上評価すべ"
"き外側の式はないため、インタプリタはその値をエコー領域に出力します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Evaluating-Inner-Lists.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Now it is easy to understand the name of the command invoked by the "
"keystrokes <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd>: the name is <code "
"class=\"code\">eval-last-sexp</code>.  The letters <code "
"class=\"code\">sexp</code> are an abbreviation for &ldquo;symbolic "
"expression&rdquo;, and <code class=\"code\">eval</code> is an abbreviation "
"for &ldquo;evaluate&rdquo;.  The command evaluates the last symbolic "
"expression."
msgstr ""
"キーストローク <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd> によって呼び出されるコマンド"
"の名前は、容易に分かります。その名前は <code class=\"code\">eval-last-sexp</"
"code> です。文字 <code class=\"code\">sexp</code> は「記号式」の略であり、"
"<code class=\"code\">eval</code> は「評価」の略です。このコマンドは、最後の記"
"号式を評価します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Evaluating-Inner-Lists.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"As an experiment, you can try evaluating the expression by putting the "
"cursor at the beginning of the next line immediately following the "
"expression, or inside the expression."
msgstr ""
"試しに、式の直後の次の行の先頭や、式の中にカーソルを置いて、式を評価してみる"
"こともできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Evaluating-Inner-Lists.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Here is another copy of the expression:"
msgstr "その式の別のコピーがこちらです："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Evaluating-Inner-Lists.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If you place the cursor at the beginning of the blank line that immediately "
"follows the expression and type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd>, you will "
"still get the value 8 printed in the echo area.  Now try putting the cursor "
"inside the expression.  If you put it right after the next to last "
"parenthesis (so it appears to sit on top of the last parenthesis), you will "
"get a 6 printed in the echo area! This is because the command evaluates the "
"expression <code class=\"code\">(+ 3 3)</code>."
msgstr ""
"式の直後にある空行の先頭にカーソルを置き、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd> と"
"入力すると、エコーエリアには依然として値 8 が出力されます。次に、カーソルを式"
"の中に配置してみてください。最後から2番目の括弧の直後（つまり、最後の括弧の上"
"に重なるように）に配置すると、エコーエリアには 6 が出力されます！これは、コマ"
"ンドが式 <code class=\"code\">(+ 3 3)</code> を評価するためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Evaluating-Inner-Lists.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Now put the cursor immediately after a number.  Type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x "
"C-e</kbd> and you will get the number itself.  In Lisp, if you evaluate a "
"number, you get the number itself&mdash;this is how numbers differ from "
"symbols.  If you evaluate a list starting with a symbol like <code "
"class=\"code\">+</code>, you will get a value returned that is the result of "
"the computer carrying out the instructions in the function definition "
"attached to that name.  If a symbol by itself is evaluated, something "
"different happens, as we will see in the next section."
msgstr ""
"次に、数値の直後にカーソルを置きます。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd> と入力"
"すると、その数値そのものが得られます。Lispでは、数値を評価すると、その数値そ"
"のものが得られます。これが、数値がシンボルと異なる点です。<code "
"class=\"code\">+</code> のようにシンボルで始まるリストを評価すると、その名前"
"に紐付けられた関数定義内の命令をコンピュータが実行した結果が返されます。シン"
"ボル単体を評価した場合は、次の節で見るように、また別のことが起こります。"

