# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Evaluation.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"When the Lisp interpreter works on an expression, the term for the activity "
"is called <em class=\"dfn\">evaluation</em>.  We say that the interpreter "
"&ldquo;evaluates the expression&rdquo;.  I&rsquo;ve used this term several "
"times before.  The word comes from its use in everyday language, &ldquo;to "
"ascertain the value or amount of; to appraise&rdquo;, according to <cite "
