# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Every.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In the <code class=\"code\">every</code> recursive pattern, an action is "
"performed on every element of a list."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">every</code> の再帰パターンでは、リストのすべての要素に"
"対して処理が行われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Every.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The basic pattern is:"
