# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Every.html build/html/eintr/Keep.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "If a list be empty, return <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr "リストが空の場合、<code class=\"code\">nil</code>を返す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Every.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Else, act on the beginning of the list (the <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> "
"of the list)"
msgstr ""
"それ以外の場合は、リストの先頭（リストの<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>）に対"
"して処理を行う。"

