msgid ""
"through a recursive call by the function on the rest (the <small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small>) of the list,"
msgstr ""
"関数がリストの残り（<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>）に対して再帰呼び出しを行"
"うことで、"

