"class=\"code\">cons</code>, with the results of acting on the rest."
msgstr ""
"また、必要に応じて、<code class=\"code\">cons</code>を用いて処理対象の要素"
"と、それ以外の要素への処理結果を結合します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Every.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun square-each (numbers-list)\n"
"  &quot;Square each of a NUMBERS LIST, recursively.&quot;\n"
"  (if (not numbers-list)                ; do-again-test\n"
"      nil\n"
"    (cons\n"
"     (* (car numbers-list) (car numbers-list))\n"
"     (square-each (cdr numbers-list))))) ; next-step-expression\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Every.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(square-each '(1 2 3))\n"
"    &rArr; (1 4 9)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Every.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If <code class=\"code\">numbers-list</code> is empty, do nothing.  But if it "
"has content, construct a list combining the square of the first number in "
"the list with the result of the recursive call."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">numbers-list</code> が空の場合は何もしない。ただし、内容"
"がある場合は、リストの最初の数値の2乗と再帰呼び出しの結果を組み合わせたリスト"
"を作成する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Every.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(The example follows the pattern exactly: <code class=\"code\">nil</code> is "
"returned if the numbers&rsquo; list is empty.  In practice, you would write "
"the conditional so it carries out the action when the numbers&rsquo; list is "
"not empty.)"
msgstr ""
"（この例はパターンに忠実に従っており、numbers&rsquo;リストが空の場合は<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>が返されます。実際には、numbers&rsquo;リストが空でな"
"い場合に処理が実行されるよう、条件式を記述することになります。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Every.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">print-elements-recursively</code> function (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Recursion-with-list.html\">Recursion with a List</a>) "
"is another example of an <code class=\"code\">every</code> pattern, except "
"in this case, rather than bring the results together using <code "
"class=\"code\">cons</code>, we print each element of output."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">print-elements-recursively</code> 関数（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Recursion-with-list.html\">リストを用いた再帰</a>を参"
"照）は、<code class=\"code\">every</code> パターンのもう一つの例です。ただ"
"し、この場合は <code class=\"code\">cons</code> を用いて結果をまとめるのでは"
"なく、出力の各要素をプリントします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
