# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Files-List.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"We will want our new function, <code class=\"code\">files-in-below-"
"directory</code>, to list the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.el</samp>&rsquo; "
"files in the directory it is told to check, and in any directories below "
"that directory."
msgstr ""
"新しい関数 <code class=\"code\">files-in-below-directory</code> には、指定さ"
"れたディレクトリおよびその配下にあるすべてのディレクトリにおいて、「<samp "
"class=\"samp\">.el</samp>」ファイルを一覧表示させたいと考えています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Files-List.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This gives us a hint on how to construct <code class=\"code\">files-in-below-"
"directory</code>: within a directory, the function should add &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">.el</samp>&rsquo; filenames to a list; and if, within a "
"directory, the function comes upon a sub-directory, it should go into that "
"sub-directory and repeat its actions."
msgstr ""
"これにより、<code class=\"code\">files-in-below-directory</code>をどのように"
"構築すべきかのヒントが得られます。ディレクトリ内では、関数は&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">.el</samp>&rsquo;というファイル名をリストに追加すべきであり、"
"また、ディレクトリ内でサブディレクトリが見つかった場合は、そのサブディレクト"
"リに入り、同様の処理を繰り返すべきです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Files-List.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"However, we should note that every directory contains a name that refers to "
"itself, called <samp class=\"file\">.</samp> (&ldquo;dot&rdquo;), and a name "
"that refers to its parent directory, called <samp class=\"file\">..</samp> "
"(&ldquo;dot dot&rdquo;).  (In <samp class=\"file\">/</samp>, the root "
"directory, <samp class=\"file\">..</samp> refers to itself, since <samp "
"class=\"file\">/</samp> has no parent.)  Clearly, we do not want our <code "
"class=\"code\">files-in-below-directory</code> function to enter those "
"directories, since they always lead us, directly or indirectly, to the "
"current directory."
msgstr ""
"ただし、すべてのディレクトリには、自身を指す <samp class=\"file\">.</samp>"
"（「ドット」）と、親ディレクトリを指す <samp class=\"file\">..</samp>（「ドッ"
"トドット」）という名前が含まれている点に注意が必要です。（ルートディレクトリ"
"である <samp class=\"file\">/</samp> では、<samp class=\"file\">/</samp> に親"
"がないため、<samp class=\"file\">..</samp> は自身を指します。）明らかに、"
"<code class=\"code\">files-in-below-directory</code> 関数がこれらのディレクト"
"リに入ることは避けたいところです。なぜなら、これらのディレクトリを辿ると、直"
"接的あるいは間接的に常にカレントディレクトリに到達してしまうからです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Files-List.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Consequently, our <code class=\"code\">files-in-below-directory</code> "
"function must do several tasks:"
msgstr ""
"したがって、我々の<code class=\"code\">files-in-below-directory</code>関数は"
"いくつかの処理を行う必要があります："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Files-List.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Check to see whether it is looking at a filename that ends in &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">.el</samp>&rsquo;; and if so, add its name to a list."
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.el</samp>&rsquo;で終わるファイル名を参照している"
"かを確認し、そうであればその名前をリストに追加してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Files-List.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Check to see whether it is looking at a filename that is the name of a "
"directory; and if so,"
msgstr ""
"ディレクトリ名であるファイル名を参照しているかを確認し、もしそうであれば、"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Files-List.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Check to see whether it is looking at <samp class=\"file\">.</samp> or <samp "
"class=\"file\">..</samp>; and if so skip it."
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">.</samp> または <samp class=\"file\">..</samp> を参照し"
"ているか確認し、そうであればスキップする。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Files-List.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Or else, go into that directory and repeat the process."
msgstr "あるいは、そのディレクトリに移動して手順を繰り返してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Files-List.html
msgid ""
"Let&rsquo;s write a function definition to do these tasks.  We will use a "
"<code class=\"code\">while</code> loop to move from one filename to another "
"within a directory, checking what needs to be done; and we will use a "
"recursive call to repeat the actions on each sub-directory.  The recursive "
"pattern is Accumulate (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"Accumulate.html\">Recursive Pattern: <em class=\"emph\">accumulate</"
"em></a>), using <code class=\"code\">append</code> as the combiner."
msgstr ""
"これらのタスクを実行するための関数定義を書いてみましょう。ディレクトリ内で"
"ファイル名を順に辿り、何を行うべきかを確認するには<code "
"class=\"code\">while</code>ループを使用し、各サブディレクトリに対して処理を繰"
"り返すには再帰呼び出しを使用します。再帰パターンはAccumulate（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Accumulate.html\">再帰パターン: <em "
"class=\"emph\">accumulate</em></a>を参照）で、結合子として<code "
"class=\"code\">append</code>を使用します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Files-List.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Here is the function:"
msgstr "関数はこちらです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Files-List.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun files-in-below-directory (directory)\n"
"  &quot;List the .el files in DIRECTORY and in its sub-directories.&quot;\n"
"  ;; Although the function will be used non-interactively,\n"
"  ;; it will be easier to test if we make it interactive.\n"
"  ;; The directory will have a name such as\n"
"  ;;  &quot;/usr/local/share/emacs/22.1.1/lisp/&quot;\n"
"  (interactive &quot;DDirectory name: &quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Files-List.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (let (el-files-list\n"
"        (current-directory-list\n"
"         (directory-files-and-attributes directory t)))\n"
"    ;; while we are in the current directory\n"
"    (while current-directory-list\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Files-List.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      (cond\n"
"       ;; check to see whether filename ends in '.el'\n"
"       ;; and if so, add its name to a list.\n"
"       ((equal &quot;.el&quot; (substring (car (car current-directory-list)) -3))\n"
"        (setq el-files-list\n"
"              (cons (car (car current-directory-list)) el-files-list)))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Files-List.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"       ;; check whether filename is that of a directory\n"
"       ((eq t (car (cdr (car current-directory-list))))\n"
"        ;; decide whether to skip or recurse\n"
"        (if\n"
"            (equal &quot;.&quot;\n"
"                   (substring (car (car current-directory-list)) -1))\n"
"            ;; then do nothing since filename is that of\n"
"            ;;   current directory or parent, &quot;.&quot; or &quot;..&quot;\n"
"            ()\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Files-List.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"          ;; else descend into the directory and repeat the process\n"
"          (setq el-files-list\n"
"                (append\n"
"                 (files-in-below-directory\n"
"                  (car (car current-directory-list)))\n"
"                 el-files-list)))))\n"
"      ;; move to the next filename in the list; this also\n"
"      ;; shortens the list so the while loop eventually comes to an end\n"
"      (setq current-directory-list (cdr current-directory-list)))\n"
"    ;; return the filenames\n"
"    el-files-list))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Files-List.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">files-in-below-directory</code> function takes one "
