"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>14.5 ファイルの検索<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Find-a-File-1\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Find-a-File.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Find-a-File\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Find-a-File\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Find-a-File.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"To find a file in Emacs, you use the <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-f</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">find-file</code>)  command.  This command is almost, but not "
"quite right for the lengths problem."
msgstr ""
"Emacsでファイルを探すには、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-f</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">find-file</code>) コマンドを使用します。このコマンドは、長さの"
"問題に対してほぼ正解ですが、完全には一致しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Find-a-File.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Let&rsquo;s look at the source for <code class=\"code\">find-file</code>:"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">find-file</code>のソースを見てみましょう："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Find-a-File.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun find-file (filename)\n"
"  &quot;Edit file FILENAME.\n"
"Switch to a buffer visiting file FILENAME,\n"
"creating one if none already exists.&quot;\n"
"  (interactive &quot;FFind file: &quot;)\n"
"  (switch-to-buffer (find-file-noselect filename)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Find-a-File.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(The most recent version of the <code class=\"code\">find-file</code> "
"function definition permits you to specify optional wildcards to visit "
"multiple files; that makes the definition more complex and we will not "
"discuss it here, since it is not relevant.  You can see its source using "
"either <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-.</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">xref-find-"
"definitions</code>) or <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h f</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">describe-function</code>).)"
msgstr ""
"（<code class=\"code\">find-file</code> 関数定義の最新バージョンでは、複数の"
"ファイルを対象とするために任意のワイルドカードを指定できるようになっていま"
"す。これにより定義が複雑になるため、ここでは関連性がないとして解説を省略しま"
"す。ソースコードは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-.</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">xref-"
"find-definitions</code>) または <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h f</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">describe-function</code>) のいずれかを用いて確認できます。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Find-a-File.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The definition I am showing possesses short but complete documentation and "
"an interactive specification that prompts you for a file name when you use "
"the command interactively.  The body of the definition contains two "
"functions, <code class=\"code\">find-file-noselect</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">switch-to-buffer</code>."
msgstr ""
"提示している定義は、簡潔ながら完全なドキュメントを備えており、コマンドを対話"
"的に使用する際にファイル名の入力を求めるインタラクティブな仕様となっていま"
"す。定義の本体には、<code class=\"code\">find-file-noselect</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">switch-to-buffer</code> という2つの関数が含まれています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Find-a-File.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"According to its documentation as shown by <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h f</kbd> "
"(the <code class=\"code\">describe-function</code> command), the <code "
"class=\"code\">find-file-noselect</code> function reads the named file into "
"a buffer and returns the buffer.  (Its most recent version includes an "
"optional <var class=\"var\">wildcards</var> argument, too, as well as "
"another to read a file literally and another to suppress warning messages.  "
"These optional arguments are irrelevant.)"
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h f</kbd>（<code class=\"code\">describe-function</code>"
"コマンド）に示されているドキュメントによれば、<code class=\"code\">find-file-"
"noselect</code>関数は指定されたファイルをバッファに読み込み、そのバッファを返"
"します。（最新バージョンでは、オプションの<var class=\"var\">wildcards</var>"
"引数のほか、ファイルをリテラルとして読み込むための引数や、警告メッセージを抑"
"制するための引数も追加されています。これらのオプション引数は本説明には関係あ"
"りません。）"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Find-a-File.html
msgid ""
"However, the <code class=\"code\">find-file-noselect</code> function does "
"not select the buffer in which it puts the file.  Emacs does not switch its "
"attention (or yours if you are using <code class=\"code\">find-file-"
"noselect</code>) to the selected buffer.  That is what <code "
"class=\"code\">switch-to-buffer</code> does: it switches the buffer to which "
"Emacs attention is directed; and it switches the buffer displayed in the "
"window to the new buffer.  We have discussed buffer switching elsewhere.  "
"(See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Switching-Buffers.html\">Switching Buffers</"
"a>.)"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Find-a-File.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In this histogram project, we do not need to display each file on the screen "
"as the program determines the length of each definition within it.  Instead "
"of employing <code class=\"code\">switch-to-buffer</code>, we can work with "
"<code class=\"code\">set-buffer</code>, which redirects the attention of the "
"computer program to a different buffer but does not redisplay it on the "
"screen.  So instead of calling on <code class=\"code\">find-file</code> to "
"do the job, we must write our own expression."
msgstr ""
"このヒストグラムプロジェクトでは、プログラムが各定義の長さを判定するため、"
"個々のファイルを画面に表示する必要はありません。<code class=\"code\">switch-"
"to-buffer</code>を用いる代わりに、コンピュータプログラムの参照先を別のバッ"
"ファへ切り替えつつ、それを画面に再表示しない<code class=\"code\">set-buffer</"
"code>を利用できます。したがって、<code class=\"code\">find-file</code>を呼び"
"出して処理を行うのではなく、独自の式を記述する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Find-a-File.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The task is easy: use <code class=\"code\">find-file-noselect</code> and "
"<code class=\"code\">set-buffer</code>."
msgstr ""
"タスクは簡単です。<code class=\"code\">find-file-noselect</code>と<code "
"class=\"code\">set-buffer</code>を使ってください。"

