msgid ""
"<span>2.2 Getting Buffers<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Getting-"
"Buffers-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>2.2 バッファの取得<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Getting-"
"Buffers-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Getting-Buffers.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-current_002dbuffer\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-other_002dbuffer\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-Getting-a-buffer\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-current_002dbuffer\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-other_002dbuffer\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-Getting-a-buffer\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Getting-Buffers.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">buffer-name</code> function returns the <em "
"class=\"emph\">name</em> of the buffer; to get the buffer <em "
"class=\"emph\">itself</em>, a different function is needed: the <code "
"class=\"code\">current-buffer</code> function.  If you use this function in "
"code, what you get is the buffer itself."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">buffer-name</code> 関数はバッファの <em class=\"emph\">"
"名前</em> を返します。バッファ <em class=\"emph\">自体</em> を取得するには、"
"別の関数である <code class=\"code\">current-buffer</code> 関数が必要です。"
"コード内でこの関数を使用すると、バッファ自体が得られます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Getting-Buffers.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"A name and the object or entity to which the name refers are different from "
"each other.  You are not your name.  You are a person to whom others refer "
"by name.  If you ask to speak to George and someone hands you a card with "
"the letters &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">G</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">e</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">o</samp>&rsquo;, "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">r</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">g</"
"samp>&rsquo;, and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">e</samp>&rsquo; written on it, "
"you might be amused, but you would not be satisfied.  You do not want to "
"speak to the name, but to the person to whom the name refers.  A buffer is "
"similar: the name of the scratch buffer is <samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</"
"samp>, but the name is not the buffer.  To get a buffer itself, you need to "
"use a function such as <code class=\"code\">current-buffer</code>."
msgstr ""
"名前と、その名前が指し示す対象や実体は、互いに異なるものです。あなたはあなた"
"自身の名前ではありません。あなたは、他者が名前で呼ぶ「人」なのです。もし"
"ジョージと話したいと伝え、誰かが &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">G</"
"samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">e</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">o</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">r</samp>&rsquo;、"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">g</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">e</"
"samp>&rsquo; という文字が書かれたカードを差し出してきたとしたら、面白がるかも"
"しれませんが、満足することはないでしょう。あなたが話したいのは名前ではなく、"
"その名前が指し示す人物なのです。バッファも同様です。スクラッチバッファの名前"
"は <samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> ですが、その名前がバッファそのもので"
"はありません。バッファ自体を取得するには、<code class=\"code\">current-"
"buffer</code> のような関数を使用する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Getting-Buffers.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"However, there is a slight complication: if you evaluate <code "
"class=\"code\">current-buffer</code> in an expression on its own, as we will "
"do here, what you see is a printed representation of the name of the buffer "
"without the contents of the buffer.  Emacs works this way for two reasons: "
"the buffer may be thousands of lines long&mdash;too long to be conveniently "
"displayed; and, another buffer may have the same contents but a different "
"name, and it is important to distinguish between them."
msgstr ""
"ただし、少々厄介な点があります。ここで行うように、式の中で <code "
"class=\"code\">current-buffer</code> を単独で評価した場合、表示されるのはバッ"
"ファの内容を含まない、バッファ名の表示形式となります。Emacs がこのような仕様"
"になっているのには2つの理由があります。一つは、バッファが数千行に及ぶことがあ"
"り、便利に表示するには長すぎるためです。もう一つは、別のバッファが同じ内容で"
"ありながら異なる名前を持っている場合があり、それらを区別することが重要だから"
"です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Getting-Buffers.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Here is an expression containing the function:"
msgstr "関数を含む式は以下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Getting-Buffers.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(current-buffer)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Getting-Buffers.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If you evaluate this expression in Info in Emacs in the usual way, <samp "
"class=\"file\">#&lt;buffer *info*&gt;</samp> will appear in the echo area.  "
"The special format indicates that the buffer itself is being returned, "
"rather than just its name."
msgstr ""
"EmacsのInfoでこの式を通常通り評価すると、エコーエリアに<samp "
"class=\"file\">#&lt;buffer *info*&gt;</samp>が表示されます。この特殊な書式"
"は、単に名前を返すのではなく、バッファそのものを返すことを示しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Getting-Buffers.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Incidentally, while you can type a number or symbol into a program, you "
"cannot do that with the printed representation of a buffer: the only way to "
"get a buffer itself is with a function such as <code class=\"code\">current-"
"buffer</code>."
msgstr ""
"ちなみに、プログラムに数値や記号を入力することはできますが、バッファの出力結"
"果に対してはそれはできません。バッファ自体を取得する唯一の方法は、<code "
"class=\"code\">current-buffer</code>のような関数を使うことです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Getting-Buffers.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"A related function is <code class=\"code\">other-buffer</code>.  This "
"returns the most recently selected buffer other than the one you are in "
"currently, not a printed representation of its name.  If you have recently "
"switched back and forth from the <samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> "
"buffer, <code class=\"code\">other-buffer</code> will return that buffer."
msgstr ""
"関連する機能に <code class=\"code\">other-buffer</code> があります。これは、"
"現在開いているバッファ以外で、直近に選択されたバッファを返すものであり、その"
"名前を文字列として出力するものではありません。最近 <samp "
"class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> バッファとの切り替えを繰り返した場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">other-buffer</code> はそのバッファを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Getting-Buffers.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "You can see this by evaluating the expression:"
msgstr "この式を評価することで、確認できます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Getting-Buffers.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(other-buffer)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Getting-Buffers.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"You should see <samp class=\"file\">#&lt;buffer *scratch*&gt;</samp> appear "
"in the echo area, or the name of whatever other buffer you switched back "
"from most recently<a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF6\" href=\"#FOOT6\"><sup>6</"
"sup></a>."
msgstr ""
"エコー領域に <samp class=\"file\">#&lt;buffer *scratch*&gt;</samp> が表示され"
"るか、あるいは直近で切り替えてきた別のバッファ名が表示されるはずです<a "
"class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF6\" href=\"#FOOT6\"><sup>6</sup></a>。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h5>
#: build/html/eintr/Getting-Buffers.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a id=\"FOOT6\" href=\"#DOCF6\">(6)</a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"FOOT6\" href=\"#DOCF6\">(6)</a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Getting-Buffers.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Actually, by default, if the buffer from which you just switched is visible "
"to you in another window, <code class=\"code\">other-buffer</code> will "
"choose the most recent buffer that you cannot see; this is a subtlety that I "
"often forget."
msgstr ""
"実はデフォルトでは、先ほど切り替えたバッファが別のウィンドウで見えている場"
"合、<code class=\"code\">other-buffer</code> は見えない直近のバッファを選択し"
"ます。これは私がつい忘れがちな細かい仕様です。"

