msgid ""
"<span>How to Evaluate<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#How-to-Evaluate-1\"> "
"&para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>評価方法<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#How-to-Evaluate-1\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/How-to-Evaluate.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<i class=\"i\">Whenever you give an editing command</i> to Emacs Lisp, such "
"as the command to move the cursor or to scroll the screen, <i "
"class=\"i\">you are evaluating an expression,</i> the first element of which "
"is a function.  <i class=\"i\">This is how Emacs works.</i>"
msgstr ""
"<i class=\"i\">カーソルの移動や画面のスクロールといった編集コマンド</i>を"
"Emacs Lispに渡すたびに、<i class=\"i\">式を評価していることになり、</i>その第"
"1要素は関数となります。<i class=\"i\">これがEmacsの仕組みです。</i>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/How-to-Evaluate.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-interactive-function-defined\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-command-defined\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-interactive-function-defined\"></a> "
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-command-defined\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/How-to-Evaluate.html
msgid ""
"When you type keys, you cause the Lisp interpreter to evaluate an expression "
"and that is how you get your results.  Even typing plain text involves "
"evaluating an Emacs Lisp function, in this case, one that uses <code "
"class=\"code\">self-insert-command</code>, which simply inserts the "
"character you typed.  The functions you evaluate by typing keystrokes are "
"called <em class=\"dfn\">interactive</em> functions, or <em "
"class=\"dfn\">commands</em>; how you make a function interactive will be "
"illustrated in the chapter on how to write function definitions.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Interactive.html\">Making a Function Interactive</a>."
msgstr ""
"キーを入力すると、Lispインタプリタが式を評価することになり、それによって結果"
"が得られます。単なるテキストの入力であっても、Emacs Lisp関数の評価が行われま"
"す。この場合は<code class=\"code\">self-insert-command</code>を使用する関数"
"で、単に入力した文字を挿入するものです。キー入力によって評価される関数は、"
"<em class=\"dfn\">インタラクティブ</em>関数、あるいは<em class=\"dfn\">コマン"
"ド</em>と呼ばれます。関数をインタラクティブにする方法については、関数定義の書"
"き方に関する章で解説します。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Interactive.html\">関数"
"をインタラクティブにする</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/How-to-Evaluate.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In addition to typing keyboard commands, we have seen a second way to "
"evaluate an expression: by positioning the cursor after a list and typing "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd>.  This is what we will do in the rest of "
"this section.  There are other ways to evaluate an expression as well; these "
"will be described as we come to them."
msgstr ""
"キーボードコマンドを入力する以外に、式を評価する2つ目の方法として、リストの後"
"にカーソルを置き、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd>と入力する方法があります。"
"本節の残りの部分では、この方法を用いて説明します。他にも式を評価する方法はあ"
"りますが、それらについては適宜説明していきます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/How-to-Evaluate.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Besides being used for practicing evaluation, the functions shown in the "
"next few sections are important in their own right.  A study of these "
"functions makes clear the distinction between buffers and files, how to "
"switch to a buffer, and how to determine a location within it."
msgstr ""
"評価の練習に用いられるだけでなく、次以降のセクションで紹介する機能は、それ自"
"体としても重要です。これらの機能を学ぶことで、バッファとファイルの違い、バッ"
"ファへの切り替え方法、およびその中の位置を特定する方法が明確になります。"

