# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-altogether.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>Putting the function definition together<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Putting-the-function-definition-together\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>関数定義をまとめる<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Putting-the-"
"function-definition-together\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-altogether.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"We have created the parts for the function definition; now we need to put "
"them together."
msgstr "関数定義用のパーツを作成しました。あとはこれらを組み合わせるだけです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-altogether.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"First, the contents of the <code class=\"code\">while</code> expression:"
msgstr "まず、<code class=\"code\">while</code> 式の内容："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-altogether.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(while (&lt;= row-number number-of-rows)   ; <span class=\"r\">true-or-false-test</span>\n"
"  (setq total (+ total row-number))\n"
"  (setq row-number (1+ row-number)))    ; <span class=\"r\">incrementer</span>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-altogether.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Along with the <code class=\"code\">let</code> expression varlist, this very "
"nearly completes the body of the function definition.  However, it requires "
"one final element, the need for which is somewhat subtle."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">let</code> 式 varlist と合わせて、これで関数定義の本体は"
"ほぼ完成です。ただし、最後にもう一つ要素が必要ですが、その必要性はやや分かり"
"にくいものです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-altogether.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The final touch is to place the variable <code class=\"code\">total</code> "
"on a line by itself after the <code class=\"code\">while</code> expression.  "
"Otherwise, the value returned by the whole function is the value of the last "
"expression that is evaluated in the body of the <code class=\"code\">let</"
"code>, and this is the value returned by the <code class=\"code\">while</"
"code>, which is always <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"仕上げとして、<code class=\"code\">while</code> 式の後に変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">total</code> を単独の行に配置します。そうしないと、関数全体で"
"返される値は、<code class=\"code\">let</code> の本体内で評価される最後の式の"
"値となり、これが <code class=\"code\">while</code> によって返される値、すなわ"
"ち常に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-altogether.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This may not be evident at first sight.  It almost looks as if the "
"incrementing expression is the last expression of the whole function.  But "
"that expression is part of the body of the <code class=\"code\">while</"
"code>; it is the last element of the list that starts with the symbol <code "
"class=\"code\">while</code>.  Moreover, the whole of the <code "
"class=\"code\">while</code> loop is a list within the body of the <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code>."
msgstr ""
"一見しただけでは分かりにくいかもしれません。増分式が関数全体の最後の式である"
"かのようにさえ見えます。しかし、その式は<code class=\"code\">while</code>の本"
"体の一部であり、記号<code class=\"code\">while</code>から始まるリストの最後の"
"要素なのです。さらに、<code class=\"code\">while</code>のループ全体は、<code "
"class=\"code\">let</code>の本体内にあるリストとなっています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-altogether.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "In outline, the function will look like this:"
msgstr "概略としては、関数は次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-altogether.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun <var class=\"var\">name-of-function</var> (<var class=\"var\">argument-list</var>)\n"
"  &quot;<var class=\"var\">documentation</var>...&quot;\n"
"  (let (<var class=\"var\">varlist</var>)\n"
"    (while (<var class=\"var\">true-or-false-test</var>)\n"
"      <var class=\"var\">body-of-while</var>... )\n"
"    ... ))                    ; <span class=\"r\">Need final expression here.</span>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-altogether.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The result of evaluating the <code class=\"code\">let</code> is what is "
"going to be returned by the <code class=\"code\">defun</code> since the "
"<code class=\"code\">let</code> is not embedded within any containing list, "
"except for the <code class=\"code\">defun</code> as a whole.  However, if "
"the <code class=\"code\">while</code> is the last element of the <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> expression, the function will always return <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  This is not what we want! Instead, what we want "
"is the value of the variable <code class=\"code\">total</code>.  This is "
"returned by simply placing the symbol as the last element of the list "
"starting with <code class=\"code\">let</code>.  It gets evaluated after the "
"preceding elements of the list are evaluated, which means it gets evaluated "
"after it has been assigned the correct value for the total."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">let</code> を評価した結果が <code class=\"code\">defun</"
"code> によって返されることになります。というのも、<code class=\"code\">let</"
"code> は <code class=\"code\">defun</code> 全体を除いて、いかなる包含リストの"
"中にも埋め込まれていないからです。しかし、もし <code class=\"code\">while</"
"code> が <code class=\"code\">let</code> 式の最後の要素である場合、関数は常"
"に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。これは意図した動作ではありませ"
"ん！代わりに欲しいのは、変数 <code class=\"code\">total</code> の値です。これ"
"は、<code class=\"code\">let</code> から始まるリストの最後の要素として単にこ"
"のシンボルを配置することで返されます。これはリストの直前の要素が評価された後"
"に評価されるため、合計値として正しい値が代入された後に評価されることになりま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-altogether.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"It may be easier to see this by printing the list starting with <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> all on one line.  This format makes it evident "
"that the <var class=\"var\">varlist</var> and <code class=\"code\">while</"
"code> expressions are the second and third elements of the list starting "
"with <code class=\"code\">let</code>, and the <code class=\"code\">total</"
"code> is the last element:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">let</code>から始まるリストをすべて1行に出力すると、より"
"分かりやすくなるでしょう。この形式であれば、<var class=\"var\">varlist</var>"
"と<code class=\"code\">while</code>の式が<code class=\"code\">let</code>から"
"始まるリストの2番目と3番目の要素であり、<code class=\"code\">total</code>が最"
"後の要素であることが一目瞭然です："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-altogether.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(let (<var class=\"var\">varlist</var>) (while (<var class=\"var\">true-or-false-test</var>) <var class=\"var\">body-of-while</var>... ) total)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-altogether.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Putting everything together, the <code class=\"code\">triangle</code> "
"function definition looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"すべてをまとめると、<code class=\"code\">triangle</code> の関数定義は次のよう"
"になります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-altogether.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun triangle (number-of-rows)    ; <span class=\"r\">Version with</span>\n"
"                                    ; <span class=\"r\">  incrementing counter.</span>\n"
"  &quot;Add up the number of pebbles in a triangle.\n"
"The first row has one pebble, the second row two pebbles,\n"
"the third row three pebbles, and so on.\n"
"The argument is NUMBER-OF-ROWS.&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-altogether.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (let ((total 0)\n"
"        (row-number 1))\n"
"    (while (&lt;= row-number number-of-rows)\n"
"      (setq total (+ total row-number))\n"
"      (setq row-number (1+ row-number)))\n"
"    total))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-altogether.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"After you have installed <code class=\"code\">triangle</code> by evaluating "
"the function, you can try it out.  Here are two examples:"
msgstr ""
"関数を評価して <code class=\"code\">triangle</code> をインストールしたら、実"
"際に試してみることができます。以下に2つの例を挙げます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-altogether.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
