# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>The parts of the function definition<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#The-parts-of-the-function-definition\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>関数定義の構成要素<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-parts-of-the-"
"function-definition\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The preceding analysis gives us the bones of our function definition: first, "
"we will need a variable that we can call <code class=\"code\">total</code> "
"that will be the total number of pebbles.  This will be the value returned "
"by the function."
msgstr ""
"これまでの分析により、関数定義の骨組みが定まりました。まず、小石の総数を表す"
"<code class=\"code\">total</code>という変数が必要になります。これが関数から返"
"される値となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Second, we know that the function will require an argument: this argument "
"will be the total number of rows in the triangle.  It can be called <code "
"class=\"code\">number-of-rows</code>."
msgstr ""
"次に、この関数には引数が必要であることが分かります。この引数は、三角形の行数"
"の合計となります。<code class=\"code\">number-of-rows</code> と呼ぶことができ"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Finally, we need a variable to use as a counter.  We could call this "
"variable <code class=\"code\">counter</code>, but a better name is <code "
"class=\"code\">row-number</code>.  That is because what the counter does in "
"this function is count rows, and a program should be written to be as "
"understandable as possible."
msgstr ""
"最後に、カウンタとして使用する変数が必要です。この変数を<code "
"class=\"code\">counter</code>と呼ぶこともできますが、<code "
"class=\"code\">row-number</code>とする方が適切です。というのも、この関数にお"
"けるカウンタの役割は行数を数えることであり、プログラムは可能な限り分かりやす"
"く記述すべきだからです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"When the Lisp interpreter first starts evaluating the expressions in the "
"function, the value of <code class=\"code\">total</code> should be set to "
"zero, since we have not added anything to it.  Then the function should add "
"the number of pebbles in the first row to the total, and then add the number "
"of pebbles in the second to the total, and then add the number of pebbles in "
"the third row to the total, and so on, until there are no more rows left to "
"add."
msgstr ""
"Lispインタプリタが関数内の式の評価を最初に開始する際、<code "
"class=\"code\">total</code> には何も加算されていないため、その値は0に設定され"
"るべきです。その後、関数は1行目の小石の数を合計に加算し、次に2行目の小石の数"
"を合計に加算し、さらに3行目の小石の数を合計に加算するというように、加算すべき"
"行がなくなるまでこれを繰り返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Both <code class=\"code\">total</code> and <code class=\"code\">row-number</"
"code> are used only inside the function, so they can be declared as local "
"variables with <code class=\"code\">let</code> and given initial values.  "
"Clearly, the initial value for <code class=\"code\">total</code> should be "
"0.  The initial value of <code class=\"code\">row-number</code> should be 1, "
"since we start with the first row.  This means that the <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> statement will look like this:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">total</code> と <code class=\"code\">row-number</code> "
"はいずれも関数内でのみ使用されるため、<code class=\"code\">let</code> でロー"
"カル変数として宣言し、初期値を設定できます。明らかに、<code "
"class=\"code\">total</code> の初期値は 0 であるべきです。<code "
"class=\"code\">row-number</code> の初期値は、最初の行から開始するため、1 であ"
"るべきです。つまり、<code class=\"code\">let</code> の文は次のようになりま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (let ((total 0)\n"
"        (row-number 1))\n"
"    <var class=\"var\">body</var>...)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"After the internal variables are declared and bound to their initial values, "
"we can begin the <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop.  The expression "
"that serves as the test should return a value of <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> for true so long as the <code class=\"code\">row-number</code> is less "
"than or equal to the <code class=\"code\">number-of-rows</code>.  (If the "
"expression tests true only so long as the row number is less than the number "
"of rows in the triangle, the last row will never be added to the total; "
"hence the row number has to be either less than or equal to the number of "
"rows.)"
msgstr ""
"内部変数を宣言し、初期値にバインドした後、<code class=\"code\">while</code> "
"ループを開始できます。判定式は、<code class=\"code\">row-number</code> が "
"<code class=\"code\">number-of-rows</code> 以下である限り、真の場合に <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> という値を返す必要があります。（もしこの式が、行番号"
"が三角形の行数未満である場合にのみ真と判定されるなら、最終行が合計に加算され"
"なくなります。したがって、行番号は行数以下である必要があります。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_003c_003d-_0028less-than-or-"
"equal_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_003c_003d-_0028less-than-or-"
"equal_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Lisp provides the <code class=\"code\">&lt;=</code> function that returns "
"true if the value of its first argument is less than or equal to the value "
"of its second argument and false otherwise.  So the expression that the "
"<code class=\"code\">while</code> will evaluate as its test should look like "
"this:"
msgstr ""
"Lispには、第1引数の値が第2引数の値以下であればtrueを、そうでなければfalseを返"
"す<code class=\"code\">&lt;=</code>関数が用意されています。したがって、<code "
"class=\"code\">while</code>がテストとして評価する式は、次のようになるはずで"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(&lt;= row-number number-of-rows)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The total number of pebbles can be found by repeatedly adding the number of "
"pebbles in a row to the total already found.  Since the number of pebbles in "
"the row is equal to the row number, the total can be found by adding the row "
"number to the total.  (Clearly, in a more complex situation, the number of "
"pebbles in the row might be related to the row number in a more complicated "
"way; if this were the case, the row number would be replaced by the "
"appropriate expression.)"
msgstr ""
"小石の総数は、ある行にある小石の数を、すでに求めた合計に繰り返し加算すること"
"で求めることができます。その行にある小石の数は行番号に等しいため、行番号を合"
"計に加算することで総数を求めることができます。（明らかに、より複雑な状況で"
"は、その行にある小石の数が行番号とより複雑な関係にあるかもしれません。その場"
"合、行番号は適切な式に置き換えられることになります。）"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(setq total (+ total row-number))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"What this does is set the new value of <code class=\"code\">total</code> to "
"be equal to the sum of adding the number of pebbles in the row to the "
"previous total."
msgstr ""
"これにより、<code class=\"code\">total</code> の新しい値が、行内の小石の数を"
"前回の合計に加えた値と等しくなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"After setting the value of <code class=\"code\">total</code>, the conditions "
"need to be established for the next repetition of the loop, if there is "
"one.  This is done by incrementing the value of the <code class=\"code\">row-"
"number</code> variable, which serves as a counter.  After the <code "
"class=\"code\">row-number</code> variable has been incremented, the true-or-"
"false-test at the beginning of the <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop "
"tests whether its value is still less than or equal to the value of the "
"<code class=\"code\">number-of-rows</code> and if it is, adds the new value "
"of the <code class=\"code\">row-number</code> variable to the <code "
"class=\"code\">total</code> of the previous repetition of the loop."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">total</code>の値を設定した後、ループの次回の繰り返しがあ"
"る場合は、そのための条件を整える必要があります。これは、カウンタとして機能す"
"る<code class=\"code\">row-number</code>変数の値をインクリメントすることで行"
"われます。<code class=\"code\">row-number</code>変数をインクリメントした後、"
"<code class=\"code\">while</code>ループの冒頭にある真偽判定により、その値が依"
"然として<code class=\"code\">number-of-rows</code>の値以下であるかどうかが判"
"定され、そうであれば、<code class=\"code\">row-number</code>変数の新しい値が"
"ループの前回の繰り返しにおける<code class=\"code\">total</code>に加算されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The built-in Emacs Lisp function <code class=\"code\">1+</code> adds 1 to a "
"number, so the <code class=\"code\">row-number</code> variable can be "
"incremented with this expression:"
msgstr ""
"Emacs Lispの組み込み関数 <code class=\"code\">1+</code> は数値に1を加算するた"
"め、変数 <code class=\"code\">row-number</code> はこの式でインクリメントでき"
"ます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Inc-Example-parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(setq row-number (1+ row-number))\n"
msgstr ""

