# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/eintr/Incrementing-Example.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>Example with incrementing counter<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Example-with-incrementing-counter\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>インクリメントカウンタの例<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Example-"
"with-incrementing-counter\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Incrementing-Example.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Suppose you are playing on the beach and decide to make a triangle of "
"pebbles, putting one pebble in the first row, two in the second row, three "
"in the third row and so on, like this:"
msgstr ""
"ビーチで遊んでいて、小石で三角形を作ろうと思ったとします。1段目に1個、2段目に"
"2個、3段目に3個というように、次のように並べていくのです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><br><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Incrementing-Example.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"               *\n"
"              * *\n"
"             * * *\n"
"            * * * *\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><br><br><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Incrementing-Example.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(About 2500 years ago, Pythagoras and others developed the beginnings of "
"number theory by considering questions such as this.)"
msgstr ""
"（約2500年前、ピタゴラスらはこのような問いを考えることで、数論の端緒を切り拓"
"きました。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><br><br><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Incrementing-Example.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Suppose you want to know how many pebbles you will need to make a triangle "
"with 7 rows?"
msgstr "7段の三角形を作るのに、小石がいくつ必要か知りたいとしましょう。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><br><br><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Incrementing-Example.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Clearly, what you need to do is add up the numbers from 1 to 7.  There are "
"two ways to do this; start with the smallest number, one, and add up the "
"list in sequence, 1, 2, 3, 4 and so on; or start with the largest number and "
"add the list going down: 7, 6, 5, 4 and so on.  Because both mechanisms "
"illustrate common ways of writing <code class=\"code\">while</code> loops, "
"we will create two examples, one counting up and the other counting down.  "
"In this first example, we will start with 1 and add 2, 3, 4 and so on."
msgstr ""
"明らかに、やるべきことは1から7までの数値を合計することです。これには2つの方法"
"があります。最小の数値である1から始めて、1, 2, 3, 4と順に合計していく方法か、"
"あるいは最大の数値から始めて、7, 6, 5, 4と順に合計していく方法です。どちらの"
"手法も<code class=\"code\">while</code>ループの一般的な記述方法を示しているた"
"め、カウントアップするものとカウントダウンするものの2つの例を作成します。この"
"最初の例では、1から始めて2, 3, 4と順に合計していきます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><br><br><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Incrementing-Example.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If you are just adding up a short list of numbers, the easiest way to do it "
"is to add up all the numbers at once.  However, if you do not know ahead of "
"time how many numbers your list will have, or if you want to be prepared for "
"a very long list, then you need to design your addition so that what you do "
"is repeat a simple process many times instead of doing a more complex "
"process once."
msgstr ""
"少数の数値を足し合わせるだけであれば、一度にすべての数値を足すのが最も簡単な"
"方法です。しかし、リストにいくつの数値が入るかあらかじめ分からない場合や、非"
"常に長いリストに備えたい場合は、複雑な処理を一度行うのではなく、単純な処理を"
"何度も繰り返すように足し算を設計する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><br><br><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Incrementing-Example.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"For example, instead of adding up all the pebbles all at once, what you can "
"do is add the number of pebbles in the first row, 1, to the number in the "
"second row, 2, and then add the total of those two rows to the third row, "
"3.  Then you can add the number in the fourth row, 4, to the total of the "
"first three rows; and so on."
msgstr ""
"例えば、小石をすべて一度に足し合わせるのではなく、1段目の小石の数1を2段目の数"
"2に足し、さらにその2段の合計を3段目の数3に足すという方法があります。それか"
"ら、最初の3段の合計に4段目の数4を足す、という具合に進めていきます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><br><br><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Incrementing-Example.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The critical characteristic of the process is that each repetitive action is "
"simple.  In this case, at each step we add only two numbers, the number of "
"pebbles in the row and the total already found.  This process of adding two "
"numbers is repeated again and again until the last row has been added to the "
"total of all the preceding rows.  In a more complex loop the repetitive "
"action might not be so simple, but it will be simpler than doing everything "
"all at once."
msgstr ""
"このプロセスの重要な特徴は、個々の反復操作が単純である点にある。この場合、各"
"ステップで加算するのは、その行にある小石の数と、すでに見つかった合計値とい"
"う、わずか2つの数値だけである。この2つの数値を加算する操作は、最後の行がそれ"
"までのすべての行の合計に加算されるまで、繰り返し行われる。より複雑なループで"
"は、反復操作はそれほど単純ではないかもしれないが、すべてを一度に行うよりは単"
"純である。"

