msgid ""
"Note that this line uses <code class=\"code\">setq-default</code> rather "
"than the <code class=\"code\">setq</code> that we have seen before; <code "
"class=\"code\">setq-default</code> sets values only in buffers that do not "
"have their own local values for the variable."
