#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/eintr/Insert-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>5.2.5 The <code class=\"code\">let</code> Expression in <code "
"class=\"code\">insert-buffer</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-"
"let-Expression-in-insert_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>5.2.5 <code class=\"code\">insert-buffer</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#The-let-Expression-in-insert_002dbuffer\"> &para;</a> におけ"
"る <code class=\"code\">let</code> 式</span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Insert-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"After ensuring that the variable <code class=\"code\">buffer</code> refers "
"to a buffer itself and not just to the name of a buffer, the <code "
"class=\"code\">insert-buffer</code> function continues with a <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> expression.  This specifies three local variables, "
"<code class=\"code\">start</code>, <code class=\"code\">end</code>, and "
"<code class=\"code\">newmark</code> and binds them to the initial value "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  These variables are used inside the "
"remainder of the <code class=\"code\">let</code> and temporarily hide any "
"other occurrence of variables of the same name in Emacs until the end of the "
"<code class=\"code\">let</code>."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">buffer</code> が単なるバッファ名ではなく、バッファ"
"そのものを参照していることを確認した上で、<code class=\"code\">insert-"
"buffer</code> 関数は <code class=\"code\">let</code> 式へと進みます。ここでは"
"3つのローカル変数 <code class=\"code\">start</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">end</code>、<code class=\"code\">newmark</code> を指定し、それ"
"らを初期値 <code class=\"code\">nil</code> にバインドします。これらの変数は "
"<code class=\"code\">let</code> の残りの部分で使用され、<code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> の終わりまで、Emacs 内で同名の他の変数の出現を一時"
"的に隠します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Insert-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The body of the <code class=\"code\">let</code> contains two <code "
"class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> expressions.  First, we will look at "
"the inner <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> expression in detail.  "
"The expression looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">let</code> の本体には、2つの <code class=\"code\">save-"
"excursion</code> 式が含まれています。まず、内側の <code class=\"code\">save-"
"excursion</code> 式を詳しく見ていきましょう。この式は次のようになっています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Insert-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(save-excursion\n"
"  (set-buffer buffer)\n"
"  (setq start (point-min) end (point-max)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Insert-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The expression <code class=\"code\">(set-buffer buffer)</code> changes "
"Emacs&rsquo;s attention from the current buffer to the one from which the "
"text will copied.  In that buffer, the variables <code class=\"code\">start</"
"code> and <code class=\"code\">end</code> are set to the beginning and end "
"of the buffer, using the commands <code class=\"code\">point-min</code> and "
"<code class=\"code\">point-max</code>.  Note that we have here an "
"illustration of how <code class=\"code\">setq</code> is able to set two "
"variables in the same expression.  The first argument of <code "
"class=\"code\">setq</code> is set to the value of its second, and its third "
"argument is set to the value of its fourth."
msgstr ""
"式 <code class=\"code\">(set-buffer buffer)</code> は、Emacs のフォーカスを現"
"在のバッファから、テキストをコピー元とするバッファへと切り替えます。そのバッ"
"ファでは、コマンド <code class=\"code\">point-min</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">point-max</code> を用いて、変数 <code class=\"code\">start</"
"code> と <code class=\"code\">end</code> にバッファの先頭と末尾が設定されま"
"す。ここでは、<code class=\"code\">setq</code> が同一の式内で2つの変数を設定"
"できる仕組みが示されている点に注目してください。<code class=\"code\">setq</"
"code> の第1引数には第2引数の値が、第3引数には第4引数の値がそれぞれ設定されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Insert-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"After the body of the inner <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> is "
"evaluated, the <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> restores the "
"original buffer, but <code class=\"code\">start</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">end</code> remain set to the values of the beginning and end "
"of the buffer from which the text will be copied."
msgstr ""
"内部の<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code>の本体が評価された後、<code "
"class=\"code\">save-excursion</code>は元のバッファを復元しますが、<code "
"class=\"code\">start</code>と<code class=\"code\">end</code>は、テキストがコ"
"ピーされるバッファの先頭と末尾の値に設定されたままとなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Insert-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The outer <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> expression looks like "
"this:"
msgstr ""
"外側の <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> 式は次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Insert-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(save-excursion\n"
"  (<var class=\"var\">inner-</var><code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code><var class=\"var\">-expression</var>\n"
"     (<var class=\"var\">go-to-new-buffer-and-set-</var><code class=\"code\">start</code><var class=\"var\">-and-</var><code class=\"code\">end</code>)\n"
"  (insert-buffer-substring buffer start end)\n"
"  (setq newmark (point)))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Insert-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">insert-buffer-substring</code> function copies the "
"text <em class=\"emph\">into</em> the current buffer <em "
"class=\"emph\">from</em> the region indicated by <code class=\"code\">start</"
"code> and <code class=\"code\">end</code> in <code class=\"code\">buffer</"
"code>.  Since the whole of the second buffer lies between <code "
"class=\"code\">start</code> and <code class=\"code\">end</code>, the whole "
"of the second buffer is copied into the buffer you are editing.  Next, the "
"value of point, which will be at the end of the inserted text, is recorded "
"in the variable <code class=\"code\">newmark</code>."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Insert-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"After the body of the outer <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> is "
"evaluated, point is relocated to its original place."
msgstr ""
"外側の<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code>の本体が評価された後、pointは"
"元の位置に再配置される。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Insert-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"However, it is convenient to locate a mark at the end of the newly inserted "
"text and locate point at its beginning.  The <code class=\"code\">newmark</"
"code> variable records the end of the inserted text.  In the last line of "
"the <code class=\"code\">let</code> expression, the <code "
"class=\"code\">(push-mark newmark)</code> expression function sets a mark to "
"this location.  (The previous location of the mark is still accessible; it "
"is recorded on the mark ring and you can go back to it with <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-u C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd>.)  Meanwhile, point "
"is located at the beginning of the inserted text, which is where it was "
"before you called the insert function, the position of which was saved by "
"the first <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code>."
msgstr ""
"ただし、新たに挿入されたテキストの末尾にマークを置き、ポイントをその先頭に配"
"置すると便利です。<code class=\"code\">newmark</code> 変数は、挿入されたテキ"
"ストの末尾を記録します。<code class=\"code\">let</code> 式の最終行において、"
"<code class=\"code\">(push-mark newmark)</code> 式関数がこの位置にマークを設"
"定します。（マークの以前の位置には依然としてアクセス可能であり、マークリング"
"に記録されているため、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></"
"kbd> でそこに戻ることができます。）一方、ポイントは挿入されたテキストの先頭に"
"配置されます。そこは insert 関数を呼び出す前の位置であり、その位置は最初の "
"<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> によって保存されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Insert-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The whole <code class=\"code\">let</code> expression looks like this:"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">let</code> 式全体は次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Insert-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let (start end newmark)\n"
"  (save-excursion\n"
"    (save-excursion\n"
"      (set-buffer buffer)\n"
"      (setq start (point-min) end (point-max)))\n"
"    (insert-buffer-substring buffer start end)\n"
"    (setq newmark (point)))\n"
"  (push-mark newmark))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Insert-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Like the <code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code> function, the <code "
"class=\"code\">insert-buffer</code> function uses <code class=\"code\">let</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code>, and <code "
"class=\"code\">set-buffer</code>.  In addition, the function illustrates one "
"way to use <code class=\"code\">or</code>.  All these functions are building "
"blocks that we will find and use again and again."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code>関数と同様に、<code "
"class=\"code\">insert-buffer</code>関数は<code class=\"code\">let</code>、"
"<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code>、<code class=\"code\">set-buffer</"
"code>を使用します。さらに、この関数は<code class=\"code\">or</code>の使い方の"
"一例を示しています。これらの関数はすべて、繰り返し利用することになる構成要素"
"です。"

