#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/eintr/Insert-or.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>5.2.4 The <code class=\"code\">or</code> in the Body<a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-or-in-the-Body\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>5.2.4 Body<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-or-in-the-Body\"> "
"&para;</a>内の<code class=\"code\">or</code></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Insert-or.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The purpose of the <code class=\"code\">or</code> expression in the <code "
"class=\"code\">insert-buffer</code> function is to ensure that the argument "
"<code class=\"code\">buffer</code> is bound to a buffer and not just to the "
"name of a buffer.  The previous section shows how the job could have been "
"done using an <code class=\"code\">if</code> expression.  However, the <code "
"class=\"code\">insert-buffer</code> function actually uses <code "
"class=\"code\">or</code>.  To understand this, it is necessary to understand "
"how <code class=\"code\">or</code> works."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">insert-buffer</code> 関数における <code "
"class=\"code\">or</code> 式の目的は、引数 <code class=\"code\">buffer</code> "
"が単なるバッファ名ではなく、バッファにバインドされるようにすることです。前節"
"では、<code class=\"code\">if</code> 式を用いてどのように処理できたかを示しま"
"した。しかし、<code class=\"code\">insert-buffer</code> 関数では実際には "
"<code class=\"code\">or</code> が使用されています。これを理解するには、<code "
"class=\"code\">or</code> の仕組みを理解する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Insert-or.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-or\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-or\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Insert-or.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"An <code class=\"code\">or</code> function can have any number of "
"arguments.  It evaluates each argument in turn and returns the value of the "
"first of its arguments that is not <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  Also, "
"and this is a crucial feature of <code class=\"code\">or</code>, it does not "
"evaluate any subsequent arguments after returning the first non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">or</code> 関数は、任意の数の引数を取ることができます。各"
"引数を順に評価し、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> ではない最初の引数の値を返"
"します。また、ここが <code class=\"code\">or</code> の極めて重要な特徴です"
"が、最初の非 <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 値を返した後は、それ以降の引数を"
"一切評価しません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Insert-or.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The <code class=\"code\">or</code> expression looks like this:"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">or</code> 式は次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Insert-or.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(or (bufferp buffer)\n"
"    (setq buffer (get-buffer buffer)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Insert-or.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The first argument to <code class=\"code\">or</code> is the expression <code "
"class=\"code\">(bufferp buffer)</code>.  This expression returns true (a non-"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value) if the buffer is actually a buffer, "
"and not just the name of a buffer.  In the <code class=\"code\">or</code> "
"expression, if this is the case, the <code class=\"code\">or</code> "
"expression returns this true value and does not evaluate the next "
"expression&mdash;and this is fine with us, since we do not want to do "
"anything to the value of <code class=\"code\">buffer</code> if it really is "
"a buffer."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">or</code> の第1引数は式 <code class=\"code\">(bufferp "
"buffer)</code> です。この式は、バッファが単なるバッファ名ではなく実際にバッ"
"ファである場合に true（<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値）を返します。"
"<code class=\"code\">or</code> 式において、この条件が満たされた場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">or</code> 式はこの true 値を返し、次の式は評価されません"
"&mdash;そして、<code class=\"code\">buffer</code> が実際にバッファである場合"
"にその値に対して何も操作を行いたくないため、これで問題ありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Insert-or.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"On the other hand, if the value of <code class=\"code\">(bufferp buffer)</"
"code> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, which it will be if the value of "
"<code class=\"code\">buffer</code> is the name of a buffer, the Lisp "
"interpreter evaluates the next element of the <code class=\"code\">or</code> "
"expression.  This is the expression <code class=\"code\">(setq buffer (get-"
"buffer buffer))</code>.  This expression returns a non-<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> value, which is the value to which it sets the "
"variable <code class=\"code\">buffer</code>&mdash;and this value is a buffer "
"itself, not the name of a buffer."
msgstr ""
"一方、<code class=\"code\">(bufferp buffer)</code> の値が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合（<code class=\"code\">buffer</code> の値"
"がバッファ名であればそうなります）、Lisp インタプリタは <code "
"class=\"code\">or</code> 式の次の要素を評価します。それが <code "
"class=\"code\">(setq buffer (get-buffer buffer))</code> 式です。この式は "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を返し、それが変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">buffer</code> に代入される値となります。そして、この値はバッ"
"ファ名ではなく、それ自体がバッファです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Insert-or.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The result of all this is that the symbol <code class=\"code\">buffer</code> "
"is always bound to a buffer itself rather than to the name of a buffer.  All "
"this is necessary because the <code class=\"code\">set-buffer</code> "
"function in a following line only works with a buffer itself, not with the "
"name to a buffer."
msgstr ""
"これらすべてにより、シンボル <code class=\"code\">buffer</code> は常にバッ"
"ファ名ではなく、バッファそのものに紐付けられます。このようにする必要があるの"
"は、後続の行にある <code class=\"code\">set-buffer</code> 関数が、バッファ名"
"ではなくバッファそのものでしか動作しないためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Insert-or.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Incidentally, using <code class=\"code\">or</code>, the situation with the "
"usher would be written like this:"
msgstr ""
"ちなみに、<code class=\"code\">or</code>を使うと、案内係との状況は次のように"
"記述されます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Insert-or.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(or (holding-on-to-guest) (find-and-take-arm-of-guest))\n"
msgstr ""

