#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/eintr/Interactive-multiply_002dby_002dseven.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>An Interactive <code class=\"code\">multiply-by-seven</code>, An "
"Overview<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#An-Interactive-"
"multiply_002dby_002dseven_002c-An-Overview\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>インタラクティブな <code class=\"code\">multiply-by-seven</code>、概要"
"<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#An-Interactive-"
"multiply_002dby_002dseven_002c-An-Overview\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Interactive-multiply_002dby_002dseven.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Both the use of the special form <code class=\"code\">interactive</code> and "
"one way to display a value in the echo area can be illustrated by creating "
"an interactive version of <code class=\"code\">multiply-by-seven</code>."
msgstr ""
"特殊形式 <code class=\"code\">interactive</code> の使用と、エコー領域に値を表"
"示する方法の両方を、<code class=\"code\">multiply-by-seven</code> のインタラ"
"クティブ版を作成することで示すことができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Interactive-multiply_002dby_002dseven.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Here is the code:"
msgstr "コードはこちらです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Interactive-multiply_002dby_002dseven.html
#: build/html/eintr/multiply_002dby_002dseven-in-detail.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun multiply-by-seven (number)       ; <span class=\"r\">Interactive version.</span>\n"
"  &quot;Multiply NUMBER by seven.&quot;\n"
"  (interactive &quot;p&quot;)\n"
"  (message &quot;The result is %d&quot; (* 7 number)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Interactive-multiply_002dby_002dseven.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"You can install this code by placing your cursor after it and typing <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd>.  The name of the function will appear in your "
"echo area.  Then, you can use this code by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u</"
"kbd> and a number and then typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x multiply-by-seven</"
"kbd> and pressing <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>.  The phrase &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">The result is &hellip;</samp>&rsquo; followed by the product "
"will appear in the echo area."
msgstr ""
"このコードは、コードの後にカーソルを置いて <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd> "
"と入力することでインストールできます。関数名がエコーエリアに表示されます。そ"
"の後、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u</kbd> と数値を入力し、さらに <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x multiply-by-seven</kbd> と入力して <kbd class=\"key\">RET</"
"kbd> を押すと、このコードを使用できます。エコーエリアには、フレーズ &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">The result is &hellip;</samp>&rsquo; とそれに続く積が表"
"示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Interactive-multiply_002dby_002dseven.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Speaking more generally, you invoke a function like this in either of two "
"ways:"
msgstr "より一般的に言えば、このような関数は次のいずれかの方法で呼び出します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ol><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Interactive-multiply_002dby_002dseven.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"By typing a prefix argument that contains the number to be passed, and then "
"typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> and the name of the function, as with "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u 3 M-x forward-sentence</kbd>; or,"
msgstr ""
"渡す数値を含む接頭辞引数を入力し、続いて <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u 3 M-x "
"forward-sentence</kbd> のように <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x</kbd> と関数名を入力す"
"るか、あるいは、"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ol><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Interactive-multiply_002dby_002dseven.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"By typing whatever key or keychord the function is bound to, as with <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-u 3 M-e</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u 3 M-e</kbd>のように、その機能に割り当てられている任意"
"のキーやキーコードを入力することで。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Interactive-multiply_002dby_002dseven.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Both the examples just mentioned work identically to move point forward "
"three sentences.  (Since <code class=\"code\">multiply-by-seven</code> is "
"not bound to a key, it could not be used as an example of key binding.)"
msgstr ""
"先ほど挙げた2つの例は、いずれも同様にポイントを3文分進める働きをします。"
"（<code class=\"code\">multiply-by-seven</code>はキーに紐付けられていないた"
"め、キーバインドの例としては使えませんでした。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Interactive-multiply_002dby_002dseven.html
msgid ""
"(See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Key-Bindings.html\">Some Key Bindings</a>, to "
"learn how to bind a command to a key.)"
msgstr ""
"（コマンドをキーに割り当てる方法については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Key-"
"Bindings.html\">主要なキーバインド</a>を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Interactive-multiply_002dby_002dseven.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"A <em class=\"dfn\">prefix argument</em> is passed to an interactive "
"function by typing the <kbd class=\"key\">META</kbd> key followed by a "
"number, for example, <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-3 M-e</kbd>, or by typing <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-u</kbd> and then a number, for example, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"u 3 M-e</kbd> (if you type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u</kbd> without a number, it "
"defaults to 4)."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">接頭辞引数</em>は、<kbd class=\"key\">META</kbd> キーに続け"
"て数値（例えば <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-3 M-e</kbd>）を入力するか、あるいは <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-u</kbd> に続けて数値（例えば <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u 3 M-e</"
"kbd>）を入力することでインタラクティブ関数に渡されます（数値を伴わずに <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-u</kbd> と入力した場合は、デフォルトで 4 となります）。"

