# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Keep.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"A third recursive pattern is called the <code class=\"code\">keep</code> "
"pattern.  In the <code class=\"code\">keep</code> recursive pattern, each "
"element of a list is tested; the element is acted on and the results are "
"kept only if the element meets a criterion."
msgstr ""
"3つ目の再帰パターンは<code class=\"code\">keep</code>パターンと呼ばれます。"
"<code class=\"code\">keep</code>再帰パターンでは、リストの各要素が判定され、"
"その要素が条件を満たす場合にのみ処理が行われ、結果が保持されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Keep.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Again, this is very like the <code class=\"code\">every</code> pattern, "
"except the element is skipped unless it meets a criterion."
msgstr ""
"繰り返しになりますが、これは<code class=\"code\">every</code>パターンに非常に"
"よく似ており、条件を満たさない限り要素がスキップされる点だけが異なります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Keep.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The pattern has three parts:"
msgstr "このパターンは3つの部分で構成されています："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Keep.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Else, if the beginning of the list (the <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> of "
"the list) passes a test"
msgstr ""
"そうでない場合、リストの先頭（リストの<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>）がテス"
"トに合格すれば"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Keep.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"act on that element and combine it, using <code class=\"code\">cons</code> "
"with"
msgstr "その要素を操作し、<code class=\"code\">cons</code>を用いて結合する"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Keep.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Otherwise, if the beginning of the list (the <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> "
"of the list) fails the test"
msgstr ""
"そうでない場合、リストの先頭（リストの<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>）がテス"
"トに不合格になると"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Keep.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "skip on that element,"
msgstr "その要素をスキップして、"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Keep.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"and, recursively call the function on the rest (the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</"
"small>) of the list."
msgstr ""
"そして、リストの残り（<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>）に対して再帰的に関数を"
"呼び出します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Keep.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Here is an example that uses <code class=\"code\">cond</code>:"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">cond</code> を使用した例を以下に示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Keep.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun keep-three-letter-words (word-list)\n"
"  &quot;Keep three letter words in WORD-LIST.&quot;\n"
"  (cond\n"
"   ;; First do-again-test: stop-condition\n"
"   ((not word-list) nil)\n"
"\n"
"   ;; Second do-again-test: when to act\n"
"   ((eq 3 (length (symbol-name (car word-list))))\n"
"    ;; combine acted-on element with recursive call on shorter list\n"
"    (cons (car word-list) (keep-three-letter-words (cdr word-list))))\n"
"\n"
"   ;; Third do-again-test: when to skip element;\n"
"   ;;   recursively call shorter list with next-step expression\n"
"   (t (keep-three-letter-words (cdr word-list)))))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Keep.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(keep-three-letter-words '(one two three four five six))\n"
"    &rArr; (one two six)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
