# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Key-Bindings.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Now for some personal key bindings:"
msgstr "ここからは、個人的なキーバインドをいくつかご紹介します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Key-Bindings.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";;; Compare windows\n"
"(keymap-global-set &quot;C-c w&quot; 'compare-windows)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Key-Bindings.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-compare_002dwindows\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-compare_002dwindows\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Key-Bindings.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">compare-windows</code> is a nifty command that compares "
"the text in your current window with text in the next window.  It makes the "
"comparison by starting at point in each window, moving over text in each "
"window as far as they match.  I use this command all the time."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">compare-windows</code>は、現在のウィンドウのテキストと次"
"のウィンドウのテキストを比較する便利なコマンドです。各ウィンドウのポイントか"
"ら開始し、一致するところまでテキストを辿ることで比較を行います。私はこのコマ"
"ンドをいつも使っています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Key-Bindings.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "This also shows how to set a key globally, for all modes."
msgstr ""
"これにより、すべてのモードでグローバルにキーを設定する方法も分かります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Key-Bindings.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Setting-a-key-globally\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Keymap-global-set\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Key-setting-globally\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-keymap_002dglobal_002dset\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Setting-a-key-globally\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Keymap-global-set\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Key-setting-globally\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-keymap_002dglobal_002dset\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Key-Bindings.html
msgid ""
"The key setting command is <code class=\"code\">keymap-global-set</code>.  "
"It is followed by the key binding.  In a <samp class=\"file\">.emacs</samp> "
"file, the keybinding is written as shown: <code class=\"code\">C-c</code> "
"stands for Control-C, which means to press the control key and the <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">c</kbd> key at the same time.  The <code class=\"code\">w</"
"code> means to press the <kbd class=\"kbd\">w</kbd> key.  The key binding is "
"surrounded by double quotation marks.  (If you were binding a <kbd "
"class=\"key\">META</kbd> key, rather than a <kbd class=\"key\">CTRL</kbd> "
"key, you would write <code class=\"code\">M-c</code> in your <samp "
"class=\"file\">.emacs</samp> file.  See <a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Init-"
"Rebinding.html#Init-Rebinding\">Rebinding Keys in Your Init File</a> in "
"<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>, for details.)"
msgstr ""
"主要な設定コマンドは <code class=\"code\">keymap-global-set</code> です。その"
"後にキーバインドが続きます。<samp class=\"file\">.emacs</samp> ファイルでは、"
"キーバインドは次のように記述されます。<code class=\"code\">C-c</code> は "
"Control-C を表し、これは Control キーと <kbd class=\"kbd\">c</kbd> キーを同時"
"に押すことを意味します。<code class=\"code\">w</code> は <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">w</kbd> キーを押すことを意味します。キーバインドは二重引用符で"
"囲まれます。（<kbd class=\"key\">CTRL</kbd> キーではなく <kbd "
"class=\"key\">META</kbd> キーをバインドする場合は、<samp "
"class=\"file\">.emacs</samp> ファイルに <code class=\"code\">M-c</code> と記"
"述します。詳細は <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite> の <a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Init-Rebinding.html#Init-Rebinding\">Rebinding Keys in Your Init File</"
"a> を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Key-Bindings.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The command invoked by the keys is <code class=\"code\">compare-windows</"
"code>.  Note that <code class=\"code\">compare-windows</code> is preceded by "
"a single-quote; otherwise, Emacs would first try to evaluate the symbol to "
"determine its value."
msgstr ""
"キーによって呼び出されるコマンドは <code class=\"code\">compare-windows</"
"code> です。なお、<code class=\"code\">compare-windows</code> の前にはシング"
"ルクォートが付いています。そうでなければ、Emacs はまずシンボルを評価してその"
"値を決定しようとします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Key-Bindings.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"These two things, the double quotation marks and the single-quote, are "
"necessary parts of key binding that I tend to forget.  Fortunately, I have "
"come to remember that I should look at my existing <samp "
"class=\"file\">.emacs</samp> file, and adapt what is there."
msgstr ""
"ダブルクォートとシングルクォートというこの2つは、キーバインドに欠かせない要素"
"なのですが、つい忘れがちです。幸いなことに、既存の<samp "
"class=\"file\">.emacs</samp>ファイルを確認して、そこに書かれている内容を調整"
"すればよいのだと、今では思い出せるようになりました。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Key-Bindings.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"As for the key binding itself: <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c w</kbd>.  This "
"combines the prefix key, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c</kbd>, with a single "
"character, in this case, <kbd class=\"kbd\">w</kbd>.  This set of keys, <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c</kbd> followed by a single character, is strictly reserved "
"for individuals&rsquo; own use.  (I call these <em class=\"dfn\">own</em> "
"keys, since these are for my own use.)  You should always be able to create "
"such a key binding for your own use without stomping on someone else&rsquo;s "
"key binding.  If you ever write an extension to Emacs, please avoid taking "
"any of these keys for public use.  Create a key like <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c "
"C-w</kbd> instead.  Otherwise, we will run out of own keys."
msgstr ""
"キーバインド自体についてですが、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c w</kbd> となります。こ"
"れはプレフィックスキー <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c</kbd> と、単一の文字（この場合"
"は <kbd class=\"kbd\">w</kbd>）を組み合わせたものです。このキーセット <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c</kbd> に続く単一の文字は、厳密に個人利用用に予約されていま"
"す。（これらは私自身の利用用であるため、<em class=\"dfn\">個人用</em>キーと呼"
"んでいます。）他者のキーバインドを侵害することなく、常に自分用にこのような"
"キーバインドを作成できるはずです。もし Emacs の拡張機能を開発する場合は、これ"
"らのキーを公開利用することは避けてください。代わりに <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c "
"C-w</kbd> のようなキーを作成してください。さもないと、個人用キーが底をついて"
"しまいます。"

