"a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Key-Bindings.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The following rebinds an existing key:"
msgstr "以下は、既存のキーを再バインドします："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Key-Bindings.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";;; Rebind 'C-x C-b' for 'buffer-menu'\n"
"(keymap-global-set &quot;C-x C-b&quot; 'buffer-menu)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Key-Bindings.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"By default, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-b</kbd> runs the <code "
"class=\"code\">list-buffers</code> command.  This command lists your buffers "
"in <em class=\"emph\">another</em> window.  Since I almost always want to do "
"something in that window, I prefer the <code class=\"code\">buffer-menu</"
"code> command, which not only lists the buffers, but moves point into that "
"window."
msgstr ""
"デフォルトでは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-b</kbd> は <code "
"class=\"code\">list-buffers</code> コマンドを実行します。このコマンドは、<em "
"class=\"emph\">別の</em> ウィンドウにバッファを一覧表示します。私はほぼ常にそ"
"のウィンドウで何かを行いたいため、バッファを一覧表示するだけでなく、ポイント"
"をそのウィンドウに移動させる <code class=\"code\">buffer-menu</code> コマンド"
"を好んで使っています。"

