# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Key-Bindings.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Historically, keys are bound globally using a lower-level function, <code "
"class=\"code\">global-set-key</code>, which is now considered legacy.  While "
"you are encouraged to use <code class=\"code\">keymap-global-set</code>, you "
"likely would encounter <code class=\"code\">global-set-key</code> in various "
"places.  The first example in this section can be rewritten using <code "
"class=\"code\">global-set-key</code> as:"
msgstr ""
"従来、キーは現在はレガシーと見なされている低レベル関数 <code "
"class=\"code\">global-set-key</code> を用いてグローバルにバインドされていまし"
"た。<code class=\"code\">keymap-global-set</code> の使用が推奨されますが、さ"
"まざまな箇所で <code class=\"code\">global-set-key</code> を目にすることにな"
"るでしょう。本セクションの最初の例は、<code class=\"code\">global-set-key</"
"code> を用いて次のように書き換えることができます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Key-Bindings.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(global-set-key &quot;\\C-cw&quot; 'compare-windows)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Key-Bindings.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"It is very similar to <code class=\"code\">keymap-global-set</code>, with "
"the keybinding following a slightly different format.  Control-C is "
"represented by <code class=\"code\">\\C-c</code>, instead of <code "
"class=\"code\">C-c</code>.  There is no space between key strokes, like "
"<code class=\"code\">\\C-c</code> and <code class=\"code\">w</code> in this "
"example.  Despite the difference, in documentation, this is still written as "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c&nbsp;w</kbd> for readability."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">keymap-global-set</code>と非常に似ていますが、キーバイン"
"ドはわずかに異なる形式になっています。Control-Cは<code class=\"code\">C-c</"
"code>ではなく、<code class=\"code\">\\C-c</code>で表されます。この例の<code "
"class=\"code\">\\C-c</code>と<code class=\"code\">w</code>のように、キー入力"
"の間にスペースはありません。こうした違いはあるものの、ドキュメント上では可読"
"性を高めるため、引き続き<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c&nbsp;w</kbd>と表記されていま"
"す。"

