# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Keymaps.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Emacs uses <em class=\"dfn\">keymaps</em> to record which keys call which "
"commands.  When you use <code class=\"code\">keymap-global-set</code> to set "
"the key binding for a single command in all parts of Emacs, you are "
"specifying the key binding in <code class=\"code\">current-global-map</code>."
msgstr ""
"Emacsでは、どのキーがどのコマンドを呼び出すかを記録するために<em "
"class=\"dfn\">キーマップ</em>を使用します。<code class=\"code\">keymap-"
"global-set</code>を使用してEmacsのあらゆる箇所で単一のコマンドのキーバインド"
"を設定する場合、<code class=\"code\">current-global-map</code>でそのキーバイ"
"ンドを指定することになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Keymaps.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Specific modes, such as C mode or Text mode, have their own keymaps; the "
"mode-specific keymaps override the global map that is shared by all buffers."
msgstr ""
"Cモードやテキストモードなどの特定のモードには、それぞれ独自のキーマップが用意"
"されており、モード固有のキーマップは、すべてのバッファで共有されるグローバル"
"マップよりも優先されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Keymaps.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">keymap-global-set</code> function binds, or "
"rebinds, the global keymap.  For example, the following binds the key <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-b</kbd> to the function <code class=\"code\">buffer-"
"menu</code>:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">keymap-global-set</code> 関数は、グローバルキーマップを"
"バインド、または再バインドします。例えば、以下はキー <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x "
"C-b</kbd> を関数 <code class=\"code\">buffer-menu</code> にバインドします："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Keymaps.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(keymap-global-set &quot;C-x C-b&quot; 'buffer-menu)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Keymaps.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Mode-specific keymaps are bound using the <code class=\"code\">keymap-set</"
"code> function, which takes a specific keymap as an argument, as well as the "
"key and the command.  For example, the following expression binds the <code "
"class=\"code\">texinfo-insert-@group</code> command to <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"c C-c g</kbd>:"
msgstr ""
"モード固有のキーマップは、特定のキーマップを引数として受け取る <code "
"class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> 関数を用いて、キーとコマンドを指定してバイン"
"ドします。例えば、以下の式は <code class=\"code\">texinfo-insert-@group</"
"code> コマンドを <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-c g</kbd> にバインドします："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Keymaps.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(keymap-set texinfo-mode-map &quot;C-c C-c g&quot; 'texinfo-insert-@group)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Keymaps.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Historically, keymaps are bound using a lower-level function, <code "
"class=\"code\">define-key</code>, which is now considered legacy.  While you "
"are encouraged to use <code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code>, you likely "
"would encounter <code class=\"code\">define-key</code> in various places.  "
"The above key binding can be rewritten using <code class=\"code\">define-"
"key</code> as:"
msgstr ""
"従来、キーマップは現在はレガシーとされる低レベル関数 <code "
"class=\"code\">define-key</code> を用いてバインドされていました。<code "
"class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> の使用が推奨されますが、さまざまな箇所で "
"<code class=\"code\">define-key</code> を目にすることがあるでしょう。上記の"
"キーバインドは、<code class=\"code\">define-key</code> を用いて次のように書き"
"換えることができます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Keymaps.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(define-key texinfo-mode-map &quot;\\C-c\\C-cg&quot; 'texinfo-insert-@group)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Keymaps.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">texinfo-insert-@group</code> function itself is a "
"little extension to Texinfo mode that inserts &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">@group</samp>&rsquo; into a Texinfo file.  I use this command "
"all the time and prefer to type the three strokes <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c C-c "
"g</kbd> rather than the six strokes <kbd class=\"kbd\">@ g r o u p</kbd>.  "
"(&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">@group</samp>&rsquo; and its matching &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">@end group</samp>&rsquo; are commands that keep all "
"enclosed text together on one page; many multi-line examples in this book "
"are surrounded by &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">@group &hellip; @end group</"
"samp>&rsquo;.)"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">texinfo-insert-@group</code> 関数自体は、Texinfo ファイ"
"ルに &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">@group</samp>&rsquo; を挿入する Texinfo モー"
"ドのちょっとした拡張機能です。私はこのコマンドをいつも使っており、6ストローク"
"の <kbd class=\"kbd\">@ g r o u p</kbd> よりも3ストロークの <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c C-c g</kbd> を入力する方を好みます。（&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">@group</samp>&rsquo; とそれに対応する &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">@end group</samp>&rsquo; は、囲まれたすべてのテキストを1ページ"
"にまとめるコマンドです。本書にある多くの複数行の例は、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">@group &hellip; @end group</samp>&rsquo; で囲まれています。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Keymaps.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Here is the <code class=\"code\">texinfo-insert-@group</code> function "
"definition:"
msgstr ""
"以下が<code class=\"code\">texinfo-insert-@group</code>の関数定義です："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Keymaps.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun texinfo-insert-@group ()\n"
"  &quot;Insert the string @group in a Texinfo buffer.&quot;\n"
"  (interactive)\n"
"  (beginning-of-line)\n"
"  (insert &quot;@group\\n&quot;))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Keymaps.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(Of course, I could have used Abbrev mode to save typing, rather than write "
"a function to insert a word; but I prefer key strokes consistent with other "
"Texinfo mode key bindings.)"
msgstr ""
"（もちろん、単語を挿入する関数を書く代わりに、Abbrevモードを使って入力の手間"
"を省くこともできたでしょう。ですが、他のTexinfoモードのキーバインドと整合性の"
"取れたキー操作の方が好みです。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Keymaps.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"You will see numerous <code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">define-key</code> expressions in <samp "
"class=\"file\">loaddefs.el</samp> as well as in the various mode libraries, "
"such as <samp class=\"file\">cc-mode.el</samp> and <samp class=\"file\">lisp-"
"mode.el</samp>."
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">loaddefs.el</samp> のほか、<samp class=\"file\">cc-"
"mode.el</samp> や <samp class=\"file\">lisp-mode.el</samp> といった各種モード"
"ライブラリにおいても、数多くの <code class=\"code\">keymap-set</code> や "
"<code class=\"code\">define-key</code> 式を目にすることになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Keymaps.html
msgid ""
"See <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
"manual/html_node/emacs/Key-Bindings.html#Key-Bindings\">Customizing Key "
