"<span>10.1 Kill Ring Overview<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Kill-Ring-"
"Overview-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>10.1 キルリングの概要<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Kill-Ring-"
"Overview-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Kill-Ring-Overview.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Kill-ring-overview\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Kill-ring-overview\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Kill-Ring-Overview.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The kill ring is a list of textual strings.  This is what it looks like:"
msgstr "キルリングはテキスト文字列のリストです。見た目は以下の通りです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Kill-Ring-Overview.html
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dring_002dyank_002dpointer.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(&quot;some text&quot; &quot;a different piece of text&quot; &quot;yet more text&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Kill-Ring-Overview.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If this were the contents of my kill ring and I pressed <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"y</kbd>, the string of characters saying &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">some "
"text</samp>&rsquo; would be inserted in this buffer where my cursor is "
"located."
msgstr ""
"これがキルリングの内容で、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-y</kbd>を押した場合、&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">some text</samp>&rsquo;という文字列が、カーソルがあるこ"
"のバッファに挿入されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Kill-Ring-Overview.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">yank</code> command is also used for duplicating "
"text by copying it.  The copied text is not cut from the buffer, but a copy "
"of it is put on the kill ring and is inserted by yanking it back."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">yank</code> コマンドは、テキストをコピーして複製する場合"
"にも使用されます。コピーされたテキストはバッファから切り出されるのではなく、"
"そのコピーがキルリングに配置され、ヤンクすることで挿入されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Kill-Ring-Overview.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Three functions are used for bringing text back from the kill ring: <code "
"class=\"code\">yank</code>, which is usually bound to <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"y</kbd>; <code class=\"code\">yank-pop</code>, which is usually bound to "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-y</kbd>; and <code class=\"code\">rotate-yank-pointer</"
"code>, which is used by the two other functions."
msgstr ""
"キルリングからテキストを呼び戻すには、3つの関数が使用されます。通常は<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-y</kbd>にバインドされている<code class=\"code\">yank</code>、"
"通常は<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-y</kbd>にバインドされている<code "
"class=\"code\">yank-pop</code>、そして他の2つの関数で使用される<code "
"class=\"code\">rotate-yank-pointer</code>です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Kill-Ring-Overview.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"These functions refer to the kill ring through a variable called the <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-ring-yank-pointer</code>.  Indeed, the insertion code "
"for both the <code class=\"code\">yank</code> and <code class=\"code\">yank-"
"pop</code> functions is:"
msgstr ""
"これらの関数は、<code class=\"code\">kill-ring-yank-pointer</code> という変数"
"を介してキルリングを参照します。実際、<code class=\"code\">yank</code> と "
"<code class=\"code\">yank-pop</code> の両関数における挿入コードは以下の通りで"
"す："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Kill-Ring-Overview.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(insert (car kill-ring-yank-pointer))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Kill-Ring-Overview.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(Well, no more.  In GNU Emacs 22, the function has been replaced by <code "
"class=\"code\">insert-for-yank</code> which calls <code "
"class=\"code\">insert-for-yank-1</code> repetitively for each <code "
"class=\"code\">yank-handler</code> segment.  In turn, <code "
"class=\"code\">insert-for-yank-1</code> strips text properties from the "
"inserted text according to <code class=\"code\">yank-excluded-properties</"
"code>.  Otherwise, it is just like <code class=\"code\">insert</code>.  We "
"will stick with plain <code class=\"code\">insert</code> since it is easier "
"to understand.)"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Kill-Ring-Overview.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"To begin to understand how <code class=\"code\">yank</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">yank-pop</code> work, it is first necessary to look at the "
"<code class=\"code\">kill-ring-yank-pointer</code> variable."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">yank</code> と <code class=\"code\">yank-pop</code> の仕"
"組みを理解し始めるには、まず <code class=\"code\">kill-ring-yank-pointer</"
"code> 変数を確認する必要があります。"

