#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/eintr/Large-buffer-case.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>What happens in a large buffer<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#What-"
"happens-in-a-large-buffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>大容量バッファでは何が起こるか<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#What-"
"happens-in-a-large-buffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Large-buffer-case.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In <code class=\"code\">beginning-of-buffer</code>, the inner <code "
"class=\"code\">if</code> expression tests whether the size of the buffer is "
"greater than 10,000 characters.  To do this, it uses the <code "
"class=\"code\">&gt;</code> function and the computation of <code "
"class=\"code\">size</code> that comes from the let expression."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">beginning-of-buffer</code> 内の式 <code "
"class=\"code\">if</code> は、バッファのサイズが 10,000 文字を超えているかどう"
"かを判定します。そのために、<code class=\"code\">&gt;</code> 関数と、let 式か"
"ら得られる <code class=\"code\">size</code> の計算を利用しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Large-buffer-case.html
msgid ""
"In the old days, the function <code class=\"code\">buffer-size</code> was "
"used.  Not only was that function called several times, it gave the size of "
"the whole buffer, not the accessible part.  The computation makes much more "
"sense when it handles just the accessible part.  (See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Narrowing-_0026-Widening.html\">Narrowing and Widening</a>, for more "
"information on focusing attention to an accessible part.)"
msgstr ""
"かつては <code class=\"code\">buffer-size</code> 関数が使用されていました。こ"
"の関数は複数回呼び出されるだけでなく、アクセス可能な部分ではなく、バッファ全"
"体のサイズを返していました。アクセス可能な部分のみを扱うようにすれば、計算は"
"はるかに理にかなったものになります。（アクセス可能な部分に着目する方法の詳細"
"については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Narrowing-_0026-Widening.html\">狭小化と"
"広域化</a>を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
