msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-string-defined\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-string-defined\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Lisp-Atoms.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In Lisp, all of the quoted text including the punctuation mark and the blank "
"spaces is a single atom.  This kind of atom is called a <em "
"class=\"dfn\">string</em> (for &ldquo;string of characters&rdquo;) and is "
"the sort of thing that is used for messages that a computer can print for a "
"human to read.  Strings are a different kind of atom than numbers or symbols "
"and are used differently."
msgstr ""
"Lispでは、句読点や空白を含む引用テキスト全体が単一のアトムとなります。このよ"
"うなアトムは<em class=\"dfn\">文字列</em>（「文字の列」の意）と呼ばれ、コン"
"ピュータが人間が読めるように出力するメッセージなどに用いられます。文字列は、"
"数値やシンボルとは異なる種類のアトムであり、使い方も異なります。"

