#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Lisp-macro.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The then-part is evaluated if the previous command was another call to <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-region</code>; if not, the else-part is evaluated."
msgstr ""
"直前のコマンドが <code class=\"code\">kill-region</code> への別の呼び出しで"
"あった場合は当時の部分が、そうでなければ else 部分が評価されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Lisp-macro.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">yank-handler</code> is an optional argument to <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-region</code> that tells the <code class=\"code\">kill-"
"append</code> and <code class=\"code\">kill-new</code> functions how deal "
"with properties added to the text, such as bold or italics."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">yank-handler</code>は<code class=\"code\">kill-region</"
"code>のオプション引数であり、太字や斜体などテキストに追加されたプロパティを"
"<code class=\"code\">kill-append</code>および<code class=\"code\">kill-new</"
"code>関数がどのように処理すべきかを指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Lisp-macro.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">last-command</code> is a variable that comes with Emacs "
"that we have not seen before.  Normally, whenever a function is executed, "
"Emacs sets the value of <code class=\"code\">last-command</code> to the "
"previous command."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">last-command</code> は、これまで見たことのない Emacs 標"
"準の変数です。通常、関数が実行されるたびに、Emacs は <code "
"class=\"code\">last-command</code> の値を直前のコマンドに設定します。"

