#: build/html/eintr/Lists-diagrammed.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"For example, the list <code class=\"code\">(rose violet buttercup)</code> "
"has three elements, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">rose</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;"
