"<span>16.9 ファイルの読み込み<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Loading-"
"Files-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Loading-Files.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Loading-files\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Loading-files\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Loading-Files.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Many people in the GNU Emacs community have written extensions to Emacs.  As "
"time goes by, these extensions are often included in new releases.  For "
"example, the Calendar and Diary packages are now part of the standard GNU "
"Emacs, as is Calc."
msgstr ""
"GNU Emacsコミュニティの多くの人々が、Emacs向けの拡張機能を開発してきました。"
"時が経つにつれ、こうした拡張機能は新たなリリースに組み込まれることが多くなっ"
"ています。例えば、CalendarやDiaryパッケージ、そしてCalcは、現在では標準のGNU "
"Emacsの一部となっています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Loading-Files.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"You can use a <code class=\"code\">load</code> command to evaluate a "
"complete file and thereby install all the functions and variables in the "
"file into Emacs.  For example:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">load</code> コマンドを使用してファイル全体を評価し、それ"
"によってファイル内のすべての関数や変数を Emacs にインストールできます。例え"
"ば："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Loading-Files.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(load &quot;~/emacs/slowsplit&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Loading-Files.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This evaluates, i.e., loads, the <samp class=\"file\">slowsplit.el</samp> "
"file or if it exists, the faster, byte compiled <samp "
"class=\"file\">slowsplit.elc</samp> file from the <samp "
"class=\"file\">emacs</samp> sub-directory of your home directory.  The file "
"contains the function <code class=\"code\">split-window-quietly</code>, "
"which John Robinson wrote in 1989."
msgstr ""
"これは、ホームディレクトリの <samp class=\"file\">emacs</samp> サブディレクト"
"リにある <samp class=\"file\">slowsplit.el</samp> ファイル、あるいは（もし存"
"在すれば）より高速なバイトコンパイル済みの <samp "
"class=\"file\">slowsplit.elc</samp> ファイルを評価、つまり読み込みます。この"
"ファイルには、ジョン・ロビンソンが1989年に作成した関数 <code "
"class=\"code\">split-window-quietly</code> が含まれています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Loading-Files.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">split-window-quietly</code> function splits a "
"window with the minimum of redisplay.  I installed it in 1989 because it "
"worked well with the slow 1200 baud terminals I was then using.  Nowadays, I "
"only occasionally come across such a slow connection, but I continue to use "
"the function because I like the way it leaves the bottom half of a buffer in "
"the lower of the new windows and the top half in the upper window."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">split-window-quietly</code> 関数は、再表示を最小限に抑え"
"てウィンドウを分割します。当時使用していた低速な1200ボーの端末でうまく動作し"
"たため、1989年にこれを導入しました。今ではこのような低速接続に遭遇することは"
"たまにしかありませんが、バッファの下半分を新しいウィンドウの下部に、上半分を"
"上部のウィンドウに残すというこの関数の挙動が気に入っているため、今でも使い続"
"けています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Loading-Files.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"To replace the key binding for the default <code class=\"code\">split-window-"
"vertically</code>, you must bind the keys to <code class=\"code\">split-"
"window-quietly</code>, like this:"
msgstr ""
"デフォルトの <code class=\"code\">split-window-vertically</code> のキーバイン"
"ドを置き換えるには、次のように <code class=\"code\">split-window-quietly</"
"code> にキーを割り当てる必要があります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Loading-Files.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(keymap-global-set &quot;C-x 2&quot; 'split-window-quietly)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Loading-Files.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-load_002dpath\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-load_002dpath\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Loading-Files.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If you load many extensions, as I do, then instead of specifying the exact "
"location of the extension file, as shown above, you can specify that "
"directory as part of Emacs&rsquo;s <code class=\"code\">load-path</code>.  "
"Then, when Emacs loads a file, it will search that directory as well as its "
"default list of directories.  (The default list is specified in <samp "
"class=\"file\">epaths.h</samp> when Emacs is built.)"
msgstr ""
"私のように多くの拡張機能を読み込んでいる場合は、上記のように拡張機能ファイル"
"の正確な場所を指定する代わりに、そのディレクトリをEmacsの<code "
"class=\"code\">load-path</code>の一部として指定できます。すると、Emacsがファ"
"イルを読み込む際、デフォルトのディレクトリリストに加えて、そのディレクトリも"
"検索対象となります。（デフォルトのリストは、Emacsのビルド時に<samp "
"class=\"file\">epaths.h</samp>で指定されます。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Loading-Files.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The following command adds your <samp class=\"file\">~/emacs</samp> "
"directory to the existing load path:"
msgstr ""
"次のコマンドで、<samp class=\"file\">~/emacs</samp> ディレクトリを既存のロー"
"ドパスに追加できます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Loading-Files.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";;; Emacs Load Path\n"
"(setq load-path (cons &quot;~/emacs&quot; load-path))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Loading-Files.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Incidentally, <code class=\"code\">load-library</code> is an interactive "
"interface to the <code class=\"code\">load</code> function.  The complete "
"function looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"ちなみに、<code class=\"code\">load-library</code>は<code "
"class=\"code\">load</code>関数へのインタラクティブなインターフェースです。関"
"数全体は以下のようになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Loading-Files.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-load_002dlibrary\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-load_002dlibrary\"></a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Loading-Files.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun load-library (library)\n"
"  &quot;Load the Emacs Lisp library named LIBRARY.\n"
"This is an interface to the function `load'.  LIBRARY is searched\n"
"for in `load-path', both with and without `load-suffixes' (as\n"
"well as `load-file-rep-suffixes').\n"
"\n"
"See Info node `(emacs)Lisp Libraries' for more details.\n"
"See `load-file' for a different interface to `load'.&quot;\n"
"  (interactive\n"
"   (list (completing-read &quot;Load library: &quot;\n"
"                          (apply-partially 'locate-file-completion-table\n"
"                                           load-path\n"
"                                           (get-load-suffixes)))))\n"
"  (load library))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Loading-Files.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The name of the function, <code class=\"code\">load-library</code>, comes "
"from the use of &ldquo;library&rdquo; as a conventional synonym for "
"&ldquo;file&rdquo;.  The source for the <code class=\"code\">load-library</"
"code> command is in the <samp class=\"file\">files.el</samp> library."
msgstr ""
"関数名 <code class=\"code\">load-library</code> は、「file」の慣用的な同義語"
"として「library」が用いられていることに由来します。<code class=\"code\">load-"
"library</code> コマンドのソースコードは <samp class=\"file\">files.el</samp> "
"ライブラリにあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Loading-Files.html
msgid ""
"Another interactive command that does a slightly different job is <code "
"class=\"code\">load-file</code>.  See <a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Lisp-"
"Libraries.html#Lisp-Libraries\">Libraries of Lisp Code for Emacs</a> in "
"<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>, for information on the "
"distinction between <code class=\"code\">load-library</code> and this "
"command."
msgstr ""
"少し異なる役割を果たすもう一つのインタラクティブコマンドに <code "
"class=\"code\">load-file</code> があります。<code class=\"code\">load-"
"library</code> とこのコマンドの違いについては、<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU "
"Emacs Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Lisp-Libraries.html#Lisp-"
"Libraries\">Libraries of Lisp Code for Emacs</a> を参照してください。"

