# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/eintr/Loop-Example.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>11.1.1 A <code class=\"code\">while</code> Loop and a List<a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#A-while-Loop-and-a-List\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>11.1.1 A <code class=\"code\">while</code> ループと List<a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#A-while-Loop-and-a-List\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Loop-Example.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"A common way to control a <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop is to test "
"whether a list has any elements.  If it does, the loop is repeated; but if "
"it does not, the repetition is ended.  Since this is an important technique, "
"we will create a short example to illustrate it."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">while</code> ループを制御する一般的な方法は、リストに要"
"素があるかどうかを判定することです。要素があればループが繰り返され、なければ"
"繰り返しが終了します。これは重要な手法であるため、具体例を作成して解説しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Loop-Example.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"A simple way to test whether a list has elements is to evaluate the list: if "
"it has no elements, it is an empty list and will return the empty list, "
"<code class=\"code\">()</code>, which is a synonym for <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> or false.  On the other hand, a list with elements "
"will return those elements when it is evaluated.  Since Emacs Lisp considers "
"as true any value that is not <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, a list that "
"returns elements will test true in a <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop."
msgstr ""
"リストに要素が含まれているかを確認する簡単な方法は、そのリストを評価すること"
"です。要素がない場合は空リストとなり、空リスト <code class=\"code\">()</"
"code> が返されます。これは <code class=\"code\">nil</code> または false の同"
"義語です。一方、要素を持つリストは、評価時にそれらの要素を返します。Emacs "
"Lisp では <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外のあらゆる値を真とみなすため、"
"要素を返すリストは <code class=\"code\">while</code> ループにおいて真と判定さ"
"れます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Loop-Example.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"For example, you can set the variable <code class=\"code\">empty-list</code> "
"to <code class=\"code\">nil</code> by evaluating the following <code "
"class=\"code\">setq</code> expression:"
msgstr ""
"例えば、以下の <code class=\"code\">setq</code> 式を評価することで、変数 "
"<code class=\"code\">empty-list</code> に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を"
"設定できます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Loop-Example.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(setq empty-list ())\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Loop-Example.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"After evaluating the <code class=\"code\">setq</code> expression, you can "
"evaluate the variable <code class=\"code\">empty-list</code> in the usual "
"way, by placing the cursor after the symbol and typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"x C-e</kbd>; <code class=\"code\">nil</code> will appear in your echo area:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">setq</code> 式を評価した後、シンボルの後にカーソルを置い"
"て <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd> と入力すれば、通常通りに変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">empty-list</code> を評価できます。すると、エコーエリアに "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> が表示されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Loop-Example.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "empty-list\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Loop-Example.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"On the other hand, if you set a variable to be a list with elements, the "
"list will appear when you evaluate the variable, as you can see by "
"evaluating the following two expressions:"
msgstr ""
"一方、変数を要素を持つリストとして設定すると、次の2つの式を評価してわかるよう"
"に、変数を評価した際にそのリストが表示されます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Loop-Example.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq animals '(gazelle giraffe lion tiger))\n"
"\n"
"animals\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Loop-Example.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Thus, to create a <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop that tests whether "
"there are any items in the list <code class=\"code\">animals</code>, the "
"first part of the loop will be written like this:"
msgstr ""
"このように、リスト <code class=\"code\">animals</code> に項目があるかどうかを"
"判定する <code class=\"code\">while</code> ループを作成するには、ループの前半"
"部分を次のように記述します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Loop-Example.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(while animals\n"
"       ...\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Loop-Example.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"When the <code class=\"code\">while</code> tests its first argument, the "
"variable <code class=\"code\">animals</code> is evaluated.  It returns a "
"list.  So long as the list has elements, the <code class=\"code\">while</"
"code> considers the results of the test to be true; but when the list is "
"empty, it considers the results of the test to be false."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">while</code> が第1引数をテストする際、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">animals</code> が評価されます。これはリストを返します。そのリ"
"ストに要素がある限り、<code class=\"code\">while</code> はテスト結果を真とみ"
"なしますが、リストが空の場合は、テスト結果を偽とみなします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Loop-Example.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"To prevent the <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop from running forever, "
"some mechanism needs to be provided to empty the list eventually.  An oft-"
"used technique is to have one of the subsequent forms in the <code "
"class=\"code\">while</code> expression set the value of the list to be the "
"<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of the list.  Each time the <code "
"class=\"code\">cdr</code> function is evaluated, the list will be made "
"shorter, until eventually only the empty list will be left.  At this point, "
"the test of the <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop will return false, "
"and the arguments to the <code class=\"code\">while</code> will no longer be "
"evaluated."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">while</code> ループが無限に回り続けるのを防ぐため、最終"
"的にリストを空にするための何らかの仕組みを設ける必要があります。よく用いられ"
"る手法は、<code class=\"code\">while</code> 式の後続の形式のいずれかで、リス"
"トの値をそのリストの <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> に設定することです。"
"<code class=\"code\">cdr</code> 関数が評価されるたびにリストは短くなり、最終"
"的に空のリストだけが残ります。この時点で、<code class=\"code\">while</code> "
"ループの判定は false となり、<code class=\"code\">while</code> への引数はそれ"
"以上評価されなくなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Loop-Example.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"For example, the list of animals bound to the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">animals</code> can be set to be the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</"
"small> of the original list with the following expression:"
msgstr ""
"例えば、変数 <code class=\"code\">animals</code> にバインドされた動物のリスト"
"は、以下の式を用いて元のリストの <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> に設定できま"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Loop-Example.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(setq animals (cdr animals))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Loop-Example.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If you have evaluated the previous expressions and then evaluate this "
"expression, you will see <code class=\"code\">(giraffe lion tiger)</code> "
"appear in the echo area.  If you evaluate the expression again, <code "
"class=\"code\">(lion tiger)</code> will appear in the echo area.  If you "
"evaluate it again and yet again, <code class=\"code\">(tiger)</code> appears "
"and then the empty list, shown by <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"先ほどの式を評価し、次にこの式を評価すると、エコー領域に <code "
"class=\"code\">(giraffe lion tiger)</code> が表示されます。さらにこの式を評価"
"すると、エコー領域に <code class=\"code\">(lion tiger)</code> が表示されま"
"す。もう一度、さらにもう一度評価すると、<code class=\"code\">(tiger)</code> "
"が表示され、続いて <code class=\"code\">nil</code> で示される空のリストが表示"
"されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
