#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/eintr/Looping-with-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>Looping with <code class=\"code\">while</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#Looping-with-while-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span><code class=\"code\">while</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Looping-with-while-1\"> &para;</a> を使ったループ処理</span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Looping-with-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"So long as the true-or-false-test of the <code class=\"code\">while</code> "
"expression returns a true value when it is evaluated, the body is repeatedly "
"evaluated.  This process is called a loop since the Lisp interpreter repeats "
"the same thing again and again, like an airplane doing a loop.  When the "
"result of evaluating the true-or-false-test is false, the Lisp interpreter "
"does not evaluate the rest of the <code class=\"code\">while</code> "
"expression and exits the loop."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">while</code> 式の真偽判定が評価時に真の値を返す限り、本"
"体は繰り返し評価されます。Lispインタプリタが、飛行機が旋回するように同じこと"
"を何度も繰り返すため、このプロセスはループと呼ばれます。真偽判定の結果が偽の"
"場合、Lispインタプリタは <code class=\"code\">while</code> 式の残りの部分を評"
"価せず、ループを終了します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Looping-with-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Clearly, if the value returned by evaluating the first argument to <code "
"class=\"code\">while</code> is always true, the body following will be "
"evaluated again and again &hellip; and again &hellip; forever.  Conversely, "
"if the value returned is never true, the expressions in the body will never "
"be evaluated.  The craft of writing a <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop "
"consists of choosing a mechanism such that the true-or-false-test returns "
"true just the number of times that you want the subsequent expressions to be "
"evaluated, and then have the test return false."
msgstr ""
"明らかに、<code class=\"code\">while</code> の第1引数を評価して返される値が常"
"に真である場合、後続の本体は何度も、何度も……そして永遠に評価され続けます。逆"
"に、返される値が決して真でない場合、本体内の式が評価されることはありません。"
"<code class=\"code\">while</code> ループを書くコツは、真偽判定が後続の式を評"
"価させたい回数分だけ真を返し、その後は偽を返すような仕組みを選択することにあ"
"ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Looping-with-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The value returned by evaluating a <code class=\"code\">while</code> is the "
"value of the true-or-false-test.  An interesting consequence of this is that "
"a <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop that evaluates without error will "
"return <code class=\"code\">nil</code> or false regardless of whether it has "
"looped 1 or 100 times or none at all.  A <code class=\"code\">while</code> "
"expression that evaluates successfully never returns a true value! What this "
"means is that <code class=\"code\">while</code> is always evaluated for its "
"side effects, which is to say, the consequences of evaluating the "
"expressions within the body of the <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop.  "
"This makes sense.  It is not the mere act of looping that is desired, but "
"the consequences of what happens when the expressions in the loop are "
"repeatedly evaluated."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">while</code> を評価して返される値は、true-or-false 判定"
"の結果となります。ここから得られる興味深い帰結は、エラーなく評価された <code "
"class=\"code\">while</code> ループは、1回、100回、あるいは一度もループしな"
"かったかにかかわらず、<code class=\"code\">nil</code> または false を返すとい"
"うことです。正常に評価された <code class=\"code\">while</code> 式が true の値"
"を返すことは決してありません！ つまり、<code class=\"code\">while</code> は常"
"に副作用、すなわち <code class=\"code\">while</code> ループの本体内にある式を"
"評価した結果のために評価されるということです。これは理にかなっています。求め"
"られているのは単なるループという行為ではなく、ループ内の式が繰り返し評価され"
"たときに何が起こるかという結果なのです。"

