#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Miscellaneous.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Here are a few miscellaneous settings:"
msgstr "いくつか雑多な設定を挙げます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><br><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Miscellaneous.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Set the shape and color of the mouse cursor:"
msgstr "マウスカーソルの形状と色を設定します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><br><ul><li><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Miscellaneous.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"; Cursor shapes are defined in\n"
"; '/usr/include/X11/cursorfont.h';\n"
"; for example, the 'target' cursor is number 128;\n"
"; the 'top_left_arrow' cursor is number 132.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><br><ul><li><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Miscellaneous.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((mpointer (x-get-resource &quot;*mpointer&quot;\n"
"                                &quot;*emacs*mpointer&quot;)))\n"
"  ;; If you have not set your mouse pointer\n"
"  ;;     then set it, otherwise leave as is:\n"
"  (if (eq mpointer nil)\n"
"      (setq mpointer &quot;132&quot;)) ; top_left_arrow\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><br><ul><li><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Miscellaneous.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (setq x-pointer-shape (string-to-number mpointer))\n"
"  (set-mouse-color &quot;white&quot;))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><br><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Miscellaneous.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Or you can set the values of a variety of features in an alist, like this:"
msgstr ""
"あるいは、次のようにalistにさまざまな特徴量の値を設定することもできます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><br><ul><li><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Miscellaneous.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq-default\n"
" default-frame-alist\n"
" '((cursor-color . &quot;white&quot;)\n"
"   (mouse-color . &quot;white&quot;)\n"
"   (foreground-color . &quot;white&quot;)\n"
"   (background-color . &quot;DodgerBlue4&quot;)\n"
"   ;; (cursor-type . bar)\n"
"   (cursor-type . box)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><br><ul><li><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Miscellaneous.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   (tool-bar-lines . 0)\n"
"   (menu-bar-lines . 1)\n"
"   (width . 80)\n"
"   (height . 58)\n"
"   (font .\n"
"         &quot;-Misc-Fixed-Medium-R-Normal--20-200-75-75-C-100-ISO8859-1&quot;)\n"
"   ))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><br><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Miscellaneous.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Convert <kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">CTRL</kbd>-h</kbd> into <kbd "
"class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> and <kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd> into <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">CTRL</kbd>-h</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"<kbd class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">CTRL</kbd>-h</kbd>を<kbd "
"class=\"key\">DEL</kbd>に、<kbd class=\"key\">DEL</kbd>を<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\"><kbd class=\"key\">CTRL</kbd>-h</kbd>に変換する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><br><ul><li><br>
#: build/html/eintr/Miscellaneous.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(Some older keyboards needed this, although I have not seen the problem "
"recently.)"
msgstr ""
"（古いキーボードの中にはこれが必要なものもありましたが、最近はそのような問題"
"は見かけません。）"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><br><ul><li><br><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Miscellaneous.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
