msgid ""
"<span>Fixing Unpleasant Key Bindings<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Fixing-Unpleasant-Key-Bindings\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>不快なキーバインドの修正<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Fixing-"
"Unpleasant-Key-Bindings\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><br>
#: build/html/eintr/Miscellaneous.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Key-bindings_002c-fixing\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Bindings_002c-key_002c-fixing-"
"unpleasant\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Key-bindings_002c-fixing\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Bindings_002c-key_002c-fixing-"
"unpleasant\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><br><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Miscellaneous.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Some systems bind keys unpleasantly.  Sometimes, for example, the <kbd "
"class=\"key\">CTRL</kbd> key appears in an awkward spot rather than at the "
"far left of the home row."
msgstr ""
"システムによっては、キーの配置が使いにくい場合があります。例えば、<kbd "
"class=\"key\">CTRL</kbd>キーがホームポジションの左端ではなく、不自然な位置に"
"配置されていることがあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><br><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Miscellaneous.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Usually, when people fix these sorts of key bindings, they do not change "
"their <samp class=\"file\">~/.emacs</samp> file.  Instead, they bind the "
"proper keys on their consoles with the <code class=\"code\">loadkeys</code> "
"or <code class=\"code\">install-keymap</code> commands in their boot script "
"and then include <code class=\"code\">xmodmap</code> commands in their <samp "
"class=\"file\">.xinitrc</samp> or <samp class=\"file\">.Xsession</samp> file "
"for X Windows."
msgstr ""
"通常、この種のキーバインドを設定する際、<samp class=\"file\">~/.emacs</samp> "
"ファイルは変更しません。代わりに、ブートスクリプト内の <code "
"class=\"code\">loadkeys</code> や <code class=\"code\">install-keymap</code> "
"コマンドでコンソールに適切なキーを割り当て、X Windows 用の <samp "
"class=\"file\">.xinitrc</samp> や <samp class=\"file\">.Xsession</samp> ファ"
"イルに <code class=\"code\">xmodmap</code> コマンドを記述します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><br><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Miscellaneous.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
