#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><br><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Miscellaneous.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"For a <samp class=\"file\">.xinitrc</samp> or <samp "
"class=\"file\">.Xsession</samp> file when the <kbd class=\"key\">Caps Lock</"
"kbd> key is at the far left of the home row:"
msgstr ""
"ホーム行の左端に <kbd class=\"key\">Caps Lock</kbd> キーがある状態で、<samp "
"class=\"file\">.xinitrc</samp> または <samp class=\"file\">.Xsession</samp> "
"ファイルの場合："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><br><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Miscellaneous.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Bind the key labeled 'Caps Lock' to 'Control'\n"
"# (Such a broken user interface suggests that keyboard manufacturers\n"
"# think that computers are typewriters from 1885.)\n"
"\n"
"xmodmap -e &quot;clear Lock&quot;\n"
"xmodmap -e &quot;add Control = Caps_Lock&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><br><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Miscellaneous.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In a <samp class=\"file\">.xinitrc</samp> or <samp class=\"file\">.Xsession</"
"samp> file, to convert an <kbd class=\"key\">ALT</kbd> key to a <kbd "
"class=\"key\">META</kbd> key:"
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">.xinitrc</samp> または <samp class=\"file\">.Xsession</"
"samp> ファイルで、<kbd class=\"key\">ALT</kbd> キーを <kbd "
"class=\"key\">META</kbd> キーに変換するには："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><br><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Miscellaneous.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Some ill designed keyboards have a key labeled ALT and no Meta\n"
"xmodmap -e &quot;keysym Alt_L = Meta_L Alt_L&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

