"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mode_002dline_002dformat\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Mode-line-format\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Mode-Line.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Finally, a feature I really like: a modified mode line."
msgstr "最後に、本当に気に入っている機能：カスタマイズしたモードライン。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Mode-Line.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"When I work over a network, I forget which machine I am using.  Also, I tend "
"to lose track of where I am, and which line point is on."
msgstr ""
"ネットワーク経由で作業していると、どのマシンを使っているのか分からなくなる。"
"また、自分がどこにいて、どのラインポイントにいるのかも把握しにくくなる傾向が"
"ある。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Mode-Line.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "So I reset my mode line to look like this:"
msgstr "そこで、モードラインをこんな感じにリセットしました："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Mode-Line.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "-:-- foo.texi   rattlesnake:/home/bob/  Line 1  (Texinfo Fill) Top\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Mode-Line.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"I am visiting a file called <samp class=\"file\">foo.texi</samp>, on my "
"machine <samp class=\"file\">rattlesnake</samp> in my <samp class=\"file\">/"
"home/bob</samp> buffer.  I am on line 1, in Texinfo mode, and am at the top "
"of the buffer."
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Mode-Line.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"My <samp class=\"file\">.emacs</samp> file has a section that looks like "
"this:"
msgstr ""
"私の<samp class=\"file\">.emacs</samp>ファイルには、次のようなセクションがあ"
"ります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Mode-Line.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; Set a Mode Line that tells me which machine, which directory,\n"
";; and which line I am on, plus the other customary information.\n"
"(setq-default mode-line-format\n"
" (quote\n"
"  (#(&quot;-&quot; 0 1\n"
"     (help-echo\n"
"      &quot;mouse-1: select window, mouse-2: delete others ...&quot;))\n"
"   mode-line-mule-info\n"
"   mode-line-modified\n"
"   mode-line-frame-identification\n"
"   &quot;    &quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Mode-Line.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   mode-line-buffer-identification\n"
"   &quot;    &quot;\n"
"   (:eval (substring\n"
"           (system-name) 0 (string-match &quot;\\\\..+&quot; (system-name))))\n"
"   &quot;:&quot;\n"
"   default-directory\n"
"   #(&quot; &quot; 0 1\n"
"     (help-echo\n"
"      &quot;mouse-1: select window, mouse-2: delete others ...&quot;))\n"
"   (line-number-mode &quot; Line %l &quot;)\n"
"   global-mode-string\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Mode-Line.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   #(&quot;   %[(&quot; 0 6\n"
"     (help-echo\n"
"      &quot;mouse-1: select window, mouse-2: delete others ...&quot;))\n"
"   (:eval (format-time-string &quot;%F&quot;))\n"
"   mode-line-process\n"
"   minor-mode-alist\n"
"   #(&quot;%n&quot; 0 2 (help-echo &quot;mouse-2: widen&quot; local-map (keymap ...)))\n"
"   &quot;)%] &quot;\n"
"   (-3 . &quot;%P&quot;)\n"
"   ;;   &quot;-%-&quot;\n"
"   )))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Mode-Line.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Here, I redefine the default mode line.  Most of the parts are from the "
"original; but I make a few changes.  I set the <em class=\"emph\">default</"
"em> mode line format so as to permit various modes, such as Info, to "
"override it."
msgstr ""
"ここでは、デフォルトのモードラインを再定義します。大部分はオリジナルのままで"
"すが、いくつか変更を加えています。Infoなどの各種モードで上書きできるよう、"
"<em class=\"emph\">デフォルト</em>のモードライン形式を設定しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Mode-Line.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Many elements in the list are self-explanatory: <code class=\"code\">mode-"
"line-modified</code> is a variable that tells whether the buffer has been "
"modified, <code class=\"code\">mode-name</code> tells the name of the mode, "
"and so on.  However, the format looks complicated because of two features we "
"have not discussed."
msgstr ""
"リスト内の多くの要素は自明です。<code class=\"code\">mode-line-modified</"
"code>はバッファが変更されたかどうかを示す変数であり、<code "
"class=\"code\">mode-name</code>はモード名を示す、といった具合です。しかし、ま"
"だ説明していない2つの特徴があるため、この形式は複雑に見えます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Mode-Line.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Properties_002c-in-mode-line-"
"example\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Properties_002c-in-mode-line-"
"example\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Mode-Line.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The first string in the mode line is a dash or hyphen, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo;.  In the old days, it would have been "
"specified simply as <code class=\"code\">&quot;-&quot;</code>.  But "
"nowadays, Emacs can add properties to a string, such as highlighting or, as "
"in this case, a help feature.  If you place your mouse cursor over the "
"hyphen, some help information appears (By default, you must wait seven-"
"tenths of a second before the information appears.  You can change that "
"timing by changing the value of <code class=\"code\">tooltip-delay</code>.)"
msgstr ""
"モードラインの1行目は、ダッシュまたはハイフンの &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-"
"</samp>&rsquo; です。昔であれば、単に <code class=\"code\">&quot;-&quot;</"
"code> と指定されていたでしょう。しかし現在では、Emacs は文字列にハイライト"
"や、今回のようなヘルプ機能といったプロパティを追加できます。ハイフンの上にマ"
"ウスカーソルを合わせると、ヘルプ情報が表示されます（デフォルトでは、情報が表"
"示されるまで0.7秒待つ必要があります。このタイミングは <code "
"class=\"code\">tooltip-delay</code> の値を変更することで調整できます）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Mode-Line.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The new string format has a special syntax:"
msgstr "新しい文字列形式には特殊な構文があります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Mode-Line.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "#(&quot;-&quot; 0 1 (help-echo &quot;mouse-1: select window, ...&quot;))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Mode-Line.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">#(</code> begins a list.  The first element of the "
"list is the string itself, just one &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  The second and third elements specify the range over which "
"the fourth element applies.  A range starts <em class=\"emph\">after</em> a "
"character, so a zero means the range starts just before the first character; "
"a 1 means that the range ends just after the first character.  The third "
"element is the property for the range.  It consists of a property list, a "
"property name, in this case, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">help-echo</"
"samp>&rsquo;, followed by a value, in this case, a string.  The second, "
"third, and fourth elements of this new string format can be repeated."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">#(</code> はリストの開始を示します。リストの最初の要素は"
"文字列そのものであり、単に &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">-</samp>&rsquo; となり"
"ます。2番目と3番目の要素は、4番目の要素が適用される範囲を指定します。範囲は文"
"字の<em class=\"emph\">後</em>から始まるため、0 は範囲が最初の文字の直前から"
"始まることを意味し、1 は範囲が最初の文字の直後で終わることを意味します。3番目"
"の要素は範囲のプロパティです。これはプロパティリスト、プロパティ名（この場合"
"は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">help-echo</samp>&rsquo;）、および値（この場合"
"は文字列）で構成されます。この新しい文字列形式の2番目、3番目、および4番目の要"
"素は、繰り返し指定することが可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Mode-Line.html
msgid ""
"See <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
"manual/html_node/elisp/Text-Properties.html#Text-Properties\">Text "
"Properties</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</"
"cite>, and see <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/"
"emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Mode-Line-Format.html#Mode-Line-Format\">Mode "
"Line Format</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</"
"cite>, for more information."
msgstr ""
"詳細については、<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</"
"cite>の<a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
"manual/html_node/elisp/Text-Properties.html#Text-Properties\">テキストプロパ"
"ティ</a>、および<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</"
"cite>の<a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
"manual/html_node/elisp/Mode-Line-Format.html#Mode-Line-Format\">モードライン"
"形式</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Mode-Line.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">mode-line-buffer-identification</code> displays the "
"current buffer name.  It is a list beginning <code class=\"code\">(#(&quot;"
"%12b&quot; 0 4 &hellip;</code>.  The <code class=\"code\">#(</code> begins "
"the list."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">mode-line-buffer-identification</code> は現在のバッファ"
"名を表示します。これは <code class=\"code\">(#(&quot;%12b&quot; 0 4 &hellip;"
"</code> から始まるリストです。<code class=\"code\">#(</code> でリストが始まり"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Mode-Line.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;%12b&quot;</samp>&rsquo; displays the "
"current buffer name, using the <code class=\"code\">buffer-name</code> "
"function with which we are familiar; the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">12</"
"samp>&rsquo; specifies the maximum number of characters that will be "
"displayed.  When a name has fewer characters, whitespace is added to fill "
"out to this number.  (Buffer names can and often should be longer than 12 "
"characters; this length works well in a typical 80 column wide window.)"
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;%12b&quot;</samp>&rsquo;は、お馴染みの"
"<code class=\"code\">buffer-name</code>関数を用いて現在のバッファ名を表示し、"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">12</samp>&rsquo;は表示される最大文字数を指定しま"
"す。名前の文字数が少ない場合は、この文字数に達するように空白が追加されます。"
"（バッファ名は12文字より長くても構いませんし、むしろそうすべき場合が多いで"
"す。この長さは、一般的な80列幅のウィンドウに適しています。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Mode-Line.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">:eval</code> says to evaluate the following form and "
"use the result as a string to display.  In this case, the expression "
"displays the first component of the full system name.  The end of the first "
"component is a &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.</samp>&rsquo; (period), so I "
"use the <code class=\"code\">string-match</code> function to tell me the "
"length of the first component.  The substring from the zeroth character to "
"that length is the name of the machine."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">:eval</code> は、以下の形式を評価し、その結果を文字列と"
"して表示するように指示しています。この場合、式はシステム名全体の第1コンポーネ"
"ントを表示します。第1コンポーネントの末尾は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">.</"
"samp>&rsquo;（ピリオド）であるため、<code class=\"code\">string-match</code> "
"関数を使用して第1コンポーネントの長さを取得します。0番目の文字からその長さま"
"での部分文字列が、マシン名となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Mode-Line.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "This is the expression:"
msgstr "これがその表現です："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Mode-Line.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(:eval (substring\n"
"        (system-name) 0 (string-match &quot;\\\\..+&quot; (system-name))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Mode-Line.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%[</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%]</samp>&rsquo; cause a pair of square brackets to appear "
"for each recursive editing level.  &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%n</"
"samp>&rsquo; says &ldquo;Narrow&rdquo; when narrowing is in effect.  &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">%P</samp>&rsquo; tells you the percentage of the buffer "
"that is above the bottom of the window, or &ldquo;Top&rdquo;, "
"&ldquo;Bottom&rdquo;, or &ldquo;All&rdquo;.  (A lower case &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">p</samp>&rsquo; tell you the percentage above the <em "
"class=\"emph\">top</em> of the window.)  &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%-</"
"samp>&rsquo; inserts enough dashes to fill out the line."
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%[</samp>&rsquo; と &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%]</samp>&rsquo; は、再帰的な編集レベルごとに一対の角括弧を表"
"示させます。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%n</samp>&rsquo; は、ナローイングが有"
"効なときに &ldquo;Narrow&rdquo; と表示します。&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%P</samp>&rsquo; は、バッファのうちウィンドウの下端より上にあ"
"る部分の割合、あるいは &ldquo;Top&rdquo;、&ldquo;Bottom&rdquo;、"
"&ldquo;All&rdquo; を表示します。（小文字の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">p</"
"samp>&rsquo; は、ウィンドウの<em class=\"emph\">上端</em>より上にある割合を表"
"示します。）&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%-</samp>&rsquo; は、行を埋めるのに十"
"分な数のハイフンを挿入します。"

