# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/No-Deferment.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Deferment-in-recursion\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Recursion-without-Deferments\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Deferment-in-recursion\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Recursion-without-Deferments\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-Deferment.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Let&rsquo;s consider again what happens with the <code "
"class=\"code\">triangle-recursively</code> function.  We will find that the "
"intermediate calculations are deferred until all can be done."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">triangle-recursively</code>関数で何が起こるのか、改めて"
"考えてみましょう。中間計算は、すべて完了するまで延期されることがわかります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-Deferment.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Here is the function definition:"
msgstr "関数の定義は以下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/No-Deferment.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun triangle-recursively (number)\n"
"  &quot;Return the sum of the numbers 1 through NUMBER inclusive.\n"
"Uses recursion.&quot;\n"
"  (if (= number 1)                    ; <span class=\"r\">do-again-test</span>\n"
"      1                               ; <span class=\"r\">then-part</span>\n"
"    (+ number                         ; <span class=\"r\">else-part</span>\n"
"       (triangle-recursively          ; <span class=\"r\">recursive call</span>\n"
"        (1- number)))))               ; <span class=\"r\">next-step-expression</span>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-Deferment.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "What happens when we call this function with an argument of 7?"
msgstr "この関数に引数7を渡して呼び出すと、どうなるでしょうか？"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-Deferment.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The first instance of the <code class=\"code\">triangle-recursively</code> "
"function adds the number 7 to the value returned by a second instance of "
"<code class=\"code\">triangle-recursively</code>, an instance that has been "
"passed an argument of 6.  That is to say, the first calculation is:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">triangle-recursively</code> 関数の最初のインスタンスは、"
"引数 6 が渡された <code class=\"code\">triangle-recursively</code> の2番目の"
"インスタンスが返す値に数値 7 を加算します。つまり、最初の計算は次のようになり"
"ます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/No-Deferment.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(+ 7 (triangle-recursively 6))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-Deferment.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The first instance of <code class=\"code\">triangle-recursively</"
"code>&mdash;you may want to think of it as a little robot&mdash;cannot "
"complete its job.  It must hand off the calculation for <code "
"class=\"code\">(triangle-recursively 6)</code> to a second instance of the "
"program, to a second robot.  This second individual is completely different "
"from the first one; it is, in the jargon, a &ldquo;different "
"instantiation&rdquo;.  Or, put another way, it is a different robot.  It is "
"the same model as the first; it calculates triangle numbers recursively; but "
"it has a different serial number."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">triangle-recursively</code>の最初のインスタンス――小さな"
"ロボットのようなものと考えてよいでしょう――は、自身の処理を完了することができ"
"ません。そのため、<code class=\"code\">(triangle-recursively 6)</code>の計算"
"をプログラムの2番目のインスタンス、つまり2台目のロボットに引き継がなければな"
"りません。この2台目の個体は、1台目とは全く別物です。専門用語で言えば、「別の"
"インスタンス化」にあたります。言い換えれば、別のロボットということです。モデ"
"ルは1台目と同じで、三角数を再帰的に計算しますが、シリアル番号が異なります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-Deferment.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"And what does <code class=\"code\">(triangle-recursively 6)</code> return? "
"It returns the number 6 added to the value returned by evaluating <code "
"class=\"code\">triangle-recursively</code> with an argument of 5.  Using the "
"robot metaphor, it asks yet another robot to help it."
msgstr ""
"では、<code class=\"code\">(triangle-recursively 6)</code>は何を返すのでしょ"
"うか？それは、引数5を指定して<code class=\"code\">triangle-recursively</code>"
"を評価して得られた値に6を加えた数値を返します。ロボットの比喩で言えば、また別"
"のロボットに助けを求めていることになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-Deferment.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Now the total is:"
msgstr "これで合計は："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/No-Deferment.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(+ 7 6 (triangle-recursively 5))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-Deferment.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "And what happens next?"
msgstr "それで、この後はどうなるの？"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/No-Deferment.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(+ 7 6 5 (triangle-recursively 4))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-Deferment.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Each time <code class=\"code\">triangle-recursively</code> is called, except "
"for the last time, it creates another instance of the program&mdash;another "
"robot&mdash;and asks it to make a calculation."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">triangle-recursively</code>が呼び出されるたびに、最後の"
"一回を除いて、プログラムの別のインスタンス&mdash;別のロボット&mdash;を生成"
"し、計算を行わせる。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-Deferment.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Eventually, the full addition is set up and performed:"
msgstr "最終的に、加算処理全体がセットアップされ、実行されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/No-Deferment.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(+ 7 6 5 4 3 2 1)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-Deferment.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This design for the function defers the calculation of the first step until "
"the second can be done, and defers that until the third can be done, and so "
"on.  Each deferment means the computer must remember what is being waited "
"on.  This is not a problem when there are only a few steps, as in this "
"example.  But it can be a problem when there are more steps."
msgstr ""
"この関数の設計では、最初のステップの計算を2番目のステップが可能になるまで延期"
"し、さらにそれを3番目のステップが可能になるまで延期する、という具合に繰り返さ"
"れます。延期が行われるたびに、コンピュータは何を待っているのかを記憶しておく"
"必要があります。この例のようにステップ数が少ない場合は問題になりません。しか"
"し、ステップ数が多くなると問題になる可能性があります。"

