#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>11.3.8 No Deferment Solution<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#No-"
"Deferment-Solution\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>11.3.8 延期不可の解決策<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#No-Deferment-"
"Solution\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-No-deferment-solution\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Solution-without-deferment\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-No-deferment-solution\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Solution-without-deferment\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The solution to the problem of deferred operations is to write in a manner "
"that does not defer operations<a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF15\" "
"href=\"#FOOT15\"><sup>15</sup></a>.  This requires writing to a different "
"pattern, often one that involves writing two function definitions, an "
"initialization function and a helper function."
msgstr ""
"操作の遅延という問題に対する解決策は、操作を遅延させない形で記述することであ"
"る<a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF15\" href=\"#FOOT15\"><sup>15</sup></a>。こ"
"れには異なるパターンでの記述が必要であり、多くの場合、初期化関数とヘルパー関"
"数という2つの関数定義を記述することになる。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The initialization function sets up the job; the helper function does the "
"work."
msgstr "初期化関数がジョブをセットアップし、ヘルパー関数が処理を行います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Here are the two function definitions for adding up numbers.  They are so "
"simple, I find them hard to understand."
msgstr ""
"数値を足し合わせるための2つの関数定義です。非常にシンプルなので、かえって理解"
"しにくいと感じています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun triangle-initialization (number)\n"
"  &quot;Return the sum of the numbers 1 through NUMBER inclusive.\n"
"This is the initialization component of a two function\n"
"duo that uses recursion.&quot;\n"
"  (triangle-recursive-helper 0 0 number))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun triangle-recursive-helper (sum counter number)\n"
"  &quot;Return SUM, using COUNTER, through NUMBER inclusive.\n"
"This is the helper component of a two function duo\n"
"that uses recursion.&quot;\n"
"  (if (&gt; counter number)\n"
"      sum\n"
"    (triangle-recursive-helper (+ sum counter)  ; <span class=\"r\">sum</span>\n"
"                               (1+ counter)     ; <span class=\"r\">counter</span>\n"
"                               number)))        ; <span class=\"r\">number</span>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Install both function definitions by evaluating them, then call <code "
"class=\"code\">triangle-initialization</code> with 2 rows:"
msgstr ""
"両方の関数定義を評価してインストールし、次に2行を指定して<code "
"class=\"code\">triangle-initialization</code>を呼び出します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(triangle-initialization 2)\n"
"    &rArr; 3\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The initialization function calls the first instance of the helper function "
"with three arguments: zero, zero, and a number which is the number of rows "
"in the triangle."
msgstr ""
"初期化関数は、0、0、および三角形の行数となる数値の3つの引数を渡して、ヘルパー"
"関数の最初のインスタンスを呼び出します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The first two arguments passed to the helper function are initialization "
"values.  These values are changed when <code class=\"code\">triangle-"
"recursive-helper</code> invokes new instances.<a class=\"footnote\" "
"id=\"DOCF16\" href=\"#FOOT16\"><sup>16</sup></a>"
msgstr ""
"ヘルパー関数に渡される最初の2つの引数は、初期化値です。これらの値は、<code "
"class=\"code\">triangle-recursive-helper</code> が新しいインスタンスを生成す"
"る際に変更されます。<a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF16\" "
"href=\"#FOOT16\"><sup>16</sup></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Let&rsquo;s see what happens when we have a triangle that has one row.  "
"(This triangle will have one pebble in it!)"
msgstr ""
"1行の三角形の場合、どうなるか見てみましょう。（この三角形には、小石が1つ入っ"
"ています！）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">triangle-initialization</code> will call its helper "
"with the arguments <code class=\"code\">0&nbsp;0&nbsp;1</code>.  That "
"function will run the conditional test whether <code class=\"code\">(&gt; "
"counter number)</code>:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">triangle-initialization</code> は引数 <code "
"class=\"code\">0&nbsp;0&nbsp;1</code> を指定してヘルパーを呼び出します。その"
"関数は、<code class=\"code\">(&gt; counter number)</code> に関する条件判定を"
"実行します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(&gt; 0 1)\n"
msgstr ""

