# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Again, <code class=\"code\">(&gt; counter number)</code> will be false, so "
"again, the Lisp interpreter will evaluate <code class=\"code\">triangle-"
"recursive-helper</code>, creating a new instance with new arguments."
msgstr ""
"ここでも <code class=\"code\">(&gt; counter number)</code> は false となるた"
"め、再び Lisp インタプリタは <code class=\"code\">triangle-recursive-helper</"
"code> を評価し、新たな引数を持つ新しいインスタンスを生成します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "This new instance will be;"
msgstr "この新しいインスタンスは、以下の通りとなります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    (triangle-recursive-helper\n"
"     (+ sum counter)  ; <span class=\"r\">sum plus counter</span> &rArr; <span class=\"r\">sum</span>\n"
"     (1+ counter)     ; <span class=\"r\">increment counter</span> &rArr; <span class=\"r\">counter</span>\n"
"     number)          ; <span class=\"r\">number stays the same</span>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(triangle-recursive-helper 1 2 1)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In this case, the <code class=\"code\">(&gt; counter number)</code> test "
"will be true! So the instance will return the value of the sum, which will "
"be 1, as expected."
msgstr ""
"この場合、<code class=\"code\">(&gt; counter number)</code> の判定は真になり"
"ます！そのため、インスタンスは和の値を返し、期待通り 1 となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Now, let&rsquo;s pass <code class=\"code\">triangle-initialization</code> an "
"argument of 2, to find out how many pebbles there are in a triangle with two "
"rows."
msgstr ""
"それでは、<code class=\"code\">triangle-initialization</code> に引数 2 を渡し"
"て、2行の三角形に小石がいくつあるか確かめてみましょう。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"That function calls <code class=\"code\">(triangle-recursive-helper 0 0 2)</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"その関数は<code class=\"code\">(triangle-recursive-helper 0 0 2)</code>を呼び"
"出します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
