#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"                          <span class=\"r\">sum counter number</span>\n"
"(triangle-recursive-helper 0    1       2)\n"
"\n"
"(triangle-recursive-helper 1    2       2)\n"
"\n"
"(triangle-recursive-helper 3    3       2)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"When the last instance is called, the <code class=\"code\">(&gt; counter "
"number)</code> test will be true, so the instance will return the value of "
"<code class=\"code\">sum</code>, which will be 3."
msgstr ""
"最後のインスタンスが呼び出される際、<code class=\"code\">(&gt; counter "
"number)</code> の判定は真となるため、そのインスタンスは <code "
"class=\"code\">sum</code> の値である 3 を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This kind of pattern helps when you are writing functions that can use many "
"resources in a computer."
msgstr ""
"このようなパターンは、コンピュータ上の多くのリソースを利用できる関数を記述す"
"る際に役立ちます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h5>
