# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The phrase <em class=\"dfn\">tail recursive</em> is used to describe such a "
"process, one that uses constant space."
msgstr ""
"<em class=\"dfn\">末尾再帰</em>という表現は、定数空間を用いるこのような処理を"
"指す際に用いられる。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h5>
#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a id=\"FOOT16\" href=\"#DOCF16\">(16)</a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"FOOT16\" href=\"#DOCF16\">(16)</a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/No-deferment-solution.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The jargon is mildly confusing: <code class=\"code\">triangle-recursive-"
"helper</code> uses a process that is iterative in a procedure that is "
"recursive.  The process is called iterative because the computer need only "
"record the three values, <code class=\"code\">sum</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">counter</code>, and <code class=\"code\">number</code>; the "
"procedure is recursive because the function calls itself.  On the other "
"hand, both the process and the procedure used by <code "
"class=\"code\">triangle-recursively</code> are called recursive.  The word "
"&ldquo;recursive&rdquo; has different meanings in the two contexts."
msgstr ""
"専門用語がやや紛らわしい。<code class=\"code\">triangle-recursive-helper</"
"code>では、再帰的な手続きの中で反復的な処理が行われている。この処理が反復的と"
"呼ばれるのは、コンピュータが<code class=\"code\">sum</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">counter</code>、<code class=\"code\">number</code>という3つの"
"値を記録するだけで済むからであり、手続きが再帰的と呼ばれるのは、関数が自身を"
"呼び出すからである。一方で、<code class=\"code\">triangle-recursively</code>"
"で用いられている処理と手続きは、どちらも再帰的と呼ばれる。「再帰的」という言"
"葉は、これら2つの文脈で異なる意味を持つ。"

