#, no-wrap
msgid "'(this list has (a list inside of it))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Numbers-Lists.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The components of this list are the words &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">this</"
"samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">list</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">has</samp>&rsquo;, and the list &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">(a list inside of it)</samp>&rsquo;.  The interior list is "
"made up of the words &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">a</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">list</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">inside</"
"samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">of</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">it</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"このリストの構成要素は、単語 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">this</samp>&rsquo;、"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">list</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">has</samp>&rsquo;、およびリスト &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">(a list inside of it)</samp>&rsquo;です。内部リストは、単語 "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">a</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">list</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">inside</"
"samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">of</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">it</samp>&rsquo;で構成されています。"

