# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/eintr/Optional-Arguments.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>5.3.1 Optional Arguments<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Optional-"
"Arguments-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>5.3.1 オプション引数<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Optional-"
"Arguments-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Optional-Arguments.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Unless told otherwise, Lisp expects that a function with an argument in its "
"function definition will be called with a value for that argument.  If that "
"does not happen, you get an error and a message that says &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Wrong number of arguments</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"特に指定がない限り、Lispは関数定義に引数を持つ関数が、その引数に値を渡されて"
"呼び出されるものと想定します。そうでない場合はエラーが発生し、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Wrong number of arguments</samp>&rsquo;というメッセージが表示"
"されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Optional-Arguments.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Optional-arguments\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Keyword\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-optional\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Optional-arguments\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Keyword\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-optional\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Optional-Arguments.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"However, optional arguments are a feature of Lisp: a particular <em "
"class=\"dfn\">keyword</em> is used to tell the Lisp interpreter that an "
"argument is optional.  The keyword is <code class=\"code\">&amp;optional</"
"code>.  (The &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&amp;</samp>&rsquo; in front of "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">optional</samp>&rsquo; is part of the keyword.)  "
"In a function definition, if an argument follows the keyword <code "
"class=\"code\">&amp;optional</code>, no value need be passed to that "
"argument when the function is called."
msgstr ""
"ただし、省略可能な引数はLispの機能であり、特定の<em class=\"dfn\">キーワード"
"</em>を用いて、引数が省略可能であることをLispインタプリタに伝えます。このキー"
"ワードは<code class=\"code\">&amp;optional</code>です。（<samp "
"class=\"samp\">optional</samp>の前にある&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&amp;</"
"samp>&rsquo;もキーワードの一部です。）関数定義において、キーワード<code "
"class=\"code\">&amp;optional</code>の後に引数が続く場合、関数を呼び出す際にそ"
"の引数に値を渡す必要はありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Optional-Arguments.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The first line of the function definition of <code class=\"code\">beginning-"
"of-buffer</code> therefore looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"したがって、<code class=\"code\">beginning-of-buffer</code>の関数定義の1行目"
"は次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Optional-Arguments.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(defun beginning-of-buffer (&amp;optional arg)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Optional-Arguments.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "In outline, the whole function looks like this:"
msgstr "概略としては、関数全体は次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Optional-Arguments.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun beginning-of-buffer (&amp;optional arg)\n"
"  &quot;<var class=\"var\">documentation</var>...&quot;\n"
"  (interactive &quot;P&quot;)\n"
"  (or (<var class=\"var\">is-the-argument-a-cons-cell</var> arg)\n"
"      (and <var class=\"var\">are-both-transient-mark-mode-and-mark-active-true</var>)\n"
"      (push-mark))\n"
"  (let (<var class=\"var\">determine-size-and-set-it</var>)\n"
"    (goto-char\n"
"      (<var class=\"var\">if-there-is-an-argument</var>\n"
"          <var class=\"var\">figure-out-where-to-go</var>\n"
"        <var class=\"var\">else-go-to</var>\n"
"        (point-min))))\n"
"  <var class=\"var\">do-nicety</var>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Optional-Arguments.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The function is similar to the <code class=\"code\">simplified-beginning-of-"
"buffer</code> function except that the <code class=\"code\">interactive</"
"code> expression has <code class=\"code\">&quot;P&quot;</code> as an "
"argument and the <code class=\"code\">goto-char</code> function is followed "
"by an if-then-else expression that figures out where to put the cursor if "
"there is an argument that is not a cons cell."
msgstr ""
"この関数は<code class=\"code\">simplified-beginning-of-buffer</code>関数と似"
"ていますが、<code class=\"code\">interactive</code>式の引数が<code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;P&quot;</code>である点と、<code class=\"code\">goto-"
"char</code>関数の後に、引数がコンスセルでない場合にカーソルをどこに配置するか"
"を決定するif-then-else式が続く点が異なります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Optional-Arguments.html
msgid ""
"(Since I do not explain a cons cell for many more chapters, please consider "
"ignoring the function <code class=\"code\">consp</code>.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"List-Implementation.html\">How Lists are Implemented</"
"a>, and <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
"manual/html_node/elisp/Cons-Cell-Type.html#Cons-Cell-Type\">Cons Cell and "
"List Types</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</"
"cite>.)"
msgstr ""
"（以降、多くの章にわたって cons セルについての説明は行わないため、関数 <code "
"class=\"code\">consp</code> は無視して構いません。<cite class=\"cite\">The "
"GNU Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite> の <a class=\"xref\" href=\"List-"
"Implementation.html\">How Lists are Implemented</a> および <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Cons-Cell-Type.html#Cons-Cell-Type\">Cons Cell and List Types</a> を参"
"照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Optional-Arguments.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">&quot;P&quot;</code> in the <code "
"class=\"code\">interactive</code> expression tells Emacs to pass a prefix "
"argument, if there is one, to the function in raw form.  A prefix argument "
"is made by typing the <kbd class=\"key\">META</kbd> key followed by a "
"number, or by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u</kbd> and then a number.  (If "
"you don&rsquo;t type a number, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u</kbd> defaults to a "
"cons cell with a 4.  A lowercase <code class=\"code\">&quot;p&quot;</code> "
"in the <code class=\"code\">interactive</code> expression causes the "
"function to convert a prefix arg to a number.)"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">interactive</code> 式内の <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;P&quot;</code> は、プレフィックス引数がある場合に、それ"
"をそのままの形式で関数に渡すよう Emacs に指示します。プレフィックス引数は、"
"<kbd class=\"key\">META</kbd> キーを入力した後に数値を入力するか、あるいは "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u</kbd> を入力してから数値を入力することで作成します。"
"（数値を入力しない場合、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u</kbd> はデフォルトで 4 を含む"
"コンスセルになります。<code class=\"code\">interactive</code> 式内で小文字の "
"<code class=\"code\">&quot;p&quot;</code> を指定すると、関数がプレフィックス"
"引数を数値に変換します。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Optional-Arguments.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The true-or-false-test of the <code class=\"code\">if</code> expression "
"looks complex, but it is not: it checks whether <code class=\"code\">arg</"
"code> has a value that is not <code class=\"code\">nil</code> and whether it "
"is a cons cell.  (That is what <code class=\"code\">consp</code> does; it "
"checks whether its argument is a cons cell.)  If <code class=\"code\">arg</"
"code> has a value that is not <code class=\"code\">nil</code> (and is not a "
"cons cell), which will be the case if <code class=\"code\">beginning-of-"
"buffer</code> is called with a numeric argument, then this true-or-false-"
"test will return true and the then-part of the <code class=\"code\">if</"
"code> expression will be evaluated.  On the other hand, if <code "
"class=\"code\">beginning-of-buffer</code> is not called with an argument, "
"the value of <code class=\"code\">arg</code> will be <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> and the else-part of the <code class=\"code\">if</"
"code> expression will be evaluated.  The else-part is simply <code "
"class=\"code\">point-min</code>, and when this is the outcome, the whole "
"<code class=\"code\">goto-char</code> expression is <code "
"class=\"code\">(goto-char (point-min))</code>, which is how we saw the <code "
"class=\"code\">beginning-of-buffer</code> function in its simplified form."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">if</code> 式の真偽判定は複雑に見えますが、実際はそうでは"
"ありません。これは、<code class=\"code\">arg</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を持ち、かつコンスセルであるかどうかを判定"
"するものです。（<code class=\"code\">consp</code> も同様で、引数がコンスセル"
"であるかどうかを判定します。）もし <code class=\"code\">arg</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を持ち（かつコンスセルではない）――これは "
"<code class=\"code\">beginning-of-buffer</code> が数値引数で呼び出された場合"
"に当てはまります――、この真偽判定は true を返し、<code class=\"code\">if</"
"code> 式の then 部分が評価されます。一方、<code class=\"code\">beginning-of-"
"buffer</code> が引数なしで呼び出された場合、<code class=\"code\">arg</code> "
"の値は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となり、<code class=\"code\">if</"
"code> 式の else 部分が評価されます。else 部分は単に <code "
"class=\"code\">point-min</code> であり、この結果となった場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">goto-char</code> 式全体は <code class=\"code\">(goto-char "
"(point-min))</code> となります。これが、簡略化された形式の <code "
"class=\"code\">beginning-of-buffer</code> 関数の姿です。"

