"<span>序文<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Preface-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Preface.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Most of the GNU Emacs integrated environment is written in the programming "
"language called Emacs Lisp.  The code written in this programming language "
"is the software&mdash;the sets of instructions&mdash;that tell the computer "
"what to do when you give it commands.  Emacs is designed so that you can "
"write new code in Emacs Lisp and easily install it as an extension to the "
"editor."
msgstr ""
"GNU Emacs統合環境の大部分は、Emacs Lispと呼ばれるプログラミング言語で記述され"
"ています。この言語で書かれたコードはソフトウェア――つまり命令群――であり、コマ"
"ンドを与えた際にコンピュータに何をすべきかを指示するものです。Emacsは、Emacs "
"Lispで新しいコードを記述し、それをエディタの拡張機能として簡単にインストール"
"できるように設計されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Preface.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(GNU Emacs is sometimes called an &ldquo;extensible editor&rdquo;, but it "
"does much more than provide editing capabilities.  It is better to refer to "
"Emacs as an &ldquo;extensible computing environment&rdquo;.  However, that "
"phrase is quite a mouthful.  It is easier to refer to Emacs simply as an "
"editor.  Moreover, everything you do in Emacs&mdash;find the Mayan date and "
"phases of the moon, simplify polynomials, debug code, manage files, read "
"letters, write books&mdash;all these activities are kinds of editing in the "
"most general sense of the word.)"
msgstr ""
"（GNU Emacsは時に「拡張可能なエディタ」と呼ばれますが、単なる編集機能の提供に"
"とどまらない多くの機能を備えています。Emacsは「拡張可能なコンピューティング環"
"境」と呼ぶ方が適切でしょう。とはいえ、その表現はかなり言いづらいものです。単"
"にエディタと呼ぶ方が簡単です。さらに、Emacsで行うあらゆること――マヤ暦の日付や"
"月の満ち欠けを調べる、多項式を簡略化する、コードをデバッグする、ファイルを管"
"理する、手紙を読む、本を書く――こうした活動はすべて、最も広義の意味での編集の"
"一種なのです。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
