#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><h3>
#: build/html/eintr/Prepare-the-data.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>14.9 Prepare the Data for Display in a Graph<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Prepare-the-Data-for-Display-in-a-Graph\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>14.9 グラフに表示するためのデータの準備<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Prepare-the-Data-for-Display-in-a-Graph\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Prepare-the-data.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">recursive-lengths-list-many-files</code> function "
"returns a list of numbers.  Each number records the length of a function "
"definition.  What we need to do now is transform this data into a list of "
"numbers suitable for generating a graph.  The new list will tell how many "
"functions definitions contain less than 10 words and symbols, how many "
"contain between 10 and 19 words and symbols, how many contain between 20 and "
"29 words and symbols, and so on."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">recursive-lengths-list-many-files</code> 関数は数値のリ"
"ストを返します。各数値は関数定義の長さを表しています。ここで行う必要があるの"
"は、このデータをグラフ生成に適した数値のリストに変換することです。新しいリス"
"トでは、単語と記号の数が10個未満の関数定義がいくつあり、10個から19個のものが"
"いくつ、20個から29個のものがいくつあるか、といった情報が示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Prepare-the-data.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In brief, we need to go through the lengths&rsquo; list produced by the "
"<code class=\"code\">recursive-lengths-list-many-files</code> function and "
"count the number of defuns within each range of lengths, and produce a list "
"of those numbers."
msgstr ""
"要するに、<code class=\"code\">recursive-lengths-list-many-files</code>関数に"
"よって生成されたlengthsのリストを走査し、各lengthsの範囲に含まれるdefunsの数"
"を数えて、それらの数値のリストを作成する必要があります。"

