# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-cond.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The version of <code class=\"code\">triangle-recursively</code> described "
"earlier is written with the <code class=\"code\">if</code> special form.  It "
"can also be written using another special form called <code "
"class=\"code\">cond</code>.  The name of the special form <code "
"class=\"code\">cond</code> is an abbreviation of the word &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">conditional</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"前述の <code class=\"code\">triangle-recursively</code> のバージョンは、"
"<code class=\"code\">if</code> という特殊形式で記述されます。また、<code "
"class=\"code\">cond</code> と呼ばれる別の特殊形式を用いて記述することも可能で"
"す。特殊形式 <code class=\"code\">cond</code> の名称は、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">conditional</samp>&rsquo; という語の略称です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-cond.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Although the <code class=\"code\">cond</code> special form is not used as "
"often in the Emacs Lisp sources as <code class=\"code\">if</code>, it is "
"used often enough to justify explaining it."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">cond</code> という特殊形式は、Emacs Lisp のソースコード"
"では <code class=\"code\">if</code> ほど頻繁には使われないものの、解説するに"
"値するほどには使われている。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
