msgid ""
"The template for a <code class=\"code\">cond</code> expression looks like "
"this:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">cond</code> 式のテンプレートは次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-cond.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(cond\n"
" <var class=\"var\">body</var>...)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-cond.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "where the <var class=\"var\">body</var> is a series of lists."
msgstr "ここで <var class=\"var\">body</var> はリストの連なりです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-cond.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Written out more fully, the template looks like this:"
msgstr "より詳細に書き出すと、テンプレートは以下のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-cond.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(cond\n"
" (<var class=\"var\">first-true-or-false-test</var> <var class=\"var\">first-consequent</var>)\n"
" (<var class=\"var\">second-true-or-false-test</var> <var class=\"var\">second-consequent</var>)\n"
" (<var class=\"var\">third-true-or-false-test</var> <var class=\"var\">third-consequent</var>)\n"
"  ...)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-cond.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"When the Lisp interpreter evaluates the <code class=\"code\">cond</code> "
"expression, it evaluates the first element (the <small class=\"sc\">CAR</"
"small> or true-or-false-test) of the first expression in a series of "
"expressions within the body of the <code class=\"code\">cond</code>."
msgstr ""
"Lispインタプリタが<code class=\"code\">cond</code>式を評価する際、<code "
"class=\"code\">cond</code>の本体内にある一連の式のうち、最初の式の第1要素"
"（<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>またはtrue-or-false-test）を評価します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-cond.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If the true-or-false-test returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code> the rest "
"of that expression, the consequent, is skipped and the true-or-false-test of "
"the next expression is evaluated.  When an expression is found whose true-or-"
"false-test returns a value that is not <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the "
"consequent of that expression is evaluated.  The consequent can be one or "
"more expressions.  If the consequent consists of more than one expression, "
"the expressions are evaluated in sequence and the value of the last one is "
"returned.  If the expression does not have a consequent, the value of the "
"true-or-false-test is returned."
msgstr ""
"真偽判定テストが式の残りの部分 <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返す場合、後"
"続部分はスキップされ、次の式の真偽判定テストが評価されます。真偽判定テストが "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値を返す式が見つかった場合、その式の後"
"続部分が評価されます。後続部分は1つ以上の式で構成されることがあります。後続部"
"分が複数の式からなる場合、各式は順次評価され、最後の式の値が返されます。式に"
"後続部分がない場合は、真偽判定テストの値が返されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-cond.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If none of the true-or-false-tests test true, the <code class=\"code\">cond</"
"code> expression returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"真偽判定テストのいずれも真とならない場合、<code class=\"code\">cond</code> 式"
"は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-cond.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Written using <code class=\"code\">cond</code>, the <code "
"class=\"code\">triangle</code> function looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">cond</code> を使って記述すると、<code "
"class=\"code\">triangle</code> 関数は次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-cond.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun triangle-using-cond (number)\n"
"  (cond ((&lt;= number 0) 0)\n"
"        ((= number 1) 1)\n"
"        ((&gt; number 1)\n"
"         (+ number (triangle-using-cond (1- number))))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-cond.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In this example, the <code class=\"code\">cond</code> returns 0 if the "
"number is less than or equal to 0, it returns 1 if the number is 1 and it "
"evaluates <code class=\"code\">(+ number (triangle-using-cond (1- number)))</"
"code> if the number is greater than 1."
msgstr ""
"この例では、<code class=\"code\">cond</code> は数値が 0 以下の場合は 0 を、1 "
"の場合は 1 を返し、数値が 1 より大きい場合は <code class=\"code\">(+ number "
"(triangle-using-cond (1- number)))</code> を評価します。"

