#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-list.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>11.3.3 Recursion with a List<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Recursion-with-a-List\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>11.3.3 List<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Recursion-with-a-List\"> "
"を用いた再帰 &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-list.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The example of a <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop that printed the "
"elements of a list of numbers can be written recursively.  Here is the code, "
"including an expression to set the value of the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">animals</code> to a list."
msgstr ""
"数値リストの要素を出力する <code class=\"code\">while</code> ループの例は、再"
"帰的に記述できます。以下に、変数 <code class=\"code\">animals</code> の値をリ"
"ストに設定する式を含めたコードを示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-list.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If you are reading this in Info in Emacs, you can evaluate this expression "
"directly in Info.  Otherwise, you must copy the example to the <samp "
"class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> buffer and evaluate each expression there.  "
"Use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-x C-e</kbd> to evaluate the <code "
"class=\"code\">(print-elements-recursively animals)</code> expression so "
"that the results are printed in the buffer; otherwise the Lisp interpreter "
"will try to squeeze the results into the one line of the echo area."
msgstr ""
"EmacsのInfoでこれを読んでいる場合は、この式をInfo内で直接評価できます。そうで"
"ない場合は、例を<samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp>バッファにコピーし、そこ"
"で各式を評価する必要があります。<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-x C-e</kbd>を使用し"
"て<code class=\"code\">(print-elements-recursively animals)</code>式を評価"
"し、結果がバッファに出力されるようにしてください。そうしないと、Lispインタプ"
"リタが結果をエコーエリアの1行に無理やり詰め込もうとします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-list.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Also, place your cursor immediately after the last closing parenthesis of "
"the <code class=\"code\">print-elements-recursively</code> function, before "
"the comment.  Otherwise, the Lisp interpreter will try to evaluate the "
"comment."
msgstr ""
"また、<code class=\"code\">print-elements-recursively</code> 関数の最後の閉じ"
"括弧の直後、コメントの前にカーソルを置いてください。そうしないと、Lisp インタ"
"プリタがコメントを評価しようとしてしまいます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-list.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"print_002delements_002drecursively\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"print_002delements_002drecursively\"></a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-list.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq animals '(gazelle giraffe lion tiger))\n"
"\n"
"(defun print-elements-recursively (list)\n"
"  &quot;Print each element of LIST on a line of its own.\n"
"Uses recursion.&quot;\n"
"  (when list                            ; <span class=\"r\">do-again-test</span>\n"
"        (print (car list))              ; <span class=\"r\">body</span>\n"
"        (print-elements-recursively     ; <span class=\"r\">recursive call</span>\n"
"         (cdr list))))                  ; <span class=\"r\">next-step-expression</span>\n"
"\n"
"(print-elements-recursively animals)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-list.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">print-elements-recursively</code> function first "
"tests whether there is any content in the list; if there is, the function "
"prints the first element of the list, the <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> of "
"the list.  Then the function invokes itself, but gives itself as its "
"argument, not the whole list, but the second and subsequent elements of the "
"list, the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of the list."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">print-elements-recursively</code> 関数はまず、リストに内"
"容があるかどうかを確認します。内容がある場合、関数はリストの最初の要素である "
"<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> を出力します。次に、関数は自身を呼び出します"
"が、引数として渡すのはリスト全体ではなく、リストの2番目以降の要素である "
"<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-list.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Put another way, if the list is not empty, the function invokes another "
"instance of code that is similar to the initial code, but is a different "
"thread of execution, with different arguments than the first instance."
msgstr ""
"言い換えれば、リストが空でない場合、関数は初期コードと類似しているが、実行ス"
"レッドが異なり、最初のインスタンスとは異なる引数を持つ別のコードインスタンス"
"を呼び出します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-list.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Put in yet another way, if the list is not empty, the first robot assembles "
"a second robot and tells it what to do; the second robot is a different "
"individual from the first, but is the same model."
msgstr ""
"別の言い方をすれば、リストが空でない場合、1台目のロボットが2台目のロボットを"
"組み立てて指示を出します。2台目のロボットは1台目とは別の個体ですが、モデルは"
"同じです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-list.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"When the second evaluation occurs, the <code class=\"code\">when</code> "
"expression is evaluated and if true, prints the first element of the list it "
"receives as its argument (which is the second element of the original "
"list).  Then the function calls itself with the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</"
"small> of the list it is invoked with, which (the second time around) is the "
"<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of "
"the original list."
msgstr ""
"2回目の評価が行われる際、<code class=\"code\">when</code> 式が評価され、真で"
"あれば引数として受け取ったリストの最初の要素（元のリストの2番目の要素）を出力"
"します。その後、関数は自身が呼び出された際のリストの <small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small> を引数として自身を再呼び出しします。これは（2回目"
"は）元のリストの <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> の <small class=\"sc\">CDR</"
"small> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-list.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Note that although we say that the function &ldquo;calls itself&rdquo;, what "
"we mean is that the Lisp interpreter assembles and instructs a new instance "
"of the program.  The new instance is a clone of the first, but is a separate "
"individual."
msgstr ""
"なお、関数が「自身を呼び出す」と述べていますが、ここで意味しているのは、Lisp"
"インタプリタがプログラムの新しいインスタンスを組み立てて指示を出すということ"
"です。この新しいインスタンスは最初のもののクローンですが、独立した個体です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-list.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Each time the function invokes itself, it does so on a shorter version of "
"the original list.  It creates a new instance that works on a shorter list."
msgstr ""
"関数が自身を呼び出すたびに、元のリストの短縮版に対して呼び出しが行われます。"
"これにより、短縮されたリストを処理する新しいインスタンスが生成されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-list.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Eventually, the function invokes itself on an empty list.  It creates a new "
"instance whose argument is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  The conditional "
"expression tests the value of <code class=\"code\">list</code>.  Since the "
"value of <code class=\"code\">list</code> is <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, the <code class=\"code\">when</code> expression tests false so the "
"then-part is not evaluated.  The function as a whole then returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"最終的に、この関数は空のリストに対して自身を呼び出します。引数に <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を持つ新しいインスタンスを生成します。条件式は "
"<code class=\"code\">list</code> の値を判定します。<code "
"class=\"code\">list</code> の値は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> であるた"
"め、<code class=\"code\">when</code> の式は false と判定され、then 節は評価さ"
"れません。その後、関数全体として <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-list.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"When you evaluate the expression <code class=\"code\">(print-elements-"
"recursively animals)</code> in the <samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> "
"buffer, you see this result:"
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> バッファ内で式 <code "
"class=\"code\">(print-elements-recursively animals)</code> を評価すると、次の"
"ような結果になります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursion-with-list.html
#: build/html/eintr/print_002delements_002dof_002dlist.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"gazelle\n"
"\n"
"giraffe\n"
"\n"
"lion\n"
"\n"
"tiger\n"
"nil\n"
msgstr ""

