# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursive-Definition-Parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Parts-of-a-Recursive-Definition\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Recursive-Definition-Parts\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Parts-of-a-Recursive-Definition\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Recursive-Definition-Parts\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursive-Definition-Parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"A recursive function typically contains a conditional expression which has "
"three parts:"
msgstr "再帰関数には通常、3つの部分からなる条件式が含まれています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ol><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursive-Definition-Parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"A true-or-false-test that determines whether the function is called again, "
"here called the <em class=\"dfn\">do-again-test</em>."
msgstr ""
"関数が再度呼び出されるかどうかを判定する真偽値テストで、ここでは<em "
"class=\"dfn\">do-again-test</em>と呼ぶ。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ol><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursive-Definition-Parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The name of the function.  When this name is called, a new instance of the "
"function&mdash;a new robot, as it were&mdash;is created and told what to do."
msgstr ""
"関数の名前。この名前が呼び出されると、その関数の新しいインスタンス――いわば新"
"しいロボット――が生成され、何をすべきか指示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ol><li>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursive-Definition-Parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"An expression that returns a different value each time the function is "
"called, here called the <em class=\"dfn\">next-step-expression</em>.  "
"Consequently, the argument (or arguments) passed to the new instance of the "
"function will be different from that passed to the previous instance.  This "
"causes the conditional expression, the <em class=\"dfn\">do-again-test</em>, "
"to test false after the correct number of repetitions."
msgstr ""
"関数が呼び出されるたびに異なる値を返す式で、ここでは<em class=\"dfn\">next-"
"step-expression</em>と呼ばれます。その結果、関数の新しいインスタンスに渡され"
"る引数（または複数の引数）は、前のインスタンスに渡されたものとは異なります。"
"これにより、条件式である<em class=\"dfn\">do-again-test</em>は、正しい回数の"
"繰り返しの後にfalseと判定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursive-Definition-Parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Recursive functions can be much simpler than any other kind of function.  "
"Indeed, when people first start to use them, they often look so mysteriously "
"simple as to be incomprehensible.  Like riding a bicycle, reading a "
"recursive function definition takes a certain knack which is hard at first "
"but then seems simple."
msgstr ""
"再帰関数は、他のいかなる種類の関数よりもはるかに単純な場合があります。実際、"
"使い始めたばかりの頃は、不可解なほど単純に見え、理解しがたいと感じることがよ"
"くあります。自転車に乗るのと同様に、再帰関数の定義を読み解くにはある程度のコ"
"ツが必要で、最初は難しく感じられますが、やがて簡単に思えるようになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursive-Definition-Parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"There are several different common recursive patterns.  A very simple "
"pattern looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"一般的によく見られる再帰パターンはいくつかあります。非常にシンプルなパターン"
"は、次のようなものです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursive-Definition-Parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun <var class=\"var\">name-of-recursive-function</var> (<var class=\"var\">argument-list</var>)\n"
"  &quot;<var class=\"var\">documentation</var>...&quot;\n"
"  (if <var class=\"var\">do-again-test</var>\n"
"    <var class=\"var\">body</var>...\n"
"    (<var class=\"var\">name-of-recursive-function</var>\n"
"         <var class=\"var\">next-step-expression</var>)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursive-Definition-Parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Each time a recursive function is evaluated, a new instance of it is created "
"and told what to do.  The arguments tell the instance what to do."
msgstr ""
"再帰関数が評価されるたびに、その新しいインスタンスが生成され、何をすべきかが"
"指示されます。引数によって、そのインスタンスに何をすべきかが伝えられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursive-Definition-Parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"An argument is bound to the value of the next-step-expression.  Each "
"instance runs with a different value of the next-step-expression."
msgstr ""
"引数はnext-step-expressionの値に束縛されます。各インスタンスは、それぞれ異な"
"るnext-step-expressionの値で実行されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursive-Definition-Parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The value in the next-step-expression is used in the do-again-test."
msgstr "next-step-expressionの値は、do-again-testで使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursive-Definition-Parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The value returned by the next-step-expression is passed to the new instance "
"of the function, which evaluates it (or some transmogrification of it) to "
"determine whether to continue or stop.  The next-step-expression is designed "
"so that the do-again-test returns false when the function should no longer "
"be repeated."
msgstr ""
"next-step-expression が返す値は関数の新しいインスタンスに渡され、そこで評価"
"（あるいは何らかの変換）が行われることで、処理を継続するか停止するかが判定さ"
"れます。next-step-expression は、関数をこれ以上繰り返すべきでない場合に、do-"
"again-test が false を返すように設計されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursive-Definition-Parts.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The do-again-test is sometimes called the <em class=\"dfn\">stop condition</"
"em>, since it stops the repetitions when it tests false."
msgstr ""
"やり直しテストは、偽と判定された時点で繰り返しを停止するため、<em "
"class=\"dfn\">停止条件</em>と呼ばれることもある。"

