#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The value returned by the function as a whole will be 10."
msgstr "関数全体として返される値は10になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursive-Example-arg-of-3-or-4.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Each time <code class=\"code\">triangle-recursively</code> is evaluated, it "
"evaluates a version of itself&mdash;a different instance of "
"itself&mdash;with a smaller argument, until the argument is small enough so "
"that it does not evaluate itself."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">triangle-recursively</code>が評価されるたびに、より小さ"
"な引数を用いて自身のバージョン――すなわち別のインスタンス――を評価し、引数が自"
"身を評価しなくなるほど十分に小さくなるまでこれを繰り返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursive-Example-arg-of-3-or-4.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Note that this particular design for a recursive function requires that "
"operations be deferred."
msgstr ""
"なお、再帰関数におけるこの特定の設計では、処理を遅延させる必要がある点に注意"
"してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
