#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Before <code class=\"code\">(triangle-recursively 7)</code> can calculate "
"its answer, it must call <code class=\"code\">(triangle-recursively 6)</"
"code>; and before <code class=\"code\">(triangle-recursively 6)</code> can "
"calculate its answer, it must call <code class=\"code\">(triangle-"
"recursively 5)</code>; and so on.  That is to say, the calculation that "
"<code class=\"code\">(triangle-recursively 7)</code> makes must be deferred "
"until <code class=\"code\">(triangle-recursively 6)</code> makes its "
"calculation; and <code class=\"code\">(triangle-recursively 6)</code> must "
"defer until <code class=\"code\">(triangle-recursively 5)</code> completes; "
"and so on."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(triangle-recursively 7)</code>が答えを算出する前には"
"<code class=\"code\">(triangle-recursively 6)</code>を呼び出す必要があり、"
"<code class=\"code\">(triangle-recursively 6)</code>が答えを算出する前には"
"<code class=\"code\">(triangle-recursively 5)</code>を呼び出す必要があり、以"
"下同様である。すなわち、<code class=\"code\">(triangle-recursively 7)</code>"
"が行う計算は<code class=\"code\">(triangle-recursively 6)</code>が計算を行う"
"まで延期されなければならず、<code class=\"code\">(triangle-recursively 6)</"
"code>は<code class=\"code\">(triangle-recursively 5)</code>が完了するまで延期"
"されなければならず、以下同様である。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursive-Example-arg-of-3-or-4.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If each of these instances of <code class=\"code\">triangle-recursively</"
"code> are thought of as different robots, the first robot must wait for the "
"second to complete its job, which must wait until the third completes, and "
"so on."
msgstr ""
"これらの<code class=\"code\">triangle-recursively</code>の各インスタンスをそ"
"れぞれ異なるロボットと見なすと、1台目のロボットは2台目が作業を終えるのを待た"
"なければならず、2台目は3台目が作業を終えるのを待たなければならず、以下同様に"
"続く。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursive-Example-arg-of-3-or-4.html
msgid ""
