#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursive-triangle-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">triangle</code> function described in a previous "
"section can also be written recursively.  It looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"前のセクションで説明した <code class=\"code\">triangle</code> 関数は、再帰的"
"に記述することもできます。次のような形になります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursive-triangle-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun triangle-recursively (number)\n"
"  &quot;Return the sum of the numbers 1 through NUMBER inclusive.\n"
"Uses recursion.&quot;\n"
"  (if (= number 1)                    ; <span class=\"r\">do-again-test</span>\n"
"      1                               ; <span class=\"r\">then-part</span>\n"
"    (+ number                         ; <span class=\"r\">else-part</span>\n"
"       (triangle-recursively          ; <span class=\"r\">recursive call</span>\n"
"        (1- number)))))               ; <span class=\"r\">next-step-expression</span>\n"
"\n"
"(triangle-recursively 7)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Recursive-triangle-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"You can install this function by evaluating it and then try it by evaluating "
"<code class=\"code\">(triangle-recursively 7)</code>.  (Remember to put your "
"cursor immediately after the last parenthesis of the function definition, "
"before the comment.)  The function evaluates to 28."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、評価してインストールし、その後 <code class=\"code\">(triangle-"
"recursively 7)</code> を評価して試すことができます。（関数定義の最後の括弧の"
"直後、コメントの前にカーソルを置くのを忘れないでください。）この関数を評価す"
"ると 28 になります。"

