msgstr "<code class=\"code\">=</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Review.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">=</code> function tests whether two arguments, both "
"numbers or markers, are equal."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">=</code> 関数は、ともに数値またはマーカーである2つの引数"
"が等しいかどうかを判定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><dl><dt>
#: build/html/eintr/Review.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">equal</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">equal</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><dl><dt>
#: build/html/eintr/Review.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">eq</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">eq</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Review.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Test whether two objects are the same.  <code class=\"code\">equal</code> "
"uses one meaning of the word &ldquo;same&rdquo; and <code class=\"code\">eq</"
"code> uses another: <code class=\"code\">equal</code> returns true if the "
"two objects have a similar structure and contents, such as two copies of the "
"same book.  On the other hand, <code class=\"code\">eq</code>, returns true "
"if both arguments are actually the same object.  <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-equal\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-eq\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"2つのオブジェクトが同一かどうかを判定します。<code class=\"code\">equal</"
"code>は「同一」という言葉の一方の意味を用い、<code class=\"code\">eq</code>は"
"もう一方の意味を用います。<code class=\"code\">equal</code>は、同じ本の2冊の"
"ように、2つのオブジェクトが類似した構造と内容を持つ場合にtrueを返します。一"
"方、<code class=\"code\">eq</code>は、両方の引数が実際に同一のオブジェクトで"
"ある場合にtrueを返します。<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-equal\"></"
"a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-eq\"></a>"

