# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Review.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"An empty string, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;&quot;</samp>&rsquo;, a "
"string with no characters in it, is smaller than any string of characters."
msgstr ""
"空文字列 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;&quot;</samp>&rsquo;（文字を含まな"
"い文字列）は、いかなる文字文字列よりも小さい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
