msgstr ""
"<span>3.6.2 サンプル <code class=\"code\">let</code> 式<a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#Sample-let-Expression-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Sample-let-Expression.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Sample-let-expression\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-let-expression-sample\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Sample-let-expression\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-let-expression-sample\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Sample-let-Expression.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The following expression creates and gives initial values to the two "
"variables <code class=\"code\">zebra</code> and <code class=\"code\">tiger</"
"code>.  The body of the <code class=\"code\">let</code> expression is a list "
"which calls the <code class=\"code\">message</code> function."
msgstr ""
"以下の式は、2つの変数 <code class=\"code\">zebra</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">tiger</code> を生成し、初期値を代入します。<code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> 式の本体は、<code class=\"code\">message</code> 関"
"数を呼び出すリストです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Sample-let-Expression.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((zebra &quot;stripes&quot;)\n"
"      (tiger &quot;fierce&quot;))\n"
"  (message &quot;One kind of animal has %s and another is %s.&quot;\n"
"           zebra tiger))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Sample-let-Expression.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Here, the varlist is <code class=\"code\">((zebra &quot;stripes&quot;) "
"(tiger &quot;fierce&quot;))</code>."
msgstr ""
"ここで、varlistは<code class=\"code\">((zebra &quot;stripes&quot;) (tiger "
"&quot;fierce&quot;))</code>です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Sample-let-Expression.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The two variables are <code class=\"code\">zebra</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">tiger</code>.  Each variable is the first element of a two-"
"element list and each value is the second element of its two-element list.  "
"In the varlist, Emacs binds the variable <code class=\"code\">zebra</code> "
"to the value <code class=\"code\">&quot;stripes&quot;</code><a "
"class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF10\" href=\"#FOOT10\"><sup>10</sup></a>, and "
"binds the variable <code class=\"code\">tiger</code> to the value <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;fierce&quot;</code>.  In this example, both values are "
"strings.  The values could just as well have been another list or a symbol.  "
"The body of the <code class=\"code\">let</code> follows after the list "
"holding the variables.  In this example, the body is a list that uses the "
"<code class=\"code\">message</code> function to print a string in the echo "
"area."
msgstr ""
"2つの変数は <code class=\"code\">zebra</code> と <code class=\"code\">tiger</"
"code> です。各変数は2要素のリストの第1要素であり、各値は対応する2要素リストの"
"第2要素です。varlist において、Emacs は変数 <code class=\"code\">zebra</"
"code> を値 <code class=\"code\">&quot;stripes&quot;</code><a "
"class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF10\" href=\"#FOOT10\"><sup>10</sup></a> に、変数 "
"<code class=\"code\">tiger</code> を値 <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;fierce&quot;</code> にそれぞれバインドします。この例で"
"は、どちらの値も文字列です。これらの値は、別のリストやシンボルであっても構い"
"ません。変数を含むリストの後には、<code class=\"code\">let</code> の本体が続"
"きます。この例では、本体は <code class=\"code\">message</code> 関数を使用して"
"エコーエリアに文字列を出力するリストとなっています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Sample-let-Expression.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"You may evaluate the example in the usual fashion, by placing the cursor "
"after the last parenthesis and typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd>.  "
"When you do this, the following will appear in the echo area:"
msgstr ""
"最後の括弧の後にカーソルを置き、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd> と入力するこ"
"とで、通常通りに例を評価できます。そうすると、エコーエリアに以下のように表示"
"されます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Sample-let-Expression.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "&quot;One kind of animal has stripes and another is fierce.&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Sample-let-Expression.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"As we have seen before, the <code class=\"code\">message</code> function "
"prints its first argument, except for &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%s</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  In this example, the value of the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">zebra</code> is printed at the location of the first &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo; and the value of the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">tiger</code> is printed at the location of the second &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"前述の通り、<code class=\"code\">message</code> 関数は &lsquo;<samp "
