msgid ""
"<span>Seeing the Current Value of a Variable<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Seeing-the-Current-Value-of-a-Variable\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>変数の現在の値を確認する<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Seeing-the-"
"Current-Value-of-a-Variable\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/See-variable-current-value.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"You can see the current value of a variable, any variable, by using the "
"<code class=\"code\">describe-variable</code> function, which is usually "
"invoked by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h v</kbd>.  If you type <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-h v</kbd> and then <code class=\"code\">kill-ring</code> "
"(followed by <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>) when prompted, you will see what "
"is in your current kill ring&mdash;this may be quite a lot! Conversely, if "
"you have been doing nothing this Emacs session except read this document, "
"you may have nothing in it.  Also, you will see the documentation for <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-ring</code>:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">describe-variable</code> 関数を使えば、任意の変数の現在"
"の値を確認できます。この関数は通常、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h v</kbd> と入力する"
"ことで呼び出されます。プロンプトが表示された際に <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h v</"
"kbd>、次に <code class=\"code\">kill-ring</code>（続いて <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd>）と入力すると、現在のキルリングの内容が表示されます――"
"かなりの量になるかもしれません！逆に、今回の Emacs セッションでこのドキュメン"
"トを読んでいただけであれば、キルリングには何も入っていないかもしれません。ま"
"た、<code class=\"code\">kill-ring</code> のドキュメントも表示されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/See-variable-current-value.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Documentation:\n"
"List of killed text sequences.\n"
"Since the kill ring is supposed to interact nicely with cut-and-paste\n"
"facilities offered by window systems, use of this variable should\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/See-variable-current-value.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"interact nicely with `interprogram-cut-function' and\n"
"`interprogram-paste-function'.  The functions `kill-new',\n"
"`kill-append', and `current-kill' are supposed to implement this\n"
"interaction; you may want to use them instead of manipulating the kill\n"
"ring directly.\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
