#: build/html/eintr/Several-files-recursively.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>14.8 Recursively Count Words in Different Files<a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#Recursively-Count-Words-in-Different-Files\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>14.8 異なるファイル内の単語を再帰的にカウントする<a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#Recursively-Count-Words-in-Different-Files\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Several-files-recursively.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Besides a <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop, you can work on each of a "
"list of files with recursion.  A recursive version of <code "
"class=\"code\">lengths-list-many-files</code> is short and simple."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">while</code> ループ以外にも、再帰を用いてファイルリスト"
"の各ファイルを処理できます。<code class=\"code\">lengths-list-many-files</"
"code> の再帰版は簡潔でシンプルです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Several-files-recursively.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The recursive function has the usual parts: the do-again-test, the next-step-"
"expression, and the recursive call.  The do-again-test determines whether "
"the function should call itself again, which it will do if the <code "
"class=\"code\">list-of-files</code> contains any remaining elements; the "
"next-step-expression resets the <code class=\"code\">list-of-files</code> to "
"the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of itself, so eventually the list will "
"be empty; and the recursive call calls itself on the shorter list.  The "
"complete function is shorter than this description! <a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-recursive_002dlengths_002dlist_002dmany_002dfiles\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"再帰関数は、do-again-test、next-step-expression、そして再帰呼び出しという、一"
"般的な構成要素で成り立っています。do-again-testは、関数が自身を再度呼び出すべ"
"きかどうかを判定し、<code class=\"code\">list-of-files</code>に残りの要素があ"
"れば呼び出しを行います。next-step-expressionは<code class=\"code\">list-of-"
"files</code>を自身の<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>にリセットするため、最終的"
"にリストは空になります。そして再帰呼び出しは、より短いリストに対して自身を呼"
"び出します。関数全体は、この説明よりも短くなっています！ <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-recursive_002dlengths_002dlist_002dmany_002dfiles\"></"
"a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Several-files-recursively.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun recursive-lengths-list-many-files (list-of-files)\n"
"  &quot;Return list of lengths of each defun in LIST-OF-FILES.&quot;\n"
"  (if list-of-files                     ; <span class=\"r\">do-again-test</span>\n"
"      (append\n"
"       (lengths-list-file\n"
"        (expand-file-name (car list-of-files)))\n"
"       (recursive-lengths-list-many-files\n"
"        (cdr list-of-files)))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Several-files-recursively.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In a sentence, the function returns the lengths&rsquo; list for the first of "
