#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Simple-Extension.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Here is a simple extension to Emacs that moves the line that point is on to "
"the top of the window.  I use this all the time, to make text easier to read."
msgstr ""
"ポイントがある行をウィンドウの最上部に移動させる、Emacs用のシンプルな拡張機能"
"です。テキストを読みやすくするために、いつも使っています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Simple-Extension.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"You can put the following code into a separate file and then load it from "
"your <samp class=\"file\">.emacs</samp> file, or you can include it within "
"your <samp class=\"file\">.emacs</samp> file."
msgstr ""
"以下のコードを別ファイルに記述して<samp class=\"file\">.emacs</samp>ファイル"
"から読み込むか、あるいは<samp class=\"file\">.emacs</samp>ファイル内に記述す"
"ることもできます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Simple-Extension.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Here is the definition:"
msgstr "定義は以下の通りです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Simple-Extension.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";;; Line to top of window;\n"
";;; replace three keystroke sequence  C-u 0 C-l\n"
"(defun line-to-top-of-window ()\n"
"  &quot;Move the line that point is on to top of window.&quot;\n"
"  (interactive)\n"
"  (recenter 0))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Simple-Extension.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Now for the key binding."
msgstr "次はキーバインドです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Simple-Extension.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Function keys as well as mouse button events and non-<small "
"class=\"sc\">ASCII</small> characters are written within square brackets, "
"without quotation marks."
msgstr ""
"ファンクションキーのほか、マウスボタンイベントや非<small class=\"sc\">ASCII</"
"small>文字は、引用符なしで角括弧内に記述します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Simple-Extension.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"I bind <code class=\"code\">line-to-top-of-window</code> to my <kbd "
"class=\"key\">F6</kbd> function key like this:"
msgstr ""
"次のように <code class=\"code\">line-to-top-of-window</code> を <kbd "
"class=\"key\">F6</kbd> ファンクションキーにバインドします。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Simple-Extension.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(keymap-global-set &quot;&lt;f6&gt;&quot; 'line-to-top-of-window)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Simple-Extension.html
msgid ""
"For more information, see <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Init-Rebinding.html#Init-"
"Rebinding\">Rebinding Keys in Your Init File</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The "
"GNU Emacs Manual</cite>."
msgstr ""
"詳細については、<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>の<a data-"
"manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"emacs/Init-Rebinding.html#Init-Rebinding\">Initファイルでのキーの再割り当て</"
"a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Simple-Extension.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Conditional-_0027twixt-two-versions-"
"of-Emacs\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Version-of-Emacs_002c-"
"choosing\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Emacs-version_002c-"
"choosing\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Conditional-_0027twixt-two-versions-"
"of-Emacs\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Version-of-Emacs_002c-"
"choosing\"></a> <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Emacs-version_002c-"
"choosing\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Simple-Extension.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If you run two versions of GNU Emacs, such as versions 27 and 28, and use "
"one <samp class=\"file\">.emacs</samp> file, you can select which code to "
"evaluate with the following conditional:"
msgstr ""
"GNU Emacs のバージョン 27 と 28 のように 2 つのバージョンを動作させ、1 つの "
"<samp class=\"file\">.emacs</samp> ファイルを使用する場合、以下の条件式で評価"
"するコードを選択できます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Simple-Extension.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(cond\n"
" ((= 27 emacs-major-version)\n"
"  ;; evaluate version 27 code\n"
"  ( ... ))\n"
" ((= 28 emacs-major-version)\n"
"  ;; evaluate version 28 code\n"
"  ( ... )))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Simple-Extension.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"For example, recent versions blink their cursors by default.  I hate such "
"blinking, as well as other features, so I placed the following in my <samp "
"class=\"file\">.emacs</samp> file<a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF21\" "
"href=\"#FOOT21\"><sup>21</sup></a>:"
msgstr ""
"例えば、最近のバージョンではデフォルトでカーソルが点滅します。私はこのような"
"点滅やその他の機能が嫌いなので、<samp class=\"file\">.emacs</samp> ファイルに"
"以下を記述しました<a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF21\" "
"href=\"#FOOT21\"><sup>21</sup></a>："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Simple-Extension.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(when (&gt;= emacs-major-version 21)\n"
"  (blink-cursor-mode 0)\n"
"  ;; Insert newline when you press 'C-n' (next-line)\n"
"  ;; at the end of the buffer\n"
"  (setq next-line-add-newlines t)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Simple-Extension.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  ;; Turn on image viewing\n"
"  (auto-image-file-mode t)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Simple-Extension.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  ;; Turn on menu bar (this bar has text)\n"
"  ;; (Use numeric argument to turn on)\n"
"  (menu-bar-mode 1)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Simple-Extension.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  ;; Turn off tool bar (this bar has icons)\n"
"  ;; (Use numeric argument to turn on)\n"
"  (tool-bar-mode nil)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Simple-Extension.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  ;; Turn off tooltip mode for tool bar\n"
"  ;; (This mode causes icon explanations to pop up)\n"
"  ;; (Use numeric argument to turn on)\n"
"  (tooltip-mode nil)\n"
"  ;; If tooltips turned on, make tips appear promptly\n"
"  (setq tooltip-delay 0.1)  ; default is 0.7 second\n"
"   )\n"
msgstr ""

