# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/eintr/Small-buffer-case.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>What happens in a small buffer<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#What-"
"happens-in-a-small-buffer\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>小さなバッファで何が起こるか<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#What-"
"happens-in-a-small-buffer\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Small-buffer-case.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If the buffer contains fewer than 10,000 characters, a slightly different "
"computation is performed.  You might think this is not necessary, since the "
"first computation could do the job.  However, in a small buffer, the first "
"method may not put the cursor on exactly the desired line; the second method "
"does a better job."
msgstr ""
"バッファに含まれる文字数が10,000文字未満の場合、わずかに異なる計算が行われま"
"す。最初の計算で十分なため、このような処理は不要だと思うかもしれません。しか"
"し、バッファが小さい場合、前者の手法ではカーソルが意図した行に正確に配置され"
"ないことがあり、後者の手法の方がより適切に動作します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Small-buffer-case.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(/ (+ 10 (* size (prefix-numeric-value arg))) 10)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Small-buffer-case.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This is code in which you figure out what happens by discovering how the "
"functions are embedded in parentheses.  It is easier to read if you reformat "
"it with each expression indented more deeply than its enclosing expression:"
msgstr ""
"これは、関数が括弧の中にどのように組み込まれているかを探ることで、何が起きて"
"いるかを読み解くコードです。各式を、それを囲む式よりも深くインデントして整形"
"し直すと、より読みやすくなります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Small-buffer-case.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (/\n"
"   (+ 10\n"
"      (*\n"
"       size\n"
"       (prefix-numeric-value arg)))\n"
"   10)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Small-buffer-case.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Looking at parentheses, we see that the innermost operation is <code "
"class=\"code\">(prefix-numeric-value arg)</code>, which converts the raw "
"argument to a number.  In the following expression, this number is "
"multiplied by the size of the accessible portion of the buffer:"
msgstr ""
"括弧を見ると、最も内側の演算は <code class=\"code\">(prefix-numeric-value "
"arg)</code> であり、生の引数を数値に変換しています。次の式では、この数値に"
"バッファのアクセス可能な領域のサイズが乗算されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Small-buffer-case.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(* size (prefix-numeric-value arg))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Small-buffer-case.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This multiplication creates a number that may be larger than the size of the "
"buffer&mdash;seven times larger if the argument is 7, for example.  Ten is "
"then added to this number and finally the large number is divided by ten to "
"provide a value that is one character larger than the percentage position in "
"the buffer."
msgstr ""
"この乗算により、バッファのサイズを超える可能性のある数値が生成されます（例え"
"ば、引数が7の場合は7倍になります）。次にこの数値に10を加算し、最後にその大き"
"な数値を10で割ることで、バッファ内のパーセント位置よりも1文字分大きい値が得ら"
"れます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Small-buffer-case.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The number that results from all this is passed to <code class=\"code\">goto-"
"char</code> and the cursor is moved to that point."
msgstr ""
"これらすべてを経て得られた数値が<code class=\"code\">goto-char</code>に渡さ"
"れ、カーソルがその地点に移動します。"

