#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/eintr/Sorting.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>14.9.1 Sorting Lists<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Sorting-"
"Lists\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>14.9.1 リストの並べ替え<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Sorting-"
"Lists\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Sorting.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-sort\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-sort\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Sorting.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Emacs contains a function to sort lists, called (as you might guess)  <code "
"class=\"code\">sort</code>.  The <code class=\"code\">sort</code> function "
"takes two arguments, the list to be sorted, and a predicate that determines "
"whether the first of two list elements is less than the second."
msgstr ""
"Emacsには、リストをソートするための関数があり、（ご想像の通り）<code "
"class=\"code\">sort</code>と呼ばれています。<code class=\"code\">sort</code>"
"関数は、ソート対象のリストと、2つのリスト要素のうち前者が後者より小さいかどう"
"かを判定する述語という2つの引数を取ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Sorting.html
msgid ""
"As we saw earlier (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Wrong-Type-of-"
"Argument.html\">Using the Wrong Type Object as an Argument</a>), a predicate "
"is a function that determines whether some property is true or false.  The "
"<code class=\"code\">sort</code> function will reorder a list according to "
"whatever property the predicate uses; this means that <code "
"class=\"code\">sort</code> can be used to sort non-numeric lists by non-"
"numeric criteria&mdash;it can, for example, alphabetize a list."
msgstr ""
"前述の通り（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Wrong-Type-of-Argument.html\">不適切な"
"型のオブジェクトを引数として使用する</a>を参照）、述語とは、あるプロパティが"
"真か偽かを判定する関数のことです。<code class=\"code\">sort</code> 関数は、述"
"語が使用するプロパティに基づいてリストを並べ替えます。つまり、<code "
"class=\"code\">sort</code> を使えば、数値以外のリストを数値以外の基準でソート"
"できるということになります&mdash;例えば、リストをアルファベット順に並べ替える"
"ことが可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Sorting.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">&lt;</code> function is used when sorting a numeric "
"list.  For example,"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">&lt;</code> 関数は、数値のリストをソートする際に使用しま"
"す。  例えば、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Sorting.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(sort '(4 8 21 17 33 7 21 7) '&lt;)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Sorting.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(4 7 7 8 17 21 21 33)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Sorting.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(Note that in this example, both the arguments are quoted so that the "
"symbols are not evaluated before being passed to <code class=\"code\">sort</"
"code> as arguments.)"
msgstr ""
"（なお、この例では、引数が<code class=\"code\">sort</code>に引数として渡され"
"る前にシンボルが評価されないよう、両方の引数がクォートされています。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Sorting.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Sorting the list returned by the <code class=\"code\">recursive-lengths-list-"
"many-files</code> function is straightforward; it uses the <code "
"class=\"code\">&lt;</code> function:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">recursive-lengths-list-many-files</code> 関数が返すリス"
"トのソートは簡単で、<code class=\"code\">&lt;</code> 関数を使用します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Sorting.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(sort\n"
" (recursive-lengths-list-many-files\n"
"  '(&quot;./lisp/macros.el&quot;\n"
"    &quot;./lisp/mailalias.el&quot;\n"
"    &quot;./lisp/hex-util.el&quot;))\n"
" '&lt;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Sorting.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "which produces:"
msgstr "これにより生成されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Sorting.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(29 32 38 71 82 90 95 178 180 218 263 283 321 324 480)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Sorting.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(Note that in this example, the first argument to <code class=\"code\">sort</"
"code> is not quoted, since the expression must be evaluated so as to produce "
"the list that is passed to <code class=\"code\">sort</code>.)"
msgstr ""
"（なお、この例では <code class=\"code\">sort</code> の第1引数にクォートが付い"
"ていないのは、<code class=\"code\">sort</code> に渡されるリストを生成するよう"
"に式を評価する必要があるためです。）"

