"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Summing-up-zap_002dto_002dchar.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Now that we have seen how <code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> and "
"<code class=\"code\">progn</code> work, we can see how the <code "
"class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code> function works as a whole."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> と <code class=\"code\">progn</"
"code> の仕組みを確認したところで、<code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code> 関"
"数全体がどのようにして動作するのかを見ていきましょう。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Summing-up-zap_002dto_002dchar.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The first argument to <code class=\"code\">kill-region</code> is the "
"position of the cursor when the <code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code> "
"command is given&mdash;the value of point at that time.  Within the <code "
"class=\"code\">progn</code>, the search function then moves point to just "
"after the zapped-to-character and <code class=\"code\">point</code> returns "
"the value of this location.  The <code class=\"code\">kill-region</code> "
"function puts together these two values of point, the first one as the "
"beginning of the region and the second one as the end of the region, and "
"removes the region."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">kill-region</code> の第1引数は、<code "
"class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code> コマンドが実行された際のカーソル位置――つま"
"りその時点での point の値です。<code class=\"code\">progn</code> 内では、検索"
"関数が point を zapped-to-character の直後まで移動させ、<code "
"class=\"code\">point</code> がこの位置の値を返します。<code "
"class=\"code\">kill-region</code> 関数は、これら2つの point の値（1つ目をリー"
"ジョンの開始位置、2つ目を終了位置として）を組み合わせ、リージョンを削除しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Summing-up-zap_002dto_002dchar.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">progn</code> special form is necessary because the "
"<code class=\"code\">kill-region</code> command takes two arguments; and it "
"would fail if <code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">point</code> expressions were written in sequence as two "
"additional arguments.  The <code class=\"code\">progn</code> expression is a "
"single argument to <code class=\"code\">kill-region</code> and returns the "
"one value that <code class=\"code\">kill-region</code> needs for its second "
"argument."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">progn</code> という特殊形式が必要なのは、<code "
"class=\"code\">kill-region</code> コマンドが2つの引数を取るためであり、<code "
"class=\"code\">search-forward</code> と <code class=\"code\">point</code> の"
"式をさらに2つの引数として連続して記述するとエラーになるためです。<code "
"class=\"code\">progn</code> 式は <code class=\"code\">kill-region</code> への"
"単一の引数であり、<code class=\"code\">kill-region</code> が第2引数として必要"
"とする1つの値を返します。"

