# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Symbols-as-Chest.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In an earlier section, I suggested that you might imagine a symbol as being "
"a chest of drawers.  The function definition is put in one drawer, the value "
"in another, and so on.  What is put in the drawer holding the value can be "
"changed without affecting the contents of the drawer holding the function "
"definition, and vice versa."
msgstr ""
"前の節で、シンボルを引き出し箱のようなものとしてイメージしてみてはどうかと提"
"案しました。関数定義を一つの引き出しに、値を別の引き出しに、というように収め"
"ます。値を収めた引き出しの中身は、関数定義を収めた引き出しの内容に影響を与え"
"ることなく変更でき、その逆も同様です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Symbols-as-Chest.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Actually, what is put in each drawer is the address of the value or function "
"definition.  It is as if you found an old chest in the attic, and in one of "
"its drawers you found a map giving you directions to where the buried "
"treasure lies."
msgstr ""
"実は、それぞれの引き出しに入っているのは、値や関数定義のアドレスなのです。そ"
"れはまるで、屋根裏部屋で古い宝箱を見つけ、その引き出しの一つから、埋蔵金のあ"
"りかを示す地図を見つけたようなものです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Symbols-as-Chest.html
msgid ""
"(In addition to its name, symbol definition, and variable value, a symbol "
"has a drawer for a <em class=\"dfn\">property list</em> which can be used to "
"record other information.  Property lists are not discussed here; see <a "
"data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/elisp/Property-Lists.html#Property-Lists\">Property Lists</a> in "
"<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>.)"
msgstr ""
"（シンボルには、名称、シンボル定義、変数値に加えて、その他の情報を記録するた"
"めに使用できる<em class=\"dfn\">プロパティリスト</em>用のドロワーがあります。"
"プロパティリストについてはここでは扱いません。<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU "
"Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>の<a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://"
"www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Property-"
"Lists.html#Property-Lists\">Property Lists</a>を参照してください。）"

