#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(save-excursion\n"
"  <var class=\"var\">body</var>...)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Template-for-save_002dexcursion.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The body of the function is one or more expressions that will be evaluated "
"in sequence by the Lisp interpreter.  If there is more than one expression "
"in the body, the value of the last one will be returned as the value of the "
"<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> function.  The other expressions "
"in the body are evaluated only for their side effects; and <code "
"class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> itself is used only for its side effect "
"(which is restoring the position of point)."
msgstr ""
"関数本体は、Lispインタプリタによって順次評価される1つ以上の式で構成されます。"
"本体に複数の式がある場合、最後の式の値が<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</"
"code>関数の値として返されます。本体内の他の式は副作用のためだけに評価され、"
"<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code>自体もその副作用（pointの位置を復元"
"すること）のためだけに使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Template-for-save_002dexcursion.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In more detail, the template for a <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</"
"code> expression looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"より詳しく言うと、<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> 式のテンプレート"
"は次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Template-for-save_002dexcursion.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(save-excursion\n"
"  <var class=\"var\">first-expression-in-body</var>\n"
"  <var class=\"var\">second-expression-in-body</var>\n"
"  <var class=\"var\">third-expression-in-body</var>\n"
"   ...\n"
"  <var class=\"var\">last-expression-in-body</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Template-for-save_002dexcursion.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "An expression, of course, may be a symbol on its own or a list."
msgstr ""
"式は、もちろんそれ自体がシンボルであったり、リストであったりすることもありま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
