# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Void-Variable.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(Again, you can quit the debugger by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">q</kbd> in "
"the <samp class=\"file\">*Backtrace*</samp> buffer.)"
msgstr ""
"（なお、<samp class=\"file\">*Backtrace*</samp>バッファに<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">q</kbd>と入力することで、デバッガを終了できます。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Void-Variable.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This backtrace is different from the very first error message we saw, which "
"said, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Debugger entered--Lisp error: (void-"
"function this)</samp>&rsquo;.  In this case, the function does not have a "
"value as a variable; while in the other error message, the function (the "
"word &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">this</samp>&rsquo;) did not have a "
"definition."
msgstr ""
"このバックトレースは、最初に見た「<samp class=\"samp\">Debugger entered--"
"Lisp error: (void-function this)</samp>」というエラーメッセージとは異なりま"
"す。今回のケースでは、関数が変数として値を持っていません。一方、もう一方のエ"
"ラーメッセージでは、関数（「<samp class=\"samp\">this</samp>」という文字列）"
"に定義がありませんでした。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Void-Variable.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In this experiment with the <code class=\"code\">+</code>, what we did was "
"cause the Lisp interpreter to evaluate the <code class=\"code\">+</code> and "
"look for the value of the variable instead of the function definition.  We "
"did this by placing the cursor right after the symbol rather than after the "
"parenthesis of the enclosing list as we did before.  As a consequence, the "
"Lisp interpreter evaluated the preceding s-expression, which in this case "
"was <code class=\"code\">+</code> by itself."
msgstr ""
"この<code class=\"code\">+</code>を用いた実験で行ったことは、Lispインタプリタ"
"に<code class=\"code\">+</code>を評価させ、関数定義ではなく変数の値を探させる"
"ことでした。具体的には、前回のように囲みリストの括弧の後ではなく、シンボルの"
"直後にカーソルを配置することでこれを実現しました。その結果、Lispインタプリタ"
"は直前のs式を評価しましたが、この場合は<code class=\"code\">+</code>単体でし"
"た。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
