# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/What-the-Kill-Ring-Does.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(In a read-only buffer, such as the <samp class=\"file\">*info*</samp> "
"buffer, the kill command, <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">kill-line</code>), will not remove the text, merely copy it "
"to the kill ring.  However, your machine may beep at you.  Alternatively, "
"for silence, you may copy the region of each line with the <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-w</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">kill-ring-save</code>) "
"command.  You must mark each line for this command to succeed, but it does "
"not matter at which end you put point or mark.)"
msgstr ""
"(<samp class=\"file\">*info*</samp> バッファのような読み取り専用バッファで"
"は、キルコマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-k</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">kill-"
"line</code>) はテキストを削除せず、単にキルリングにコピーします。ただし、マシ"
"ンからビープ音が鳴る場合があります。あるいは、音を出さずに済ませたい場合は、"
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-w</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">kill-ring-save</code>) コ"
"マンドで各行の領域をコピーすることもできます。このコマンドを機能させるには各"
"行にマークを付ける必要がありますが、ポイントやマークをどちらの端に配置しても"
"構いません。)"

