"最初のテストを行うには、マークとポイントを次の行の先頭と末尾に合わせ、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c =</kbd>（<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c =</kbd>をバインドしていない"
"場合は<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x count-words-example</kbd>）を入力してください："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Whitespace-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "    one   two  three\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Whitespace-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Emacs will tell you, correctly, that the region has three words."
msgstr "Emacsは、リージョンに3単語あると正しく表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Whitespace-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Repeat the test, but place mark at the beginning of the line and place point "
"just <em class=\"emph\">before</em> the word &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">one</samp>&rsquo;.  Again type the command <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c =</kbd> (or <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x count-words-example</"
"kbd>).  Emacs should tell you that the region has no words, since it is "
"composed only of the whitespace at the beginning of the line.  But instead "
"Emacs tells you that the region has one word!"
msgstr ""
"テストを繰り返しますが、マークを行頭に置き、ポイントを単語 &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">one</samp>&rsquo; の<em class=\"emph\">直前</em>に配置してくだ"
"さい。再度、コマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c =</kbd>（または <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">M-x count-words-example</kbd>）を入力します。行頭の空白文字のみ"
"で構成されているため、Emacs はリージョンに単語がないと表示するはずです。しか"
"し実際には、Emacs はリージョンに1つの単語があると表示します！"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Whitespace-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"For the third test, copy the sample line to the end of the <samp "
"class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> buffer and then type several spaces at the "
"end of the line.  Place mark right after the word &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">three</samp>&rsquo; and point at the end of line.  (The end "
"of the line will be the end of the buffer.)  Type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-c =</"
"kbd> (or <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x count-words-example</kbd>) as you did "
"before.  Again, Emacs should tell you that the region has no words, since it "
"is composed only of the whitespace at the end of the line.  Instead, Emacs "
"displays an error message saying &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Search failed</"
"samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"3回目のテストでは、サンプル行を<samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp>バッファ"
"の末尾にコピーし、行の末尾にスペースを数個入力してください。単語&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">three</samp>&rsquo;の直後にマークを置き、行末にポイントを置い"
"てください。（行末はバッファの末尾になります。）先ほどと同様に<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-c =</kbd>（または<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-x count-words-example</"
"kbd>）と入力してください。ここでも、リージョンが行末の空白文字のみで構成され"
"ているため、Emacsはリージョンに単語がないことを通知するはずです。代わりに、"
"Emacsは&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Search failed</samp>&rsquo;というエラー"
"メッセージを表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Whitespace-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The two bugs stem from the same problem."
msgstr "その2つのバグは同じ問題に起因している。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Whitespace-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Consider the first manifestation of the bug, in which the command tells you "
"that the whitespace at the beginning of the line contains one word.  What "
"happens is this: The <code class=\"code\">M-x count-words-example</code> "
"command moves point to the beginning of the region.  The <code "
"class=\"code\">while</code> tests whether the value of point is smaller than "
"the value of <code class=\"code\">end</code>, which it is.  Consequently, "
"the regular expression search looks for and finds the first word.  It leaves "
"point after the word.  <code class=\"code\">count</code> is set to one.  The "
"<code class=\"code\">while</code> loop repeats; but this time the value of "
"point is larger than the value of <code class=\"code\">end</code>, the loop "
"is exited; and the function displays a message saying the number of words in "
"the region is one.  In brief, the regular expression search looks for and "
"finds the word even though it is outside the marked region."
msgstr ""
"バグの最初の現れ方を考えてみましょう。ここでは、コマンドが行頭の空白に1つの単"
"語が含まれていることを示します。実際に起こることは次の通りです。<code "
"class=\"code\">M-x count-words-example</code> コマンドがポイントを領域の先頭"
"に移動させます。<code class=\"code\">while</code> はポイントの値が <code "
"class=\"code\">end</code> の値より小さいかどうかを判定しますが、実際には小さ"
"いです。その結果、正規表現検索が最初の単語を探して見つけ出します。検索は単語"
"の後にポイントを残します。<code class=\"code\">count</code> には1が設定されま"
"す。<code class=\"code\">while</code> のループが繰り返されますが、今度はポイ"
"ントの値が <code class=\"code\">end</code> の値より大きいため、ループが終了"
"し、関数は領域内の単語数が1であるというメッセージを表示します。要するに、正規"
"表現検索は、単語がマークされた領域の外にあるにもかかわらず、それを探し出して"
"見つけるのです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Whitespace-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In the second manifestation of the bug, the region is whitespace at the end "
"of the buffer.  Emacs says &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Search failed</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  What happens is that the true-or-false-test in the <code "
"class=\"code\">while</code> loop tests true, so the search expression is "
"executed.  But since there are no more words in the buffer, the search fails."
msgstr ""
"このバグの2つ目の現象では、バッファ末尾の領域が空白になっています。Emacsは "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Search failed</samp>&rsquo; と記述します。実際に"
"は、<code class=\"code\">while</code> ループ内の真偽判定が true となるため、"
"検索式が実行されます。しかし、バッファ内にこれ以上の単語が存在しないため、検"
"索は失敗します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Whitespace-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In both manifestations of the bug, the search extends or attempts to extend "
"outside of the region."
msgstr ""
"このバグのどちらの挙動においても、検索範囲が領域外まで広がるか、あるいは広げ"
"ようとします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Whitespace-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The solution is to limit the search to the region&mdash;this is a fairly "
"simple action, but as you may have come to expect, it is not quite as simple "
"as you might think."
msgstr ""
"解決策は、探索範囲をその領域に限定することです――これはかなり単純な操作です"
"が、ご想像の通り、それほど単純ではありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Whitespace-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"As we have seen, the <code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> function "
"takes a search pattern as its first argument.  But in addition to this "
"first, mandatory argument, it accepts three optional arguments.  The "
"optional second argument bounds the search.  The optional third argument, if "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code>, causes the function to return <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> rather than signal an error if the search fails.  "
"The optional fourth argument is a repeat count.  (In Emacs, you can see a "
"function&rsquo;s documentation by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h f</kbd>, the "
"name of the function, and then <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>.)"
msgstr ""
"これまで見てきたように、<code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> 関数は"
"第1引数として検索パターンを受け取ります。しかし、この必須の第1引数に加えて、3"
"つのオプション引数も指定可能です。オプションの第2引数は検索範囲を限定します。"
"オプションの第3引数が <code class=\"code\">t</code> の場合、検索に失敗した際"
"にエラーを通知するのではなく、関数は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返しま"
"す。オプションの第4引数は繰り返し回数です。（Emacs では、関数名である <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-h f</kbd> と入力し、続けて <kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd> と入"
"力することで、その関数のドキュメントを確認できます。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Whitespace-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In the <code class=\"code\">count-words-example</code> definition, the value "
"of the end of the region is held by the variable <code class=\"code\">end</"
"code> which is passed as an argument to the function.  Thus, we can add "
"<code class=\"code\">end</code> as an argument to the regular expression "
"search expression:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">count-words-example</code> の定義では、領域の終端の値が"
"変数 <code class=\"code\">end</code> に保持され、これが関数の引数として渡され"
"ます。したがって、正規表現の検索式に引数として <code class=\"code\">end</"
"code> を追加できます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Whitespace-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(re-search-forward &quot;\\\\w+\\\\W*&quot; end)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Whitespace-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"However, if you make only this change to the <code class=\"code\">count-"
"words-example</code> definition and then test the new version of the "
"definition on a stretch of whitespace, you will receive an error message "
"saying &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Search failed</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"ただし、<code class=\"code\">count-words-example</code> の定義にこの変更のみ"
"を加え、新しいバージョンの定義を空白文字列でテストすると、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">Search failed</samp>&rsquo; というエラーメッセージが表示されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Whitespace-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"What happens is this: the search is limited to the region, and fails as you "
"expect because there are no word-constituent characters in the region.  "
"Since it fails, we receive an error message.  But we do not want to receive "
"an error message in this case; we want to receive the message &ldquo;The "
"region does NOT have any words.&rdquo;"
msgstr ""
"次のようなことが起こります。検索範囲がリージョンに限定され、そのリージョン内"
"に単語構成文字が存在しないため、予想通り失敗します。失敗したため、エラーメッ"
"セージが返されます。しかし、この場合にエラーメッセージを受け取りたいわけでは"
"なく、「リージョンに単語が存在しません」というメッセージを受け取りたいので"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Whitespace-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The solution to this problem is to provide <code class=\"code\">re-search-"
"forward</code> with a third argument of <code class=\"code\">t</code>, which "
"causes the function to return <code class=\"code\">nil</code> rather than "
"signal an error if the search fails."
msgstr ""
"この問題の解決策は、<code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> に第3引数と"
"して <code class=\"code\">t</code> を渡すことです。これにより、検索に失敗した"
"際にエラーを通知するのではなく、関数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返す"
"ようになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Whitespace-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"However, if you make this change and try it, you will see the message "
"&ldquo;Counting words in region ... &rdquo; and &hellip; you will keep on "
"seeing that message &hellip;, until you type <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">keyboard-quit</code>)."
msgstr ""
"ただし、この変更を加えて試してみると、「Counting words in region ...」という"
"メッセージが表示され……<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-g</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">keyboard-quit</code>) と入力するまで、そのメッセージが表示され"
"続けます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Whitespace-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Here is what happens: the search is limited to the region, as before, and it "
"fails because there are no word-constituent characters in the region, as "
"expected.  Consequently, the <code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> "
"expression returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  It does nothing else.  "
"In particular, it does not move point, which it does as a side effect if it "
"finds the search target.  After the <code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</"
"code> expression returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the next "
"expression in the <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop is evaluated.  This "
"expression increments the count.  Then the loop repeats.  The true-or-false-"
"test tests true because the value of point is still less than the value of "
"end, since the <code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> expression did "
"not move point. &hellip; and the cycle repeats &hellip;"
msgstr ""
"次のようなことが起こります。検索は前述の通り領域内に限定されますが、予想通り"
"領域内に単語構成文字が存在しないため、失敗します。その結果、<code "
"class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> 式は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> "
"を返します。それ以外の処理は一切行いません。特に、検索対象が見つかった際に副"
"次的に行うポイントの移動は行いません。<code class=\"code\">re-search-"
"forward</code> 式が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返した後、<code "
"class=\"code\">while</code> ループ内の次の式が評価されます。この式はカウント"
"をインクリメントします。その後、ループが繰り返されます。<code "
"class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> 式がポイントを移動させなかったため、"
"ポイントの値は依然として end の値よりも小さく、真偽判定は true となります。"
"&hellip; そしてサイクルが繰り返されます &hellip;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Whitespace-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">count-words-example</code> definition requires yet "
"another modification, to cause the true-or-false-test of the <code "
"class=\"code\">while</code> loop to test false if the search fails.  Put "
"another way, there are two conditions that must be satisfied in the true-or-"
"false-test before the word count variable is incremented: point must still "
"be within the region and the search expression must have found a word to "
"count."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">count-words-example</code> の定義には、検索に失敗した場"
"合に <code class=\"code\">while</code> ループの真偽判定が false となるよう、"
"さらに別の修正を加える必要があります。言い換えれば、単語数変数をインクリメン"
"トする前に、真偽判定において満たされなければならない条件が2つあります。すなわ"
"ち、point が依然として領域内にあり、かつ検索式がカウント対象の単語を見つけて"
"いることです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Whitespace-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Since both the first condition and the second condition must be true "
"together, the two expressions, the region test and the search expression, "
"can be joined with an <code class=\"code\">and</code> special form and "
"embedded in the <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop as the true-or-false-"
"test, like this:"
msgstr ""
"第1条件と第2条件がともに成立する必要があるため、領域判定式と検索式という2つの"
"式を<code class=\"code\">and</code>特殊形式で結合し、次のようにtrue-or-false-"
"testとして<code class=\"code\">while</code>ループ内に埋め込むことができます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Whitespace-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(and (&lt; (point) end) (re-search-forward &quot;\\\\w+\\\\W*&quot; end t))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Whitespace-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> expression returns <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> if the search succeeds and as a side effect moves "
"point.  Consequently, as words are found, point is moved through the "
"region.  When the search expression fails to find another word, or when "
"point reaches the end of the region, the true-or-false-test tests false, the "
"<code class=\"code\">while</code> loop exits, and the <code "
"class=\"code\">count-words-example</code> function displays one or other of "
"its messages."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> 式は、検索に成功した場合に "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> を返し、副作用としてポイントを移動させます。そ"
"の結果、単語が見つかるたびに、ポイントはリージョン内を移動します。検索式が別"
"の単語を見つけられなかった場合、あるいはポイントがリージョンの末尾に達した場"
"合、真偽値判定は false となり、<code class=\"code\">while</code> ループが終了"
"し、<code class=\"code\">count-words-example</code> 関数がいずれかのメッセー"
"ジを表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Whitespace-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"After incorporating these final changes, the <code class=\"code\">count-"
"words-example</code> works without bugs (or at least, without bugs that I "
"have found!).  Here is what it looks like:"
msgstr ""
"これらの最終的な変更を加えたことで、<code class=\"code\">count-words-"
"example</code>はバグなく動作するようになりました（少なくとも、私が見つけた限"
"りでは！）。実際の表示は以下の通りです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Whitespace-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";;; <span class=\"r\">Final version:</span> <code class=\"code\">while</code>\n"
"(defun count-words-example (beginning end)\n"
"  &quot;Print number of words in the region.&quot;\n"
"  (interactive &quot;r&quot;)\n"
"  (message &quot;Counting words in region ... &quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Whitespace-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";;; <span class=\"r\">1. Set up appropriate conditions.</span>\n"
"  (save-excursion\n"
"    (let ((count 0))\n"
"      (goto-char beginning)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Whitespace-Bug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";;; <span class=\"r\">2. Run the</span> while <span class=\"r\">loop.</span>\n"
"      (while (and (&lt; (point) end)\n"
