msgid ""
"Both examples show what to Lisp is the same list, the list made up of the "
"symbols &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">this</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">list</samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">looks</"
"samp>&rsquo;, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">like</samp>&rsquo;, and &lsquo;"
