"class=\"samp\">this</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">list</"
"samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">looks</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">like</samp>&rsquo;、および &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">this</"
