# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Words-in-a-defun.html
msgid ""
"Our next project is to count the number of words in a function definition.  "
"Clearly, this can be done using some variant of <code class=\"code\">count-"
"words-example</code>.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Counting-"
"Words.html\">Counting via Repetition and Regexps</a>.  If we are just going "
"to count the words in one definition, it is easy enough to mark the "
"definition with the <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-h</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">mark-defun</code>) command, and then call <code "
"class=\"code\">count-words-example</code>."
msgstr ""
"次のプロジェクトは、関数定義内の単語数を数えることです。当然ながら、これは"
"<code class=\"code\">count-words-example</code>の何らかのバリエーションを用い"
"て実現できます。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Counting-Words.html\">繰り返しと正規"
"表現によるカウント</a>を参照してください。単一の定義内の単語数を数えるだけで"
"あれば、その定義に<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-M-h</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">mark-"
"defun</code>) コマンドを付与し、その後<code class=\"code\">count-words-"
"example</code>を呼び出せば十分簡単です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Words-in-a-defun.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"However, I am more ambitious: I want to count the words and symbols in every "
"definition in the Emacs sources and then print a graph that shows how many "
"functions there are of each length: how many contain 40 to 49 words or "
"symbols, how many contain 50 to 59 words or symbols, and so on.  I have "
"often been curious how long a typical function is, and this will tell."
msgstr ""
"しかし、私はさらに意欲的な目標を掲げています。Emacsのソースコードにあるすべて"
"の定義に含まれる単語と記号の数をカウントし、それぞれの長さの関数がいくつある"
"かを示すグラフを出力したいと考えています。例えば、単語や記号が40〜49個含まれ"
"る関数がいくつあり、50〜59個含まれる関数がいくつあるか、といった具合です。典"
"型的な関数がどれくらいの長さなのかずっと気になっていたので、これで分かるはず"
"です。"

