"  (set-face-foreground 'diary   &quot;skyblue&quot;)\n"
"  (set-face-background 'holiday &quot;slate blue&quot;)\n"
"  (set-face-foreground 'holiday &quot;white&quot;))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/X11-Colors.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The various shades of blue soothe my eye and prevent me from seeing the "
"screen flicker."
msgstr "さまざまな色合いの青が目に優しく、画面のちらつきが気にならない。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/X11-Colors.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Alternatively, I could have set my specifications in various X "
"initialization files.  For example, I could set the foreground, background, "
"cursor, and pointer (i.e., mouse) colors in my <samp "
"class=\"file\">~/.Xresources</samp> file like this:"
msgstr ""
"あるいは、各種X初期化ファイルで設定を行うこともできました。例えば、<samp "
"class=\"file\">~/.Xresources</samp>ファイルでフォアグラウンド、バックグラウン"
"ド、カーソル、ポインタ（つまりマウス）の色を次のように設定できました。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/X11-Colors.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Emacs*foreground:   white\n"
"Emacs*background:   darkblue\n"
"Emacs*cursorColor:  white\n"
"Emacs*pointerColor: white\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/X11-Colors.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In any event, since it is not part of Emacs, I set the root color of my X "
"window in my <samp class=\"file\">~/.xinitrc</samp> file, like this<a "
"class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF22\" href=\"#FOOT22\"><sup>22</sup></a>:"
msgstr ""
"いずれにせよ、Emacsの一部ではないため、<samp class=\"file\">~/.xinitrc</samp>"
"ファイルで次のようにXウィンドウのルート色を設定しています<a "
"class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF22\" href=\"#FOOT22\"><sup>22</sup></a>："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/X11-Colors.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "xsetroot -solid Navy -fg white &amp;\n"
msgstr ""

