#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/eintr/Y-Axis-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>C.2.2 Construct a Y Axis Element<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#Construct-a-Y-Axis-Element\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>C.2.2 Y軸要素の作成<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Construct-a-Y-"
"Axis-Element\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Y-Axis-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"When we print the vertical axis, we want to insert strings such as &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">5&nbsp;-</samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">10&nbsp;-&nbsp;</samp>&rsquo; every five lines.  Moreover, we "
"want the numbers and dashes to line up, so shorter numbers must be padded "
"with leading spaces.  If some of the strings use two digit numbers, the "
"strings with single digit numbers must include a leading blank space before "
"the number."
msgstr ""
"縦軸を出力する際、5行ごとに &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">5&nbsp;-</"
"samp>&rsquo; や &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">10&nbsp;-&nbsp;</samp>&rsquo; と"
"いった文字列を挿入したいと考えています。また、数値とハイフンの位置を揃えるた"
"め、短い数値には先頭にスペースを詰めて埋める必要があります。一部の文字列で2桁"
"の数値を使用する場合、1桁の数値を含む文字列には、数値の前に先頭の空白を入れる"
"必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Y-Axis-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-number_002dto_002dstring\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-number_002dto_002dstring\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Y-Axis-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"To figure out the length of the number, the <code class=\"code\">length</"
"code> function is used.  But the <code class=\"code\">length</code> function "
"works only with a string, not with a number.  So the number has to be "
"converted from being a number to being a string.  This is done with the "
"<code class=\"code\">number-to-string</code> function.  For example,"
msgstr ""
"数値の長さを求めるには、<code class=\"code\">length</code>関数を使用します。"
"しかし、<code class=\"code\">length</code>関数は文字列に対してのみ有効で、数"
"値には適用できません。そのため、数値を数値から文字列に変換する必要がありま"
"す。これは<code class=\"code\">number-to-string</code>関数を用いて行います。"
"例えば、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Y-Axis-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(length (number-to-string 35))\n"
"     &rArr; 2\n"
"\n"
"(length (number-to-string 100))\n"
"     &rArr; 3\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Y-Axis-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(<code class=\"code\">number-to-string</code> is also called <code "
"class=\"code\">int-to-string</code>; you will see this alternative name in "
"various sources.)"
msgstr ""
"(<code class=\"code\">number-to-string</code> は <code class=\"code\">int-to-"
"string</code> とも呼ばれます。さまざまな資料でこの別称を目にするでしょう。)"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Y-Axis-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In addition, in each label, each number is followed by a string such as "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;</samp>&rsquo;, which we will call "
"the <code class=\"code\">Y-axis-tic</code> marker.  This variable is defined "
"with <code class=\"code\">defvar</code>:"
msgstr ""
"さらに、各ラベルにおいて、各数値の後には &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&nbsp;-"
"&nbsp;</samp>&rsquo; のような文字列が続いており、これを <code "
"class=\"code\">Y-axis-tic</code> マーカーと呼びます。この変数は <code "
"class=\"code\">defvar</code> で定義されています："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Y-Axis-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Y_002daxis_002dtic\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Y_002daxis_002dtic\"></a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Y-Axis-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defvar Y-axis-tic &quot; - &quot;\n"
"   &quot;String that follows number in a Y axis label.&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Y-Axis-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The length of the Y label is the sum of the length of the Y axis tic mark "
"and the length of the number of the top of the graph."
msgstr "Y軸ラベルの長さは、Y軸の目盛りの長さとグラフ上部の数値の長さの和です。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Y-Axis-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(length (concat (number-to-string height) Y-axis-tic)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Y-Axis-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This value will be calculated by the <code class=\"code\">print-graph</code> "
"function in its varlist as <code class=\"code\">full-Y-label-width</code> "
"and passed on.  (Note that we did not think to include this in the varlist "
"when we first proposed it.)"
msgstr ""
"この値は、<code class=\"code\">print-graph</code> 関数がその varlist 内で "
"<code class=\"code\">full-Y-label-width</code> として計算し、そのまま渡しま"
"す。（なお、最初に提案した際は、これを varlist に含めることは想定していません"
"でした。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Y-Axis-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"To make a complete vertical axis label, a tic mark is concatenated with a "
"number; and the two together may be preceded by one or more spaces depending "
"on how long the number is.  The label consists of three parts: the "
"(optional) leading spaces, the number, and the tic mark.  The function is "
"passed the value of the number for the specific row, and the value of the "
"width of the top line, which is calculated (just once) by <code "
"class=\"code\">print-graph</code>."
msgstr ""
"完全な垂直軸ラベルを作成するには、目盛り記号と数値を連結します。また、数値の"
"長さに応じて、これら2つの前に1つ以上のスペースが置かれる場合があります。ラベ"
"ルは、（任意の）先頭スペース、数値、および目盛り記号の3つの部分で構成されま"
"す。この関数には、特定の行の数値と、<code class=\"code\">print-graph</code>に"
"よって（一度だけ）計算される最上行の幅の値が渡されます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Y-Axis-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun Y-axis-element (number full-Y-label-width)\n"
"  &quot;Construct a NUMBERed label element.\n"
"A numbered element looks like this `  5 - ',\n"
"and is padded as needed so all line up with\n"
"the element for the largest number.&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Y-Axis-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (let* ((leading-spaces\n"
"         (- full-Y-label-width\n"
"            (length\n"
"             (concat (number-to-string number)\n"
"                     Y-axis-tic)))))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Y-Axis-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    (concat\n"
"     (make-string leading-spaces ? )\n"
"     (number-to-string number)\n"
"     Y-axis-tic)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Y-Axis-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">Y-axis-element</code> function concatenates "
"together the leading spaces, if any; the number, as a string; and the tic "
"mark."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">Y-axis-element</code> 関数は、先頭のスペース（あれば）、"
"数値を文字列として、およびティックマークを連結します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Y-Axis-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"To figure out how many leading spaces the label will need, the function "
"subtracts the actual length of the label&mdash;the length of the number plus "
"the length of the tic mark&mdash;from the desired label width."
msgstr ""
"ラベルに必要な先頭のスペース数を算出するため、この関数は希望するラベル幅か"
"ら、ラベルの実際の長さ（数値の長さに目盛りの長さを加えたもの）を差し引きま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Y-Axis-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-make_002dstring\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-make_002dstring\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Y-Axis-Element.html
msgid ""
"Blank spaces are inserted using the <code class=\"code\">make-string</code> "
"function.  This function takes two arguments: the first tells it how long "
"the string will be and the second is a symbol for the character to insert, "
"in a special format.  The format is a question mark followed by a blank "
"space, like this, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">? </samp>&rsquo;.  See <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Character-Type.html#Character-Type\">Character Type</a> in <cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>, for a description "
"of the syntax for characters.  (Of course, you might want to replace the "
"blank space by some other character &hellip; You know what to do.)"
msgstr ""
"空白は <code class=\"code\">make-string</code> 関数を用いて挿入されます。この"
"関数は2つの引数を取ります。1つ目は文字列の長さを、2つ目は特殊な形式の挿入文字"
"を表す記号を指定します。形式は、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">? </samp>&rsquo; "
"のように、クエスチョンマークに続いて空白が入る形です。文字の構文に関する説明"
"については、<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite> "
"の <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/elisp/Character-Type.html#Character-Type\">Character Type</a> を参"
"照してください。（もちろん、空白を別の文字に置き換えたい場合もあるでしょう……"
"やり方はお分かりかと思います。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Y-Axis-Element.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">number-to-string</code> function is used in the "
"concatenation expression, to convert the number to a string that is "
"concatenated with the leading spaces and the tic mark."
msgstr ""
"連結式では<code class=\"code\">number-to-string</code>関数が使用されており、"
"数値を文字列に変換して先頭のスペースやティックマークと連結しています。"

