# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Y_002daxis_002dcolumn.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The preceding functions provide all the tools needed to construct a function "
"that generates a list of numbered and blank strings to insert as the label "
"for the vertical axis:"
msgstr ""
"前述の関数群により、縦軸のラベルとして挿入するための、番号付き文字列と空白文"
"字列のリストを生成する関数を構築するために必要なツールがすべて揃います："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/Y_002daxis_002dcolumn.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
