msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Y_002daxis_002dcolumn\"></a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Y_002daxis_002dcolumn.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun Y-axis-column (height width-of-label)\n"
"  &quot;Construct list of Y axis labels and blank strings.\n"
"For HEIGHT of line above base and WIDTH-OF-LABEL.&quot;\n"
"  (let (Y-axis)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Y_002daxis_002dcolumn.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    (while (&gt; height 1)\n"
"      (if (zerop (% height Y-axis-label-spacing))\n"
"          ;; <span class=\"r\">Insert label.</span>\n"
"          (setq Y-axis\n"
"                (cons\n"
"                 (Y-axis-element height width-of-label)\n"
"                 Y-axis))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/Y_002daxis_002dcolumn.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        ;; <span class=\"r\">Else, insert blanks.</span>\n"
"        (setq Y-axis\n"
"              (cons\n"
"               (make-string width-of-label ? )\n"
"               Y-axis)))\n"
"      (setq height (1- height)))\n"
"    ;; <span class=\"r\">Insert base line.</span>\n"
"    (setq Y-axis\n"
"          (cons (Y-axis-element 1 width-of-label) Y-axis))\n"
"    (nreverse Y-axis)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/Y_002daxis_002dcolumn.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In this function, we start with the value of <code class=\"code\">height</"
"code> and repetitively subtract one from its value.  After each subtraction, "
"we test to see whether the value is an integral multiple of the <code "
"class=\"code\">Y-axis-label-spacing</code>.  If it is, we construct a "
"numbered label using the <code class=\"code\">Y-axis-element</code> "
"function; if not, we construct a blank label using the <code "
"class=\"code\">make-string</code> function.  The base line consists of the "
"number one followed by a tic mark."
msgstr ""
"この関数では、まず <code class=\"code\">height</code> の値から始め、その値か"
"ら1を繰り返し減算します。減算を行うたびに、その値が <code class=\"code\">Y-"
"axis-label-spacing</code> の整数倍であるかどうかを判定します。整数倍であれば "
"<code class=\"code\">Y-axis-element</code> 関数を用いて番号付きラベルを作成"
"し、そうでなければ <code class=\"code\">make-string</code> 関数を用いて空白ラ"
"ベルを作成します。ベースラインは、数値の1に続いてティックマークで構成されま"
"す。"

