"Expression<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-append_002dto_002dbuffer-"
"Interactive-Expression\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>4.4.1 <code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code> インタラクティブ式"
"<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-append_002dto_002dbuffer-Interactive-"
"Expression\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-interactive.html
msgid ""
"Since the <code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code> function will be used "
"interactively, the function must have an <code class=\"code\">interactive</"
"code> expression.  (For a review of <code class=\"code\">interactive</code>, "
"see <a class=\"ref\" href=\"Interactive.html\">Making a Function "
"Interactive</a>.)"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code> 関数はインタラクティブに使用され"
"るため、その関数には <code class=\"code\">interactive</code> 式が必要です。"
"（<code class=\"code\">interactive</code> の復習については、<a class=\"ref\" "
"href=\"Interactive.html\">関数をインタラクティブにする</a> を参照してくださ"
"い。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-interactive.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The expression reads as follows:"
msgstr "式は次のように読みます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/append-interactive.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(interactive\n"
" (list (read-buffer\n"
"        &quot;Append to buffer: &quot;\n"
"        (other-buffer (current-buffer) t))\n"
"       (region-beginning)\n"
"       (region-end)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-interactive.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This expression is not one with letters standing for parts, as described "
"earlier.  Instead, it starts a list with these parts:"
msgstr ""
"この表現は、前述のような、各部分を表す文字を用いたものではありません。代わり"
"に、以下の部分でリストを開始します："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-interactive.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The first part of the list is an expression to read the name of a buffer and "
"return it as a string.  That is <code class=\"code\">read-buffer</code>.  "
"The function requires a prompt as its first argument, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&quot;Append to buffer: &quot;</samp>&rsquo;.  Its second "
"argument tells the command what value to provide if you don&rsquo;t specify "
"anything."
msgstr ""
"リストの前半部分は、バッファ名を読み取って文字列として返す式です。それが "
"<code class=\"code\">read-buffer</code> です。この関数は、第1引数としてプロン"
"プト &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;Append to buffer: &quot;</"
"samp>&rsquo; を必要とします。第2引数は、何も指定しなかった場合にどのような値"
"を返すかをコマンドに指示するものです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-interactive.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In this case that second argument is an expression containing the function "
"<code class=\"code\">other-buffer</code>, an exception, and a &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">t</samp>&rsquo;, standing for true."
msgstr ""
"この場合、2番目の引数は、関数 <code class=\"code\">other-buffer</code>、例"
"外、および真を表す &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">t</samp>&rsquo; を含む式となり"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-interactive.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The first argument to <code class=\"code\">other-buffer</code>, the "
"exception, is yet another function, <code class=\"code\">current-buffer</"
"code>.  That is not going to be returned.  The second argument is the symbol "
"for true, <code class=\"code\">t</code>.  That tells <code "
"class=\"code\">other-buffer</code> that it may show visible buffers (except "
"in this case, it will not show the current buffer, which makes sense)."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">other-buffer</code> の第1引数である例外は、また別の関数 "
"<code class=\"code\">current-buffer</code> です。これは返されません。第2引数"
"は true を表すシンボル <code class=\"code\">t</code> です。これにより <code "
"class=\"code\">other-buffer</code> は、可視バッファを表示してよいことが伝えら"
"れます（ただしこの場合は、現在のバッファは表示されませんが、これは妥当な挙動"
"です）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-interactive.html
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The expression looks like this:"
msgstr "式は次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/append-interactive.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(other-buffer (current-buffer) t)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-interactive.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The second and third arguments to the <code class=\"code\">list</code> "
"expression are <code class=\"code\">(region-beginning)</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">(region-end)</code>.  These two functions specify the "
"beginning and end of the text to be appended."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">list</code> 式の第2引数と第3引数は <code "
"class=\"code\">(region-beginning)</code> と <code class=\"code\">(region-"
"end)</code> です。これら2つの関数は、追記するテキストの開始位置と終了位置を指"
"定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-interactive.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Originally, the command used the letters &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">B</"
"samp>&rsquo; and &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">r</samp>&rsquo;.  The whole "
"<code class=\"code\">interactive</code> expression looked like this:"
msgstr ""
"もともと、このコマンドでは&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">B</samp>&rsquo;と"
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">r</samp>&rsquo;という文字が使われていました。"
"<code class=\"code\">interactive</code>という式全体は、次のような形でした："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/append-interactive.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(interactive &quot;BAppend to buffer: \\nr&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-interactive.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"But when that was done, the default value of the buffer switched to was "
"invisible.  That was not wanted."
msgstr ""
"しかし、それが終わると、バッファが切り替わった際のデフォルト値が非表示になっ"
"た。それは望ましくなかった。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-interactive.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(The prompt was separated from the second argument with a newline, &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">\\n</samp>&rsquo;.  It was followed by an &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">r</samp>&rsquo; that told Emacs to bind the two arguments "
"that follow the symbol <code class=\"code\">buffer</code> in the "
"function&rsquo;s argument list (that is, <code class=\"code\">start</code> "
"and <code class=\"code\">end</code>) to the values of point and mark.  That "
"argument worked fine.)"
msgstr ""
"（プロンプトは、改行 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\n</samp>&rsquo; によって第"
"2引数から区切られていた。それに続いて &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">r</"
"samp>&rsquo; があり、これによりEmacsは、関数の引数リストにおいてシンボル "
"<code class=\"code\">buffer</code> に続く2つの引数（すなわち <code "
"class=\"code\">start</code> と <code class=\"code\">end</code>）を、point と "
"mark の値にバインドするように指示されていた。その引数は正常に動作した。）"

