# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The body of the <code class=\"code\">let</code> expression in <code "
"class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code> consists of a <code "
"class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> expression."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code> における <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> 式の本体は、<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</"
"code> 式で構成される。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> function saves the location "
"of point, and restores it to that position after the expressions in the body "
"of the <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> complete execution.  In "
"addition, <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> keeps track of the "
"original buffer, and restores it.  This is how <code class=\"code\">save-"
"excursion</code> is used in <code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> 関数はポイントの位置を保存し、"
"<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> の本体内の式の実行が完了した後にそ"
"の位置を復元します。さらに、<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> は元の"
"バッファを追跡し、それを復元します。このようにして、<code "
"class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> が <code class=\"code\">append-to-"
"buffer</code> で使用されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Indentation-for-formatting\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Formatting-convention\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Indentation-for-formatting\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Formatting-convention\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Incidentally, it is worth noting here that a Lisp function is normally "
"formatted so that everything that is enclosed in a multi-line spread is "
"indented more to the right than the first symbol.  In this function "
"definition, the <code class=\"code\">let</code> is indented more than the "
"<code class=\"code\">defun</code>, and the <code class=\"code\">save-"
"excursion</code> is indented more than the <code class=\"code\">let</code>, "
"like this:"
msgstr ""
"ちなみに、ここで注目すべき点は、Lispの関数は通常、複数行にわたる広がりの中に"
"囲まれたすべての要素が、最初の記号よりも右側にインデントされるように記述され"
"るということです。この関数定義では、<code class=\"code\">let</code> は <code "
"class=\"code\">defun</code> よりも、<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</"
"code> は <code class=\"code\">let</code> よりも、次のようにインデントされてい"
"ます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun ...\n"
"  ...\n"
"  ...\n"
"  (let...\n"
"    (save-excursion\n"
"      ...\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This formatting convention makes it easy to see that the lines in the body "
"of the <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> are enclosed by the "
"parentheses associated with <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code>, just "
"as the <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> itself is enclosed by the "
"parentheses associated with the <code class=\"code\">let</code>:"
msgstr ""
"この書式規則により、<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code>の本文中の行が"
"<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code>に対応する括弧で囲まれていることが"
"容易に分かります。同様に、<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code>自体も"
"<code class=\"code\">let</code>に対応する括弧で囲まれています："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((oldbuf (current-buffer)))\n"
"  (save-excursion\n"
"    ...\n"
"    (set-buffer ...)\n"
"    (insert-buffer-substring oldbuf start end)\n"
"    ...))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The use of the <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> function can be "
"viewed as a process of filling in the slots of a template:"
