msgid ""
"<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"let_002a-introduced\"></a><a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-let_002a\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"anchor\" id=\"let_002a-introduced\"></a><a class=\"index-entry-"
"id\" id=\"index-let_002a\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In this function, the body of the <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> "
"contains only one expression, the <code class=\"code\">let*</code> "
"expression.  You know about a <code class=\"code\">let</code> function.  The "
"<code class=\"code\">let*</code> function is different.  It enables Emacs to "
"set each variable in its varlist in sequence, one after another; such that "
"variables in the latter part of the varlist can make use of the values to "
"which Emacs set variables earlier in the varlist."
msgstr ""
"この関数では、<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> の本体には <code "
"class=\"code\">let*</code> 式という1つの式のみが含まれています。<code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> 関数についてはご存知かと思います。<code "
"class=\"code\">let*</code> 関数は異なります。この関数により、Emacs は "
"varlist 内の各変数を順次、一つずつ設定できるようになります。これにより、"
"varlist の後半にある変数が、それより前に Emacs が設定した値を利用できるように"
"なります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Looking at the <code class=\"code\">let*</code> expression in <code "
"class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code>:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code> 内の <code class=\"code\">let*</"
"code> 式を見ると："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let* ((append-to (get-buffer-create buffer))\n"
"       (windows (get-buffer-window-list append-to t t))\n"
"       point)\n"
"  BODY...)\n"
msgstr ""

