#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"we see that <code class=\"code\">append-to</code> is bound to the value "
"returned by the <code class=\"code\">(get-buffer-create&nbsp;buffer)</"
"code>.  On the next line, <code class=\"code\">append-to</code> is used as "
"an argument to <code class=\"code\">get-buffer-window-list</code>; this "
"would not be possible with the <code class=\"code\">let</code> expression.  "
"Note that <code class=\"code\">point</code> is automatically bound to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, the same way as it would be done in the <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> statement."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">append-to</code> が <code class=\"code\">(get-buffer-"
