"行では、<code class=\"code\">append-to</code> が <code class=\"code\">get-"
"buffer-window-list</code> の引数として使用されていますが、これは <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> 式では不可能です。なお、<code "
"class=\"code\">point</code> は <code class=\"code\">let</code> 文の場合と同様"
"に、自動的に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> にバインドされる点に注意してくだ"
"さい。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Now let&rsquo;s focus on the functions <code class=\"code\">set-buffer</"
"code> and <code class=\"code\">insert-buffer-substring</code> in the body of "
"the <code class=\"code\">let*</code> expression."
msgstr ""
"それでは、<code class=\"code\">let*</code>式の本体にある関数<code "
"class=\"code\">set-buffer</code>と<code class=\"code\">insert-buffer-"
"substring</code>に注目してみましょう。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In the old days, the <code class=\"code\">set-buffer</code> expression was "
"simply"
msgstr "昔は、<code class=\"code\">set-buffer</code> という表現は単に"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(set-buffer (get-buffer-create buffer))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "but now it is"
msgstr "だが今は"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(set-buffer append-to)\n"
