# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This is because <code class=\"code\">append-to</code> was bound to <code "
"class=\"code\">(get-buffer-create buffer)</code> earlier on in the <code "
"class=\"code\">let*</code> expression."
msgstr ""
"これは、<code class=\"code\">let*</code> 式のより前の箇所で <code "
"class=\"code\">append-to</code> が <code class=\"code\">(get-buffer-create "
"buffer)</code> に束縛されていたためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code> function definition inserts "
"text from the buffer in which you are currently to a named buffer.  It "
"happens that <code class=\"code\">insert-buffer-substring</code> does just "
"the reverse&mdash;it copies text from another buffer to the current "
"buffer&mdash;that is why the <code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code> "
"definition starts out with a <code class=\"code\">let</code> that binds the "
"local symbol <code class=\"code\">oldbuf</code> to the value returned by "
"<code class=\"code\">current-buffer</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code> 関数定義は、現在使用しているバッ"
"ファから名前付きバッファへテキストを挿入します。たまたま <code "
"class=\"code\">insert-buffer-substring</code> はその逆、つまり別のバッファか"
"ら現在のバッファへテキストをコピーします。そのため、<code "
"class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code> の定義は、ローカルシンボル <code "
"class=\"code\">oldbuf</code> を <code class=\"code\">current-buffer</code> が"
"返す値にバインドする <code class=\"code\">let</code> から始まるようになってい"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">insert-buffer-substring</code> expression looks "
"like this:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">insert-buffer-substring</code> 式は次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(insert-buffer-substring oldbuf start end)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">insert-buffer-substring</code> function copies a "
"string <em class=\"emph\">from</em> the buffer specified as its first "
"argument and inserts the string into the present buffer.  In this case, the "
"argument to <code class=\"code\">insert-buffer-substring</code> is the value "
"of the variable created and bound by the <code class=\"code\">let</code>, "
"namely the value of <code class=\"code\">oldbuf</code>, which was the "
"current buffer when you gave the <code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</"
"code> command."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">insert-buffer-substring</code> 関数は、第1引数で指定され"
"たバッファから文字列を<em class=\"emph\">コピー</em>し、その文字列を現在の"
"バッファに挿入します。この場合、<code class=\"code\">insert-buffer-"
"substring</code> の引数は、<code class=\"code\">let</code> によって作成・バイ"
"ンドされた変数の値、すなわち <code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code> コ"
"マンドを実行した際に現在のバッファであった <code class=\"code\">oldbuf</"
"code> の値となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"After <code class=\"code\">insert-buffer-substring</code> has done its work, "
"<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> will restore the action to the "
"original buffer and <code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code> will have "
"done its job."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">insert-buffer-substring</code> の処理が完了すると、"
"<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> がアクションを元のバッファに復元"
"し、<code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code> が処理を完了します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Written in skeletal form, the workings of the body look like this:"
msgstr "骨格形式で記述すると、身体の仕組みは次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let (<var class=\"var\">bind-</var><code class=\"code\">oldbuf</code><var class=\"var\">-to-value-of-</var><code class=\"code\">current-buffer</code>)\n"
"  (save-excursion                       ; <span class=\"r\">Keep track of buffer.</span>\n"
"    <var class=\"var\">change-buffer</var>\n"
"    <var class=\"var\">insert-substring-from-</var><code class=\"code\">oldbuf</code><var class=\"var\">-into-buffer</var>)\n"
"\n"
"  <var class=\"var\">change-back-to-original-buffer-when-finished</var>\n"
"<var class=\"var\">let-the-local-meaning-of-</var><code class=\"code\">oldbuf</code><var class=\"var\">-disappear-when-finished</var>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In summary, <code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code> works as follows: "
"it saves the value of the current buffer in the variable called <code "
"class=\"code\">oldbuf</code>.  It gets the new buffer (creating one if need "
"be) and switches Emacs&rsquo;s attention to it.  Using the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">oldbuf</code>, it inserts the region of text from the old "
"buffer into the new buffer; and then using <code class=\"code\">save-"
"excursion</code>, it brings you back to your original buffer."
msgstr ""
"まとめると、<code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code>は次のように動作しま"
"す。まず、現在のバッファの値を<code class=\"code\">oldbuf</code>という変数に"
"保存します。次に、新しいバッファを取得し（必要に応じて作成し）、Emacsのフォー"
"カスをそこへ切り替えます。<code class=\"code\">oldbuf</code>の値を用いて、旧"
"バッファのテキスト範囲を新バッファに挿入し、最後に<code class=\"code\">save-"
"excursion</code>を用いて元のバッファに戻ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append-save_002dexcursion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In looking at <code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code>, you have "
"explored a fairly complex function.  It shows how to use <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> and <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code>, "
"and how to change to and come back from another buffer.  Many function "
"definitions use <code class=\"code\">let</code>, <code class=\"code\">save-"
"excursion</code>, and <code class=\"code\">set-buffer</code> this way."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code>を見ると、かなり複雑な関数につい"
