#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append_002dto_002dbuffer-body.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The body of the <code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code> function begins "
"with <code class=\"code\">let</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code> 関数の本体は <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> から始まります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append_002dto_002dbuffer-body.html
msgid ""
"As we have seen before (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"let.html\"><code "
"class=\"code\">let</code></a>), the purpose of a <code class=\"code\">let</"
"code> expression is to create and give initial values to one or more "
"variables that will only be used within the body of the <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code>.  This means that such a variable will not be "
"confused with any variable of the same name outside the <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> expression."
msgstr ""
"前述の通り（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"let.html\"><code class=\"code\">let</"
"code></a>を参照）、<code class=\"code\">let</code>式の目的は、<code "
"class=\"code\">let</code>の本体内でのみ使用される1つ以上の変数を生成し、初期"
"値を代入することです。つまり、このような変数は、<code class=\"code\">let</"
"code>式の外部にある同名の変数と混同されることはありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append_002dto_002dbuffer-body.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"We can see how the <code class=\"code\">let</code> expression fits into the "
"function as a whole by showing a template for <code class=\"code\">append-to-"
"buffer</code> with the <code class=\"code\">let</code> expression in outline:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">let</code>式をアウトラインに示した<code "
"class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code>のテンプレートを提示することで、<code "
"class=\"code\">let</code>式が関数全体の中でどのように位置づけられるかを確認で"
"きます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/append_002dto_002dbuffer-body.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun append-to-buffer (buffer start end)\n"
"  &quot;<var class=\"var\">documentation</var>...&quot;\n"
"  (interactive ...)\n"
"  (let ((<var class=\"var\">variable</var> <var class=\"var\">value</var>))\n"
"        <var class=\"var\">body</var>...))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
