#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append_002dto_002dbuffer-body.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In this part of the <code class=\"code\">let</code> expression, the one "
"variable, <code class=\"code\">oldbuf</code>, is bound to the value returned "
"by the <code class=\"code\">(current-buffer)</code> expression.  The "
"variable, <code class=\"code\">oldbuf</code>, is used to keep track of the "
"buffer in which you are working and from which you will copy."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">let</code> 式のこの部分では、唯一の変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">oldbuf</code> に <code class=\"code\">(current-buffer)</code> "
"式が返す値が代入されます。変数 <code class=\"code\">oldbuf</code> は、現在操"
"作しているバッファと、そこからコピーを行うバッファを管理するために使用されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
