#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((oldbuf (current-buffer)))\n"
"  ... )\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append_002dto_002dbuffer-body.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The two parentheses before <code class=\"code\">oldbuf</code> might surprise "
"you if you did not realize that the first parenthesis before <code "
"class=\"code\">oldbuf</code> marks the boundary of the varlist and the "
"second parenthesis marks the beginning of the two-element list, <code "
"class=\"code\">(oldbuf (current-buffer))</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">oldbuf</code> の前にある2つの括弧は、<code "
"class=\"code\">oldbuf</code> の前の1つ目の括弧が varlist の境界を、2つ目の括"
"弧が2要素のリスト <code class=\"code\">(oldbuf (current-buffer))</code> の開"
"始を示していることに気づかなければ、意外に感じられるかもしれません。"

