"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-insert_002dbuffer_002dsubstring\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append_002dto_002dbuffer-overview.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code> command uses the <code "
"class=\"code\">insert-buffer-substring</code> function to copy the region.  "
"<code class=\"code\">insert-buffer-substring</code> is described by its "
"name: it takes a substring from a buffer, and inserts it into another buffer."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code> コマンドは <code "
"class=\"code\">insert-buffer-substring</code> 関数を使用して領域をコピーしま"
"す。<code class=\"code\">insert-buffer-substring</code> はその名称が示す通"
"り、バッファから部分文字列を取り出し、それを別のバッファに挿入します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append_002dto_002dbuffer-overview.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Most of <code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code> is concerned with "
"setting up the conditions for <code class=\"code\">insert-buffer-substring</"
"code> to work: the code must specify both the buffer to which the text will "
"go, the window it comes from and goes to, and the region that will be copied."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code> の大部分は、<code "
"class=\"code\">insert-buffer-substring</code> が動作するための条件設定に関す"
"るものです。コードでは、テキストの格納先となるバッファ、テキストの出所および"
"転送先となるウィンドウ、そしてコピー対象となる領域のすべてを指定する必要があ"
"ります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/append_002dto_002dbuffer-overview.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Here is a possible implementation of the function:"
msgstr "関数の実装例を以下に示します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/append_002dto_002dbuffer-overview.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun append-to-buffer (buffer start end)\n"
"  &quot;Append to specified buffer the text of the region.\n"
"It is inserted into that buffer before its point.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/append_002dto_002dbuffer-overview.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When calling from a program, give three arguments:\n"
"BUFFER (or buffer name), START and END.\n"
"START and END specify the portion of the current buffer to be copied.&quot;\n"
"  (interactive\n"
"   (list (read-buffer &quot;Append to buffer: &quot; (other-buffer\n"
"                                            (current-buffer) t))\n"
"         (region-beginning) (region-end)))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/append_002dto_002dbuffer-overview.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (let ((oldbuf (current-buffer)))\n"
"    (save-excursion\n"
"      (let* ((append-to (get-buffer-create buffer))\n"
"             (windows (get-buffer-window-list append-to t t))\n"
"             point)\n"
"        (set-buffer append-to)\n"
"        (setq point (point))\n"
"        (barf-if-buffer-read-only)\n"
"        (insert-buffer-substring oldbuf start end)\n"
"        (dolist (window windows)\n"
"          (when (= (window-point window) point)\n"
"            (set-window-point window (point))))))))\n"
msgstr ""

