# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/beginning_002dof_002dbuffer-complete.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Here is the complete text of the <code class=\"code\">beginning-of-buffer</"
"code> function:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">beginning-of-buffer</code>関数の全文は以下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><br><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/beginning_002dof_002dbuffer-complete.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun beginning-of-buffer (&amp;optional arg)\n"
"  &quot;Move point to the beginning of the buffer;\n"
"leave mark at previous position.\n"
"With \\\\[universal-argument] prefix,\n"
"do not set mark at previous position.\n"
"With numeric arg N,\n"
"put point N/10 of the way from the beginning.\n"
"\n"
"If the buffer is narrowed,\n"
"this command uses the beginning and size\n"
"of the accessible part of the buffer.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><br><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/beginning_002dof_002dbuffer-complete.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Don't use this command in Lisp programs!\n"
"\\(goto-char (point-min)) is faster\n"
"and avoids clobbering the mark.&quot;\n"
"  (interactive &quot;P&quot;)\n"
"  (or (consp arg)\n"
"      (and transient-mark-mode mark-active)\n"
"      (push-mark))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><br><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/beginning_002dof_002dbuffer-complete.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (let ((size (- (point-max) (point-min))))\n"
"    (goto-char (if (and arg (not (consp arg)))\n"
"                   (+ (point-min)\n"
"                      (if (&gt; size 10000)\n"
"                          ;; Avoid overflow for large buffer sizes!\n"
"                          (* (prefix-numeric-value arg)\n"
"                             (/ size 10))\n"
"                        (/ (+ 10 (* size (prefix-numeric-value arg)))\n"
"                           10)))\n"
"                 (point-min))))\n"
"  (if (and arg (not (consp arg))) (forward-line 1)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><br><p>
#: build/html/eintr/beginning_002dof_002dbuffer-complete.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Except for two small points, the previous discussion shows how this function "
"works.  The first point deals with a detail in the documentation string, and "
"the second point concerns the last line of the function."
msgstr ""
"2つの些細な点を除けば、これまでの説明でこの関数の仕組みが分かります。1点目は"
"ドキュメント文字列の詳細に関するもので、2点目は関数の最終行に関するものです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><br><p>
#: build/html/eintr/beginning_002dof_002dbuffer-complete.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "In the documentation string, there is reference to an expression:"
msgstr "ドキュメント文字列に、ある式への参照があります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><br><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/beginning_002dof_002dbuffer-complete.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\\\[universal-argument]\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><br><p>
#: build/html/eintr/beginning_002dof_002dbuffer-complete.html
msgid ""
"A &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\\\</samp>&rsquo; is used before the first "
"square bracket of this expression.  This &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\\\</"
"samp>&rsquo; tells the Lisp interpreter to substitute whatever key is "
"currently bound to the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[&hellip;]</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  In the case of <code class=\"code\">universal-argument</"
"code>, that is usually <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u</kbd>, but it might be "
"different.  (See <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Documentation-Tips.html#Documentation-"
"Tips\">Tips for Documentation Strings</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU "
"Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>, for more information.)"
msgstr ""
"この式の最初の角括弧の前には &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\\\</samp>&rsquo; "
"が使用されています。この &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\\\</samp>&rsquo; は、"
"現在 &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">[&hellip;]</samp>&rsquo; にバインドされてい"
"るキーを代入するようLispインタプリタに指示します。<code "
"class=\"code\">universal-argument</code> の場合、通常は <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-"
"u</kbd> となりますが、異なる場合もあります。（詳細については、<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite> の <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Documentation-Tips.html#Documentation-Tips\">Tips for Documentation "
"Strings</a> を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><br><p>
#: build/html/eintr/beginning_002dof_002dbuffer-complete.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Finally, the last line of the <code class=\"code\">beginning-of-buffer</"
"code> command says to move point to the beginning of the next line if the "
"command is invoked with an argument:"
msgstr ""
"最後に、<code class=\"code\">beginning-of-buffer</code>コマンドの最後の行で"
"は、引数付きでコマンドが呼び出された場合にポイントを次の行の先頭に移動させる"
"よう指定されています："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><br><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/beginning_002dof_002dbuffer-complete.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(if (and arg (not (consp arg))) (forward-line 1))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><br><p>
#: build/html/eintr/beginning_002dof_002dbuffer-complete.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This puts the cursor at the beginning of the first line after the "
"appropriate tenths position in the buffer.  This is a flourish that means "
"that the cursor is always located <em class=\"emph\">at least</em> the "
"requested tenths of the way through the buffer, which is a nicety that is, "
"perhaps, not necessary, but which, if it did not occur, would be sure to "
"draw complaints.  (The <code class=\"code\">(not (consp arg))</code> portion "
"is so that if you specify the command with a <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u</kbd>, "
"but without a number, that is to say, if the raw prefix argument is simply a "
"cons cell, the command does not put you at the beginning of the second line.)"
msgstr ""
"これにより、バッファ内の適切な10分の1の位置を過ぎた後、カーソルが1行目の先頭"
"に配置されます。これは、カーソルが常にバッファ内の要求された10分の1の位置<em "
"class=\"emph\">以上</em>に位置することを保証する工夫であり、おそらく不要とも"
"言える配慮ですが、もしこれがなければ間違いなく不満の声が上がることでしょう。"
"（<code class=\"code\">(not (consp arg))</code> の部分は、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-u</kbd> を指定して数値を省略した場合、つまり raw プレフィック"
"ス引数が単なるコンスセルである場合に、コマンドがカーソルを2行目の先頭に配置し"
"ないようにするためのものです。）"

