# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/beginning_002dof_002dbuffer.html
msgid ""
"The basic structure of the <code class=\"code\">beginning-of-buffer</code> "
"function has already been discussed.  (See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"simplified_002dbeginning_002dof_002dbuffer.html\">A Simplified <code "
"class=\"code\">beginning-of-buffer</code> Definition</a>.)  This section "
"describes the complex part of the definition."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">beginning-of-buffer</code> 関数の基本構造については、す"
"でに説明済みです。（<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"simplified_002dbeginning_002dof_002dbuffer.html\">簡略化した <code "
"class=\"code\">beginning-of-buffer</code> の定義</a>を参照してください。）本"
"節では、定義の複雑な部分について説明します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/beginning_002dof_002dbuffer.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"As previously described, when invoked without an argument, <code "
"class=\"code\">beginning-of-buffer</code> moves the cursor to the beginning "
"of the buffer (in truth, the beginning of the accessible portion of the "
"buffer), leaving the mark at the previous position.  However, when the "
"command is invoked with a number between one and ten, the function considers "
"that number to be a fraction of the length of the buffer, measured in "
"tenths, and Emacs moves the cursor that fraction of the way from the "
"beginning of the buffer.  Thus, you can either call this function with the "
"key command <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-&lt;</kbd>, which will move the cursor to "
"the beginning of the buffer, or with a key command such as <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-u 7 M-&lt;</kbd> which will move the cursor to a point 70% "
"of the way through the buffer.  If a number bigger than ten is used for the "
"argument, it moves to the end of the buffer."
msgstr ""
"前述の通り、引数なしで呼び出された場合、<code class=\"code\">beginning-of-"
"buffer</code> はカーソルをバッファの先頭（正確には、バッファのアクセス可能な"
"部分の先頭）に移動させ、マークは直前の位置に残したままにします。しかし、この"
"コマンドに1から10までの数値を指定して呼び出すと、関数はその数値をバッファ長の"
"10分の1単位の割合とみなし、Emacs はカーソルをバッファの先頭からその割合分だけ"
"移動させます。したがって、この関数をキーコマンド <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-&lt;</"
"kbd> で呼び出してカーソルをバッファの先頭に移動させることも、あるいは <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-u 7 M-&lt;</kbd> のようなキーコマンドでカーソルをバッファの"
"70%の位置まで移動させることも可能です。引数に10より大きい数値を指定した場合"
"は、バッファの末尾に移動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/beginning_002dof_002dbuffer.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">beginning-of-buffer</code> function can be called "
