#: build/html/eintr/car-cdr-_0026-cons.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In Lisp, <code class=\"code\">car</code>, <code class=\"code\">cdr</code>, "
"and <code class=\"code\">cons</code> are fundamental functions.  The <code "
"class=\"code\">cons</code> function is used to construct lists, and the "
"<code class=\"code\">car</code> and <code class=\"code\">cdr</code> "
"functions are used to take them apart."
