msgid ""
"As we have seen earlier (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Making-"
"Errors.html\">Generate an Error Message</a>), when the Emacs Lisp "
"interpreter has trouble evaluating an expression, it provides you with help; "
"in the jargon, this is called &ldquo;signaling an error&rdquo;.  Usually, "
"the computer stops the program and shows you a message."
msgstr ""
"前述の通り（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Making-Errors.html\">エラーメッセージの"
"生成</a>を参照）、Emacs Lispインタプリタが式の評価に問題を抱えた場合、ヘルプ"
"が表示されます。専門用語では、これを「エラーをシグナルする」と呼びます。通"
"常、コンピュータはプログラムを停止し、メッセージを表示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/condition_002dcase.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"However, some programs undertake complicated actions.  They should not "
"simply stop on an error.  In the <code class=\"code\">kill-region</code> "
"function, the most likely error is that you will try to kill text that is "
"read-only and cannot be removed.  So the <code class=\"code\">kill-region</"
"code> function contains code to handle this circumstance.  This code, which "
"makes up the body of the <code class=\"code\">kill-region</code> function, "
"is inside of a <code class=\"code\">condition-case</code> special form."
msgstr ""
"しかし、複雑な処理を行うプログラムもあります。そうしたプログラムは、単にエ"
"ラーで停止すべきではありません。<code class=\"code\">kill-region</code>関数に"
"おいて最も起こりやすいエラーは、読み取り専用で削除できないテキストを削除しよ"
"うとすることです。そのため、<code class=\"code\">kill-region</code>関数にはこ"
"の状況に対処するためのコードが含まれています。<code class=\"code\">kill-"
"region</code>関数の本体を構成するこのコードは、<code "
"class=\"code\">condition-case</code>特殊形式の中に記述されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/condition_002dcase.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The template for <code class=\"code\">condition-case</code> looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">condition-case</code>のテンプレートは次のようになってい"
"ます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/condition_002dcase.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(condition-case\n"
"  <var class=\"var\">var</var>\n"
"  <var class=\"var\">bodyform</var>\n"
"  <var class=\"var\">error-handler</var>...)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/condition_002dcase.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The second argument, <var class=\"var\">bodyform</var>, is straightforward.  "
"The <code class=\"code\">condition-case</code> special form causes the Lisp "
"interpreter to evaluate the code in <var class=\"var\">bodyform</var>.  If "
"no error occurs, the special form returns the code&rsquo;s value and "
"produces the side-effects, if any."
msgstr ""
"第2引数の <var class=\"var\">bodyform</var> は単純です。特殊形式 <code "
"class=\"code\">condition-case</code> は、Lispインタプリタに <var "
"class=\"var\">bodyform</var> 内のコードを評価させます。エラーが発生しなけれ"
"ば、この特殊形式はコードの値を返し、副作用があればそれを発生させます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/condition_002dcase.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In short, the <var class=\"var\">bodyform</var> part of a <code "
"class=\"code\">condition-case</code> expression determines what should "
"happen when everything works correctly."
msgstr ""
"要するに、<code class=\"code\">condition-case</code> 式の <var "
"class=\"var\">bodyform</var> の部分が、すべてが正常に動作した際に何が起こるか"
"を決定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/condition_002dcase.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"However, if an error occurs, among its other actions, the function "
"generating the error signal will define one or more error condition names."
msgstr ""
"ただし、エラーが発生した場合、エラー信号を生成する関数は、その他の処理の一環"
"として、1つ以上のエラー条件名を定義します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/condition_002dcase.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"An error handler is the third argument to <code class=\"code\">condition-"
"case</code>.  An error handler has two parts, a <var class=\"var\">condition-"
"name</var> and a <var class=\"var\">body</var>.  If the <var "
"class=\"var\">condition-name</var> part of an error handler matches a "
"condition name generated by an error, then the <var class=\"var\">body</var> "
"part of the error handler is run."
msgstr ""
"エラーハンドラは <code class=\"code\">condition-case</code> の第3引数です。エ"
"ラーハンドラは、<var class=\"var\">condition-name</var> と <var "
"class=\"var\">body</var> の2つの部分で構成されています。エラーハンドラの "
"<var class=\"var\">condition-name</var> 部分がエラーによって生成された条件名"
"と一致する場合、エラーハンドラの <var class=\"var\">body</var> 部分が実行され"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/condition_002dcase.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"As you will expect, the <var class=\"var\">condition-name</var> part of an "
"error handler may be either a single condition name or a list of condition "
"names."
msgstr ""
"ご想像の通り、エラーハンドラの <var class=\"var\">condition-name</var> 部分"
"は、単一の条件名または条件名のリストのいずれかになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/condition_002dcase.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Also, a complete <code class=\"code\">condition-case</code> expression may "
"contain more than one error handler.  When an error occurs, the first "
"applicable handler is run."
msgstr ""
"また、完全な <code class=\"code\">condition-case</code> 式には、複数のエラー"
"ハンドラを含めることができます。エラーが発生すると、最初に適用可能なハンドラ"
"が実行されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/condition_002dcase.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Lastly, the first argument to the <code class=\"code\">condition-case</code> "
"expression, the <var class=\"var\">var</var> argument, is sometimes bound to "
"a variable that contains information about the error.  However, if that "
"argument is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, as is the case in <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-region</code>, that information is discarded."
msgstr ""
"最後に、<code class=\"code\">condition-case</code> 式の第1引数である <var "
"class=\"var\">var</var> 引数は、エラーに関する情報を含む変数にバインドされる"
"ことがあります。ただし、<code class=\"code\">kill-region</code> の場合のよう"
"にその引数が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> である場合は、その情報は破棄され"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/condition_002dcase.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In brief, in the <code class=\"code\">kill-region</code> function, the code "
"<code class=\"code\">condition-case</code> works like this:"
msgstr ""
"簡単に言うと、<code class=\"code\">kill-region</code>関数において、コード"
"<code class=\"code\">condition-case</code>は次のように動作します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/condition_002dcase.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<var class=\"var\">If no errors</var>, <var class=\"var\">run only this code</var>\n"
"    <var class=\"var\">but</var>, <var class=\"var\">if errors</var>, <var class=\"var\">run this other code</var>.\n"
msgstr ""

