msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-copy_002dto_002dbuffer\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/copy_002dto_002dbuffer.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"After understanding how <code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code> works, "
"it is easy to understand <code class=\"code\">copy-to-buffer</code>.  This "
"function copies text into a buffer, but instead of adding to the second "
"buffer, it replaces all the previous text in the second buffer."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code>の仕組みを理解すれば、<code "
"class=\"code\">copy-to-buffer</code>を理解するのは簡単です。この関数はテキス"
"トをバッファにコピーしますが、2つ目のバッファに追加するのではなく、2つ目の"
"バッファにあるそれまでのすべてのテキストを置き換えます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/copy_002dto_002dbuffer.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The body of <code class=\"code\">copy-to-buffer</code> looks like this,"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">copy-to-buffer</code>の本体はこんな感じで、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/copy_002dto_002dbuffer.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"...\n"
"(interactive &quot;BCopy to buffer: \\nr&quot;)\n"
"(let ((oldbuf (current-buffer)))\n"
"  (with-current-buffer (get-buffer-create buffer)\n"
"    (barf-if-buffer-read-only)\n"
"    (erase-buffer)\n"
"    (save-excursion\n"
"      (insert-buffer-substring oldbuf start end)))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/copy_002dto_002dbuffer.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">copy-to-buffer</code> function has a simpler <code "
"class=\"code\">interactive</code> expression than <code "
"class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">copy-to-buffer</code> 関数は、<code "
"class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code> よりもシンプルな <code "
"class=\"code\">interactive</code> 式を持っています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/copy_002dto_002dbuffer.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The definition then says"
msgstr "すると、定義には次のようにあります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/copy_002dto_002dbuffer.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(with-current-buffer (get-buffer-create buffer) ...\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/copy_002dto_002dbuffer.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"First, look at the earliest inner expression; that is evaluated first.  That "
"expression starts with <code class=\"code\">get-buffer-create buffer</"
"code>.  The function tells the computer to use the buffer with the name "
"specified as the one to which you are copying, or if such a buffer does not "
"exist, to create it.  Then, the <code class=\"code\">with-current-buffer</"
"code> function evaluates its body with that buffer temporarily current, "
"after which it will switch back to the buffer we are at now<a "
"class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF12\" href=\"#FOOT12\"><sup>12</sup></a>."
msgstr ""
"まず、最も内側にある式を確認してください。それが最初に評価されます。その式は "
"<code class=\"code\">get-buffer-create buffer</code> で始まっています。この関"
"数は、コピー先として指定された名前のバッファを使用するか、そのようなバッファ"
"が存在しない場合は新たに作成するようにコンピュータに指示します。次に、<code "
"class=\"code\">with-current-buffer</code> 関数はそのバッファを一時的に有効に"
"した状態で本体を評価し、その後、現在使用しているバッファに戻ります<a "
"class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF12\" href=\"#FOOT12\"><sup>12</sup></a>。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/copy_002dto_002dbuffer.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(This demonstrates another way to shift the computer&rsquo;s attention but "
"not the user&rsquo;s.  The <code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code> "
"function showed how to do the same with <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</"
"code> and <code class=\"code\">set-buffer</code>.  <code class=\"code\">with-"
"current-buffer</code> is a newer, and arguably easier, mechanism.)"
msgstr ""
"（これは、ユーザーではなくコンピュータの注意をそらす別の方法を示すものです。"
"<code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code> 関数では、<code "
"class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> や <code class=\"code\">set-buffer</"
"code> を用いて同様の処理を行う方法を示しました。<code class=\"code\">with-"
"current-buffer</code> はより新しく、おそらくより簡便な仕組みです。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/copy_002dto_002dbuffer.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">barf-if-buffer-read-only</code> function sends you "
"an error message saying the buffer is read-only if you cannot modify it."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">barf-if-buffer-read-only</code> 関数は、バッファを変更で"
"きない場合に、バッファが読み取り専用である旨のエラーメッセージを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/copy_002dto_002dbuffer.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The next line has the <code class=\"code\">erase-buffer</code> function as "
"its sole contents.  That function erases the buffer."
msgstr ""
"次の行は、<code class=\"code\">erase-buffer</code> 関数のみを記述しています。"
"この関数はバッファを消去します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/copy_002dto_002dbuffer.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Finally, the last two lines contain the <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</"
"code> expression with <code class=\"code\">insert-buffer-substring</code> as "
"its body.  The <code class=\"code\">insert-buffer-substring</code> "
"expression copies the text from the buffer you are in (and you have not seen "
"the computer shift its attention, so you don&rsquo;t know that that buffer "
"is now called <code class=\"code\">oldbuf</code>)."
