"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Counting-words-in-a-defun-1\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/count_002dwords_002din_002ddefun.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"We have seen that there are several ways to write a <code "
"class=\"code\">count-words-region</code> function.  To write a <code "
"class=\"code\">count-words-in-defun</code>, we need merely adapt one of "
"these versions."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">count-words-region</code> 関数の書き方にはいくつかの方法"
"があることが分かりました。<code class=\"code\">count-words-in-defun</code> を"
"書くには、これらの形式のいずれかを適宜調整すればよいだけです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/count_002dwords_002din_002ddefun.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The version that uses a <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop is easy to "
"understand, so I am going to adapt that.  Because <code class=\"code\">count-"
"words-in-defun</code> will be part of a more complex program, it need not be "
"interactive and it need not display a message but just return the count.  "
"These considerations simplify the definition a little."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">while</code> ループを使用しているバージョンは分かりやす"
"いため、それを流用することにします。<code class=\"code\">count-words-in-"
"defun</code> はより複雑なプログラムの一部となるため、インタラクティブである必"
"要はなく、メッセージを表示する必要もなく、単にカウントを返すだけで構いませ"
"ん。こうした点を考慮することで、定義が少し簡素化されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/count_002dwords_002din_002ddefun.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"On the other hand, <code class=\"code\">count-words-in-defun</code> will be "
"used within a buffer that contains function definitions.  Consequently, it "
"is reasonable to ask that the function determine whether it is called when "
"point is within a function definition, and if it is, to return the count for "
"that definition.  This adds complexity to the definition, but saves us from "
"needing to pass arguments to the function."
msgstr ""
"一方で、<code class=\"code\">count-words-in-defun</code> は関数定義を含むバッ"
"ファ内で使用されます。したがって、ポイントが関数定義内にあるときに呼び出され"
"たかどうかを関数側で判定し、そうであればその定義のカウントを返すように求める"
"のは妥当でしょう。これにより定義の複雑さは増しますが、関数に引数を渡す必要が"
"なくなります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
