#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"We are presuming that this function will be called within a buffer "
"containing function definitions.  Point will either be within a function "
"definition or not.  For <code class=\"code\">count-words-in-defun</code> to "
"work, point must move to the beginning of the definition, a counter must "
"start at zero, and the counting loop must stop when point reaches the end of "
"the definition."
msgstr ""
"この関数は、関数定義を含むバッファ内で呼び出されるものと想定しています。point"
"は関数定義内にある場合とない場合があります。<code class=\"code\">count-words-"
"in-defun</code>を動作させるには、pointが定義の先頭に移動し、カウンタが0から開"
"始され、かつpointが定義の末尾に達したときにカウントループが停止する必要があり"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/count_002dwords_002din_002ddefun.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">beginning-of-defun</code> function searches "
"backwards for an opening delimiter such as a &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">(</"
"samp>&rsquo; at the beginning of a line, and moves point to that position, "
"or else to the limit of the search.  In practice, this means that <code "
"class=\"code\">beginning-of-defun</code> moves point to the beginning of an "
"enclosing or preceding function definition, or else to the beginning of the "
"buffer.  We can use <code class=\"code\">beginning-of-defun</code> to place "
"point where we wish to start."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">beginning-of-defun</code> 関数は、行頭にある &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">(</samp>&rsquo; のような開始デリミタを後方から検索し、ポ"
"イントをその位置、あるいは検索範囲の終端まで移動させます。実際には、<code "
"class=\"code\">beginning-of-defun</code> はポイントを囲んでいる関数定義や直前"
"の関数定義の先頭、あるいはバッファの先頭まで移動させます。<code "
"class=\"code\">beginning-of-defun</code> を使えば、任意の開始位置にポイントを"
"置くことができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/count_002dwords_002din_002ddefun.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop requires a counter to keep track "
"of the words or symbols being counted.  A <code class=\"code\">let</code> "
"expression can be used to create a local variable for this purpose, and bind "
"it to an initial value of zero."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">while</code> ループでは、カウント対象の単語や記号を管理"
"するためのカウンタが必要です。<code class=\"code\">let</code> 式を使用してこ"
"の目的のためのローカル変数を作成し、初期値として 0 を代入することができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/count_002dwords_002din_002ddefun.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">end-of-defun</code> function works like <code "
"class=\"code\">beginning-of-defun</code> except that it moves point to the "
"end of the definition.  <code class=\"code\">end-of-defun</code> can be used "
"as part of an expression that determines the position of the end of the "
"definition."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">end-of-defun</code> 関数は、ポイントを定義の末尾に移動さ"
"せる点を除けば、<code class=\"code\">beginning-of-defun</code> と同様に動作し"
"ます。<code class=\"code\">end-of-defun</code> は、定義の末尾の位置を決定する"
"式の一部として使用できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/count_002dwords_002din_002ddefun.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The set up for <code class=\"code\">count-words-in-defun</code> takes shape "
"rapidly: first we move point to the beginning of the definition, then we "
"create a local variable to hold the count, and finally, we record the "
"position of the end of the definition so the <code class=\"code\">while</"
"code> loop will know when to stop looping."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">count-words-in-defun</code> のセットアップは迅速に形にな"
"ります。まずポイントを定義の先頭に移動し、次にカウントを保持するためのローカ"
"ル変数を作成し、最後に <code class=\"code\">while</code> ループがいつ終了すべ"
"きかを判断できるよう、定義の末尾の位置を記録します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/count_002dwords_002din_002ddefun.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(beginning-of-defun)\n"
"(let ((count 0)\n"
"      (end (save-excursion (end-of-defun) (point))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/count_002dwords_002din_002ddefun.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The code is simple.  The only slight complication is likely to concern <code "
"class=\"code\">end</code>: it is bound to the position of the end of the "
"definition by a <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> expression that "
"returns the value of point after <code class=\"code\">end-of-defun</code> "
"temporarily moves it to the end of the definition."
msgstr ""
"コードはシンプルです。唯一のわずかな複雑さは、おそらく <code "
"class=\"code\">end</code> に関するものでしょう。これは、<code "
"class=\"code\">end-of-defun</code> が一時的にポイントを定義の末尾に移動させた"
"後の値を返す <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> 式によって、定義の末"
"尾の位置に結び付けられています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/count_002dwords_002din_002ddefun.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The second part of the <code class=\"code\">count-words-in-defun</code>, "
"after the set up, is the <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">count-words-in-defun</code>のセットアップに続く後半部分"
"は、<code class=\"code\">while</code>のループです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/count_002dwords_002din_002ddefun.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The loop must contain an expression that jumps point forward word by word "
"and symbol by symbol, and another expression that counts the jumps.  The "
"true-or-false-test for the <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop should "
"test true so long as point should jump forward, and false when point is at "
"the end of the definition.  We have already redefined the regular expression "
"for this, so the loop is straightforward:"
msgstr ""
"ループには、pointを単語単位および記号単位で前方へジャンプさせる式と、そのジャ"
"ンプ回数をカウントする別の式を含める必要があります。<code "
"class=\"code\">while</code>ループの真偽判定は、pointが前方へジャンプすべき限"
"りtrueとなり、pointが定義の末尾にあるときはfalseとなるべきです。これに関する"
"正規表現はすでに再定義済みであるため、ループの実装は単純です："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/count_002dwords_002din_002ddefun.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(while (and (&lt; (point) end)\n"
"            (re-search-forward\n"
"             &quot;\\\\(\\\\w\\\\|\\\\s_\\\\)+[^ \\t\\n]*[ \\t\\n]*&quot; end t))\n"
"  (setq count (1+ count)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/count_002dwords_002din_002ddefun.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The third part of the function definition returns the count of words and "
"symbols.  This part is the last expression within the body of the <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> expression, and can be, very simply, the local "
"variable <code class=\"code\">count</code>, which when evaluated returns the "
"count."
msgstr ""
"関数定義の第3部分は、単語と記号の数を返します。この部分は <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> 式の本体における最後の式であり、ごく単純に、評価時"
"にその数を返すローカル変数 <code class=\"code\">count</code> である場合があり"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/count_002dwords_002din_002ddefun.html
