#: build/html/eintr/current_002dkill.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">current-kill</code> function changes the element in "
"the kill ring to which <code class=\"code\">kill-ring-yank-pointer</code> "
"points.  (Also, the <code class=\"code\">kill-new</code> function sets <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-ring-yank-pointer</code> to point to the latest element "
"of the kill ring.  The <code class=\"code\">kill-new</code> function is used "
"directly or indirectly by <code class=\"code\">kill-append</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">copy-region-as-kill</code>, <code class=\"code\">kill-ring-"
"save</code>, <code class=\"code\">kill-line</code>, and <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-region</code>.)"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">current-kill</code> 関数は、<code class=\"code\">kill-"
"ring-yank-pointer</code> が指すキルリング内の要素を変更します。（また、<code "
"class=\"code\">kill-new</code> 関数は <code class=\"code\">kill-ring-yank-"
"pointer</code> がキルリングの最新の要素を指すように設定します。<code "
"class=\"code\">kill-new</code> 関数は、<code class=\"code\">kill-append</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">copy-region-as-kill</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">kill-ring-save</code>、<code class=\"code\">kill-line</code>、"
"および <code class=\"code\">kill-region</code> によって直接的または間接的に使"
"用されます。）"

