# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/debug.html
msgid ""
"Suppose you have written a function definition that is intended to return "
"the sum of the numbers 1 through a given number.  (This is the <code "
"class=\"code\">triangle</code> function discussed earlier.  See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Decrementing-Example.html\">Example with Decrementing "
"Counter</a>, for a discussion.)"
msgstr ""
"1から指定された数値までの合計を返すことを目的とした関数定義を記述したとしま"
"す。（これは前述の<code class=\"code\">triangle</code>関数です。解説について"
"は<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Decrementing-Example.html\">デクリメントカウンタの"
"例</a>を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/debug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"However, your function definition has a bug.  You have mistyped &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">1=</samp>&rsquo; for &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">1-</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  Here is the broken definition:"
msgstr ""
"ただし、関数の定義にバグがあります。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">1-</"
"samp>&rsquo; を &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">1=</samp>&rsquo; と打ち間違えてい"
"ます。誤った定義は以下の通りです："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/debug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-triangle_002dbugged\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-triangle_002dbugged\"></a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/debug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun triangle-bugged (number)\n"
"  &quot;Return sum of numbers 1 through NUMBER inclusive.&quot;\n"
"  (let ((total 0))\n"
"    (while (&gt; number 0)\n"
"      (setq total (+ total number))\n"
"      (setq number (1= number)))      ; <span class=\"r\">Error here.</span>\n"
"    total))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/debug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If you are reading this in Info, you can evaluate this definition in the "
"normal fashion.  You will see <code class=\"code\">triangle-bugged</code> "
"appear in the echo area."
msgstr ""
"Infoでこれを読んでいる場合は、通常通りにこの定義を確認できます。エコー領域に "
"<code class=\"code\">triangle-bugged</code> が表示されるはずです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/debug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Now evaluate the <code class=\"code\">triangle-bugged</code> function with "
"an argument of 4:"
msgstr ""
"次に、引数に4を指定して<code class=\"code\">triangle-bugged</code>関数を評価"
"します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/debug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(triangle-bugged 4)\n"
msgstr ""

