# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/debug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(I have reformatted this example slightly; the debugger does not fold long "
"lines.  As usual, you can quit the debugger by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">q</"
"kbd> in the <samp class=\"file\">*Backtrace*</samp> buffer.)"
msgstr ""
"（この例は若干体裁を整えています。デバッガは長い行を折り畳まないためです。通"
"常通り、<samp class=\"file\">*Backtrace*</samp>バッファに<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">q</kbd>と入力することでデバッガを終了できます。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/debug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In practice, for a bug as simple as this, the Lisp error line will tell you "
"what you need to know to correct the definition.  The function <code "
"class=\"code\">1=</code> is void."
msgstr ""
"実際には、これほど単純なバグであれば、Lispのエラー行を見れば定義を修正するた"
"めに何を知るべきかが分かります。関数 <code class=\"code\">1=</code> は void "
"です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/debug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"However, suppose you are not quite certain what is going on? You can read "
"the complete backtrace."
msgstr ""
"ただ、何が起きているのかよく分からない場合はどうでしょうか。バックトレースの"
"全文を確認できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/debug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Emacs automatically starts the debugger that puts you in the <samp "
"class=\"file\">*Backtrace*</samp> buffer.  You can also start the debugger "
"manually as described below."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは自動的にデバッガを起動し、<samp class=\"file\">*Backtrace*</samp>バッ"
"ファを表示します。また、以下に説明するように、手動でデバッガを起動することも"
"可能です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/debug.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Read the <samp class=\"file\">*Backtrace*</samp> buffer from the bottom up; "
"it tells you what Emacs did that led to the error.  Emacs made an "
"interactive call to <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">eval-last-sexp</code>), which led to the evaluation of the "
"<code class=\"code\">triangle-bugged</code> expression.  Each line above "
"tells you what the Lisp interpreter evaluated next."
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">*Backtrace*</samp> バッファを下から上に向かって読み進め"
"てください。そこには、エラーに至った Emacs の動作が記されています。Emacs が "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">eval-last-sexp</"
"code>) をインタラクティブに呼び出し、それが <code class=\"code\">triangle-"
"bugged</code> 式の評価につながりました。その上の各行は、Lisp インタプリタが次"
"に何を評価したかを示しています。"

