#: build/html/eintr/defcustom.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "This message is only a warning.  If you click on the button to"
msgstr "このメッセージはあくまで警告です。ボタンをクリックすると、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/defcustom.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save for Future Sessions\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/defcustom.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Emacs will write a <code class=\"code\">custom-set-&hellip;</code> "
"expression near the end of your <samp class=\"file\">.emacs</samp> file that "
"will be evaluated after your hand-written expression.  It will, therefore, "
"overrule your hand-written expression.  No harm will be done.  When you do "
"this, however, be careful to remember which expression is active; if you "
"forget, you may confuse yourself."
msgstr ""
"Emacsは、<samp class=\"file\">.emacs</samp>ファイルの末尾付近に<code "
"class=\"code\">custom-set-&hellip;</code>式を書き込みます。これは、手書きの式"
"よりも後に評価されます。したがって、手書きの式を上書きすることになります。特"
"に問題はありません。ただし、この操作を行う際は、どの式が有効になっているかを"
"忘れずに確認してください。忘れてしまうと、混乱を招く恐れがあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/defcustom.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"So long as you remember where the values are set, you will have no trouble.  "
"In any event, the values are always set in your initialization file, which "
"is usually called <samp class=\"file\">.emacs</samp>."
msgstr ""
"値の設定箇所さえ覚えていれば、困ることはありません。いずれにせよ、値は常に初"
"期化ファイル（通常は <samp class=\"file\">.emacs</samp> と呼ばれます）で設定"
"されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/defcustom.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"I myself use <code class=\"code\">customize</code> for hardly anything.  "
"Mostly, I write expressions myself."
msgstr ""
"私自身、<code class=\"code\">customize</code>を使うことはほとんどありません。"
"大抵は自前で式を書いています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
