msgid ""
"<span>11.2 Save your time: <code class=\"code\">dolist</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">dotimes</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Save-your-"
"time_003a-dolist-and-dotimes\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>11.2 時間を節約する: <code class=\"code\">dolist</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">dotimes</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#Save-your-"
"time_003a-dolist-and-dotimes\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/dolist-dotimes.html
msgid ""
"In addition to <code class=\"code\">while</code>, both <code "
"class=\"code\">dolist</code> and <code class=\"code\">dotimes</code> provide "
"for looping.  Sometimes these are quicker to write than the equivalent <code "
"class=\"code\">while</code> loop.  Both are Lisp macros.  (See <a data-"
"manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/"
"elisp/Macros.html#Macros\">Macros</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs "
"Lisp Reference Manual</cite>. )"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">while</code> に加えて、<code class=\"code\">dolist</"
"code> と <code class=\"code\">dotimes</code> はいずれもループ処理が可能です。"
"場合によっては、同等の <code class=\"code\">while</code> ループよりも記述が簡"
"潔になることがあります。どちらも Lisp マクロです。（<cite class=\"cite\">The "
"GNU Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"elisp\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/"
"Macros.html#Macros\">Macros</a> を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/dolist-dotimes.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">dolist</code> works like a <code class=\"code\">while</"
"code> loop that <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>s down a list: <code "
"class=\"code\">dolist</code> automatically shortens the list each time it "
"loops&mdash;takes the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of the list&mdash;and "
"binds the <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> of each shorter version of the "
"list to the first of its arguments."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">dolist</code> は、リストを <small class=\"sc\">CDR</"
"small> で辿る <code class=\"code\">while</code> ループのように動作します。"
"<code class=\"code\">dolist</code> はループするたびに自動的にリストを短縮し"
"&mdash;リストの <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> を取得し&mdash;、短縮された各"
"バージョンのリストの <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> を、その第1引数にバイン"
"ドします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
