#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/dolist.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Suppose, for example, you want to reverse a list, so that "
"&ldquo;first&rdquo; &ldquo;second&rdquo; &ldquo;third&rdquo; becomes "
"&ldquo;third&rdquo; &ldquo;second&rdquo; &ldquo;first&rdquo;."
msgstr ""
"例えば、リストを反転させて、「first」「second」「third」が「third」「second」"
"「first」になるようにしたいとします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/dolist.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In practice, you would use the <code class=\"code\">reverse</code> function, "
"like this:"
msgstr ""
"実際には、次のように <code class=\"code\">reverse</code> 関数を使用します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/dolist.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq animals '(gazelle giraffe lion tiger))\n"
"\n"
"(reverse animals)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/dolist.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Here is how you could reverse the list using a <code class=\"code\">while</"
"code> loop:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">while</code>ループを使ってリストを逆順にするには、次のよ"
"うにします。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/dolist.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq animals '(gazelle giraffe lion tiger))\n"
"\n"
"(defun reverse-list-with-while (list)\n"
"  &quot;Using while, reverse the order of LIST.&quot;\n"
"  (let (value)  ; make sure list starts empty\n"
"    (while list\n"
"      (setq value (cons (car list) value))\n"
"      (setq list (cdr list)))\n"
"    value))\n"
"\n"
"(reverse-list-with-while animals)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/dolist.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"And here is how you could use the <code class=\"code\">dolist</code> macro:"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">dolist</code> マクロの使い方は以下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/dolist.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq animals '(gazelle giraffe lion tiger))\n"
"\n"
"(defun reverse-list-with-dolist (list)\n"
"  &quot;Using dolist, reverse the order of LIST.&quot;\n"
"  (let (value)  ; make sure list starts empty\n"
"    (dolist (element list value)\n"
"      (setq value (cons element value)))))\n"
"\n"
"(reverse-list-with-dolist animals)\n"
msgstr ""

