# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/dolist.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "in the echo area."
msgstr "エコー領域で。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/dolist.html
msgid ""
"For this example, the existing <code class=\"code\">reverse</code> function "
"is obviously best.  The <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop is just like "
"our first example (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"Loop-Example.html\">A <code "
"class=\"code\">while</code> Loop and a List</a>).  The <code "
"class=\"code\">while</code> first checks whether the list has elements; if "
"so, it constructs a new list by adding the first element of the list to the "
"existing list (which in the first iteration of the loop is <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>).  Since the second element is prepended in front "
"of the first element, and the third element is prepended in front of the "
"second element, the list is reversed."
msgstr ""
"この例では、既存の <code class=\"code\">reverse</code> 関数が最適であることは"
"明らかです。<code class=\"code\">while</code> ループは、最初の例（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Loop-Example.html\"><code class=\"code\">while</code> "
"ループとリスト</a> を参照）と同様です。<code class=\"code\">while</code> はま"
"ずリストに要素があるかを確認し、あればリストの最初の要素を既存のリスト（ルー"
"プの初回反復では <code class=\"code\">nil</code>）に追加して新しいリストを構"
"築します。2番目の要素が1番目の要素の前に、3番目の要素が2番目の要素の前にそれ"
"ぞれ追加されるため、リストは逆順になります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/dolist.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In the expression using a <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop, the <code "
"class=\"code\">(setq&nbsp;list&nbsp;(cdr&nbsp;list))</code> expression "
"shortens the list, so the <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop eventually "
"stops.  In addition, it provides the <code class=\"code\">cons</code> "
"expression with a new first element by creating a new and shorter list at "
"each repetition of the loop."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">while</code> ループを用いた式では、<code "
"class=\"code\">(setq&nbsp;list&nbsp;(cdr&nbsp;list))</code> 式によってリスト"
"が短縮されるため、最終的に <code class=\"code\">while</code> ループが停止しま"
"す。さらに、ループが繰り返されるたびに新しくより短いリストを作成することで、"
"<code class=\"code\">cons</code> 式に新たな先頭要素を提供します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/dolist.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">dolist</code> expression does very much the same as "
"the <code class=\"code\">while</code> expression, except that the <code "
"class=\"code\">dolist</code> macro does some of the work you have to do when "
"writing a <code class=\"code\">while</code> expression."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">dolist</code> 式は <code class=\"code\">while</code> 式"
"とほぼ同様に動作しますが、<code class=\"code\">dolist</code> マクロは <code "
"class=\"code\">while</code> 式を記述する際に必要となる処理の一部を担っていま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/dolist.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Like a <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop, a <code "
"class=\"code\">dolist</code> loops.  What is different is that it "
"automatically shortens the list each time it loops&mdash;it <small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small>s down the list on its own&mdash;and it "
"automatically binds the <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> of each shorter "
"version of the list to the first of its arguments."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">while</code> ループと同様に、<code "
"class=\"code\">dolist</code> もループします。異なる点は、ループするたびに自動"
"的にリストを短縮すること&mdash;自らリストを <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> "
"で辿っていく&mdash;そして、短縮された各バージョンのリストの <small "
"class=\"sc\">CAR</small> を、最初の引数に自動的にバインドすることです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/dolist.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In the example, the <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> of each shorter version "
"of the list is referred to using the symbol &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">element</samp>&rsquo;, the list itself is called &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">list</samp>&rsquo;, and the value returned is called &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">value</samp>&rsquo;.  The remainder of the <code "
"class=\"code\">dolist</code> expression is the body."
msgstr ""
"この例では、リストの各短縮版の <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> を記号 &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">element</samp>&rsquo; で参照し、リスト自体を &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">list</samp>&rsquo; 、返される値を &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">value</samp>&rsquo; と呼んでいます。<code "
"class=\"code\">dolist</code> 式の残りの部分は本体となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/dolist.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">dolist</code> expression binds the <small "
"class=\"sc\">CAR</small> of each shorter version of the list to <code "
"class=\"code\">element</code> and then evaluates the body of the expression; "
"and repeats the loop.  The result is returned in <code class=\"code\">value</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">dolist</code> 式は、リストの各短縮版の <small "
"class=\"sc\">CAR</small> を <code class=\"code\">element</code> にバインド"
"し、その後式の本体を評価して、ループを繰り返します。結果は <code "
"class=\"code\">value</code> に返されます。"

