msgstr ""
"<span><code class=\"code\">dotimes</code> マクロ<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#The-dotimes-Macro\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/dotimes.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dotimes\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-dotimes\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/dotimes.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">dotimes</code> macro is similar to <code "
"class=\"code\">dolist</code>, except that it loops a specific number of "
"times."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">dotimes</code> マクロは <code class=\"code\">dolist</"
"code> と同様ですが、特定の回数だけループする点が異なります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/dotimes.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The first argument to <code class=\"code\">dotimes</code> is assigned the "
"numbers 0, 1, 2 and so forth each time around the loop.  You need to provide "
"the value of the second argument, which is how many times the macro loops."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">dotimes</code> の第1引数には、ループが回るたびに 0, 1, "
"2 といった数値が代入されます。第2引数の値、つまりマクロが何回ループするかを指"
"定する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/dotimes.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"For example, the following binds the numbers from 0 up to, but not "
"including, the number 3 to the first argument, <var class=\"var\">number</"
"var>, and then constructs a list of the three numbers.  (The first number is "
"0, the second number is 1, and the third number is 2; this makes a total of "
"three numbers in all, starting with zero as the first number.)"
msgstr ""
"例えば、以下では0から3未満までの数値を第1引数 <var class=\"var\">number</"
"var> にバインドし、3つの数値からなるリストを構築します。（1番目の数値は0、2番"
"目の数値は1、3番目の数値は2であり、0を1番目として合計3つの数値となります。）"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/dotimes.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let (value)      ; otherwise a value is a void variable\n"
"  (dotimes (number 3)\n"
"    (setq value (cons number value)))\n"
"  value)\n"
"\n"
"&rArr; (2 1 0)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/dotimes.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The way to use <code class=\"code\">dotimes</code> is to operate on some "
"expression <var class=\"var\">number</var> number of times and then return "
"the result, either as a list or an atom."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">dotimes</code> の使い方は、ある式 <var "
"class=\"var\">number</var> に対して数回演算を行い、その結果をリストまたはアト"
"ムとして返すというものです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/dotimes.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Here is an example of a <code class=\"code\">defun</code> that uses <code "
"class=\"code\">dotimes</code> to add up the number of pebbles in a triangle."
msgstr ""
"以下は、<code class=\"code\">dotimes</code> を用いて三角形の中にある小石の数"
"を合計する <code class=\"code\">defun</code> の例です。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/dotimes.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun triangle-using-dotimes (number-of-rows)\n"
"  &quot;Using `dotimes', add up the number of pebbles in a triangle.&quot;\n"
"(let ((total 0))  ; otherwise a total is a void variable\n"
"  (dotimes (number number-of-rows)\n"
"    (setq total (+ total (1+ number))))\n"
"  total))\n"
"\n"
"(triangle-using-dotimes 4)\n"
msgstr ""

