msgstr ""
"<span>3.8 If&ndash;then&ndash;else 式<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#If_002d_002dthen_002d_002delse-Expressions\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/else.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Else\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Else\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/else.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"An <code class=\"code\">if</code> expression may have an optional third "
"argument, called the <em class=\"dfn\">else-part</em>, for the case when the "
"true-or-false-test returns false.  When this happens, the second argument or "
"then-part of the overall <code class=\"code\">if</code> expression is <em "
"class=\"emph\">not</em> evaluated, but the third or else-part <em "
"class=\"emph\">is</em> evaluated.  You might think of this as the cloudy day "
"alternative for the decision &ldquo;if it is warm and sunny, then go to the "
"beach, else read a book!&rdquo;."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">if</code> 式には、true-or-false 判定が false を返した場"
"合のための、<em class=\"dfn\">else-part</em> と呼ばれる任意の第3引数を指定で"
"きます。このとき、全体の <code class=\"code\">if</code> 式の第2引数（then-"
"part）は <em class=\"emph\">評価されません</em>が、第3引数（else-part）は "
"<em class=\"emph\">評価されます</em>。これは、「暖かくて晴れているならビーチ"
"へ、そうでなければ本を読もう！」という判断に対する、「曇りの日」の代替案のよ"
"うなものだと考えればよいでしょう。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/else.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The word &ldquo;else&rdquo; is not written in the Lisp code; the else-part "
"of an <code class=\"code\">if</code> expression comes after the then-part.  "
"In the written Lisp, the else-part is usually written to start on a line of "
"its own and is indented less than the then-part:"
msgstr ""
"Lispコードには「else」という単語は記述されません。<code class=\"code\">if</"
"code>式のelse部分はthen部分の後に続きます。記述形式のLispでは、else部分は通"
"常、独立した行から書き始められ、then部分よりもインデントを浅くします："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/else.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(if <var class=\"var\">true-or-false-test</var>\n"
"    <var class=\"var\">action-to-carry-out-if-the-test-returns-true</var>\n"
"  <var class=\"var\">action-to-carry-out-if-the-test-returns-false</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/else.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"For example, the following <code class=\"code\">if</code> expression prints "
"the message &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">4 is not greater than 5!</"
"samp>&rsquo; when you evaluate it in the usual way:"
msgstr ""
"例えば、以下の <code class=\"code\">if</code> 式を通常の方法で評価すると、"
"メッセージ &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">4 is not greater than 5!</"
"samp>&rsquo; が出力されます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/else.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(if (&gt; 4 5)                               ; <span class=\"r\">if-part</span>\n"
"    (message &quot;4 falsely greater than 5!&quot;) ; <span class=\"r\">then-part</span>\n"
"  (message &quot;4 is not greater than 5!&quot;))   ; <span class=\"r\">else-part</span>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/else.html
msgid ""
"Note that the different levels of indentation make it easy to distinguish "
"the then-part from the else-part.  (GNU Emacs has several commands that "
"automatically indent <code class=\"code\">if</code> expressions correctly.  "
"See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Typing-Lists.html\">GNU Emacs Helps You Type "
"Lists</a>.)"
msgstr ""
"インデントのレベルが異なるため、then部分とelse部分を容易に区別できる点に注意"
"してください。（GNU Emacsには、<code class=\"code\">if</code>式を正しく自動イ"
"ンデントするコマンドがいくつか用意されています。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Typing-Lists.html\">GNU Emacs Helps You Type Lists</a>を参照してくださ"
"い。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/else.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"We can extend the <code class=\"code\">type-of-animal</code> function to "
"include an else-part by simply incorporating an additional part to the <code "
"class=\"code\">if</code> expression."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">if</code> 式に別の部分を追加するだけで、<code "
"class=\"code\">type-of-animal</code> 関数を拡張して else 節を含めることができ"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/else.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"You can see the consequences of doing this if you evaluate the following "
"version of the <code class=\"code\">type-of-animal</code> function "
"definition to install it and then evaluate the two subsequent expressions to "
"pass different arguments to the function."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">type-of-animal</code> 関数定義の以下のバージョンを評価し"
"てインストールし、続いて2つの式を評価して関数に異なる引数を渡すことで、このよ"
"うな操作を行った際の結果を確認できます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/else.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun type-of-animal (characteristic)  ; <span class=\"r\">Second version.</span>\n"
"  &quot;Print message in echo area depending on CHARACTERISTIC.\n"
"If the CHARACTERISTIC is the string \\&quot;fierce\\&quot;,\n"
"then warn of a tiger; else say it is not fierce.&quot;\n"
"  (if (equal characteristic &quot;fierce&quot;)\n"
"      (message &quot;It is a tiger!&quot;)\n"
"    (message &quot;It is not fierce!&quot;)))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><br><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/else.html build/html/eintr/if-in-more-detail.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(type-of-animal &quot;fierce&quot;)\n"
"\n"
"(type-of-animal &quot;striped&quot;)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><br><p>
#: build/html/eintr/else.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"When you evaluate <code class=\"code\">(type-of-animal &quot;fierce&quot;)</"
"code>, you will see the following message printed in the echo area: <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;It is a tiger!&quot;</code>; but when you evaluate "
"<code class=\"code\">(type-of-animal &quot;striped&quot;)</code>, you will "
"see <code class=\"code\">&quot;It is not fierce!&quot;</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(type-of-animal &quot;fierce&quot;)</code> を評価する"
"と、エコー領域に次のようなメッセージが出力されます：<code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;It is a tiger!&quot;</code>。一方、<code "
"class=\"code\">(type-of-animal &quot;striped&quot;)</code> を評価すると、"
"<code class=\"code\">&quot;It is not fierce!&quot;</code> が表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><br><p>
#: build/html/eintr/else.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(Of course, if the <var class=\"var\">characteristic</var> were <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;ferocious&quot;</code>, the message <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;It is not fierce!&quot;</code> would be printed; and it "
"would be misleading! When you write code, you need to take into account the "
"possibility that some such argument will be tested by the <code "
"class=\"code\">if</code> and write your program accordingly.)"
msgstr ""
"（もちろん、もし <var class=\"var\">characteristic</var> が <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;ferocious&quot;</code> であれば、メッセージ <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;It is not fierce!&quot;</code> が出力されることになり、"
"それは誤解を招くことになります！コードを書く際は、こうした引数のいずれかが "
"<code class=\"code\">if</code> でテストされる可能性を考慮し、それに応じてプロ"
"グラムを記述する必要があります。）"

