# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-let.html
msgid ""
"The next line of the <code class=\"code\">forward-paragraph</code> function "
"begins a <code class=\"code\">let*</code> expression (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"append-save_002dexcursion.html#let_002a-introduced\"><code "
"class=\"code\">let*</code> introduced</a>), in which Emacs binds a total of "
"seven variables: <code class=\"code\">opoint</code>, <code "
"class=\"code\">fill-prefix-regexp</code>, <code class=\"code\">parstart</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">parsep</code>, <code class=\"code\">sp-parstart</"
"code>, <code class=\"code\">start</code>, and <code class=\"code\">found-"
"start</code>.  The first part of the <code class=\"code\">let*</code> "
"expression looks like below:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">forward-paragraph</code> 関数の次の行では <code "
"class=\"code\">let*</code> 式（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"append-"
"save_002dexcursion.html#let_002a-introduced\"><code class=\"code\">let*</"
"code> の導入を参照</a>）が始まり、そこで Emacs は <code "
"class=\"code\">opoint</code>、<code class=\"code\">fill-prefix-regexp</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">parstart</code>、<code class=\"code\">parsep</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">sp-parstart</code>、<code class=\"code\">start</"
"code>、<code class=\"code\">found-start</code> の計 7 つの変数をバインドしま"
"す。<code class=\"code\">let*</code> 式の前半部分は以下のようになります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let* ((opoint (point))\n"
"       (fill-prefix-regexp\n"
"        (and fill-prefix (not (equal fill-prefix &quot;&quot;))\n"
"             (not paragraph-ignore-fill-prefix)\n"
"             (regexp-quote fill-prefix)))\n"
"       ;; Remove ^ from paragraph-start and paragraph-sep if they are there.\n"
"       ;; These regexps shouldn't be anchored, because we look for them\n"
"       ;; starting at the left-margin.  This allows paragraph commands to\n"
"       ;; work normally with indented text.\n"
"       ;; This hack will not find problem cases like &quot;whatever\\\\|^something&quot;.\n"
"       (parstart (if (and (not (equal &quot;&quot; paragraph-start))\n"
"                          (equal ?^ (aref paragraph-start 0)))\n"
"                     (substring paragraph-start 1)\n"
"                   paragraph-start))\n"
"       (parsep (if (and (not (equal &quot;&quot; paragraph-separate))\n"
"                        (equal ?^ (aref paragraph-separate 0)))\n"
"                   (substring paragraph-separate 1)\n"
"                 paragraph-separate))\n"
"       (parsep\n"
"        (if fill-prefix-regexp\n"
"            (concat parsep &quot;\\\\|&quot;\n"
"                    fill-prefix-regexp &quot;[ \\t]*$&quot;)\n"
"          parsep))\n"
"       ;; This is used for searching.\n"
"       (sp-parstart (concat &quot;^[ \\t]*\\\\(?:&quot; parstart &quot;\\\\|&quot; parsep &quot;\\\\)&quot;))\n"
"       start found-start)\n"
"  ...)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">parsep</code> appears twice, first, to "
"remove instances of &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</samp>&rsquo;, and second, "
"to handle fill prefixes."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">parsep</code> は2回登場し、1回目は &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">^</samp>&rsquo; の出現箇所を削除するため、2回目はフィルプレ"
"フィックスを処理するためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">opoint</code> is just the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">point</code>.  As you can guess, it is used in a <code "
"class=\"code\">constrain-to-field</code> expression, just as in <code "
"class=\"code\">forward-sentence</code>."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">opoint</code> は単に <code class=\"code\">point</"
"code> の値です。ご想像の通り、<code class=\"code\">forward-sentence</code> と"
"同様に <code class=\"code\">constrain-to-field</code> の式でも使用されていま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The variable <code class=\"code\">fill-prefix-regexp</code> is set to the "
"value returned by evaluating the following list:"
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">fill-prefix-regexp</code> には、以下のリストを評価"
"して得られた値が代入されます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(and fill-prefix\n"
"     (not (equal fill-prefix &quot;&quot;))\n"
"     (not paragraph-ignore-fill-prefix)\n"
"     (regexp-quote fill-prefix))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This is an expression whose first element is the <code class=\"code\">and</"
"code> special form."
msgstr "これは、第1要素が<code class=\"code\">and</code>特殊形式である式です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-let.html
msgid ""
"As we learned earlier (see <a class=\"pxref\" href=\"kill_002dnew-"
"function.html\">The <code class=\"code\">kill-new</code> function</a>), the "
"<code class=\"code\">and</code> special form evaluates each of its arguments "
"until one of the arguments returns a value of <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, in which case the <code class=\"code\">and</code> expression returns "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>; however, if none of the arguments returns a "
"value of <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the value resulting from "
"evaluating the last argument is returned.  (Since such a value is not <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, it is considered true in Lisp.)  In other words, "
"an <code class=\"code\">and</code> expression returns a true value only if "
"all its arguments are true.  <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-"
"and-1\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"先に学んだように（<a class=\"pxref\" href=\"kill_002dnew-"
"function.html\"><code class=\"code\">kill-new</code> 関数</a>を参照）、<code "
"class=\"code\">and</code> 特殊形式は、引数のいずれかが <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の値を返すまで各引数を評価し、その場合は <code "
"class=\"code\">and</code> 式が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。た"
"だし、どの引数も <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の値を返さない場合は、最後の"
"引数を評価した結果が返されます。（このような値は <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> ではないため、Lisp では真とみなされます。）言い換えれば、<code "
"class=\"code\">and</code> 式は、すべての引数が真である場合にのみ真の値を返し"
"ます。  <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-and-1\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In this case, the variable <code class=\"code\">fill-prefix-regexp</code> is "
"bound to a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</code> value only if the following "
"four expressions produce a true (i.e., a non-<code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>) value when they are evaluated; otherwise, <code class=\"code\">fill-"
"prefix-regexp</code> is bound to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この場合、変数 <code class=\"code\">fill-prefix-regexp</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外の値に束縛されるのは、以下の4つの式を評価した際"
"に真（すなわち <code class=\"code\">nil</code> 以外）の値が得られた場合に限ら"
"れ、それ以外の場合は <code class=\"code\">fill-prefix-regexp</code> が <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> に束縛されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><dl><dt>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">fill-prefix</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">fill-prefix</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"When this variable is evaluated, the value of the fill prefix, if any, is "
"returned.  If there is no fill prefix, this variable returns <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"この変数が評価されると、フィルプレフィックスが存在する場合はその値が返されま"
"す。フィルプレフィックスがない場合は、この変数は <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><dl><dt>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">(not (equal fill-prefix &quot;&quot;)</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">(not (equal fill-prefix &quot;&quot;)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This expression checks whether an existing fill prefix is an empty string, "
"that is, a string with no characters in it.  An empty string is not a useful "
"fill prefix."
msgstr ""
"この式は、既存のフィルプレフィックスが空文字列、すなわち文字を含まない文字列"
"であるかどうかを判定します。空文字列は有用なフィルプレフィックスではありませ"
"ん。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><dl><dt>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">(not paragraph-ignore-fill-prefix)</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">(not paragraph-ignore-fill-prefix)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This expression returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if the variable "
"<code class=\"code\">paragraph-ignore-fill-prefix</code> has been turned on "
"by being set to a true value such as <code class=\"code\">t</code>."
msgstr ""
"この式は、変数 <code class=\"code\">paragraph-ignore-fill-prefix</code> が "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> のような真の値に設定されて有効になった場合、"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><dl><dt>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<code class=\"code\">(regexp-quote fill-prefix)</code>"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">(regexp-quote fill-prefix)</code>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><dl><dd><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This is the last argument to the <code class=\"code\">and</code> special "
"form.  If all the arguments to the <code class=\"code\">and</code> are true, "
"the value resulting from evaluating this expression will be returned by the "
"<code class=\"code\">and</code> expression and bound to the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">fill-prefix-regexp</code>,"
msgstr ""
"これは <code class=\"code\">and</code> 特殊形式への最後の引数です。<code "
"class=\"code\">and</code> のすべての引数が真である場合、この式を評価して得ら"
"れた値が <code class=\"code\">and</code> 式によって返され、変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">fill-prefix-regexp</code> に束縛されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-regexp_002dquote\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-regexp_002dquote\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The result of evaluating this <code class=\"code\">and</code> expression "
"successfully is that <code class=\"code\">fill-prefix-regexp</code> will be "
"bound to the value of <code class=\"code\">fill-prefix</code> as modified by "
"the <code class=\"code\">regexp-quote</code> function.  What <code "
"class=\"code\">regexp-quote</code> does is read a string and return a "
"regular expression that will exactly match the string and match nothing "
"else.  This means that <code class=\"code\">fill-prefix-regexp</code> will "
"be set to a value that will exactly match the fill prefix if the fill prefix "
"exists.  Otherwise, the variable will be set to <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"この <code class=\"code\">and</code> 式の評価が正常に完了した結果、<code "
"class=\"code\">fill-prefix-regexp</code> には <code class=\"code\">regexp-"
"quote</code> 関数によって変更された <code class=\"code\">fill-prefix</code> "
"の値がバインドされます。<code class=\"code\">regexp-quote</code> は文字列を読"
"み込み、その文字列に完全に一致し、それ以外には一切一致しない正規表現を返しま"
"す。つまり、fill プレフィックスが存在する場合、<code class=\"code\">fill-"
"prefix-regexp</code> にはその fill プレフィックスに完全に一致する値が設定され"
"ます。そうでない場合、変数には <code class=\"code\">nil</code> が設定されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The next two local variables in the <code class=\"code\">let*</code> "
"expression are designed to remove instances of &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">^</samp>&rsquo; from <code class=\"code\">parstart</code> and "
"<code class=\"code\">parsep</code>, the local variables which indicate the "
"paragraph start and the paragraph separator.  The next expression sets <code "
"class=\"code\">parsep</code> again.  That is to handle fill prefixes."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">let*</code> 式の続く2つのローカル変数は、段落の開始と段"
"落区切りを示すローカル変数である <code class=\"code\">parstart</code> および "
"<code class=\"code\">parsep</code> から、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^</"
"samp>&rsquo; の出現箇所を除去するように設計されています。次の式では、再び "
"<code class=\"code\">parsep</code> を設定します。これはフィルプレフィックスを"
"処理するためのものです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This is the setting that requires the definition call <code "
"class=\"code\">let*</code> rather than <code class=\"code\">let</code>.  The "
"true-or-false-test for the <code class=\"code\">if</code> depends on whether "
"the variable <code class=\"code\">fill-prefix-regexp</code> evaluates to "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> or some other value."
msgstr ""
"これは、<code class=\"code\">let</code>ではなく定義呼び出し<code "
"class=\"code\">let*</code>を必要とする設定です。<code class=\"code\">if</"
"code>の真偽判定は、変数<code class=\"code\">fill-prefix-regexp</code>が<code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>と評価されるか、あるいは別の値と評価されるかによって"
"決まります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If <code class=\"code\">fill-prefix-regexp</code> does not have a value, "
"Emacs evaluates the else-part of the <code class=\"code\">if</code> "
"expression and binds <code class=\"code\">parsep</code> to its local value.  "
"(<code class=\"code\">parsep</code> is a regular expression that matches "
"what separates paragraphs.)"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">fill-prefix-regexp</code> に値がない場合、Emacs は "
"<code class=\"code\">if</code> 式の else 部分を評価し、<code "
"class=\"code\">parsep</code> をそのローカル値にバインドします。（<code "
"class=\"code\">parsep</code> は、段落を区切る部分にマッチする正規表現です。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"But if <code class=\"code\">fill-prefix-regexp</code> does have a value, "
"Emacs evaluates the then-part of the <code class=\"code\">if</code> "
"expression and binds <code class=\"code\">parsep</code> to a regular "
"expression that includes the <code class=\"code\">fill-prefix-regexp</code> "
"as part of the pattern."
msgstr ""
"ただし、<code class=\"code\">fill-prefix-regexp</code> に値がある場合、Emacs "
"は <code class=\"code\">if</code> 式の then 部を評価し、<code "
"class=\"code\">parsep</code> を <code class=\"code\">fill-prefix-regexp</"
"code> をパターンの一部として含む正規表現にバインドします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Specifically, <code class=\"code\">parsep</code> is set to the original "
"value of the paragraph separate regular expression concatenated with an "
"alternative expression that consists of the <code class=\"code\">fill-prefix-"
"regexp</code> followed by optional whitespace to the end of the line.  (The "
"whitespace is defined by <code class=\"code\">&quot;[&nbsp;\\t]*$&quot;</"
"code>.)  The &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\\\|</samp>&rsquo; defines this "
"portion of the regexp as an alternative to <code class=\"code\">parsep</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"具体的には、<code class=\"code\">parsep</code> には、段落の元の値を区切る正規"
"表現に、<code class=\"code\">fill-prefix-regexp</code> に続いて行末までの任意"
"の空白文字が続く代替表現を連結したものが設定されます。（この空白文字は <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;[&nbsp;\\t]*$&quot;</code> で定義されます。）&lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">\\\\|</samp>&rsquo; は、この正規表現の部分を <code "
"class=\"code\">parsep</code> の代替として定義します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"According to a comment in the code, the next local variable, <code "
"class=\"code\">sp-parstart</code>, is used for searching, and then the final "
"two, <code class=\"code\">start</code> and <code class=\"code\">found-start</"
"code>, are set to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"コード内のコメントによると、次のローカル変数 <code class=\"code\">sp-"
"parstart</code> が検索に使用され、その後、最後の2つ <code "
"class=\"code\">start</code> と <code class=\"code\">found-start</code> が "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-let.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Now we get into the body of the <code class=\"code\">let*</code>.  The first "
"part of the body of the <code class=\"code\">let*</code> deals with the case "
"when the function is given a negative argument and is therefore moving "
"backwards.  We will skip this section."
msgstr ""
"ここからは<code class=\"code\">let*</code>の本体に入ります。<code "
"class=\"code\">let*</code>の本体の前半部分では、関数に負の引数が与えられ、そ"
"の結果逆方向に移動する場合について扱っています。この節は省略します。"

