# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>The forward motion <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop<a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-forward-motion-while-loop\"> &para;</a></"
"span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>前進動作 <code class=\"code\">while</code> ループ<a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#The-forward-motion-while-loop\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The second part of the body of the <code class=\"code\">let*</code> deals "
"with forward motion.  It is a <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop that "
"repeats itself so long as the value of <code class=\"code\">arg</code> is "
"greater than zero.  In the most common use of the function, the value of the "
"argument is 1, so the body of the <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop is "
"evaluated exactly once, and the cursor moves forward one paragraph."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">let*</code>の本体の後半部分は、前方への移動を処理しま"
"す。これは<code class=\"code\">arg</code>の値が0より大きい限り繰り返される"
"<code class=\"code\">while</code>ループです。この関数の最も一般的な用法では、"
"引数の値は1となるため、<code class=\"code\">while</code>ループの本体はちょう"
"ど1回だけ評価され、カーソルは1段落分前方に移動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This part handles three situations: when point is between paragraphs, when "
"there is a fill prefix and when there is no fill prefix."
msgstr ""
"この部分では、pointが段落間にある場合、fillプレフィックスがある場合、および"
"fillプレフィックスがない場合の3つのケースを処理します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop looks like this:"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">while</code> ループは次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";; <span class=\"r\">going forwards and not at the end of the buffer</span>\n"
"(while (and (&gt; arg 0) (not (eobp)))\n"
"\n"
"  ;; <span class=\"r\">between paragraphs</span>\n"
"  ;; Move forward over separator lines...\n"
"  (while (and (not (eobp))\n"
"              (progn (move-to-left-margin) (not (eobp)))\n"
"              (looking-at parsep))\n"
"    (forward-line 1))\n"
"  ;;  <span class=\"r\">This decrements the loop</span>\n"
"  (unless (eobp) (setq arg (1- arg)))\n"
"  ;; ... and one more line.\n"
"  (forward-line 1)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (if fill-prefix-regexp\n"
"      ;; There is a fill prefix; it overrides parstart;\n"
"      ;; we go forward line by line\n"
"      (while (and (not (eobp))\n"
"                  (progn (move-to-left-margin) (not (eobp)))\n"
"                  (not (looking-at parsep))\n"
"                  (looking-at fill-prefix-regexp))\n"
"        (forward-line 1))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ;; There is no fill prefix;\n"
"    ;; we go forward character by character\n"
"    (while (and (re-search-forward sp-parstart nil 1)\n"
"                (progn (setq start (match-beginning 0))\n"
"                       (goto-char start)\n"
"                       (not (eobp)))\n"
"                (progn (move-to-left-margin)\n"
"                       (not (looking-at parsep)))\n"
"                (or (not (looking-at parstart))\n"
"                    (and use-hard-newlines\n"
"                         (not (get-text-property (1- start) 'hard)))))\n"
"      (forward-char 1))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ;; and if there is no fill prefix and if we are not at the end,\n"
"    ;;     go to whatever was found in the regular expression search\n"
"    ;;     for sp-parstart\n"
"    (if (&lt; (point) (point-max))\n"
"        (goto-char start))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-eobp\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-eobp\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"We can see that this is a decrementing counter <code class=\"code\">while</"
"code> loop, using the expression <code class=\"code\">(setq arg (1- arg))</"
"code> as the decrementer.  That expression is not far from the <code "
"class=\"code\">while</code>, but is hidden in another Lisp macro, an <code "
"class=\"code\">unless</code> macro.  Unless we are at the end of the "
"buffer&mdash;that is what the <code class=\"code\">eobp</code> function "
"determines; it is an abbreviation of &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">End Of "
"Buffer P</samp>&rsquo;&mdash;we decrease the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">arg</code> by one."
msgstr ""
"これは、式 <code class=\"code\">(setq arg (1- arg))</code> をデクリメント値と"
"して用いる、デクリメントカウンタ <code class=\"code\">while</code> ループであ"
"ることがわかります。この式は <code class=\"code\">while</code> からそれほど離"
"れていませんが、別の Lisp マクロである <code class=\"code\">unless</code> マ"
"クロの中に隠されています。バッファの末尾に達していない限り――これは <code "
"class=\"code\">eobp</code> 関数によって判定されます。この関数は &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">End Of Buffer P</samp>&rsquo; の略記であり、<code "
"class=\"code\">arg</code> の値を 1 減らします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(If we are at the end of the buffer, we cannot go forward any more and the "
"next loop of the <code class=\"code\">while</code> expression will test "
"false since the test is an <code class=\"code\">and</code> with <code "
"class=\"code\">(not (eobp))</code>.  The <code class=\"code\">not</code> "
"function means exactly as you expect; it is another name for <code "
"class=\"code\">null</code>, a function that returns true when its argument "
"is false.)"
msgstr ""
"（バッファの末尾に達した場合、それ以上先に進むことはできず、<code "
"class=\"code\">while</code> 式の次のループでは、判定が <code "
"class=\"code\">and</code> と <code class=\"code\">(not (eobp))</code> の組み"
"合わせとなるため、false と判定されます。<code class=\"code\">not</code> 関数"
"は期待通りの動作をします。これは <code class=\"code\">null</code> の別名であ"
"り、引数が false のときに true を返す関数です。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Interestingly, the loop count is not decremented until we leave the space "
"between paragraphs, unless we come to the end of buffer or stop seeing the "
"local value of the paragraph separator."
msgstr ""
"興味深いことに、バッファの末尾に達するか、あるいは段落区切りのローカル値が見"
"えなくなるまで、段落間のスペースを抜けるまでループ回数は減算されません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"That second <code class=\"code\">while</code> also has a <code "
"class=\"code\">(move-to-left-margin)</code> expression.  The function is "
"self-explanatory.  It is inside a <code class=\"code\">progn</code> "
"expression and not the last element of its body, so it is only invoked for "
"its side effect, which is to move point to the left margin of the current "
"line."
msgstr ""
"その2番目の <code class=\"code\">while</code> にも <code "
"class=\"code\">(move-to-left-margin)</code> 式があります。関数の内容は一目瞭"
"然です。これは <code class=\"code\">progn</code> 式の中にあり、その本体の最後"
"の要素ではないため、ポイントを現在の行の左マージンに移動させるという副作用の"
"ためだけに呼び出されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-looking_002dat\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-looking_002dat\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">looking-at</code> function is also self-"
"explanatory; it returns true if the text after point matches the regular "
"expression given as its argument."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">looking-at</code> 関数もその名の通りで、ポイント以降のテ"
"キストが引数として与えられた正規表現に一致すれば true を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The rest of the body of the loop looks difficult at first, but makes sense "
"as you come to understand it."
msgstr ""
"ループの残りの部分は、最初は難しく見えますが、理解が進むにつれて納得がいくよ"
"うになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "First consider what happens if there is a fill prefix:"
msgstr "まず、フィルプレフィックスがある場合にどうなるかを考えてみましょう："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This expression moves point forward line by line so long as four conditions "
"are true:"
msgstr ""
"この式は、4つの条件が満たされている限り、点を1行ずつ前方に移動させます："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ol><li>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Point is not at the end of the buffer."
msgstr "ポインタがバッファの末尾にありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ol><li>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"We can move to the left margin of the text and are not at the end of the "
"buffer."
msgstr ""
"テキストの左マージンに移動でき、バッファの末尾にいるわけではありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ol><li>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The text following point does not separate paragraphs."
msgstr "ドット以降のテキストは段落を区切りません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ol><li>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The pattern following point is the fill prefix regular expression."
msgstr "パターンの次の要素は、塗りつぶしプレフィックスの正規表現です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The last condition may be puzzling, until you remember that point was moved "
"to the beginning of the line early in the <code class=\"code\">forward-"
"paragraph</code> function.  This means that if the text has a fill prefix, "
"the <code class=\"code\">looking-at</code> function will see it."
msgstr ""
"最後の条件は一見不可解に思えるかもしれませんが、<code class=\"code\">forward-"
"paragraph</code> 関数の序盤でそのポイントが行頭に移動されたことを思い出せば納"
"得がいくでしょう。つまり、テキストに塗りつぶしプレフィックスがある場合、"
"<code class=\"code\">looking-at</code> 関数がそれを認識することになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Consider what happens when there is no fill prefix."
msgstr "フィルプレフィックスがない場合に何が起こるかを考えてみましょう。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    (while (and (re-search-forward sp-parstart nil 1)\n"
"                (progn (setq start (match-beginning 0))\n"
"                       (goto-char start)\n"
"                       (not (eobp)))\n"
"                (progn (move-to-left-margin)\n"
"                       (not (looking-at parsep)))\n"
"                (or (not (looking-at parstart))\n"
"                    (and use-hard-newlines\n"
"                         (not (get-text-property (1- start) 'hard)))))\n"
"      (forward-char 1))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop has us searching forward for "
"<code class=\"code\">sp-parstart</code>, which is the combination of "
"possible whitespace with the local value of the start of a paragraph or of a "
"paragraph separator.  (The latter two are within an expression starting "
"<code class=\"code\">\\(?:</code> so that they are not referenced by the "
"<code class=\"code\">match-beginning</code> function.)"
