#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"mean go to the start of the text matched by the regular expression search."
msgstr "正規表現検索にマッチしたテキストの先頭に移動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">(match-beginning 0)</code> expression is new.  It "
"returns a number specifying the location of the start of the text that was "
"matched by the last search."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">(match-beginning 0)</code> 式は新しく導入されました。こ"
"れは、直前の検索でマッチしたテキストの開始位置を示す数値を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">match-beginning</code> function is used here "
"because of a characteristic of a forward search: a successful forward "
"search, regardless of whether it is a plain search or a regular expression "
"search, moves point to the end of the text that is found.  In this case, a "
"successful search moves point to the end of the pattern for <code "
"class=\"code\">sp-parstart</code>."
msgstr ""
"ここで <code class=\"code\">match-beginning</code> 関数が使われているのは、前"
"方検索の特性によるものです。前方検索が成功した場合、それが単純な検索であれ正"
"規表現による検索であれ、ポイントは見つかったテキストの末尾に移動します。この"
"場合、検索が成功すると、ポイントは <code class=\"code\">sp-parstart</code> の"
"パターンの末尾に移動します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"However, we want to put point at the end of the current paragraph, not "
"somewhere else.  Indeed, since the search possibly includes the paragraph "
"separator, point may end up at the beginning of the next one unless we use "
"an expression that includes <code class=\"code\">match-beginning</code>."
msgstr ""
"しかし、point は別の場所ではなく、現在の段落の末尾に配置したいと考えていま"
"す。実際、検索に段落区切りが含まれる可能性があるため、<code "
"class=\"code\">match-beginning</code> を含む式を使用しない限り、point が次の"
"段落の先頭に配置されてしまう恐れがあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-match_002dbeginning\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-match_002dbeginning\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"When given an argument of 0, <code class=\"code\">match-beginning</code> "
"returns the position that is the start of the text matched by the most "
"recent search.  In this case, the most recent search looks for <code "
"class=\"code\">sp-parstart</code>.  The <code class=\"code\">(match-"
"beginning 0)</code> expression returns the beginning position of that "
"pattern, rather than the end position of that pattern."
msgstr ""
"引数に 0 を指定すると、<code class=\"code\">match-beginning</code> は直近の検"
"索でマッチしたテキストの開始位置を返します。この場合、直近の検索では <code "
"class=\"code\">sp-parstart</code> が検索対象となります。<code "
"class=\"code\">(match-beginning 0)</code> 式は、そのパターンの終了位置ではな"
"く、開始位置を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dpara-while.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(Incidentally, when passed a positive number as an argument, the <code "
"class=\"code\">match-beginning</code> function returns the location of point "
"at that parenthesized expression in the last search unless that "
"parenthesized expression begins with <code class=\"code\">\\(?:</code>.  I "
"don&rsquo;t know why <code class=\"code\">\\(?:</code> appears here since "
"the argument is 0.)"
msgstr ""
"（ちなみに、正の数を引数として渡された場合、<code class=\"code\">match-"
"beginning</code> 関数は、その括弧付き式が <code class=\"code\">\\(?:</code> "
"で始まっていない限り、直前の検索におけるその括弧付き式内の点の位置を返しま"
"す。引数が 0 であるのに、なぜここに <code class=\"code\">\\(?:</code> が現れ"
"るのかは分かりません。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
