#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-re_002dsearch.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>The regular expression search<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-"
"regular-expression-search\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>正規表現検索<a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-regular-expression-"
"search\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-re_002dsearch.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> function searches for the "
"end of the sentence, that is, for the pattern defined by the <code "
"class=\"code\">sentence-end</code> regular expression.  If the pattern is "
"found&mdash;if the end of the sentence is found&mdash;then the <code "
"class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> function does two things:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> 関数は、文末、すなわち <code "
"class=\"code\">sentence-end</code> 正規表現で定義されたパターンを検索します。"
"パターンが見つかった場合&mdash;つまり文末が見つかった場合&mdash;、<code "
"class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> 関数は次の2つの処理を行います："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ol><li>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-re_002dsearch.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> function carries out a "
"side effect, which is to move point to the end of the occurrence found."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> 関数は、見つかった出現箇所の末"
"尾にポイントを移動させるという副作用をもたらします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ol><li>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-re_002dsearch.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> function returns a value "
"of true.  This is the value received by the <code class=\"code\">if</code>, "
"and means that the search was successful."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> 関数は true を返します。これが "
"<code class=\"code\">if</code> で受信される値となり、検索が成功したことを意味"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-re_002dsearch.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The side effect, the movement of point, is completed before the <code "
"class=\"code\">if</code> function is handed the value returned by the "
"successful conclusion of the search."
msgstr ""
"副作用であるポイントの移動は、<code class=\"code\">if</code>関数に探索が正常"
"に完了して返された値が渡される前に完了する。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-re_002dsearch.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"When the <code class=\"code\">if</code> function receives the value of true "
"from a successful call to <code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code>, the "
"<code class=\"code\">if</code> evaluates the then-part, which is the "
"expression <code class=\"code\">(skip-chars-backward &quot; \\t\\n&quot;)</"
"code>.  This expression moves backwards over any blank spaces, tabs or "
"carriage returns until a printed character is found and then leaves point "
"after the character.  Since point has already been moved to the end of the "
"pattern that marks the end of the sentence, this action leaves point right "
"after the closing printed character of the sentence, which is usually a "
"period."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">if</code> 関数が <code class=\"code\">re-search-"
"forward</code> の呼び出し成功により true の値を受け取ると、<code "
"class=\"code\">if</code> は then 部分、すなわち式 <code class=\"code\">(skip-"
"chars-backward &quot; \\t\\n&quot;)</code> を評価します。この式は、印字文字が"
"見つかるまで空白、タブ、またはキャリッジリターンを遡り、その文字の直後にポイ"
"ントを移動させます。ポイントはすでに文末を示すパターンの末尾に移動しているた"
"め、この操作により、ポイントは文の最後の印字文字（通常はピリオド）の直後に置"
"かれることになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-re_002dsearch.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"On the other hand, if the <code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> "
"function fails to find a pattern marking the end of the sentence, the "
"function returns false.  The false then causes the <code class=\"code\">if</"
"code> to evaluate its third argument, which is <code class=\"code\">(goto-"
"char par-end)</code>: it moves point to the end of the paragraph."
msgstr ""
"一方、<code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> 関数が文末を示すパターン"
"を見つけられなかった場合、この関数は false を返します。すると、この false に"
"よって <code class=\"code\">if</code> が第3引数である <code "
"class=\"code\">(goto-char par-end)</code> を評価し、ポインタを段落の末尾に移"
"動させます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-re_002dsearch.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(And if the text is in a form or equivalent, and point may not move fully, "
"then the <code class=\"code\">constrain-to-field</code> function comes into "
"play.)"
msgstr ""
"（また、テキストがフォームまたはそれに準ずる形式であり、ポイントが完全に移動"
"できない場合には、<code class=\"code\">constrain-to-field</code> 関数が機能し"
"ます。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-re_002dsearch.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Regular expression searches are exceptionally useful and the pattern "
"illustrated by <code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code>, in which the "
"search is the test of an <code class=\"code\">if</code> expression, is "
"handy.  You will see or write code incorporating this pattern often."
msgstr ""
"正規表現による検索は非常に有用であり、<code class=\"code\">re-search-"
"forward</code>で示される、検索を<code class=\"code\">if</code>式の判定とする"
"パターンは便利です。このパターンを取り入れたコードを頻繁に目にしたり、記述し"
"たりすることになるでしょう。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-re_002dsearch.html
msgid ""
