# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-while-loops.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>The <code class=\"code\">while</code> loops<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#The-while-loops\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span><code class=\"code\">while</code> ループ<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#The-while-loops\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-while-loops.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Two <code class=\"code\">while</code> loops follow.  The first <code "
"class=\"code\">while</code> has a true-or-false-test that tests true if the "
"prefix argument for <code class=\"code\">forward-sentence</code> is a "
"negative number.  This is for going backwards.  The body of this loop is "
"similar to the body of the second <code class=\"code\">while</code> clause, "
"but it is not exactly the same.  We will skip this <code "
"class=\"code\">while</code> loop and concentrate on the second <code "
"class=\"code\">while</code> loop."
msgstr ""
"続いて2つの<code class=\"code\">while</code>ループがあります。最初の<code "
"class=\"code\">while</code>には、<code class=\"code\">forward-sentence</code>"
"の接頭辞引数が負の数である場合に真となる真偽判定があります。これは逆方向に辿"
"るためのものです。このループの本体は、2番目の<code class=\"code\">while</"
"code>節の本体と似ていますが、完全に同一ではありません。この<code "
"class=\"code\">while</code>ループは省略し、2番目の<code "
"class=\"code\">while</code>ループに注目します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-while-loops.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The second <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop is for moving point "
"forward.  Its skeleton looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"2つ目の <code class=\"code\">while</code> ループは、点を前方に移動させるため"
"のものです。その骨組みは以下のようになっています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-while-loops.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(while (&gt; arg 0)            ; <span class=\"r\">true-or-false-test</span>\n"
"  (let <var class=\"var\">varlist</var>\n"
"    (if (<var class=\"var\">true-or-false-test</var>)\n"
"        <var class=\"var\">then-part</var>\n"
"      <var class=\"var\">else-part</var>\n"
"  (setq arg (1- arg))))     ; <code class=\"code\">while</code> <span class=\"r\">loop decrementer</span>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-while-loops.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop is of the decrementing kind.  "
"(See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Decrementing-Loop.html\">A Loop with a "
"Decrementing Counter</a>.)  It has a true-or-false-test that tests true so "
"long as the counter (in this case, the variable <code class=\"code\">arg</"
"code>) is greater than zero; and it has a decrementer that subtracts 1 from "
"the value of the counter every time the loop repeats."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">while</code> ループはデクリメント型です。（<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Decrementing-Loop.html\">デクリメントカウンタを用いた"
"ループ</a>を参照してください。）このループには、カウンタ（この場合は変数 "
"<code class=\"code\">arg</code>）が 0 より大きい限り真となる真偽判定があり、"
"また、ループが繰り返されるたびにカウンタの値から 1 を減算するデクリメンターが"
"備わっています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-while-loops.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If no prefix argument is given to <code class=\"code\">forward-sentence</"
"code>, which is the most common way the command is used, this <code "
"class=\"code\">while</code> loop will run once, since the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">arg</code> will be 1."
msgstr ""
"コマンドの最も一般的な使い方である <code class=\"code\">forward-sentence</"
"code> にプレフィックス引数が指定されない場合、<code class=\"code\">arg</"
"code> の値が 1 となるため、この <code class=\"code\">while</code> ループは1回"
"実行されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-while-loops.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The body of the <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop consists of a <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> expression, which creates and binds a local "
"variable, and has, as its body, an <code class=\"code\">if</code> expression."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">while</code> ループの本体は、ローカル変数を生成してバイ"
"ンドする <code class=\"code\">let</code> 式で構成されており、その本体として "
"<code class=\"code\">if</code> 式を持つ。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-while-loops.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The body of the <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">while</code> ループの本体は次のようになっています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-while-loops.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(let ((par-end\n"
"       (save-excursion (end-of-paragraph-text) (point))))\n"
"  (if (re-search-forward sentence-end par-end t)\n"
"      (skip-chars-backward &quot; \\t\\n&quot;)\n"
"    (goto-char par-end)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-while-loops.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">let</code> expression creates and binds the local "
"variable <code class=\"code\">par-end</code>.  As we shall see, this local "
"variable is designed to provide a bound or limit to the regular expression "
"search.  If the search fails to find a proper sentence ending in the "
"paragraph, it will stop on reaching the end of the paragraph."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">let</code> という式は、ローカル変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">par-end</code> を生成してバインドします。後述するように、この"
"ローカル変数は正規表現による検索に制約や制限を設けるために設計されています。"
"検索によって段落内で適切な文が見つからなかった場合、段落の末尾に達した時点で"
"検索は停止します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-while-loops.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"But first, let us examine how <code class=\"code\">par-end</code> is bound "
"to the value of the end of the paragraph.  What happens is that the <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> sets the value of <code class=\"code\">par-end</"
"code> to the value returned when the Lisp interpreter evaluates the "
"expression"
msgstr ""
"しかしその前に、まず <code class=\"code\">par-end</code> が段落末尾の値にどの"
"ように束縛されるのかを見てみましょう。実際には、<code class=\"code\">let</"
"code> が <code class=\"code\">par-end</code> の値を、Lispインタプリタが式を評"
"価した際に返される値に設定します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-while-loops.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(save-excursion (end-of-paragraph-text) (point))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-while-loops.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In this expression, <code class=\"code\">(end-of-paragraph-text)</code> "
"moves point to the end of the paragraph, <code class=\"code\">(point)</code> "
"returns the value of point, and then <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</"
"code> restores point to its original position.  Thus, the <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> binds <code class=\"code\">par-end</code> to the "
"value returned by the <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> expression, "
"which is the position of the end of the paragraph.  (The <code "
"class=\"code\">end-of-paragraph-text</code> function uses <code "
"class=\"code\">forward-paragraph</code>, which we will discuss shortly.)"
msgstr ""
"この式では、<code class=\"code\">(end-of-paragraph-text)</code> で point を段"
"落の末尾に移動し、<code class=\"code\">(point)</code> で point の値を返し、そ"
"の後 <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> で point を元の位置に戻しま"
"す。  したがって、<code class=\"code\">let</code> は <code "
"class=\"code\">par-end</code> を <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> "
"式が返す値（すなわち段落末尾の位置）にバインドします。  （<code "
"class=\"code\">end-of-paragraph-text</code> 関数では <code "
"class=\"code\">forward-paragraph</code> を使用していますが、これについては後"
"ほど説明します。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-while-loops.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Emacs next evaluates the body of the <code class=\"code\">let</code>, which "
"is an <code class=\"code\">if</code> expression that looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"Emacsは次に<code class=\"code\">let</code>の本体を評価します。これは次のよう"
"な<code class=\"code\">if</code>式です。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-while-loops.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(if (re-search-forward sentence-end par-end t) ; <span class=\"r\">if-part</span>\n"
"    (skip-chars-backward &quot; \\t\\n&quot;)              ; <span class=\"r\">then-part</span>\n"
"  (goto-char par-end)))                        ; <span class=\"r\">else-part</span>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-while-loops.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">if</code> tests whether its first argument is true "
"and if so, evaluates its then-part; otherwise, the Emacs Lisp interpreter "
"evaluates the else-part.  The true-or-false-test of the <code "
"class=\"code\">if</code> expression is the regular expression search."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">if</code> は、第1引数が真であるかどうかを判定し、真であ"
"れば then 部を評価します。そうでない場合は、Emacs Lisp インタプリタが else 部"
"を評価します。<code class=\"code\">if</code> 式の真偽判定は、正規表現検索で"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/fwd_002dsentence-while-loops.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"It may seem odd to have what looks like the real work of the <code "
"class=\"code\">forward-sentence</code> function buried here, but this is a "
"common way this kind of operation is carried out in Lisp."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">forward-sentence</code> 関数の本来の処理と思われるものが"
"ここに埋もれているのは奇妙に思えるかもしれませんが、Lisp ではこの種の操作は一"
"般的にこのように行われます。"

