#: build/html/eintr/graph_002dbody_002dprint.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "We need to fill in the slots of the template."
msgstr "テンプレートの空欄を埋める必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/graph_002dbody_002dprint.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Clearly, we can use the <code class=\"code\">(apply 'max numbers-list)</"
"code> expression to determine the height of the graph."
msgstr ""
"明らかに、<code class=\"code\">(apply 'max numbers-list)</code> 式を用いてグ"
"ラフの高さを決定できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/graph_002dbody_002dprint.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop will cycle through the <code "
"class=\"code\">numbers-list</code> one element at a time.  As it is "
"shortened by the <code class=\"code\">(setq numbers-list (cdr numbers-"
"list))</code> expression, the <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> of each "
"instance of the list is the value of the argument for <code "
"class=\"code\">column-of-graph</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">while</code> ループは、<code class=\"code\">numbers-"
"list</code> の要素を1つずつ順に処理します。<code class=\"code\">(setq "
"numbers-list (cdr numbers-list))</code> 式によって短縮されるにつれ、リストの"
"各インスタンスにおける <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> は、<code "
"class=\"code\">column-of-graph</code> の引数の値となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/graph_002dbody_002dprint.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"At each cycle of the <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop, the <code "
"class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</code> function inserts the list returned by "
"<code class=\"code\">column-of-graph</code>.  Since the <code "
"class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</code> function moves point to the lower "
"right of the inserted rectangle, we need to save the location of point at "
"the time the rectangle is inserted, move back to that position after the "
"rectangle is inserted, and then move horizontally to the next place from "
"which <code class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</code> is called."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">while</code> ループの各サイクルで、<code "
"class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</code> 関数は <code class=\"code\">column-of-"
"graph</code> が返すリストを挿入します。<code class=\"code\">insert-"
"rectangle</code> 関数は point を挿入された矩形の右下に移動させるため、矩形が"
"挿入された時点の point の位置を保存し、矩形の挿入後にその位置に戻り、さらに "
"<code class=\"code\">insert-rectangle</code> が呼び出される次の場所まで水平方"
"向に移動する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/graph_002dbody_002dprint.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If the inserted columns are one character wide, as they will be if single "
"blanks and asterisks are used, the repositioning command is simply <code "
"class=\"code\">(forward-char 1)</code>; however, the width of a column may "
"be greater than one.  This means that the repositioning command should be "
"written <code class=\"code\">(forward-char symbol-width)</code>.  The <code "
"class=\"code\">symbol-width</code> itself is the length of a <code "
"class=\"code\">graph-blank</code> and can be found using the expression "
"<code class=\"code\">(length graph-blank)</code>.  The best place to bind "
"the <code class=\"code\">symbol-width</code> variable to the value of the "
"width of graph column is in the varlist of the <code class=\"code\">let</"
"code> expression."
msgstr ""
"挿入された列の幅が1文字分である場合（単一の空白やアスタリスクを使用する場合な"
"ど）、再配置コマンドは単に <code class=\"code\">(forward-char 1)</code> とな"
"ります。しかし、列の幅が1文字を超える場合もあります。この場合、再配置コマンド"
"は <code class=\"code\">(forward-char symbol-width)</code> と記述する必要があ"
"ります。<code class=\"code\">symbol-width</code> 自体は <code "
"class=\"code\">graph-blank</code> の長さであり、式 <code "
"class=\"code\">(length graph-blank)</code> を用いて求めることができます。"
"<code class=\"code\">symbol-width</code> 変数をグラフ列の幅の値にバインドする"
"最適な場所は、<code class=\"code\">let</code> 式の varlist 内です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/graph_002dbody_002dprint.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "These considerations lead to the following function definition:"
msgstr "これらの考察から、次のような関数定義が導かれます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/graph_002dbody_002dprint.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun graph-body-print (numbers-list)\n"
"  &quot;Print a bar graph of the NUMBERS-LIST.\n"
"The numbers-list consists of the Y-axis values.&quot;\n"
"\n"
"  (let ((height (apply 'max numbers-list))\n"
"        (symbol-width (length graph-blank))\n"
"        from-position)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/graph_002dbody_002dprint.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    (while numbers-list\n"
"      (setq from-position (point))\n"
"      (insert-rectangle\n"
"       (column-of-graph height (car numbers-list)))\n"
"      (goto-char from-position)\n"
"      (forward-char symbol-width)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/graph_002dbody_002dprint.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"      ;; <span class=\"r\">Draw graph column by column.</span>\n"
"      (sit-for 0)\n"
"      (setq numbers-list (cdr numbers-list)))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/graph_002dbody_002dprint.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ;; <span class=\"r\">Place point for X axis labels.</span>\n"
"    (forward-line height)\n"
"    (insert &quot;\\n&quot;)\n"
"))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/graph_002dbody_002dprint.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The one unexpected expression in this function is the <code "
"class=\"code\">(sit-for&nbsp;0)</code> expression in the <code "
"class=\"code\">while</code> loop.  This expression makes the graph printing "
"operation more interesting to watch than it would be otherwise.  The "
"expression causes Emacs to <em class=\"dfn\">sit</em> or do nothing for a "
"zero length of time and then redraw the screen.  Placed here, it causes "
"Emacs to redraw the screen column by column.  Without it, Emacs would not "
"redraw the screen until the function exits."
msgstr ""
"この関数の中で唯一意外な表現は、<code class=\"code\">while</code> ループ内の "
"<code class=\"code\">(sit-for&nbsp;0)</code> という式です。この式があること"
"で、グラフの描画処理が、そうでない場合よりも興味深いものになっています。この"
"式により、Emacs は長さ 0 の時間だけ <em class=\"dfn\">待機</em> または何もし"
"ない状態となり、その後画面を再描画します。ここに配置することで、Emacs は画面"
"を1列ずつ再描画するようになります。この式がなければ、Emacs は関数が終了するま"
"で画面を再描画しません。"

