"link\" href=\"#if-in-more-detail-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span><code class=\"code\">if</code> の詳細<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#if-in-more-detail-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/if-in-more-detail.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-if_002dpart-defined\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-then_002dpart-defined\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-if_002dpart-defined\"></a> <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-then_002dpart-defined\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/if-in-more-detail.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"An <code class=\"code\">if</code> expression written in Lisp does not use "
"the word &ldquo;then&rdquo;; the test and the action are the second and "
"third elements of the list whose first element is <code class=\"code\">if</"
"code>.  Nonetheless, the test part of an <code class=\"code\">if</code> "
"expression is often called the <em class=\"dfn\">if-part</em> and the second "
"argument is often called the <em class=\"dfn\">then-part</em>."
msgstr ""
"Lispで記述される<code class=\"code\">if</code>式では、「then」という語は使わ"
"れません。判定と処理は、第1要素が<code class=\"code\">if</code>であるリストの"
"第2要素および第3要素となります。とはいえ、<code class=\"code\">if</code>式の"
"判定部分は<em class=\"dfn\">if-part</em>、第2引数は<em class=\"dfn\">then-"
"part</em>と呼ばれることがよくあります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/if-in-more-detail.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Also, when an <code class=\"code\">if</code> expression is written, the true-"
"or-false-test is usually written on the same line as the symbol <code "
"class=\"code\">if</code>, but the action to carry out if the test is true, "
"the then-part, is written on the second and subsequent lines.  This makes "
"the <code class=\"code\">if</code> expression easier to read."
msgstr ""
"また、<code class=\"code\">if</code> 式を記述する場合、真偽判定は通常、記号 "
"<code class=\"code\">if</code> と同じ行に記述されますが、判定が真だった場合に"
"実行する処理である then 部は、2行目以降に記述されます。これにより、<code "
"class=\"code\">if</code> 式がより読みやすくなります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/if-in-more-detail.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(if <var class=\"var\">true-or-false-test</var>\n"
"    <var class=\"var\">action-to-carry-out-if-test-is-true</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/if-in-more-detail.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The true-or-false-test will be an expression that is evaluated by the Lisp "
"interpreter."
msgstr "真偽判定テストは、Lispインタプリタによって評価される式となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/if-in-more-detail.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Here is an example that you can evaluate in the usual manner.  The test is "
"whether the number 5 is greater than the number 4.  Since it is, the message "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">5 is greater than 4!</samp>&rsquo; will be "
"printed."
msgstr ""
"以下に、通常通りに評価できる例を示します。テスト内容は、数値 5 が数値 4 より"
"大きいかどうかです。大きいため、メッセージ &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">5 is "
"greater than 4!</samp>&rsquo; が出力されます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/if-in-more-detail.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(if (&gt; 5 4)                             ; <span class=\"r\">if-part</span>\n"
"    (message &quot;5 is greater than 4!&quot;))   ; <span class=\"r\">then-part</span>\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/if-in-more-detail.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(The function <code class=\"code\">&gt;</code> tests whether its first "
"argument is greater than its second argument and returns true if it is.)  <a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-_003e-_0028greater-than_0029\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"(関数 <code class=\"code\">&gt;</code> は、第1引数が第2引数より大きいかどうか"
"を判定し、そうであれば true を返します。)  <a class=\"index-entry-id\" "
"id=\"index-_003e-_0028greater-than_0029\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/if-in-more-detail.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Of course, in actual use, the test in an <code class=\"code\">if</code> "
"expression will not be fixed for all time as it is by the expression <code "
"class=\"code\">(&gt; 5 4)</code>.  Instead, at least one of the variables "
"used in the test will be bound to a value that is not known ahead of time.  "
"(If the value were known ahead of time, we would not need to run the test!)"
msgstr ""
"もちろん、実際の使用においては、<code class=\"code\">if</code> 式におけるテス"
"トは、<code class=\"code\">(&gt; 5 4)</code> 式のように常に固定されるわけでは"
"ありません。その代わりに、テストで使用される変数のうち少なくとも1つは、あらか"
"じめは不明な値に束縛されることになります。（もしその値があらかじめ分かってい"
"れば、テストを実行する必要はありません！）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/if-in-more-detail.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"For example, the value may be bound to an argument of a function "
"definition.  In the following function definition, the character of the "
"animal is a value that is passed to the function.  If the value bound to "
"<code class=\"code\">characteristic</code> is <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;fierce&quot;</code>, then the message, &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">It is a tiger!</samp>&rsquo; will be printed; otherwise, "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> will be returned."
msgstr ""
"例えば、その値は関数定義の引数に束縛されることがあります。以下の関数定義で"
"は、動物の文字が関数に渡される値となります。<code "
"class=\"code\">characteristic</code> に束縛されている値が <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;fierce&quot;</code> であれば、メッセージ &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">It is a tiger!</samp>&rsquo; が出力され、そうでなければ <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> が返されます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/if-in-more-detail.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun type-of-animal (characteristic)\n"
"  &quot;Print message in echo area depending on CHARACTERISTIC.\n"
"If the CHARACTERISTIC is the string \\&quot;fierce\\&quot;,\n"
"then warn of a tiger.&quot;\n"
"  (if (equal characteristic &quot;fierce&quot;)\n"
