#: build/html/eintr/insert_002dbuffer-body.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The body of the <code class=\"code\">insert-buffer</code> function has two "
"major parts: an <code class=\"code\">or</code> expression and a <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> expression.  The purpose of the <code "
"class=\"code\">or</code> expression is to ensure that the argument <code "
"class=\"code\">buffer</code> is bound to a buffer and not just the name of a "
"buffer.  The body of the <code class=\"code\">let</code> expression contains "
