# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/insert_002dbuffer.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">insert-buffer</code> is yet another buffer-related "
"function.  This command copies another buffer <em class=\"emph\">into</em> "
"the current buffer.  It is the reverse of <code class=\"code\">append-to-"
"buffer</code> or <code class=\"code\">copy-to-buffer</code>, since they copy "
"a region of text <em class=\"emph\">from</em> the current buffer to another "
"buffer."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">insert-buffer</code> もまた、バッファ関連の関数の一つで"
"す。このコマンドは、別のバッファを現在のバッファに<em class=\"emph\">コピー</"
"em>します。これは、現在のバッファから別のバッファへテキストの一領域を<em "
"class=\"emph\">コピー</em>する <code class=\"code\">append-to-buffer</code> "
"や <code class=\"code\">copy-to-buffer</code> とは逆の動作となります。"

