"link\" href=\"#The-kill_002dnew-function\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span><code class=\"code\">kill-new</code> 関数<a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#The-kill_002dnew-function\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kill_002dnew\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-kill_002dnew\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In version 22 the <code class=\"code\">kill-new</code> function looks like "
"this:"
msgstr ""
"バージョン22では、<code class=\"code\">kill-new</code>関数は次のようになって"
"います。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun kill-new (string &amp;optional replace yank-handler)\n"
"  &quot;Make STRING the latest kill in the kill ring.\n"
"Set `kill-ring-yank-pointer' to point to it.\n"
"\n"
"If `interprogram-cut-function' is non-nil, apply it to STRING.\n"
"Optional second argument REPLACE non-nil means that STRING will replace\n"
"the front of the kill ring, rather than being added to the list.\n"
"...&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (if (&gt; (length string) 0)\n"
"      (if yank-handler\n"
"          (put-text-property 0 (length string)\n"
"                             'yank-handler yank-handler string))\n"
"    (if yank-handler\n"
"        (signal 'args-out-of-range\n"
"                (list string &quot;yank-handler specified for empty string&quot;))))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (if (fboundp 'menu-bar-update-yank-menu)\n"
"      (menu-bar-update-yank-menu string (and replace (car kill-ring))))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (if (and replace kill-ring)\n"
"      (setcar kill-ring string)\n"
"    (push string kill-ring)\n"
"    (if (&gt; (length kill-ring) kill-ring-max)\n"
"        (setcdr (nthcdr (1- kill-ring-max) kill-ring) nil)))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (setq kill-ring-yank-pointer kill-ring)\n"
"  (if interprogram-cut-function\n"
"      (funcall interprogram-cut-function string (not replace))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "(Notice that the function is not interactive.)"
msgstr "（関数が対話型ではないことに注意してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "As usual, we can look at this function in parts."
msgstr "いつものように、この関数を部分ごとに見ていくことができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The function definition has an optional <code class=\"code\">yank-handler</"
"code> argument, which when invoked tells the function how to deal with "
"properties added to the text, such as bold or italics.  We will skip that."
msgstr ""
"関数定義にはオプションの <code class=\"code\">yank-handler</code> 引数があ"
"り、これを指定すると、太字や斜体などテキストに追加されたプロパティをどのよう"
"に処理すべきかを関数に伝えることができます。これについては割愛します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The first line of the documentation makes sense:"
msgstr "ドキュメントの1行目は理にかなっている："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make STRING the latest kill in the kill ring.\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Let&rsquo;s skip over the rest of the documentation for the moment."
msgstr "ひとまず、残りのドキュメントは飛ばしましょう。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Also, let&rsquo;s skip over the initial <code class=\"code\">if</code> "
"expression and those lines of code involving <code class=\"code\">menu-bar-"
"update-yank-menu</code>.  We will explain them below."
msgstr ""
"また、冒頭の <code class=\"code\">if</code> 式と <code class=\"code\">menu-"
"bar-update-yank-menu</code> を含む数行のコードはひとまず飛ばしましょう。これ"
"らについては後ほど解説します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The critical lines are these:"
msgstr "重要な箇所は以下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (if (and replace kill-ring)\n"
"      ;; <span class=\"r\">then</span>\n"
"      (setcar kill-ring string)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ;; <span class=\"r\">else</span>\n"
"    (push string kill-ring)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    (if (&gt; (length kill-ring) kill-ring-max)\n"
"        ;; <span class=\"r\">avoid overly long kill ring</span>\n"
"        (setcdr (nthcdr (1- kill-ring-max) kill-ring) nil)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#.  /@w 
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The conditional test is <code class=\"code\">(and&nbsp;replace&nbsp;kill-"
"ring)</code>.  This will be true when two conditions are met: the kill ring "
"has something in it, and the <code class=\"code\">replace</code> variable is "
"true."
msgstr ""
"条件判定は <code class=\"code\">(and&nbsp;replace&nbsp;kill-ring)</code> で"
"す。これは、キルリングに何らかのものが入っており、かつ変数 <code "
"class=\"code\">replace</code> が真であるという2つの条件が満たされたときに成立"
"します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"When the <code class=\"code\">kill-append</code> function sets <code "
"class=\"code\">replace</code> to be true and when the kill ring has at least "
"one item in it, the <code class=\"code\">setcar</code> expression is "
"executed:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">kill-append</code> 関数が <code class=\"code\">replace</"
"code> を true に設定し、かつキルリングに少なくとも1つのアイテムが存在する場"
"合、<code class=\"code\">setcar</code> 式が実行されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(setcar kill-ring string)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">setcar</code> function actually changes the first "
"element of the <code class=\"code\">kill-ring</code> list to the value of "
"<code class=\"code\">string</code>.  It replaces the first element."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">setcar</code> 関数は、実際には <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-ring</code> リストの最初の要素を <code "
"class=\"code\">string</code> の値に変更します。最初の要素を置き換えるのです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"On the other hand, if the kill ring is empty, or replace is false, the else-"
"part of the condition is executed:"
msgstr ""
"一方、キルリングが空であるか、replaceがfalseである場合は、条件のelse部分が実"
"行されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(push string kill-ring)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">push</code> puts its first argument onto the second.  "
"It is similar to the older"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">push</code> は第1引数を第2引数に代入します。これは旧来の"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(setq kill-ring (cons string kill-ring))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "or the newer"
msgstr "あるいはより新しいもの"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(add-to-list kill-ring string)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"When it is false, the expression first constructs a new version of the kill "
"ring by prepending <code class=\"code\">string</code> to the existing kill "
"ring as a new element (that is what the <code class=\"code\">push</code> "
"does).  Then it executes a second <code class=\"code\">if</code> clause.  "
"This second <code class=\"code\">if</code> clause keeps the kill ring from "
"growing too long."
msgstr ""
"偽の場合、この式はまず、既存のキルリングの先頭に新しい要素として <code "
"class=\"code\">string</code> を付加することで、キルリングの新しいバージョンを"
"構築します（これが <code class=\"code\">push</code> の動作です）。次に、2番目"
"の <code class=\"code\">if</code> 節を実行します。この2番目の <code "
"class=\"code\">if</code> 節により、キルリングが長くなりすぎるのを防ぎます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Let&rsquo;s look at these two expressions in order."
msgstr "これら2つの表現を順番に見ていきましょう。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">push</code> line of the else-part sets the new "
"value of the kill ring to what results from adding the string being killed "
"to the old kill ring."
msgstr ""
"else部分の<code class=\"code\">push</code>行は、キルリングの新しい値を、キル"
"対象の文字列を既存のキルリングに加えた結果に設定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "We can see how this works with an example."
msgstr "具体例を通して、これがどのように機能するのか見てみましょう。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "First,"
msgstr "まず、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(setq example-list '(&quot;here is a clause&quot; &quot;another clause&quot;))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"After evaluating this expression with <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd>, you "
"can evaluate <code class=\"code\">example-list</code> and see what it "
"returns:"
msgstr ""
"この式を <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd> で評価した後、<code "
"class=\"code\">example-list</code> を評価してどのような値が返ってくるかを確認"
"できます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"example-list\n"
"     &rArr; (&quot;here is a clause&quot; &quot;another clause&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Now, we can add a new element on to this list by evaluating the following "
"expression: <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-push_002c-example\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"次に、以下の式を評価することで、このリストに新しい要素を追加できます。<a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-push_002c-example\"></a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(push &quot;a third clause&quot; example-list)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"When we evaluate <code class=\"code\">example-list</code>, we find its value "
"is:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">example-list</code>を評価すると、その値は次のようになり"
"ます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"example-list\n"
"     &rArr; (&quot;a third clause&quot; &quot;here is a clause&quot; &quot;another clause&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Thus, the third clause is added to the list by <code class=\"code\">push</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"したがって、3番目の節が<code class=\"code\">push</code>によってリストに追加さ"
"れる。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Now for the second part of the <code class=\"code\">if</code> clause.  This "
"expression keeps the kill ring from growing too long.  It looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"次に、<code class=\"code\">if</code> 節の後半部分です。この式により、キルリン"
"グが長くなりすぎるのを防ぎます。内容は以下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(if (&gt; (length kill-ring) kill-ring-max)\n"
"    (setcdr (nthcdr (1- kill-ring-max) kill-ring) nil))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The code checks whether the length of the kill ring is greater than the "
"maximum permitted length.  This is the value of <code class=\"code\">kill-"
"ring-max</code> (which is 120, by default).  If the length of the kill ring "
"is too long, then this code sets the last element of the kill ring to <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>.  It does this by using two functions, <code "
"class=\"code\">nthcdr</code> and <code class=\"code\">setcdr</code>."
msgstr ""
"このコードは、キルリングの長さが最大許容長を超えているかどうかを判定します。"
"これは<code class=\"code\">kill-ring-max</code>（デフォルトでは120）の値で"
"す。キルリングの長さが長すぎる場合、このコードはキルリングの最後の要素を"
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>に設定します。具体的には、<code "
"class=\"code\">nthcdr</code>と<code class=\"code\">setcdr</code>という2つの関"
"数を用いてこれを行います。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html
msgid ""
"We looked at <code class=\"code\">setcdr</code> earlier (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"setcdr.html\"><code class=\"code\">setcdr</code></"
"a>).  It sets the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of a list, just as <code "
"class=\"code\">setcar</code> sets the <small class=\"sc\">CAR</small> of a "
"list.  In this case, however, <code class=\"code\">setcdr</code> will not be "
"setting the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of the whole kill ring; the "
"<code class=\"code\">nthcdr</code> function is used to cause it to set the "
"<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of the next to last element of the kill "
"ring&mdash;this means that since the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of the "
"next to last element is the last element of the kill ring, it will set the "
"last element of the kill ring."
msgstr ""
"先ほど <code class=\"code\">setcdr</code> について見ました（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"setcdr.html\"><code class=\"code\">setcdr</code></a> "
"を参照）。これは、<code class=\"code\">setcar</code> がリストの <small "
"class=\"sc\">CAR</small> を設定するのと同様に、リストの <small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small> を設定します。ただし、この場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">setcdr</code> はキルリング全体の <small class=\"sc\">CDR</"
"small> を設定するわけではありません。<code class=\"code\">nthcdr</code> 関数"
"を用いて、キルリングの最後から2番目の要素の <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> "
"を設定するようにしています。つまり、最後から2番目の要素の <small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small> はキルリングの最後の要素であるため、結果としてキルリ"
"ングの最後の要素が設定されることになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-nthcdr_002c-example\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-nthcdr_002c-example\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">nthcdr</code> function works by repeatedly taking "
"the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of a list&mdash;it takes the <small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of the "
"<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> &hellip; It does this <var class=\"var\">N</"
"var> times and returns the results.  (See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"nthcdr.html\"><code class=\"code\">nthcdr</code></a>.)"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nthcdr</code> 関数は、リストの <small class=\"sc\">CDR</"
"small> を繰り返し取得することで動作します&mdash;<small class=\"sc\">CDR</"
"small> の <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> の <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> "
"を取得し&hellip; これを <var class=\"var\">N</var> 回繰り返し、その結果を返し"
"ます。  (<a class=\"xref\" href=\"nthcdr.html\"><code class=\"code\">nthcdr</"
"code></a> を参照してください。)"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-setcdr_002c-example\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-setcdr_002c-example\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html
msgid ""
"Thus, if we had a four element list that was supposed to be three elements "
"long, we could set the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of the next to last "
"element to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, and thereby shorten the list.  "
"(If you set the last element to some other value than <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, which you could do, then you would not have "
"shortened the list.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"setcdr.html\"><code "
"class=\"code\">setcdr</code></a>.)"
msgstr ""
"したがって、本来3要素であるべき4要素のリストがある場合、最後から2番目の要素の"
"<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>を<code class=\"code\">nil</code>に設定するこ"
"とで、リストを短縮できます。（もし最後の要素を<code class=\"code\">nil</code>"
"以外の値に設定した場合――これは可能です――、リストを短縮したことにはなりませ"
"ん。<a class=\"xref\" href=\"setcdr.html\"><code class=\"code\">setcdr</"
"code></a>を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"You can see shortening by evaluating the following three expressions in "
"turn.  First set the value of <code class=\"code\">trees</code> to <code "
"class=\"code\">(maple oak pine birch)</code>, then set the <small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of its second <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> to "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> and then find the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">trees</code>:"
msgstr ""
"以下の3つの式を順に評価することで、短縮を確認できます。まず<code "
"class=\"code\">trees</code>の値を<code class=\"code\">(maple oak pine "
"birch)</code>に設定し、次に2番目の<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>の<small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small>の値を<code class=\"code\">nil</code>に設定し、最後に"
"<code class=\"code\">trees</code>の値を求めます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq trees (list 'maple 'oak 'pine 'birch))\n"
"     &rArr; (maple oak pine birch)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setcdr (nthcdr 2 trees) nil)\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
"\n"
"trees\n"
"     &rArr; (maple oak pine)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(The value returned by the <code class=\"code\">setcdr</code> expression is "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> since that is what the <small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small> is set to.)"
msgstr ""
"（<code class=\"code\">setcdr</code> 式が返す値は <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> となります。これは、<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> に設定されている値"
"だからです。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"To repeat, in <code class=\"code\">kill-new</code>, the <code "
"class=\"code\">nthcdr</code> function takes the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</"
"small> a number of times that is one less than the maximum permitted size of "
"the kill ring and <code class=\"code\">setcdr</code> sets the <small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of that element (which will be the rest of the "
"elements in the kill ring) to <code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  This "
"prevents the kill ring from growing too long."
msgstr ""
"繰り返しになりますが、<code class=\"code\">kill-new</code> では、<code "
"class=\"code\">nthcdr</code> 関数が <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> に、キル"
"リングの最大許容サイズより1小さい回数分の値を代入し、<code "
"class=\"code\">setcdr</code> がその要素（キルリング内の残りの要素となります）"
"の <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> を <code class=\"code\">nil</code> に設定"
"します。これにより、キルリングが長くなりすぎるのを防ぎます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The next to last expression in the <code class=\"code\">kill-new</code> "
"function is"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">kill-new</code>関数の最後から2番目の式は"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">kill-ring-yank-pointer</code> is a global variable "
"that is set to be the <code class=\"code\">kill-ring</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">kill-ring-yank-pointer</code>は、<code "
"class=\"code\">kill-ring</code>に設定されるグローバル変数です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Even though the <code class=\"code\">kill-ring-yank-pointer</code> is called "
"a &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">pointer</samp>&rsquo;, it is a variable just "
"like the kill ring.  However, the name has been chosen to help humans "
"understand how the variable is used."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">kill-ring-yank-pointer</code>は「<samp "
"class=\"samp\">pointer</samp>」と呼ばれていますが、キルリングと同様に変数で"
"す。ただし、この名称は、人間がその変数の使われ方を理解しやすくするために付け"
"られています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Now, to return to an early expression in the body of the function:"
msgstr "さて、関数本体にある初期の式に戻りましょう。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (if (fboundp 'menu-bar-update-yank-menu)\n"
"       (menu-bar-update-yank-menu string (and replace (car kill-ring))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "It starts with an <code class=\"code\">if</code> expression"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">if</code> 式から始まります"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html
msgid ""
"In this case, the expression tests first to see whether <code "
"class=\"code\">menu-bar-update-yank-menu</code> exists as a function, and if "
"so, calls it.  The <code class=\"code\">fboundp</code> function returns true "
"if the symbol it is testing has a function definition that is not void.  If "
"the symbol&rsquo;s function definition were void, we would receive an error "
"message, as we did when we created errors intentionally (see <a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Making-Errors.html\">Generate an Error Message</a>)."
msgstr ""
"この場合、式はまず <code class=\"code\">menu-bar-update-yank-menu</code> が関"
"数として存在するかどうかを判定し、存在すればそれを呼び出します。<code "
"class=\"code\">fboundp</code> 関数は、判定対象のシンボルの関数定義が void で"
"ない場合に true を返します。もしそのシンボルの関数定義が void であれば、意図"
"的にエラーを発生させたときと同様に、エラーメッセージが表示されます（<a "
"class=\"pxref\" href=\"Making-Errors.html\">エラーメッセージの生成</a>を参"
"照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The then-part contains an expression whose first element is the function "
"<code class=\"code\">and</code>."
msgstr ""
"その時点の部分には、第1要素が関数 <code class=\"code\">and</code> である式が"
"含まれている。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-and\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-and\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">and</code> special form evaluates each of its "
"arguments until one of the arguments returns a value of <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code>, in which case the <code class=\"code\">and</code> "
"expression returns <code class=\"code\">nil</code>; however, if none of the "
"arguments returns a value of <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, the value "
"resulting from evaluating the last argument is returned.  (Since such a "
"value is not <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, it is considered true in Emacs "
"Lisp.)  In other words, an <code class=\"code\">and</code> expression "
"returns a true value only if all its arguments are true.  (See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Second-Buffer-Related-Review.html\">Review</a>.)"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">and</code> 特殊形式は、引数のいずれかが <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> の値を返すまで各引数を評価し、その場合は <code "
"class=\"code\">and</code> 式が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返します。た"
"だし、どの引数も <code class=\"code\">nil</code> の値を返さない場合は、最後の"
"引数を評価した結果が返されます。（このような値は <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> ではないため、Emacs Lisp では真とみなされます。）言い換えれば、<code "
"class=\"code\">and</code> 式は、すべての引数が真である場合にのみ真の値を返し"
"ます。（<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Second-Buffer-Related-Review.html\">復習</a>"
"を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The expression determines whether the second argument to <code "
"class=\"code\">menu-bar-update-yank-menu</code> is true or not."
msgstr ""
"この式によって、<code class=\"code\">menu-bar-update-yank-menu</code> の第2引"
"数が真であるか否かが決まります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">menu-bar-update-yank-menu</code> is one of the "
"functions that make it possible to use the &ldquo;Select and Paste&rdquo; "
"menu in the Edit item of a menu bar; using a mouse, you can look at the "
"various pieces of text you have saved and select one piece to paste."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">menu-bar-update-yank-menu</code>は、メニューバーの「編"
"集」項目にある「選択して貼り付け」メニューを利用可能にする機能の一つです。マ"
"ウスを使って保存済みのさまざまなテキストを確認し、その中から一つを選択して貼"
"り付けることができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The last expression in the <code class=\"code\">kill-new</code> function "
"adds the newly copied string to whatever facility exists for copying and "
"pasting among different programs running in a windowing system.  In the X "
"Windowing system, for example, the <code class=\"code\">x-select-text</code> "
"function takes the string and stores it in memory operated by X.  You can "
"paste the string in another program, such as an Xterm."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">kill-new</code> 関数の最後の式は、新たにコピーした文字列"
"を、ウィンドウシステム上で動作する異なるプログラム間でコピー＆ペーストを行う"
"ための既存の機能に追加します。例えば X Windowing システムでは、<code "
"class=\"code\">x-select-text</code> 関数が文字列を受け取り、X が管理するメモ"
"リに格納します。この文字列を、Xterm などの別のプログラムに貼り付けることがで"
"きます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (if interprogram-cut-function\n"
"      (funcall interprogram-cut-function string (not replace))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dnew-function.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If an <code class=\"code\">interprogram-cut-function</code> exists, then "
"Emacs executes <code class=\"code\">funcall</code>, which in turn calls its "
"first argument as a function and passes the remaining arguments to it.  "
"(Incidentally, as far as I can see, this <code class=\"code\">if</code> "
"expression could be replaced by an <code class=\"code\">and</code> "
"expression similar to the one in the first part of the function.)"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">interprogram-cut-function</code> が存在する場合、Emacs "
"は <code class=\"code\">funcall</code> を実行し、それがさらに第1引数を関数と"
"して呼び出し、残りの引数をそこに渡します。（ちなみに、私が見る限り、この "
"<code class=\"code\">if</code> 式は、関数の前半部分にあるものと同様の <code "
"class=\"code\">and</code> 式に置き換えられるでしょう。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
