#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dregion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code> function uses the <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-region</code> function.  This function clips text from a "
"region and copies that text to the kill ring, from which it may be retrieved."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code> 関数は <code class=\"code\">kill-"
"region</code> 関数を使用します。この関数は領域からテキストを切り出し、そのテ"
"キストをキルリングにコピーします。そこからテキストを取得できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dregion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The Emacs 22 version of that function uses <code class=\"code\">condition-"
"case</code> and <code class=\"code\">copy-region-as-kill</code>, both of "
"which we will explain.  <code class=\"code\">condition-case</code> is an "
"important special form."
msgstr ""
"その関数のEmacs 22版では<code class=\"code\">condition-case</code>と<code "
"class=\"code\">copy-region-as-kill</code>が使われており、これらについてはいず"
"れも解説します。<code class=\"code\">condition-case</code>は重要な特殊形式で"
"す。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/kill_002dregion.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In essence, the <code class=\"code\">kill-region</code> function calls <code "
"class=\"code\">condition-case</code>, which takes three arguments.  In this "
"function, the first argument does nothing.  The second argument contains the "
"code that does the work when all goes well.  The third argument contains the "
"code that is called in the event of an error."
msgstr ""

