# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/last_002dcommand-_0026-this_002dcommand.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Normally, whenever a function is executed, Emacs sets the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">this-command</code> to the function being executed (which in "
"this case would be <code class=\"code\">copy-region-as-kill</code>).  At the "
"same time, Emacs sets the value of <code class=\"code\">last-command</code> "
"to the previous value of <code class=\"code\">this-command</code>."
msgstr ""
"通常、関数が実行されるたびに、Emacsは<code class=\"code\">this-command</code>"
"の値を実行中の関数（この場合は<code class=\"code\">copy-region-as-kill</"
"code>）に設定します。同時に、Emacsは<code class=\"code\">last-command</code>"
"の値を<code class=\"code\">this-command</code>の直前の値に設定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/last_002dcommand-_0026-this_002dcommand.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In the first part of the body of the <code class=\"code\">copy-region-as-"
"kill</code> function, an <code class=\"code\">if</code> expression "
"determines whether the value of <code class=\"code\">last-command</code> is "
"<code class=\"code\">kill-region</code>.  If so, the then-part of the <code "
"class=\"code\">if</code> expression is evaluated; it uses the <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-append</code> function to concatenate the text copied at "
"this call to the function with the text already in the first element (the "
"<small class=\"sc\">CAR</small>) of the kill ring.  On the other hand, if "
"the value of <code class=\"code\">last-command</code> is not <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-region</code>, then the <code class=\"code\">copy-region-"
"as-kill</code> function attaches a new element to the kill ring using the "
"<code class=\"code\">kill-new</code> function."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">copy-region-as-kill</code> 関数の本体の前半部分では、"
"<code class=\"code\">if</code> 式によって <code class=\"code\">last-command</"
"code> の値が <code class=\"code\">kill-region</code> であるかどうかが判定され"
"ます。そうであれば、<code class=\"code\">if</code> 式の then 部分が評価されま"
"す。この部分では <code class=\"code\">kill-append</code> 関数を用いて、今回の"
"関数呼び出し時にコピーされたテキストと、キルリングの最初の要素（<small "
"class=\"sc\">CAR</small>）に既に含まれているテキストを連結します。一方、"
"<code class=\"code\">last-command</code> の値が <code class=\"code\">kill-"
"region</code> でない場合は、<code class=\"code\">copy-region-as-kill</code> "
"関数が <code class=\"code\">kill-new</code> 関数を用いてキルリングに新しい要"
"素を追加します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/last_002dcommand-_0026-this_002dcommand.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">if</code> expression reads as follows; it uses "
"<code class=\"code\">eq</code>:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">if</code> 式は次のように記述され、<code "
"class=\"code\">eq</code> を使用します："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/last_002dcommand-_0026-this_002dcommand.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (if (eq last-command 'kill-region)\n"
"      ;; <span class=\"r\">then-part</span>\n"
"      (kill-append  (filter-buffer-substring beg end) (&lt; end beg))\n"
"    ;; <span class=\"r\">else-part</span>\n"
"    (kill-new  (filter-buffer-substring beg end)))\n"
msgstr ""

