# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/length.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"You can find out how many elements there are in a list by using the Lisp "
"function <code class=\"code\">length</code>, as in the following examples:"
msgstr ""
"以下の例のように、Lispの関数 <code class=\"code\">length</code> を使うこと"
