# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/length.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In the third example, the <code class=\"code\">cons</code> function is used "
"to construct a three element list which is then passed to the <code "
"class=\"code\">length</code> function as its argument."
msgstr ""
"3番目の例では、<code class=\"code\">cons</code>関数を用いて3つの要素からなる"
