"ています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/length.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"We can also use <code class=\"code\">length</code> to count the number of "
"elements in an empty list:"
