# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><h3>
#: build/html/eintr/lengths_002dlist_002dfile.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>14.6 <code class=\"code\">lengths-list-file</code> in Detail<a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#lengths_002dlist_002dfile-in-Detail\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>14.6 <code class=\"code\">lengths-list-file</code> の詳細<a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#lengths_002dlist_002dfile-in-Detail\"> &para;"
"</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/lengths_002dlist_002dfile.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The core of the <code class=\"code\">lengths-list-file</code> function is a "
"<code class=\"code\">while</code> loop containing a function to move point "
"forward defun by defun, and a function to count the number of words and "
"symbols in each defun.  This core must be surrounded by functions that do "
"various other tasks, including finding the file, and ensuring that point "
"starts out at the beginning of the file.  The function definition looks like "
"this: <a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-lengths_002dlist_002dfile\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">lengths-list-file</code> 関数の中核となるのは、point を "
"defun 単位で前進させる関数と、各 defun 内の単語数と記号数をカウントする関数を"
"含む <code class=\"code\">while</code> ループです。この中核部分は、ファイルの"
"検索や、point がファイルの先頭から始まることの確保など、その他のさまざまな処"
"理を行う関数で囲まれている必要があります。関数の定義は次のようになります。<a "
"class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-lengths_002dlist_002dfile\"></a>"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/lengths_002dlist_002dfile.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun lengths-list-file (filename)\n"
"  &quot;Return list of definitions' lengths within the file named FILENAME.\n"
"The returned list is a list of numbers.\n"
"Each number in the list is the number of words or\n"
"symbols in one function definition.&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/lengths_002dlist_002dfile.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (message &quot;Working on `%s' ... &quot; filename)\n"
"  (save-excursion\n"
"    (let ((buffer (find-file-noselect filename))\n"
"          (lengths-list))\n"
"      (set-buffer buffer)\n"
"      (setq buffer-read-only t)\n"
"      (widen)\n"
"      (goto-char (point-min))\n"
"      (while (re-search-forward &quot;^(defun&quot; nil t)\n"
"        (setq lengths-list\n"
"              (cons (count-words-in-defun) lengths-list)))\n"
"      (kill-buffer buffer)\n"
"      lengths-list)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/lengths_002dlist_002dfile.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The function is passed one argument <var class=\"var\">filename</var>, the "
"name of the file on which it will work.  It has four lines of documentation, "
"but no interactive specification.  Since people worry that a computer is "
"broken if they don&rsquo;t see anything going on, the first line of the body "
"is a message."
msgstr ""
"この関数には、処理対象となるファイル名である1つの引数 <var "
"class=\"var\">filename</var> が渡されます。ドキュメントは4行ありますが、イン"
"タラクティブな仕様記述はありません。何が起きているのかが見えないとコンピュー"
"タが故障したのではないかと不安に思う人がいるため、本体の1行目にはメッセージが"
"記述されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/lengths_002dlist_002dfile.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The next line contains a <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> that "
"returns Emacs&rsquo;s attention to the current buffer when the function "
"completes.  This is useful in case you embed this function in another "
"function that presumes point is restored to the original buffer."
msgstr ""
"次の行には、関数の実行が完了した際にEmacsのフォーカスを現在のバッファに戻す"
"<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code>が含まれています。これは、pointが元"
"のバッファに復元されることを前提とした別の関数の中に、この関数を組み込む場合"
"に有用です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/lengths_002dlist_002dfile.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In the varlist of the <code class=\"code\">let</code> expression, Emacs "
"finds the file and binds the local variable <code class=\"code\">buffer</"
"code> to the buffer containing the file.  At the same time, Emacs creates "
"<code class=\"code\">lengths-list</code> as a local variable."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">let</code> 式の varlist において、Emacs はファイルを探"
"し、ローカル変数 <code class=\"code\">buffer</code> をそのファイルを含むバッ"
"ファにバインドします。同時に、Emacs は <code class=\"code\">lengths-list</"
"code> をローカル変数として作成します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/lengths_002dlist_002dfile.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Next, Emacs switches its attention to the buffer."
msgstr "次に、Emacsはバッファにフォーカスを移します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/lengths_002dlist_002dfile.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In the following line, Emacs makes the buffer read-only.  Ideally, this line "
"is not necessary.  None of the functions for counting words and symbols in a "
"function definition should change the buffer.  Besides, the buffer is not "
"going to be saved, even if it were changed.  This line is entirely the "
"consequence of great, perhaps excessive, caution.  The reason for the "
"caution is that this function and those it calls work on the sources for "
"Emacs and it is inconvenient if they are inadvertently modified.  It goes "
"without saying that I did not realize a need for this line until an "
"experiment went awry and started to modify my Emacs source files &hellip;"
msgstr ""
"次の行で、Emacsはバッファを読み取り専用にします。本来であれば、この行は不要で"
"す。関数定義内の単語や記号をカウントする関数のいずれも、バッファを変更すべき"
"ではありません。それに、たとえ変更されたとしても、バッファが保存されることは"
"ありません。この行は、極めて、おそらく過剰なまでの慎重さから生じたものです。"
"慎重な理由は、この関数およびそれが呼び出す関数がEmacsのソースコードに対して動"
"作しており、意図せず変更されてしまうと不都合だからです。言うまでもなく、実験"
"が失敗してEmacsのソースファイルが変更され始めるまで、この行が必要だとは気づき"
"ませんでした&hellip;"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/lengths_002dlist_002dfile.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Next comes a call to widen the buffer if it is narrowed.  This function is "
"usually not needed&mdash;Emacs creates a fresh buffer if none already "
"exists; but if a buffer visiting the file already exists Emacs returns that "
"one.  In this case, the buffer may be narrowed and must be widened.  If we "
"wanted to be fully user-friendly, we would arrange to save the restriction "
"and the location of point, but we won&rsquo;t."
msgstr ""
"次に、バッファが狭められている場合にそれを広げる処理が続きます。この機能は通"
"常不要です。Emacsは、バッファが存在しない場合は新規に作成しますが、ファイルを"
"参照しているバッファが既に存在する場合はそれを返します。この場合、バッファが"
"狭められている可能性があり、広げる必要があります。完全にユーザーフレンドリー"
"にするなら、制限情報とポイントの位置を保存するようにしたいところですが、そう"
"はしません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
