msgid ""
"<span>C.4.4 The <code class=\"code\">mapcar</code> Function<a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-mapcar-Function\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>C.4.4 <code class=\"code\">mapcar</code> 関数<a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#The-mapcar-Function\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/mapcar.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mapcar\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-mapcar\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/mapcar.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">mapcar</code> is a function that calls its first "
"argument with each element of its second argument, in turn.  The second "
"argument must be a sequence."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">mapcar</code> は、第2引数の各要素を順に第1引数に渡して呼"
"び出す関数です。第2引数はシーケンスである必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/mapcar.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">map</samp>&rsquo; part of the name comes "
"from the mathematical phrase, &ldquo;mapping over a domain&rdquo;, meaning "
"to apply a function to each of the elements in a domain.  The mathematical "
"phrase is based on the metaphor of a surveyor walking, one step at a time, "
"over an area he is mapping.  And &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">car</"
"samp>&rsquo;, of course, comes from the Lisp notion of the first of a list."
msgstr ""
"名称の「<samp class=\"samp\">map</samp>」の部分は、数学的な表現である「領域上"
"の写像」に由来しており、これは領域内の各要素に関数を適用することを意味しま"
"す。この数学的な表現は、測量士が写像対象の区域を一歩ずつ歩いていくという比喩"
"に基づいています。そして「<samp class=\"samp\">car</samp>」は、言うまでもな"
"く、リストの先頭というLispの概念に由来しています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/mapcar.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(mapcar '1+ '(2 4 6))\n"
"     &rArr; (3 5 7)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/mapcar.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The function <code class=\"code\">1+</code> which adds one to its argument, "
"is executed on <em class=\"emph\">each</em> element of the list, and a new "
"list is returned."
msgstr ""
"引数に1を加える関数 <code class=\"code\">1+</code> がリストの<em "
"class=\"emph\">各</em>要素に対して実行され、新しいリストが返されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/mapcar.html
msgid ""
"Contrast this with <code class=\"code\">apply</code>, which applies its "
"first argument to all the remaining.  (See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Readying-"
"a-Graph.html\">Readying a Graph</a>, for an explanation of <code "
"class=\"code\">apply</code>.)"
msgstr ""
"これに対し、<code class=\"code\">apply</code>は第1引数を残りのすべての引数に"
"適用します。（<code class=\"code\">apply</code>の解説については、<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"Readying-a-Graph.html\">グラフの準備</a>を参照してくだ"
"さい。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/mapcar.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In the definition of <code class=\"code\">one-fiftieth</code>, the first "
"argument is the anonymous function:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">one-fiftieth</code> の定義において、第1引数は無名関数で"
"す："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/mapcar.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"and the second argument is <code class=\"code\">full-range</code>, which "
"will be bound to <code class=\"code\">list-for-graph</code>."
msgstr ""
"また、第2引数は <code class=\"code\">full-range</code> であり、これは <code "
"class=\"code\">list-for-graph</code> にバインドされます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/mapcar.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The whole expression looks like this:"
msgstr "式全体は次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/mapcar.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(mapcar (lambda (arg) (/ arg 50)) full-range))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/mapcar.html
msgid ""
"See <a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/"
"manual/html_node/elisp/Mapping-Functions.html#Mapping-Functions\">Mapping "
"Functions</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</"
"cite>, for more about <code class=\"code\">mapcar</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">mapcar</code>の詳細については、<cite class=\"cite\">The "
"GNU Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>の<a data-manual=\"elisp\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Mapping-"
"Functions.html#Mapping-Functions\">Mapping Functions</a>を参照してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/mapcar.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Using the <code class=\"code\">one-fiftieth</code> function, we can generate "
"a list in which each element is one-fiftieth the size of the corresponding "
"element in <code class=\"code\">list-for-graph</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">one-fiftieth</code>関数を使えば、各要素が<code "
"class=\"code\">list-for-graph</code>の対応する要素の50分の1の大きさとなるリス"
