"in-detail.html\"><code class=\"code\">multiply-by-seven</code> in detail</"
"a>, for an example of this.)"
msgstr ""
"ダブルクォートで囲まれた文字列全体が単一の引数となり、<i class=\"i\">そのまま"
"</i>出力されます。（なお、この例ではメッセージ自体がダブルクォートで囲まれた"
"状態でエコーエリアに表示されます。これは、<code class=\"code\">message</code>"
"関数が返す値が表示されるためです。ご自身で作成されるプログラムで<code "
"class=\"code\">message</code>を使用する場合の多くは、テキストは副作用として"
"クォートなしでエコーエリアに出力されます。この例については、<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"multiply_002dby_002dseven-in-detail.html\"><code "
"class=\"code\">multiply-by-seven</code>の詳細</a>を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/message.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"However, if there is a &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo; in the "
"quoted string of characters, the <code class=\"code\">message</code> "
"function does not print the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo; as "
"such, but looks to the argument that follows the string.  It evaluates the "
"second argument and prints the value at the location in the string where the "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo; is."
msgstr ""
"ただし、引用符で囲まれた文字列の中に &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%s</"
"samp>&rsquo; がある場合、<code class=\"code\">message</code> 関数は &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo; をそのまま出力するのではなく、文字列に"
"続く引数を参照します。第2引数を評価し、文字列内で &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo; がある位置の値を出力します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/message.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"You can see this by positioning the cursor after the following expression "
"and typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd>:"
msgstr ""
"以下の式の後にカーソルを置いて <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd> と入力する"
"と、これが確認できます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/message.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(message &quot;The name of this buffer is: %s.&quot; (buffer-name))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/message.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In Info, <code class=\"code\">&quot;The name of this buffer is: *info*.&quot;"
"</code> will appear in the echo area.  The function <code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-name</code> returns the name of the buffer as a "
"string, which the <code class=\"code\">message</code> function inserts in "
"place of <code class=\"code\">%s</code>."
msgstr ""
"Infoでは、<code class=\"code\">&quot;The name of this buffer is: "
"*info*.&quot;</code>がエコーエリアに表示されます。関数<code "
"class=\"code\">buffer-name</code>はバッファ名を文字列として返し、関数<code "
"class=\"code\">message</code>がそれを<code class=\"code\">%s</code>の代わりに"
"挿入します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/message.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"To print a value as an integer, use &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%d</"
"samp>&rsquo; in the same way as &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%s</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  For example, to print a message in the echo area that states "
"the value of the <code class=\"code\">fill-column</code>, evaluate the "
"following:"
msgstr ""
"値を整数として出力するには、<samp class=\"samp\">%s</samp>と同様に<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%d</samp>を使用します。例えば、echo領域に<code "
"class=\"code\">fill-column</code>の値を示すメッセージを出力するには、以下を評"
"価します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/message.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(message &quot;The value of fill-column is %d.&quot; fill-column)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/message.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"On my system, when I evaluate this list, <code class=\"code\">&quot;The "
"value of fill-column is 72.&quot;</code> appears in my echo area<a "
"class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF5\" href=\"#FOOT5\"><sup>5</sup></a>."
msgstr ""
"私の環境では、このリストを評価すると、エコー領域に<code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;The value of fill-column is 72.&quot;</code>が表示されま"
"す<a class=\"footnote\" id=\"DOCF5\" href=\"#FOOT5\"><sup>5</sup></a>。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/message.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If there is more than one &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo; in "
"the quoted string, the value of the first argument following the quoted "
"string is printed at the location of the first &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo; and the value of the second argument is "
"printed at the location of the second &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%s</"
"samp>&rsquo;, and so on."
msgstr ""
"引用符で囲まれた文字列内に複数の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%s</"
"samp>&rsquo; がある場合、最初の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo; "
"の位置にその文字列に続く第1引数の値が、2番目の &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo; の位置に第2引数の値が、というように順に出力さ"
"れます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/message.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "For example, if you evaluate the following,"
msgstr "例えば、以下を評価すると、"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/message.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(message &quot;There are %d %s in the office!&quot;\n"
"         (- fill-column 14) &quot;pink elephants&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/message.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"a rather whimsical message will appear in your echo area.  On my system it "
"says, <code class=\"code\">&quot;There are 58 pink elephants in the office!"
"&quot;</code>."
msgstr ""
"エコーエリアにかなり風変わりなメッセージが表示されます。私の環境では、<code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;There are 58 pink elephants in the office!&quot;</code>"
"と表示されています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/message.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The expression <code class=\"code\">(- fill-column 14)</code> is evaluated "
"and the resulting number is inserted in place of the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%d</samp>&rsquo;; and the string in double quotes, <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;pink elephants&quot;</code>, is treated as a single "
"argument and inserted in place of the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%s</"
"samp>&rsquo;.  (That is to say, a string between double quotes evaluates to "
"itself, like a number.)"
msgstr ""
"式 <code class=\"code\">(- fill-column 14)</code> が評価され、その結果得られ"
"た数値が &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%d</samp>&rsquo; の代わりに挿入されま"
"す。また、ダブルクォートで囲まれた文字列 <code class=\"code\">&quot;pink "
"elephants&quot;</code> は単一の引数として扱われ、&lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo; の代わりに挿入されます。（つまり、ダブル"
"クォートで囲まれた文字列は、数値と同様にそれ自体として評価されます。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/message.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Finally, here is a somewhat complex example that not only illustrates the "
"computation of a number, but also shows how you can use an expression within "
"an expression to generate the text that is substituted for &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo;:"
msgstr ""
"最後に、数値の計算例を示すだけでなく、式の中で式を用いることで &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo; に代入されるテキストを生成する方法も示す、や"
"や複雑な例を挙げます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/message.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(message &quot;He saw %d %s&quot;\n"
"         (- fill-column 32)\n"
"         (concat &quot;red &quot;\n"
"                 (substring\n"
"                  &quot;The quick brown foxes jumped.&quot; 16 21)\n"
"                 &quot; leaping.&quot;))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/message.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In this example, <code class=\"code\">message</code> has three arguments: "
"the string, <code class=\"code\">&quot;He saw %d %s&quot;</code>, the "
"expression, <code class=\"code\">(- fill-column 32)</code>, and the "
"expression beginning with the function <code class=\"code\">concat</code>.  "
"The value resulting from the evaluation of <code class=\"code\">(- fill-"
"column 32)</code> is inserted in place of the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%d</samp>&rsquo;; and the value returned by the expression "
"beginning with <code class=\"code\">concat</code> is inserted in place of "
"the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"この例では、<code class=\"code\">message</code> には文字列、<code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;He saw %d %s&quot;</code>、式、<code class=\"code\">(- "
"fill-column 32)</code>、および関数 <code class=\"code\">concat</code> で始ま"
"る式という3つの引数があります。<code class=\"code\">(- fill-column 32)</"
"code> の評価結果が &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%d</samp>&rsquo; の代わりに挿"
"入され、<code class=\"code\">concat</code> で始まる式が返す値が &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo; の代わりに挿入されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/message.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"When your fill column is 70 and you evaluate the expression, the message "
"<code class=\"code\">&quot;He saw 38 red foxes leaping.&quot;</code> appears "
"in your echo area."
msgstr ""
"フィル列が70の状態で式を評価すると、エコー領域にメッセージ <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;He saw 38 red foxes leaping.&quot;</code> が表示されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><h5>
#: build/html/eintr/message.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a id=\"FOOT5\" href=\"#DOCF5\">(5)</a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"FOOT5\" href=\"#DOCF5\">(5)</a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/message.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Actually, you can use <code class=\"code\">%s</code> to print a number.  It "
"is non-specific.  <code class=\"code\">%d</code> prints only the part of a "
"number left of a decimal point, and not anything that is not a number."
msgstr ""
"実は、<code class=\"code\">%s</code> を使って数値を出力できます。これは非限定"
"的です。<code class=\"code\">%d</code> は数値の小数点より左側の部分のみを出力"
"し、数値でないものは一切出力しません。"

