# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/multiply_002dby_002dseven-in-detail.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Let&rsquo;s look at the use of the special form <code "
"class=\"code\">interactive</code> and then at the function <code "
"class=\"code\">message</code> in the interactive version of <code "
"class=\"code\">multiply-by-seven</code>.  You will recall that the function "
"definition looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"特殊形式 <code class=\"code\">interactive</code> の使い方を確認し、次に "
"<code class=\"code\">multiply-by-seven</code> の対話型バージョンにおける関数 "
"<code class=\"code\">message</code> を見てみましょう。関数の定義は次のように"
"なっていることを思い出してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/multiply_002dby_002dseven-in-detail.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In this function, the expression, <code class=\"code\">(interactive "
"&quot;p&quot;)</code>, is a list of two elements.  The <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;p&quot;</code> tells Emacs to pass the prefix argument "
"to the function and use its value for the argument of the function."
msgstr ""
"この関数では、式 <code class=\"code\">(interactive &quot;p&quot;)</code> は2"
"つの要素からなるリストです。<code class=\"code\">&quot;p&quot;</code> は、プ"
"レフィックス引数を関数に渡し、その値を関数の引数として使用するようにEmacsに指"
"示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/multiply_002dby_002dseven-in-detail.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The argument will be a number.  This means that the symbol <code "
"class=\"code\">number</code> will be bound to a number in the line:"
msgstr ""
"引数は数値となります。つまり、行内のシンボル <code class=\"code\">number</"
"code> は数値にバインドされます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/multiply_002dby_002dseven-in-detail.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(message &quot;The result is %d&quot; (* 7 number))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/multiply_002dby_002dseven-in-detail.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"For example, if your prefix argument is 5, the Lisp interpreter will "
"evaluate the line as if it were:"
msgstr ""
"例えば、接頭辞引数が 5 の場合、Lisp インタプリタはその行を次のように評価しま"
"す："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/multiply_002dby_002dseven-in-detail.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(message &quot;The result is %d&quot; (* 7 5))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/multiply_002dby_002dseven-in-detail.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(If you are reading this in GNU Emacs, you can evaluate this expression "
"yourself.)  First, the interpreter will evaluate the inner list, which is "
"<code class=\"code\">(* 7 5)</code>.  This returns a value of 35.  Next, it "
"will evaluate the outer list, passing the values of the second and "
"subsequent elements of the list to the function <code "
"class=\"code\">message</code>."
msgstr ""
"（GNU Emacs でこれを読んでいるなら、この式を自分で評価できます。）  まず、イ"
"ンタプリタは内側のリスト、つまり <code class=\"code\">(* 7 5)</code> を評価し"
"ます。  これにより 35 という値が返されます。  次に、外側のリストを評価し、リ"
"ストの2番目以降の要素の値を関数 <code class=\"code\">message</code> に渡しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/multiply_002dby_002dseven-in-detail.html
msgid ""
"As we have seen, <code class=\"code\">message</code> is an Emacs Lisp "
"function especially designed for sending a one line message to a user.  (See "
"<a class=\"xref\" href=\"message.html\">The <code class=\"code\">message</"
"code> function</a>.)  In summary, the <code class=\"code\">message</code> "
"function prints its first argument in the echo area as is, except for "
"occurrences of &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%d</samp>&rsquo; or &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo; (and various other %-sequences which we have "
"not mentioned).  When it sees a control sequence, the function looks to the "
"second or subsequent arguments and prints the value of the argument in the "
"location in the string where the control sequence is located."
msgstr ""
"これまで見てきたように、<code class=\"code\">message</code> はユーザーに1行の"
"メッセージを送信するために特別に設計された Emacs Lisp 関数です。（<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"message.html\"><code class=\"code\">message</code> 関数"
"</a>を参照してください。）まとめると、<code class=\"code\">message</code> 関"
"数は、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%d</samp>&rsquo; や &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">%s</samp>&rsquo;（およびここでは言及しなかったその他のさまざま"
"な %-シーケンス）が出現する場合を除き、第1引数をそのままエコーエリアに出力し"
"ます。制御シーケンスを検出すると、この関数は第2引数以降を参照し、制御シーケン"
"スが存在する文字列上の位置にその引数の値を出力します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/multiply_002dby_002dseven-in-detail.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In the interactive <code class=\"code\">multiply-by-seven</code> function, "
"the control string is &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%d</samp>&rsquo;, which "
"requires a number, and the value returned by evaluating <code "
"class=\"code\">(* 7 5)</code> is the number 35.  Consequently, the number 35 "
"is printed in place of the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%d</samp>&rsquo; and "
"the message is &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">The result is 35</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"インタラクティブな<code class=\"code\">multiply-by-seven</code>関数では、制御"
"文字列は&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%d</samp>&rsquo;であり、数値が必要で、"
"<code class=\"code\">(* 7 5)</code>を評価して返される値は数値35です。したがっ"
"て、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%d</samp>&rsquo;の代わりに数値35が出力され、"
"メッセージは&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">The result is 35</samp>&rsquo;となり"
"ます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/multiply_002dby_002dseven-in-detail.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(Note that when you call the function <code class=\"code\">multiply-by-"
"seven</code>, the message is printed without quotes, but when you call <code "
"class=\"code\">message</code>, the text is printed in double quotes.  This "
"is because the value returned by <code class=\"code\">message</code> is what "
"appears in the echo area when you evaluate an expression whose first element "
"is <code class=\"code\">message</code>; but when embedded in a function, "
"<code class=\"code\">message</code> prints the text as a side effect without "
"quotes.)"
msgstr ""
"（なお、関数 <code class=\"code\">multiply-by-seven</code> を呼び出すとメッ"
"セージは引用符なしで出力されますが、<code class=\"code\">message</code> を呼"
"び出すとテキストは二重引用符で囲まれて出力されます。これは、<code "
"class=\"code\">message</code> が返す値が、第1要素が <code "
"class=\"code\">message</code> である式を評価した際にエコー領域に表示される値"
"であるためです。しかし、関数内に埋め込まれた場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">message</code> は副作用としてテキストを引用符なしで出力しま"
"す。）"

