"buffer_002dsubstring_002dno_002dproperties\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-Properties_002c-mention-of-"
"buffer_002dsubstring_002dno_002dproperties\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/narrow-Exercise.html
msgid ""
"(<code class=\"code\">buffer-substring</code> is a previously unmentioned "
"function you will have to investigate yourself; or perhaps you will have to "
"use <code class=\"code\">buffer-substring-no-properties</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">filter-buffer-substring</code> &hellip;, yet other "
"functions.  Text properties are a feature otherwise not discussed here.  See "
"<a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/elisp/Text-Properties.html#Text-Properties\">Text Properties</a> "
"in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>.)"
msgstr ""
"(<code class=\"code\">buffer-substring</code> はここでは言及されていない関数"
"であり、ご自身で調べる必要があります。あるいは、<code class=\"code\">buffer-"
"substring-no-properties</code> や <code class=\"code\">filter-buffer-"
"substring</code> &hellip; といった他の関数を使う必要があるかもしれません。テ"
"キストプロパティは、ここでは触れない機能です。<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU "
"Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite> の <a data-manual=\"elisp\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/elisp/Text-"
"Properties.html#Text-Properties\">Text Properties</a> を参照してください。)"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/narrow-Exercise.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
