msgstr ""
"<span>7.3 <code class=\"code\">nthcdr</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#nthcdr-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/nthcdr.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-nthcdr\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-nthcdr\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/nthcdr.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">nthcdr</code> function is associated with the <code "
"class=\"code\">cdr</code> function.  What it does is take the <small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of a list repeatedly."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nthcdr</code> 関数は <code class=\"code\">cdr</code> 関"
"数に関連付けられています。この関数は、リストの <small class=\"sc\">CDR</"
"small> を繰り返し取得します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/nthcdr.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If you take the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of the list <code "
"class=\"code\">(pine fir oak maple)</code>, you will be returned the list "
"<code class=\"code\">(fir oak maple)</code>.  If you repeat this on what was "
"returned, you will be returned the list <code class=\"code\">(oak maple)</"
"code>.  (Of course, repeated <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>ing on the "
"original list will just give you the original <small class=\"sc\">CDR</"
"small> since the function does not change the list.  You need to evaluate "
"the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> "
"and so on.)  If you continue this, eventually you will be returned an empty "
"list, which in this case, instead of being shown as <code class=\"code\">()</"
"code> is shown as <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"リスト <code class=\"code\">(pine fir oak maple)</code> の <small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small> を取ると、リスト <code class=\"code\">(fir oak "
"maple)</code> が返されます。返されたリストに対してこれを繰り返すと、リスト "
"<code class=\"code\">(oak maple)</code> が返されます。（もちろん、元のリスト"
"に対して繰り返し <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> を行っても、関数がリストを変"
"更しないため、単に元の <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> が得られるだけです。"
"<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> の <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> をさらに評"
"価していく必要があります。）これを続けると、最終的に空のリストが返されます。"
"この場合、<code class=\"code\">()</code> ではなく <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code> として表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/nthcdr.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"For review, here is a series of repeated <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>s, "
"the text following the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&rArr;</samp>&rsquo; "
"shows what is returned."
msgstr ""
"確認用に、繰り返し出現する一連の<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>を以下に示しま"
"す。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&rArr;</samp>&rsquo;に続くテキストに、返され"
"る内容が表示されています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/nthcdr.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(cdr '(pine fir oak maple))\n"
"     &rArr; (fir oak maple)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/nthcdr.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(cdr '(fir oak maple))\n"
"     &rArr; (oak maple)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/nthcdr.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(cdr '(oak maple))\n"
"     &rArr; (maple)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/nthcdr.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(cdr '(maple))\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
