msgid ""
"(cdr ())\n"
"     &rArr; nil\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/nthcdr.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"You can also do several <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>s without printing "
"the values in between, like this:"
msgstr ""
"また、次のように、途中の値を出力せずに複数の<small class=\"sc\">CDR</small>を"
"記述することもできます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/nthcdr.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(cdr (cdr '(pine fir oak maple)))\n"
"     &rArr; (oak maple)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/nthcdr.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In this example, the Lisp interpreter evaluates the innermost list first.  "
"The innermost list is quoted, so it just passes the list as it is to the "
"innermost <code class=\"code\">cdr</code>.  This <code class=\"code\">cdr</"
"code> passes a list made up of the second and subsequent elements of the "
"list to the outermost <code class=\"code\">cdr</code>, which produces a list "
"composed of the third and subsequent elements of the original list.  In this "
"example, the <code class=\"code\">cdr</code> function is repeated and "
"returns a list that consists of the original list without its first two "
"elements."
msgstr ""
"この例では、Lispインタプリタはまず最内層のリストを評価します。最内層のリスト"
"はクォートされているため、そのままの状態で最内層の<code class=\"code\">cdr</"
"code>に渡されます。この<code class=\"code\">cdr</code>は、リストの2番目以降の"
"要素からなるリストを最外層の<code class=\"code\">cdr</code>に渡し、これにより"
"元のリストの3番目以降の要素からなるリストが生成されます。この例では、<code "
"class=\"code\">cdr</code>関数が繰り返し呼び出され、元のリストから最初の2つの"
"要素を除いたリストを返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/nthcdr.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">nthcdr</code> function does the same as repeating "
"the call to <code class=\"code\">cdr</code>.  In the following example, the "
"argument 2 is passed to the function <code class=\"code\">nthcdr</code>, "
"along with the list, and the value returned is the list without its first "
"two items, which is exactly the same as repeating <code class=\"code\">cdr</"
"code> twice on the list:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">nthcdr</code> 関数は、<code class=\"code\">cdr</code> の"
"呼び出しを繰り返すのと同じ動作をします。以下の例では、引数 2 がリストと共に関"
