msgid ""
"Write an interactive function with an optional argument that tests whether "
"its argument, a number, is greater than or equal to, or else, less than the "
"value of <code class=\"code\">fill-column</code>, and tells you which, in a "
"message.  However, if you do not pass an argument to the function, use 56 as "
"a default value."
