msgid ""
"The second row of the X axis consists of numbers, preceded by several blank "
"spaces and also separated according to the value of the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">X-axis-label-spacing</code>."
msgstr ""
"X軸の2行目は数値で構成されており、その前にはいくつかの空白があり、また変数 "
"<code class=\"code\">X-axis-label-spacing</code> の値に応じて区切られていま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/print_002dX_002daxis.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The value of the variable <code class=\"code\">X-axis-label-spacing</code> "
"should itself be measured in units of <code class=\"code\">symbol-width</"
"code>, since you may want to change the width of the symbols that you are "
"using to print the body of the graph without changing the ways the graph is "
"labeled."
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">X-axis-label-spacing</code> の値自体も <code "
"class=\"code\">symbol-width</code> の単位で測定すべきです。そうすることで、グ"
"ラフのラベル付け方法を変更することなく、グラフの本体を印刷する際に使用する記"
"号の幅を調整できるためです。"

