# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/print_002dY_002daxis-in-Detail.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"It is easy enough to see in the figure what the Y axis label should look "
"like; but to say in words, and then to write a function definition to do the "
"job is another matter.  It is not quite true to say that we want a number "
"and a tic every five lines: there are only three lines between the &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">1</samp>&rsquo; and the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">5</"
"samp>&rsquo; (lines 2, 3, and 4), but four lines between the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">5</samp>&rsquo; and the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">10</"
"samp>&rsquo; (lines 6, 7, 8, and 9).  It is better to say that we want a "
"number and a tic mark on the base line (number 1) and then that we want a "
"number and a tic on the fifth line from the bottom and on every line that is "
"a multiple of five."
msgstr ""
"図を見れば、Y軸のラベルがどのような形式になるべきかは容易に分かります。しか"
"し、それを言葉で説明し、さらにその処理を行う関数定義を書くとなると、話は別で"
"す。5行ごとに数値と目盛りが欲しいというのは、必ずしも正確ではありません。"
"「<samp class=\"samp\">1</samp>」と「<samp class=\"samp\">5</samp>」の間には3"
"行（2、3、4行目）しかありませんが、「<samp class=\"samp\">5</samp>」と"
"「<samp class=\"samp\">10</samp>」の間には4行（6、7、8、9行目）あります。むし"
"ろ、基準線（数値1）に数値と目盛りを置き、次に下から5行目および5の倍数となるす"
"べての行に数値と目盛りを置きたい、と述べる方が適切でしょう。"

