"は、通常通りInfo内で以下の式を評価できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/print_002delements_002dof_002dlist.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If you are using an earlier version of Emacs, you need to copy the necessary "
"expressions to your <samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> buffer and "
"evaluate them there.  This is because the echo area had only one line in the "
"earlier versions."
msgstr ""
"旧バージョンのEmacsを使用している場合は、必要な式を<samp "
"class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp>バッファにコピーし、そこで評価する必要がありま"
"す。これは、旧バージョンではエコーエリアが1行しかなかったためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/print_002delements_002dof_002dlist.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"You can copy the expressions by marking the beginning of the region with "
"<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">set-mark-command</code>), moving the cursor to the end of the "
"region and then copying the region using <kbd class=\"kbd\">M-w</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">kill-ring-save</code>, which calls <code class=\"code\">copy-"
"region-as-kill</code> and then provides visual feedback).  In the <samp "
"class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> buffer, you can yank the expressions back by "
"typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-y</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">yank</code>)."
msgstr ""
"領域の先頭を <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-<kbd class=\"key\">SPC</kbd></kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">set-mark-command</code>) でマークし、カーソルを領域の末尾に移"
"動させた後、<kbd class=\"kbd\">M-w</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">kill-ring-"
"save</code>。これは <code class=\"code\">copy-region-as-kill</code> を呼び出"
"し、視覚的なフィードバックを提供します) を使って領域をコピーできます。<samp "
"class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> バッファでは、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-y</kbd> "
"(<code class=\"code\">yank</code>) と入力することで、式をヤンクして戻すことが"
"できます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/print_002delements_002dof_002dlist.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"After you have copied the expressions to the <samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</"
"samp> buffer, evaluate each expression in turn.  Be sure to evaluate the "
"last expression, <code class=\"code\">(print-elements-of-list animals)</"
"code>, by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-x C-e</kbd>, that is, by giving an "
"argument to <code class=\"code\">eval-last-sexp</code>.  This will cause the "
"result of the evaluation to be printed in the <samp "
"class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp> buffer instead of being printed in the echo "
"area.  (Otherwise you will see something like this in your echo area: <code "
"class=\"code\">^Jgazelle^J^Jgiraffe^J^Jlion^J^Jtiger^Jnil</code>, in which "
"each &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^J</samp>&rsquo; stands for a newline.)"
msgstr ""
"式を<samp class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp>バッファにコピーしたら、各式を順に評"
"価してください。最後の式<code class=\"code\">(print-elements-of-list "
"animals)</code>については、必ず<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-u C-x C-e</kbd>と入力す"
"る、つまり<code class=\"code\">eval-last-sexp</code>に引数を渡すことで評価す"
"るようにしてください。これにより、評価結果がエコー領域ではなく、<samp "
"class=\"file\">*scratch*</samp>バッファに出力されます。（そうしないと、エコー"
"領域に<code class=\"code\">^Jgazelle^J^Jgiraffe^J^Jlion^J^Jtiger^Jnil</code>"
"のような表示が現れます。ここで各&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">^J</samp>&rsquo;"
"は改行を表します。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/print_002delements_002dof_002dlist.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"You can evaluate these expressions directly in the Info buffer, and the echo "
"area will grow to show the results."
msgstr ""
"これらの式はInfoバッファで直接評価でき、エコー領域が拡張されて結果が表示され"
"ます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/print_002delements_002dof_002dlist.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(setq animals '(gazelle giraffe lion tiger))\n"
"\n"
"(defun print-elements-of-list (list)\n"
"  &quot;Print each element of LIST on a line of its own.&quot;\n"
"  (while list\n"
"    (print (car list))\n"
"    (setq list (cdr list))))\n"
"\n"
"(print-elements-of-list animals)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/print_002delements_002dof_002dlist.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "When you evaluate the three expressions in sequence, you will see this:"
msgstr "3つの式を順に評価すると、次のようになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/print_002delements_002dof_002dlist.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Each element of the list is printed on a line of its own (that is what the "
"function <code class=\"code\">print</code> does) and then the value returned "
"by the function is printed.  Since the last expression in the function is "
"the <code class=\"code\">while</code> loop, and since <code "
"class=\"code\">while</code> loops always return <code class=\"code\">nil</"
"code>, a <code class=\"code\">nil</code> is printed after the last element "
"of the list."
msgstr ""
"リストの各要素は1行ずつ出力され（これが関数 <code class=\"code\">print</"
"code> の動作です）、その後に関数から返された値が出力されます。関数内の最後の"
"式は <code class=\"code\">while</code> ループであり、また <code "
"class=\"code\">while</code> ループは常に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を返"
"すため、リストの最後の要素の後に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> が出力されま"
"す。"

