# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/print_002dgraph-Varlist.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In writing the <code class=\"code\">print-graph</code> function, the first "
"task is to write the varlist in the <code class=\"code\">let</code> "
"expression.  (We will leave aside for the moment any thoughts about making "
"the function interactive or about the contents of its documentation string.)"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">print-graph</code> 関数を記述する際、最初の作業は <code "
"class=\"code\">let</code> 式に varlist を記述することです。（関数をインタラク"
"ティブにすることや、ドキュメント文字列の内容に関する考察については、ひとまず"
"脇に置いておきます。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/print_002dgraph-Varlist.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The varlist should set several values.  Clearly, the top of the label for "
"the vertical axis must be at least the height of the graph, which means that "
"we must obtain this information here.  Note that the <code "
"class=\"code\">print-graph-body</code> function also requires this "
"information.  There is no reason to calculate the height of the graph in two "
"different places, so we should change <code class=\"code\">print-graph-body</"
"code> from the way we defined it earlier to take advantage of the "
"calculation."
msgstr ""
"varlistには複数の値を設定する必要があります。明らかに、縦軸のラベル上部は少な"
"くともグラフの高さ以上である必要があり、つまりここでこの情報を取得しなければ"
"なりません。なお、<code class=\"code\">print-graph-body</code>関数でもこの情"
"報が必要であることに注意してください。グラフの高さを別々の場所で計算する理由"
"はありませんので、この計算を活用するために、<code class=\"code\">print-graph-"
"body</code>を以前に定義した方法から変更しましょう。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/print_002dgraph-Varlist.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Similarly, both the function for printing the X axis labels and the <code "
"class=\"code\">print-graph-body</code> function need to learn the value of "
"the width of each symbol.  We can perform the calculation here and change "
"the definition for <code class=\"code\">print-graph-body</code> from the way "
"we defined it in the previous chapter."
msgstr ""
"同様に、X軸ラベルを出力する関数と<code class=\"code\">print-graph-body</code>"
"関数の両方で、各記号の幅の値を学習させる必要があります。ここで計算を行い、"
"<code class=\"code\">print-graph-body</code>の定義を前章で定義した方法から変"
"更することができます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/print_002dgraph-Varlist.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The length of the label for the horizontal axis must be at least as long as "
"the graph.  However, this information is used only in the function that "
"prints the horizontal axis, so it does not need to be calculated here."
msgstr ""
"横軸のラベルの長さは、グラフの長さ以上である必要があります。ただし、この情報"
"は横軸を出力する関数でのみ使用されるため、ここで計算する必要はありません。"

