# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/progn.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-progn\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-progn\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/progn.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">progn</code> is a special form that causes each of its "
"arguments to be evaluated in sequence and then returns the value of the last "
"one.  The preceding expressions are evaluated only for the side effects they "
"perform.  The values produced by them are discarded."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">progn</code> は、各引数を順次評価し、最後の引数の値を返"
"す特殊な形式です。直前の式は、副作用のみを目的として評価されます。それらに"
"よって生成された値は破棄されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/progn.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The template for a <code class=\"code\">progn</code> expression is very "
"simple:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">progn</code> 式のテンプレートは非常にシンプルです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/progn.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(progn\n"
"  <var class=\"var\">body</var>...)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/progn.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In <code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code>, the <code class=\"code\">progn</"
"code> expression has to do two things: put point in exactly the right "
"position; and return the location of point so that <code class=\"code\">kill-"
"region</code> will know how far to kill to."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code> において、<code "
"class=\"code\">progn</code> 式は2つのことを行う必要があります。すなわち、"
"point をちょうど正しい位置に配置することと、<code class=\"code\">kill-"
"region</code> がどの程度まで消去すべきか分かるように point の位置を返すことで"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/progn.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The first argument to the <code class=\"code\">progn</code> is <code "
"class=\"code\">search-forward</code>.  When <code class=\"code\">search-"
"forward</code> finds the string, the function leaves point immediately after "
"the last character in the target string.  (In this case the target string is "
"just one character long.)  If the search is backwards, <code "
"class=\"code\">search-forward</code> leaves point just before the first "
"character in the target.  The movement of point is a side effect."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">progn</code> の第1引数は <code class=\"code\">search-"
"forward</code> です。<code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> が文字列を見"
"つけると、関数は対象文字列の最後の文字の直後にポイントを移動させます。（この"
"場合、対象文字列は1文字のみです。）検索を逆方向に行う場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">search-forward</code> は対象文字列の最初の文字の直前にポイント"
"を移動させます。ポイントの移動は副作用です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/progn.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The second and last argument to <code class=\"code\">progn</code> is the "
"expression <code class=\"code\">(point)</code>.  This expression returns the "
"value of point, which in this case will be the location to which it has been "
"moved by <code class=\"code\">search-forward</code>.  (In the source, a line "
"that tells the function to go to the previous character, if it is going "
"forward, was commented out in 1999; I don&rsquo;t remember whether that "
"feature or mis-feature was ever a part of the distributed source.)  The "
"value of <code class=\"code\">point</code> is returned by the <code "
"class=\"code\">progn</code> expression and is passed to <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-region</code> as <code class=\"code\">kill-region</"
"code>&rsquo;s second argument."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">progn</code> の2番目にして最後の引数は、式 <code "
"class=\"code\">(point)</code> です。この式は point の値を返し、この場合は "
"<code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> によって移動した先の位置となりま"
"す。（ソースコードにおいて、前方に移動している場合に直前の文字に戻るよう関数"
"に指示する行が1999年にコメントアウトされました。この機能、あるいは不具合とも"
"言える仕様が、配布されたソースコードに含まれていたかどうかは記憶にありませ"
"ん。）<code class=\"code\">point</code> の値は <code class=\"code\">progn</"
"code> 式によって返され、<code class=\"code\">kill-region</code> の第2引数とし"
"て <code class=\"code\">kill-region</code> に渡されます。"

