#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/re_002dsearch-Exercises.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Write a function to search for a regular expression that matches two or more "
"blank lines in sequence."
msgstr ""
"2行以上の空行に連続してマッチする正規表現を検索する関数を作成してください。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/re_002dsearch-Exercises.html
msgid ""
"Write a function to search for duplicated words, such as &ldquo;the "
"the&rdquo;.  See <a data-manual=\"emacs\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/"
"software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/Regexps.html#Regexps\">Syntax of "
"Regular Expressions</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>, "
"for information on how to write a regexp (a regular expression) to match a "
"string that is composed of two identical halves.  You can devise several "
"regexps; some are better than others.  The function I use is described in an "
"appendix, along with several regexps.  See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"the_002dthe.html\"><code class=\"code\">the-the</code> Duplicated "
"Words Function</a>."
msgstr ""
"「the the」のような重複語を検索する関数を作成してください。2つの同一の部分か"
"らなる文字列にマッチする正規表現（regexp）の書き方については、<cite "
"class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Manual</cite>の<a data-manual=\"emacs\" "
"href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/html_node/emacs/"
"Regexps.html#Regexps\">正規表現の構文</a>を参照してください。正規表現はいくつ"
"か考案でき、中には他よりも優れたものもあります。私が使用している関数は、いく"
"つかの正規表現とともに付録に記載されています。<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"the_002dthe.html\"><code class=\"code\">the-the</code> 重複語関数</a>"
"を参照してください。"

