# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/re_002dsearch_002dforward.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-re_002dsearch_002dforward\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-re_002dsearch_002dforward\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/re_002dsearch_002dforward.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> function is very like the "
"<code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> function.  (See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"search_002dforward.html\">The <code class=\"code\">search-forward</"
"code> Function</a>.)"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> 関数は <code "
"class=\"code\">search-forward</code> 関数と非常によく似ています。（<a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"search_002dforward.html\"><code class=\"code\">search-"
"forward</code> 関数</a> を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/re_002dsearch_002dforward.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> searches for a regular "
"expression.  If the search is successful, it leaves point immediately after "
"the last character in the target.  If the search is backwards, it leaves "
"point just before the first character in the target.  You may tell <code "
"class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> to return <code class=\"code\">t</"
"code> for true.  (Moving point is therefore a side effect.)"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> は正規表現を検索します。検索に"
"成功した場合、ターゲットの最後の文字の直後にポイントを移動します。検索が逆順"
"だった場合は、ターゲットの最初の文字の直前にポイントを移動します。<code "
"class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> に true のときに <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> を返すよう指定できます。（したがって、ポイントの移動"
"は副作用となります。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/re_002dsearch_002dforward.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Like <code class=\"code\">search-forward</code>, the <code class=\"code\">re-"
"search-forward</code> function takes four arguments:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">search-forward</code>と同様に、<code class=\"code\">re-"
"search-forward</code>関数は4つの引数を取ります："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><ol><li>
#: build/html/eintr/re_002dsearch_002dforward.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The first argument is the regular expression that the function searches "
"for.  The regular expression will be a string between quotation marks."
msgstr ""
"第1引数は、関数が検索対象とする正規表現です。正規表現は引用符で囲まれた文字列"
"となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><ol><li>
#: build/html/eintr/re_002dsearch_002dforward.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The optional second argument limits how far the function will search; it is "
"a bound, which is specified as a position in the buffer."
msgstr ""
"省略可能な第2引数は、関数が検索する範囲を制限します。これは境界であり、バッ"
"ファ内の位置を指定します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><ol><li>
#: build/html/eintr/re_002dsearch_002dforward.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The optional third argument specifies how the function responds to failure: "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> as the third argument causes the function to "
"signal an error (and print a message) when the search fails; any other value "
"causes it to return <code class=\"code\">nil</code> if the search fails and "
"<code class=\"code\">t</code> if the search succeeds."
msgstr ""
"省略可能な第3引数は、関数が失敗時にどのように動作するかを指定します。第3引数"
"に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を指定すると、検索に失敗した際に関数がエ"
"ラーを通知（およびメッセージを出力）します。それ以外の値を指定すると、検索失"
"敗時に <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を、検索成功時に <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><ol><li>
#: build/html/eintr/re_002dsearch_002dforward.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The optional fourth argument is the repeat count.  A negative repeat count "
"causes <code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> to search backwards."
msgstr ""
"省略可能な第4引数は繰り返し回数です。繰り返し回数が負の場合、<code "
"class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code>は逆方向に検索します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/re_002dsearch_002dforward.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The template for <code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> looks like "
"this:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code>のテンプレートは次のようになって"
"います。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/re_002dsearch_002dforward.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(re-search-forward &quot;<var class=\"var\">regular-expression</var>&quot;\n"
"                <var class=\"var\">limit-of-search</var>\n"
"                <var class=\"var\">what-to-do-if-search-fails</var>\n"
"                <var class=\"var\">repeat-count</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/re_002dsearch_002dforward.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The second, third, and fourth arguments are optional.  However, if you want "
"to pass a value to either or both of the last two arguments, you must also "
"pass a value to all the preceding arguments.  Otherwise, the Lisp "
"interpreter will mistake which argument you are passing the value to."
msgstr ""
"第2、第3、第4引数は省略可能です。ただし、最後の2つの引数のいずれか、あるいは"
