# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"You can write the function for counting words recursively as well as with a "
"<code class=\"code\">while</code> loop.  Let&rsquo;s see how this is done."
msgstr ""
"単語数を数える関数は、再帰的に記述することも、<code class=\"code\">while</"
"code>ループを用いて記述することもできます。それでは、その方法を見てみましょ"
"う。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"First, we need to recognize that the <code class=\"code\">count-words-"
"example</code> function has three jobs: it sets up the appropriate "
"conditions for counting to occur; it counts the words in the region; and it "
"sends a message to the user telling how many words there are."
msgstr ""
"まず、<code class=\"code\">count-words-example</code>関数には3つの役割がある"
"ことを認識しておく必要があります。それは、カウントが行われるための適切な条件"
"を整えること、領域内の単語数を数えること、そして単語数をユーザーに通知する"
"メッセージを送信することです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If we write a single recursive function to do everything, we will receive a "
"message for every recursive call.  If the region contains 13 words, we will "
"receive thirteen messages, one right after the other.  We don&rsquo;t want "
"this! Instead, we must write two functions to do the job, one of which (the "
"recursive function) will be used inside of the other.  One function will set "
"up the conditions and display the message; the other will return the word "
"count."
msgstr ""
"すべてを処理する再帰関数を1つだけ書くと、再帰呼び出しのたびにメッセージが出力"
"されます。領域に13個の単語がある場合、13通のメッセージが立て続けに出力される"
"ことになります。これは避けたいところです。代わりに、処理を行うために2つの関数"
"を記述し、そのうちの1つ（再帰関数）をもう一方の中で使用するようにします。一方"
"の関数が条件を設定してメッセージを表示し、もう一方が単語数を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Let us start with the function that causes the message to be displayed.  We "
"can continue to call this <code class=\"code\">count-words-example</code>."
msgstr ""
"メッセージを表示させる関数から始めましょう。これを引き続き <code "
"class=\"code\">count-words-example</code> と呼ぶことにします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"This is the function that the user will call.  It will be interactive.  "
"Indeed, it will be similar to our previous versions of this function, except "
"that it will call <code class=\"code\">recursive-count-words</code> to "
"determine how many words are in the region."
msgstr ""
"これはユーザーが呼び出す関数です。対話型となります。実際、この関数の以前の"
"バージョンと同様ですが、領域内の単語数を判定するために <code "
"class=\"code\">recursive-count-words</code> を呼び出す点が異なります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"We can readily construct a template for this function, based on our previous "
"versions:"
msgstr ""
"これまでのバージョンを基に、この関数のテンプレートを容易に作成できます："

