";;; <span class=\"r\">2. Count the words.</span>\n"
"    <var class=\"var\">recursive call</var>\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";;; <span class=\"r\">3. Send a message to the user.</span>\n"
"    <var class=\"var\">message providing word count</var>))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The definition looks straightforward, except that somehow the count returned "
"by the recursive call must be passed to the message displaying the word "
"count.  A little thought suggests that this can be done by making use of a "
"<code class=\"code\">let</code> expression: we can bind a variable in the "
"varlist of a <code class=\"code\">let</code> expression to the number of "
"words in the region, as returned by the recursive call; and then the <code "
"class=\"code\">cond</code> expression, using binding, can display the value "
"to the user."
msgstr ""
"定義は一見単純に見えますが、どういうわけか、再帰呼び出しによって返されたカウ"
"ント値を単語数を表示するメッセージに渡す必要があります。少し考えてみると、こ"
"れは<code class=\"code\">let</code>式を利用することで実現できることがわかりま"
"す。具体的には、<code class=\"code\">let</code>式のvarlistにある変数に、再帰"
"呼び出しで返された領域内の単語数をバインドし、その後、<code "
"class=\"code\">cond</code>式がそのバインドを用いてその値をユーザーに表示すれ"
"ばよいのです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Often, one thinks of the binding within a <code class=\"code\">let</code> "
"expression as somehow secondary to the primary work of a function.  But in "
"this case, what you might consider the primary job of the function, counting "
"words, is done within the <code class=\"code\">let</code> expression."
msgstr ""
"多くの場合、<code class=\"code\">let</code> 式内の束縛は、関数の主たる役割に"
"比べれば二次的なものだと考えられがちです。しかしこの場合、単語数を数えるとい"
"う、関数の主たる役割とも呼べる処理は、<code class=\"code\">let</code> 式の中"
"で行われています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Using <code class=\"code\">let</code>, the function definition looks like "
"this:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">let</code>を使うと、関数定義は次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun count-words-example (beginning end)\n"
"  &quot;Print number of words in the region.&quot;\n"
"  (interactive &quot;r&quot;)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";;; <span class=\"r\">1. Set up appropriate conditions.</span>\n"
"  (message &quot;Counting words in region ... &quot;)\n"
"  (save-excursion\n"
"    (goto-char beginning)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";;; <span class=\"r\">2. Count the words.</span>\n"
"    (let ((count (recursive-count-words end)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Next, we need to write the recursive counting function."
msgstr "次に、再帰的なカウント関数を記述する必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"A recursive function has at least three parts: the do-again-test, the next-"
"step-expression, and the recursive call."
msgstr ""
"再帰関数は、少なくとも「再実行判定」、「次のステップの式」、「再帰呼び出し」"
"の3つの部分から構成される。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The do-again-test determines whether the function will or will not be called "
"again.  Since we are counting words in a region and can use a function that "
"moves point forward for every word, the do-again-test can check whether "
"point is still within the region.  The do-again-test should find the value "
"of point and determine whether point is before, at, or after the value of "
"the end of the region.  We can use the <code class=\"code\">point</code> "
"function to locate point.  Clearly, we must pass the value of the end of the "
"region to the recursive counting function as an argument."
msgstr ""
"do-again-testは、関数が再度呼び出されるかどうかを判定します。ある領域内の単語"
"数をカウントしており、単語ごとにポイントを前方に進める関数を利用できるため、"
"do-again-testでポイントがまだ領域内にあるかを確認できます。do-again-testでは"
"ポイントの値を取得し、ポイントが領域の終端の値より前か、等しいか、あるいは後"
"かを判定する必要があります。ポイントの位置を特定するには、<code "
"class=\"code\">point</code>関数を利用できます。当然ながら、領域の終端の値を引"
"数として再帰的なカウント関数に渡す必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In addition, the do-again-test should also test whether the search finds a "
"word.  If it does not, the function should not call itself again."
msgstr ""
"さらに、do-again-testでは、検索で単語が見つかったかどうかも判定する必要があり"
"ます。見つからなかった場合、関数は自身を再呼び出しすべきではありません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The next-step-expression changes a value so that when the recursive function "
"is supposed to stop calling itself, it stops.  More precisely, the next-step-"
"expression changes a value so that at the right time, the do-again-test "
"stops the recursive function from calling itself again.  In this case, the "
"next-step-expression can be the expression that moves point forward, word by "
"word."
msgstr ""
"次ステップ式は、再帰関数が自身を呼び出すのを止めるべきタイミングで、実際に停"
"止するように値を変更します。より正確には、次ステップ式は、適切なタイミングで "
"do-again-test が再帰関数の再呼び出しを停止させるように値を変更します。この場"
"合、次ステップ式は、ポイントを単語ごとに前方へ進める式であっても構いません。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The third part of a recursive function is the recursive call."
msgstr "再帰関数の3番目の部分は、再帰呼び出しです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Somewhere, we also need a part that does the work of the function, a part "
"that does the counting.  A vital part!"
msgstr ""
"どこかに、関数の役割を果たすパーツ、つまりカウントを行うパーツも必要だ。不可"
"欠なパーツだ！"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "But already, we have an outline of the recursive counting function:"
msgstr "しかし、すでに再帰的な計数関数の概要は出来上がっています："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun recursive-count-words (region-end)\n"
"  &quot;<var class=\"var\">documentation</var>...&quot;\n"
"   <var class=\"var\">do-again-test</var>\n"
"   <var class=\"var\">next-step-expression</var>\n"
"   <var class=\"var\">recursive call</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Now we need to fill in the slots.  Let&rsquo;s start with the simplest cases "
"first: if point is at or beyond the end of the region, there cannot be any "
"words in the region, so the function should return zero.  Likewise, if the "
"search fails, there are no words to count, so the function should return "
"zero."
msgstr ""
"次に、空欄を埋めていきましょう。まずは最も単純なケースから考えます。点が領域"
"の端にあるか、あるいはそれを超えている場合、その領域内に単語は存在し得ないた"
"め、関数は0を返すべきです。同様に、検索に失敗した場合も、カウントすべき単語は"
"存在しないため、関数は0を返すべきです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"On the other hand, if point is within the region and the search succeeds, "
"the function should call itself again."
msgstr ""
"一方、点が領域内にあり、探索が成功した場合は、関数は自身を再呼び出しする必要"
"があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Thus, the do-again-test should look like this:"
msgstr "したがって、do-again-testは次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(and (&lt; (point) region-end)\n"
"     (re-search-forward &quot;\\\\w+\\\\W*&quot; region-end t))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
msgid ""
"Note that the search expression is part of the do-again-test&mdash;the "
"function returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> if its search succeeds and "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code> if it fails.  (See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Whitespace-Bug.html\">The Whitespace Bug in <code "
"class=\"code\">count-words-example</code></a>, for an explanation of how "
"<code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> works.)"
msgstr ""
"なお、検索式は do-again-test の一部であり、関数は検索に成功した場合は <code "
"class=\"code\">t</code> を、失敗した場合は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> を"
"返します。（<code class=\"code\">re-search-forward</code> の動作に関する説明"
"については、<a class=\"xref\" href=\"Whitespace-Bug.html\"><code "
"class=\"code\">count-words-example</code> におけるホワイトスペース・バグ</a> "
"を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The do-again-test is the true-or-false test of an <code class=\"code\">if</"
"code> clause.  Clearly, if the do-again-test succeeds, the then-part of the "
"<code class=\"code\">if</code> clause should call the function again; but if "
"it fails, the else-part should return zero since either point is outside the "
"region or the search failed because there were no words to find."
msgstr ""
"do-again-testは、<code class=\"code\">if</code>節の真偽判定テストである。明ら"
"かに、do-again-testが成功すれば、<code class=\"code\">if</code>節のthen部は関"
"数を再度呼び出すべきである。一方、失敗した場合は、いずれかの地点が領域外であ"
"るか、あるいは検索すべき単語が存在せず検索が失敗したため、else部は0を返すべき"
"である。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"But before considering the recursive call, we need to consider the next-step-"
"expression.  What is it? Interestingly, it is the search part of the do-"
"again-test."
msgstr ""
"しかし、再帰呼び出しを検討する前に、次のステップの式を考える必要があります。"
"それは一体何でしょうか？興味深いことに、それはdo-again-testの探索部分なので"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In addition to returning <code class=\"code\">t</code> or <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> for the do-again-test, <code class=\"code\">re-"
"search-forward</code> moves point forward as a side effect of a successful "
"search.  This is the action that changes the value of point so that the "
"recursive function stops calling itself when point completes its movement "
"through the region.  Consequently, the <code class=\"code\">re-search-"
"forward</code> expression is the next-step-expression."
msgstr ""
"do-again-test に対して <code class=\"code\">t</code> または <code "
"class=\"code\">nil</code> を返すほか、<code class=\"code\">re-search-"
"forward</code> は探索成功の副作用として point を前方に移動させます。これは、"
"point が領域内の移動を完了した際に再帰関数が自身を呼び出すのを停止するよう、"
"point の値を変更する処理です。したがって、<code class=\"code\">re-search-"
"forward</code> 式が次のステップ式となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In outline, then, the body of the <code class=\"code\">recursive-count-"
"words</code> function looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"まとめると、<code class=\"code\">recursive-count-words</code>関数の本体は次の"
"ようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(if <var class=\"var\">do-again-test-and-next-step-combined</var>\n"
"    ;; <span class=\"r\">then</span>\n"
"    <var class=\"var\">recursive-call-returning-count</var>\n"
"  ;; <span class=\"r\">else</span>\n"
"  <var class=\"var\">return-zero</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "How to incorporate the mechanism that counts?"
msgstr "カウントする仕組みをどう組み込むか？"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If you are not used to writing recursive functions, a question like this can "
"be troublesome.  But it can and should be approached systematically."
msgstr ""
"再帰関数を書くことに慣れていないと、このような問題は厄介かもしれません。しか"
"し、体系的にアプローチすることは可能ですし、そうすべきです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"We know that the counting mechanism should be associated in some way with "
"the recursive call.  Indeed, since the next-step-expression moves point "
"forward by one word, and since a recursive call is made for each word, the "
"counting mechanism must be an expression that adds one to the value returned "
"by a call to <code class=\"code\">recursive-count-words</code>."
msgstr ""
"カウント機構は、何らかの形で再帰呼び出しと関連している必要がある。実際、次ス"
"テップ式はポインタを1単語分進め、また単語ごとに再帰呼び出しが行われるため、カ"
"ウント機構は<code class=\"code\">recursive-count-words</code>への呼び出しに"
"よって返される値に1を加算する式でなければならない。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Consider several cases:"
msgstr "いくつかのケースを考えてみましょう："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If there are two words in the region, the function should return a value "
"resulting from adding one to the value returned when it counts the first "
"word, plus the number returned when it counts the remaining words in the "
"region, which in this case is one."
msgstr ""
"領域内に2つの単語がある場合、この関数は、1つ目の単語をカウントした際に返され"
"る値に1を加え、さらに領域内の残りの単語をカウントした際に返される数値（この場"
"合は1）を加算した結果を返す必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If there is one word in the region, the function should return a value "
"resulting from adding one to the value returned when it counts that word, "
"plus the number returned when it counts the remaining words in the region, "
"which in this case is zero."
msgstr ""
"その領域に単語が1つある場合、関数は、その単語をカウントした際に返される値に1"
"を加え、さらにその領域に残っている単語をカウントした際に返される値（この場合"
"は0）を足した結果を返す必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><ul><li>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "If there are no words in the region, the function should return zero."
msgstr "その領域に単語が存在しない場合、関数は0を返す必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"From the sketch we can see that the else-part of the <code "
"class=\"code\">if</code> returns zero for the case of no words.  This means "
"that the then-part of the <code class=\"code\">if</code> must return a value "
"resulting from adding one to the value returned from a count of the "
"remaining words."
msgstr ""
"スケッチから、<code class=\"code\">if</code> の else 部分は単語がない場合に "
"0 を返すことがわかります。つまり、<code class=\"code\">if</code> の then 部分"
"は、残りの単語数のカウントから得られた値に 1 を加算した結果を返す必要がありま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The expression will look like this, where <code class=\"code\">1+</code> is "
"a function that adds one to its argument."
msgstr ""
"式は次のようになります。ここで <code class=\"code\">1+</code> は、引数に 1 を"
"加える関数です。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(1+ (recursive-count-words region-end))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The whole <code class=\"code\">recursive-count-words</code> function will "
"then look like this:"
msgstr ""
"すると、<code class=\"code\">recursive-count-words</code> 関数全体は次のよう"
"になります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun recursive-count-words (region-end)\n"
"  &quot;<var class=\"var\">documentation</var>...&quot;\n"
"\n"
";;; <span class=\"r\">1. do-again-test</span>\n"
"  (if (and (&lt; (point) region-end)\n"
"           (re-search-forward &quot;\\\\w+\\\\W*&quot; region-end t))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
";;; <span class=\"r\">2. then-part: the recursive call</span>\n"
"      (1+ (recursive-count-words region-end))\n"
"\n"
";;; <span class=\"r\">3. else-part</span>\n"
"    0))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "Let&rsquo;s examine how this works:"
msgstr "これがどのような仕組みなのか、見てみましょう："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If there are no words in the region, the else part of the <code "
"class=\"code\">if</code> expression is evaluated and consequently the "
"function returns zero."
msgstr ""
"その領域に単語が存在しない場合、<code class=\"code\">if</code> 式の else 部分"
"が評価され、その結果、関数は 0 を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If there is one word in the region, the value of point is less than the "
"value of <code class=\"code\">region-end</code> and the search succeeds.  In "
"this case, the true-or-false-test of the <code class=\"code\">if</code> "
"expression tests true, and the then-part of the <code class=\"code\">if</"
"code> expression is evaluated.  The counting expression is evaluated.  This "
"expression returns a value (which will be the value returned by the whole "
"function) that is the sum of one added to the value returned by a recursive "
"call."
msgstr ""
"その領域に単語が1つしかない場合、pointの値は<code class=\"code\">region-end</"
"code>の値よりも小さく、探索は成功します。この場合、<code class=\"code\">if</"
"code>式の真偽判定はtrueとなり、<code class=\"code\">if</code>式のthen部分が評"
"価されます。カウント式が評価されます。この式は、再帰呼び出しによって返された"
"値に1を加えた和（これが関数全体によって返される値となります）を返します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Meanwhile, the next-step-expression has caused point to jump over the first "
"(and in this case only) word in the region.  This means that when <code "
"class=\"code\">(recursive-count-words region-end)</code> is evaluated a "
"second time, as a result of the recursive call, the value of point will be "
"equal to or greater than the value of region end.  So this time, <code "
"class=\"code\">recursive-count-words</code> will return zero.  The zero will "
"be added to one, and the original evaluation of <code "
"class=\"code\">recursive-count-words</code> will return one plus zero, which "
"is one, which is the correct amount."
msgstr ""
"一方、next-step-expression によって、point は region 内の最初の（そしてこの場"
"合唯一の）単語を飛び越えました。つまり、再帰呼び出しの結果として <code "
"class=\"code\">(recursive-count-words region-end)</code> が2回目に評価される"
"際、point の値は region end の値以上になります。したがって、今回は <code "
"class=\"code\">recursive-count-words</code> が 0 を返します。この 0 が 1 に加"
"算され、<code class=\"code\">recursive-count-words</code> の元の評価では 1 プ"
"ラス 0、すなわち 1 が返されます。これが正しい値となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Clearly, if there are two words in the region, the first call to <code "
"class=\"code\">recursive-count-words</code> returns one added to the value "
"returned by calling <code class=\"code\">recursive-count-words</code> on a "
"region containing the remaining word&mdash;that is, it adds one to one, "
"producing two, which is the correct amount."
msgstr ""
"明らかに、その領域に2つの単語がある場合、<code class=\"code\">recursive-"
"count-words</code>への最初の呼び出しは、残りの単語を含む領域に対して<code "
"class=\"code\">recursive-count-words</code>を呼び出して返された値に1を加えた"
"値を返す――つまり、1に1を足して2となり、これが正しい値となる。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Similarly, if there are three words in the region, the first call to <code "
"class=\"code\">recursive-count-words</code> returns one added to the value "
"returned by calling <code class=\"code\">recursive-count-words</code> on a "
"region containing the remaining two words&mdash;and so on and so on."
msgstr ""
"同様に、領域内に3つの単語がある場合、<code class=\"code\">recursive-count-"
"words</code>への最初の呼び出しは、残りの2つの単語を含む領域に対して<code "
"class=\"code\">recursive-count-words</code>を呼び出して返された値に1を加えた"
"値を返し&mdash;といった具合に続きます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "With full documentation the two functions look like this:"
msgstr "完全なドキュメントを付けると、2つの関数は次のようになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The recursive function:"
msgstr "再帰関数："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dcount_002dwords.html
