# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dgraph_002dbody_002dprint.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">graph-body-print</code> function may also be "
"written recursively.  The recursive solution is divided into two parts: an "
"outside wrapper that uses a <code class=\"code\">let</code> expression to "
"determine the values of several variables that need only be found once, such "
"as the maximum height of the graph, and an inside function that is called "
"recursively to print the graph."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">graph-body-print</code> 関数は、再帰的に記述することも可"
"能です。再帰的な解法は2つの部分に分かれています。一つは、グラフの最大高さな"
"ど、一度だけ求めればよい複数の変数の値を <code class=\"code\">let</code> 式を"
"用いて決定する外側のラッパーであり、もう一つは、グラフを出力するために再帰的"
"に呼び出される内側の関数です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dgraph_002dbody_002dprint.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The wrapper is uncomplicated:"
msgstr "ラッパーはシンプルです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dgraph_002dbody_002dprint.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun recursive-graph-body-print (numbers-list)\n"
"  &quot;Print a bar graph of the NUMBERS-LIST.\n"
"The numbers-list consists of the Y-axis values.&quot;\n"
"  (let ((height (apply 'max numbers-list))\n"
"        (symbol-width (length graph-blank))\n"
"        from-position)\n"
"    (recursive-graph-body-print-internal\n"
"     numbers-list\n"
"     height\n"
"     symbol-width)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dgraph_002dbody_002dprint.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The recursive function is a little more difficult.  It has four parts: the "
"do-again-test, the printing code, the recursive call, and the next-step-"
"expression.  The do-again-test is a <code class=\"code\">when</code> "
"expression that determines whether the <code class=\"code\">numbers-list</"
"code> contains any remaining elements; if it does, the function prints one "
"column of the graph using the printing code and calls itself again.  The "
"function calls itself again according to the value produced by the next-step-"
"expression which causes the call to act on a shorter version of the <code "
"class=\"code\">numbers-list</code>."
msgstr ""
"再帰関数は少し複雑です。これは、再実行判定、出力コード、再帰呼び出し、そして"
"次ステップ式の4つの部分で構成されています。再実行判定は<code "
"class=\"code\">when</code>式で、<code class=\"code\">numbers-list</code>に残"
"りの要素があるかどうかを判定します。要素がある場合、関数は出力コードを用いて"
"グラフの1列を出力し、自身を再度呼び出します。関数は、次ステップ式によって生成"
"された値に基づいて自身を再度呼び出し、これにより呼び出しは<code "
"class=\"code\">numbers-list</code>の短縮版に対して処理を行うことになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dgraph_002dbody_002dprint.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun recursive-graph-body-print-internal\n"
"  (numbers-list height symbol-width)\n"
"  &quot;Print a bar graph.\n"
"Used within recursive-graph-body-print function.&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dgraph_002dbody_002dprint.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (when numbers-list\n"
"        (setq from-position (point))\n"
"        (insert-rectangle\n"
"         (column-of-graph height (car numbers-list)))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/recursive_002dgraph_002dbody_002dprint.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        (goto-char from-position)\n"
"        (forward-char symbol-width)\n"
"        (sit-for 0)     ; <span class=\"r\">Draw graph column by column.</span>\n"
"        (recursive-graph-body-print-internal\n"
"         (cdr numbers-list) height symbol-width)))\n"
msgstr ""

