# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/save_002drestriction.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-save_002drestriction\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-save_002drestriction\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/save_002drestriction.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In Emacs Lisp, you can use the <code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> "
"special form to keep track of whatever narrowing is in effect, if any.  When "
"the Lisp interpreter meets with <code class=\"code\">save-restriction</"
"code>, it executes the code in the body of the <code class=\"code\">save-"
"restriction</code> expression, and then undoes any changes to narrowing that "
"the code caused.  If, for example, the buffer is narrowed and the code that "
"follows <code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> gets rid of the "
"narrowing, <code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> returns the buffer "
"to its narrowed region afterwards.  In the <code class=\"code\">what-line</"
"code> command, any narrowing the buffer may have is undone by the <code "
"class=\"code\">widen</code> command that immediately follows the <code "
"class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> command.  Any original narrowing is "
"restored just before the completion of the function."
msgstr ""
"Emacs Lispでは、<code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> 特殊フォームを使"
"用して、適用されているナローイング（もしあれば）を追跡できます。Lispインタプ"
"リタが <code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> に到達すると、<code "
"class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> 式のボディ内のコードを実行し、その後、"
"そのコードによって生じたナローイングへの変更を元に戻します。例えば、バッファ"
"がナローイングされており、<code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> に続く"
"コードがそのナローイングを解除した場合、<code class=\"code\">save-"
"restriction</code> はその後バッファをナローイングされた領域に戻します。<code "
"class=\"code\">what-line</code> コマンドにおいて、バッファに適用されている可"
"能性のあるナローイングは、<code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> コマン"
"ドの直後に続く <code class=\"code\">widen</code> コマンドによって解除されま"
"す。元のナローイングは、関数の終了直前に復元されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/save_002drestriction.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The template for a <code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> expression "
"is simple:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> 式のテンプレートはシンプルです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/save_002drestriction.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(save-restriction\n"
"  <var class=\"var\">body</var>... )\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/save_002drestriction.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The body of the <code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> is one or more "
"expressions that will be evaluated in sequence by the Lisp interpreter."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> の本体は、Lispインタプリタによっ"
"て順次評価される1つ以上の式です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/save_002drestriction.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Finally, a point to note: when you use both <code class=\"code\">save-"
"excursion</code> and <code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code>, one right "
"after the other, you should use <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> "
"outermost.  If you write them in reverse order, you may fail to record "
"narrowing in the buffer to which Emacs switches after calling <code "
"class=\"code\">save-excursion</code>.  Thus, when written together, <code "
"class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> and <code class=\"code\">save-"
"restriction</code> should be written like this:"
msgstr ""
"最後に注意点です。<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> を連続して使用する場合は、最も外側に "
"<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> を配置してください。逆の順序で記述"
"すると、<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> を呼び出した後に Emacs が"
"切り替わるバッファにおいて、狭窄を記録し損ねる可能性があります。したがって、"
"併せて記述する場合、<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> は次のように記述すべきです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/save_002drestriction.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(save-excursion\n"
"  (save-restriction\n"
"    <var class=\"var\">body</var>...))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/save_002drestriction.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In other circumstances, when not written together, the <code "
"class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> and <code class=\"code\">save-"
"restriction</code> special forms must be written in the order appropriate to "
"the function."
msgstr ""
"その他の場合で、併せて記述されないときは、<code class=\"code\">save-"
"excursion</code> および <code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> の特殊形"
"式を、機能に応じた順序で記述しなければならない。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/save_002drestriction.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (save-restriction\n"
"    (widen)\n"
"    (save-excursion\n"
"    <var class=\"var\">body</var>...))\n"
msgstr ""

