#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><h4>
#: build/html/eintr/search_002dforward.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>8.1.3 The <code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> Function<a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-search_002dforward-Function\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>8.1.3 <code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> 関数<a "
"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-search_002dforward-Function\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/search_002dforward.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-search_002dforward\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-search_002dforward\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/search_002dforward.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> function is used to locate "
"the zapped-for-character in <code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code>.  If the "
"search is successful, <code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> leaves "
"point immediately after the last character in the target string.  (In <code "
"class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code>, the target string is just one character "
"long.  <code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code> uses the function <code "
"class=\"code\">char-to-string</code> to ensure that the computer treats that "
"character as a string.)  If the search is backwards, <code "
"class=\"code\">search-forward</code> leaves point just before the first "
"character in the target.  Also, <code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> "
"returns <code class=\"code\">t</code> for true.  (Moving point is therefore "
"a side effect.)"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> 関数は、<code class=\"code\">zap-"
"to-char</code> 内で文字として置換された箇所を特定するために使用されます。検索"
"に成功した場合、<code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> は対象文字列の最後"
"の文字の直後にポイントを移動させます。（<code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</"
"code> では、対象文字列はわずか1文字です。<code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</"
"code> は <code class=\"code\">char-to-string</code> 関数を使用して、コン"
"ピュータがその文字を文字列として扱うようにします。）検索が逆順だった場合、"
"<code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> は対象文字列の最初の文字の直前にポ"
"イントを移動させます。また、<code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> は "
"true に対して <code class=\"code\">t</code> を返します。（したがって、ポイン"
"トの移動は副作用となります。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/search_002dforward.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In <code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code>, the <code class=\"code\">search-"
"forward</code> function looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code> では、<code class=\"code\">search-"
"forward</code> 関数は次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/search_002dforward.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(search-forward (char-to-string char) nil nil arg)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/search_002dforward.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> function takes four arguments:"
msgstr "<code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> 関数は4つの引数を取ります："

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ol><li>
#: build/html/eintr/search_002dforward.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The first argument is the target, what is searched for.  This must be a "
"string, such as &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;z&quot;</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"第1引数はターゲット、つまり検索対象です。これは &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&quot;z&quot;</samp>&rsquo; のような文字列である必要がありま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ol><li><p>
#: build/html/eintr/search_002dforward.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"As it happens, the argument passed to <code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</"
"code> is a single character.  Because of the way computers are built, the "
"Lisp interpreter may treat a single character as being different from a "
"string of characters.  Inside the computer, a single character has a "
"different electronic format than a string of one character.  (A single "
"character can often be recorded in the computer using exactly one byte; but "
"a string may be longer, and the computer needs to be ready for this.)  Since "
"the <code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> function searches for a "
"string, the character that the <code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code> "
"function receives as its argument must be converted inside the computer from "
"one format to the other; otherwise the <code class=\"code\">search-forward</"
"code> function will fail.  The <code class=\"code\">char-to-string</code> "
"function is used to make this conversion."
msgstr ""
"実は、<code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code> に渡される引数は単一の文字で"
"す。コンピュータの構造上、Lispインタプリタは単一の文字を、文字の文字列とは異"
"なるものとして扱う場合があります。コンピュータ内部では、単一の文字は1文字の文"
"字列とは異なる電子形式を持っています。（単一の文字は、多くの場合ちょうど1バイ"
"トでコンピュータに記録できますが、文字列はそれより長くなる可能性があり、コン"
"ピュータはそれに対応しておく必要があります。）<code class=\"code\">search-"
"forward</code> 関数は文字列を検索するため、<code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</"
"code> 関数が引数として受け取る文字は、コンピュータ内部で一方の形式からもう一"
"方の形式へと変換されなければなりません。そうしないと、<code "
"class=\"code\">search-forward</code> 関数は失敗します。<code "
"class=\"code\">char-to-string</code> 関数は、この変換を行うために使用されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ol><li>
#: build/html/eintr/search_002dforward.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The second argument bounds the search; it is specified as a position in the "
"buffer.  In this case, the search can go to the end of the buffer, so no "
"bound is set and the second argument is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>."
msgstr ""
"第2引数は検索範囲を制限するもので、バッファ内の位置として指定されます。この場"
"合、検索はバッファの末尾まで及ぶ可能性があるため、制限は設定されず、第2引数"
"は <code class=\"code\">nil</code> となります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ol><li>
#: build/html/eintr/search_002dforward.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The third argument tells the function what it should do if the search "
"fails&mdash;it can signal an error (and print a message) or it can return "
"<code class=\"code\">nil</code>.  A <code class=\"code\">nil</code> as the "
"third argument causes the function to signal an error when the search fails."
msgstr ""
"第3引数は、検索に失敗した際に関数がどう動作すべきかを指定します。エラーを通知"
"（およびメッセージを出力）することも、<code class=\"code\">nil</code>を返すこ"
"とも可能です。第3引数に<code class=\"code\">nil</code>を指定すると、検索失敗"
"時に関数がエラーを通知するようになります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><ol><li>
#: build/html/eintr/search_002dforward.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The fourth argument to <code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> is the "
"repeat count&mdash;how many occurrences of the string to look for.  This "
"argument is optional and if the function is called without a repeat count, "
"this argument is passed the value 1.  If this argument is negative, the "
"search goes backwards."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> の第4引数は繰り返し回数&mdash;文字"
"列を何回検索するかです。この引数は省略可能で、繰り返し回数を指定せずに関数を"
"呼び出した場合は、この引数に 1 が渡されます。この引数が負の値の場合、検索は逆"
"方向に行われます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/search_002dforward.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In template form, a <code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> expression "
"looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"テンプレート形式では、<code class=\"code\">search-forward</code> 式は次のよう"
"になります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/search_002dforward.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(search-forward &quot;<var class=\"var\">target-string</var>&quot;\n"
"                <var class=\"var\">limit-of-search</var>\n"
"                <var class=\"var\">what-to-do-if-search-fails</var>\n"
"                <var class=\"var\">repeat-count</var>)\n"
msgstr ""

