#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><h3>
#: build/html/eintr/sentence_002dend.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<span>12.1 The Regular Expression for <code class=\"code\">sentence-end</"
"code><a class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-Regular-Expression-for-"
"sentence_002dend\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>12.1 <code class=\"code\">sentence-end</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#The-Regular-Expression-for-sentence_002dend\"> &para;</a> の正"
"規表現</span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/sentence_002dend.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-sentence_002dend\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-sentence_002dend\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/sentence_002dend.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The symbol <code class=\"code\">sentence-end</code> is bound to the pattern "
"that marks the end of a sentence.  What should this regular expression be?"
msgstr ""
"記号 <code class=\"code\">sentence-end</code> は、文末を示すパターンに結びつ"
"いています。この正規表現はどうあるべきでしょうか？"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/sentence_002dend.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Clearly, a sentence may be ended by a period, a question mark, or an "
"exclamation mark.  Indeed, in English, only clauses that end with one of "
"those three characters should be considered the end of a sentence.  This "
"means that the pattern should include the character set:"
msgstr ""
"明らかに、文はピリオド、疑問符、または感嘆符で終わることがあります。実際、英"
"語では、これら3つの記号のいずれかで終わる節のみを文末とみなすべきです。つま"
"り、パターンには以下の文字セットを含める必要があります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/sentence_002dend.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "[.?!]\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/sentence_002dend.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"However, we do not want <code class=\"code\">forward-sentence</code> merely "
"to jump to a period, a question mark, or an exclamation mark, because such a "
"character might be used in the middle of a sentence.  A period, for example, "
"is used after abbreviations.  So other information is needed."
msgstr ""
"しかし、<code class=\"code\">forward-sentence</code> が単にピリオドや疑問符、"
"感嘆符へとジャンプすることは避けたい。そうした文字は文の途中で使用される可能"
"性があるからだ。例えば、ピリオドは略語の後に使われる。したがって、他の情報が"
"必要となる。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/sentence_002dend.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"According to convention, you type two spaces after every sentence, but only "
"one space after a period, a question mark, or an exclamation mark in the "
"body of a sentence.  So a period, a question mark, or an exclamation mark "
"followed by two spaces is a good indicator of an end of sentence.  However, "
"in a file, the two spaces may instead be a tab or the end of a line.  This "
"means that the regular expression should include these three items as "
"alternatives."
msgstr ""
"慣習として、文の後にはスペースを2つ、文の途中にあるピリオド、疑問符、または感"
"嘆符の後にはスペースを1つだけ入力します。したがって、ピリオド、疑問符、または"
"感嘆符の後にスペースが2つ続く場合は、文末であることを示す良い指標となります。"
"しかし、ファイル内では、そのスペース2つがタブや行末である場合もあります。つま"
"り、正規表現にはこれら3つのパターンを選択肢として含める必要があります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/sentence_002dend.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "This group of alternatives will look like this:"
msgstr "この選択肢群は、次のようになります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/sentence_002dend.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\\\($\\\\| \\\\|  \\\\)\n"
"       ^   ^^\n"
"      TAB  SPC\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/sentence_002dend.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Here, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$</samp>&rsquo; indicates the end of the "
"line, and I have pointed out where the tab and two spaces are inserted in "
"the expression.  Both are inserted by putting the actual characters into the "
"expression."
msgstr ""
"ここでは、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">$</samp>&rsquo;が行末を示しており、式の"
"中でタブと2つのスペースがどこに挿入されているかを明示しました。どちらも、実際"
"の文字を式に記述することで挿入されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/sentence_002dend.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Two backslashes, &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\\\</samp>&rsquo;, are "
"required before the parentheses and vertical bars: the first backslash "
"quotes the following backslash in Emacs; and the second indicates that the "
"following character, the parenthesis or the vertical bar, is special."
msgstr ""
"括弧と垂直バーの前には、2つのバックスラッシュ &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\"
"\\</samp>&rsquo; が必要です。1つ目のバックスラッシュはEmacsにおいて後続のバッ"
"クスラッシュをクォートし、2つ目は後続の文字（括弧または垂直バー）が特殊である"
"ことを示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/sentence_002dend.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Also, a sentence may be followed by one or more carriage returns, like this:"
msgstr "また、文の後に、次のように1つ以上の改行が続く場合があります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/sentence_002dend.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[\n"
"]*\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/sentence_002dend.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Like tabs and spaces, a carriage return is inserted into a regular "
"expression by inserting it literally.  The asterisk indicates that the <kbd "
"class=\"key\">RET</kbd> is repeated zero or more times."
msgstr ""
"タブやスペースと同様に、キャリッジリターンはリテラルとして挿入することで正規"
"表現に組み込まれます。アスタリスクは、<kbd class=\"key\">RET</kbd>が0回以上繰"
"り返されることを示します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/sentence_002dend.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"But a sentence end does not consist only of a period, a question mark or an "
"exclamation mark followed by appropriate space: a closing quotation mark or "
"a closing brace of some kind may precede the space.  Indeed more than one "
"such mark or brace may precede the space.  These require a expression that "
"looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"しかし、文末は単にピリオド、疑問符、あるいは感嘆符とそれに続く適切なスペース"
"だけで構成されるわけではありません。スペースの前に、閉じ引用符や何らかの閉じ"
"中括弧が来ることがあります。実際、こうした記号や中括弧が複数個、スペースの前"
"に来ることもあります。これらには、次のような表記が必要となります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/sentence_002dend.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "[]\\&quot;')}]*\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/sentence_002dend.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In this expression, the first &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">]</samp>&rsquo; is "
"the first character in the expression; the second character is &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&quot;</samp>&rsquo;, which is preceded by a &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; to tell Emacs the &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">&quot;</samp>&rsquo; is <em class=\"emph\">not</em> special.  "
"The last three characters are &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">'</samp>&rsquo;, "
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">)</samp>&rsquo;, and &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">}</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"この式において、最初の &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">]</samp>&rsquo; は式の先頭"
"文字です。2番目の文字は &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;</samp>&rsquo; であ"
"り、その前には &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">\\</samp>&rsquo; が置かれていて、"
"これにより Emacs に &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">&quot;</samp>&rsquo; が特殊で"
"は<em class=\"emph\">ない</em>ことを伝えます。最後の3つの文字は &lsquo;<samp "
"class=\"samp\">'</samp>&rsquo;、&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">)</samp>&rsquo;、"
"および &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">}</samp>&rsquo; です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/sentence_002dend.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"All this suggests what the regular expression pattern for matching the end "
"of a sentence should be; and, indeed, if we evaluate <code "
"class=\"code\">sentence-end</code> we find that it returns the following "
"value:"
msgstr ""
"これらすべては、文末にマッチさせるための正規表現パターンがどうあるべきかを示"
"唆しています。そして実際に、<code class=\"code\">sentence-end</code> を評価し"
"てみると、次のような値が返されることがわかります。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/sentence_002dend.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sentence-end\n"
"     &rArr; &quot;[.?!][]\\&quot;')}]*\\\\($\\\\|     \\\\|  \\\\)[\n"
"]*&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/sentence_002dend.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(Well, not in GNU Emacs 22; that is because of an effort to make the process "
"simpler and to handle more glyphs and languages.  When the value of <code "
"class=\"code\">sentence-end</code> is <code class=\"code\">nil</code>, then "
"use the value defined by the function <code class=\"code\">sentence-end</"
"code>.  (Here is a use of the difference between a value and a function in "
"Emacs Lisp.)  The function returns a value constructed from the variables "
"<code class=\"code\">sentence-end-base</code>, <code class=\"code\">sentence-"
"end-double-space</code>, <code class=\"code\">sentence-end-without-period</"
"code>, and <code class=\"code\">sentence-end-without-space</code>.  The "
"critical variable is <code class=\"code\">sentence-end-base</code>; its "
"global value is similar to the one described above but it also contains two "
"additional quotation marks.  These have differing degrees of curliness.  The "
"<code class=\"code\">sentence-end-without-period</code> variable, when true, "
"tells Emacs that a sentence may end without a period, such as text in Thai.)"
msgstr ""
"（もっとも、GNU Emacs 22ではそうではありません。これは、処理を簡素化し、より"
"多くのグリフや言語に対応させようとする取り組みによるものです。<code "
"class=\"code\">sentence-end</code> の値が <code class=\"code\">nil</code> で"
"ある場合は、関数 <code class=\"code\">sentence-end</code> で定義された値を使"
"用します。（これは Emacs Lisp における値と関数の違いを利用した例です。）この"
"関数は、変数 <code class=\"code\">sentence-end-base</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">sentence-end-double-space</code>、<code "
"class=\"code\">sentence-end-without-period</code>、および <code "
"class=\"code\">sentence-end-without-space</code> から構成される値を返します。"
"重要な変数は <code class=\"code\">sentence-end-base</code> であり、そのグロー"
"バル値は前述のものと同様ですが、さらに2つの引用符が含まれています。これらは曲"
"がり具合が異なります。変数 <code class=\"code\">sentence-end-without-period</"
"code> が真の場合、タイ語のテキストのように、文がピリオドなしで終わってもよい"
"ことを Emacs に伝えます。）"

