"href=\"#setcar-1\"> &para;</a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>7.5 <code class=\"code\">setcar</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#setcar-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/setcar.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-setcar\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-setcar\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/setcar.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"As you might guess from their names, the <code class=\"code\">setcar</code> "
"and <code class=\"code\">setcdr</code> functions set the <small "
"class=\"sc\">CAR</small> or the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of a list to "
"a new value.  They actually change the original list, unlike <code "
"class=\"code\">car</code> and <code class=\"code\">cdr</code> which leave "
"the original list as it was.  One way to find out how this works is to "
"experiment.  We will start with the <code class=\"code\">setcar</code> "
"function."
msgstr ""
"その名前から推測できる通り、<code class=\"code\">setcar</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">setcdr</code> 関数は、リストの <small class=\"sc\">CAR</"
"small> または <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> を新しい値に設定します。これら"
"は実際に元のリストを変更しますが、<code class=\"code\">car</code> と <code "
"class=\"code\">cdr</code> は元のリストをそのままにします。これがどのように動"
"作するかを確認する一つの方法は、実際に試してみることです。まずは <code "
"class=\"code\">setcar</code> 関数から始めてみましょう。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/setcar.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"First, we can make a list and then set the value of a variable to the list, "
"using the <code class=\"code\">setq</code> special form.  Because we intend "
"to use <code class=\"code\">setcar</code> to change the list, this <code "
"class=\"code\">setq</code> should not use the quoted form <code "
"class=\"code\">'(antelope giraffe lion tiger)</code>, as that would yield a "
"list that is part of the program and bad things could happen if we tried to "
"change part of the program while running it.  Generally speaking an Emacs "
"Lisp program&rsquo;s components should be constant (or unchanged) while the "
"program is running.  So we instead construct an animal list by using the "
"<code class=\"code\">list</code> function, as follows:"
msgstr ""
"まず、リストを作成し、<code class=\"code\">setq</code> という特殊形式を用いて"
"変数にそのリストを代入します。<code class=\"code\">setcar</code> を使ってリス"
"トを変更するつもりなので、この <code class=\"code\">setq</code> では引用形式"
"の <code class=\"code\">'(antelope giraffe lion tiger)</code> を使うべきでは"
"ありません。そうすると、プログラムの一部となるリストが生成されてしまい、実行"
"中にプログラムの一部を変更しようとした際に予期せぬ問題が発生する恐れがあるた"
"めです。一般的に、Emacs Lisp プログラムの構成要素は、プログラムの実行中は定数"
"（あるいは不変）であるべきです。そこで、代わりに <code class=\"code\">list</"
"code> 関数を用いて、次のように動物のリストを構築します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/setcar.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(setq animals (list 'antelope 'giraffe 'lion 'tiger))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/setcar.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If you are reading this in Info inside of GNU Emacs, you can evaluate this "
"expression in the usual fashion, by positioning the cursor after the "
"expression and typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd>.  (I&rsquo;m doing "
"this right here as I write this.  This is one of the advantages of having "
"the interpreter built into the computing environment.  Incidentally, when "
"there is nothing on the line after the final parentheses, such as a comment, "
"point can be on the next line.  Thus, if your cursor is in the first column "
"of the next line, you do not need to move it.  Indeed, Emacs permits any "
"amount of white space after the final parenthesis.)"
msgstr ""
"GNU EmacsのInfoでこれを読んでいる場合は、式の後にカーソルを置き、<kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">C-x C-e</kbd>と入力するという通常の方法でこの式を評価できます。"
"（今まさにこれを書きながらそうしています。これが、コンピューティング環境にイ"
"ンタプリタが組み込まれていることの利点の一つです。ちなみに、最後の括弧の後の"
"行にコメントなど何もない場合は、ポイントは次の行にあっても構いません。した"
"がって、カーソルが次の行の1列目にあるなら、それを移動させる必要はありません。"
"実際、Emacsでは最後の括弧の後に任意の量の空白を入れることができます。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/setcar.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"When we evaluate the variable <code class=\"code\">animals</code>, we see "
"that it is bound to the list <code class=\"code\">(antelope giraffe lion "
"tiger)</code>:"
msgstr ""
"変数 <code class=\"code\">animals</code> を評価すると、それがリスト <code "
"class=\"code\">(antelope giraffe lion tiger)</code> に束縛されていることがわ"
"かります："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/setcar.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"animals\n"
"     &rArr; (antelope giraffe lion tiger)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/setcar.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Put another way, the variable <code class=\"code\">animals</code> points to "
"the list <code class=\"code\">(antelope giraffe lion tiger)</code>."
msgstr ""
"言い換えれば、変数 <code class=\"code\">animals</code> はリスト <code "
"class=\"code\">(antelope giraffe lion tiger)</code> を指しています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/setcar.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Next, evaluate the function <code class=\"code\">setcar</code> while passing "
"it two arguments, the variable <code class=\"code\">animals</code> and the "
"quoted symbol <code class=\"code\">hippopotamus</code>; this is done by "
"writing the three element list <code class=\"code\">(setcar animals "
"'hippopotamus)</code> and then evaluating it in the usual fashion:"
msgstr ""
"次に、変数 <code class=\"code\">animals</code> とクォートされたシンボル "
"<code class=\"code\">hippopotamus</code> という2つの引数を渡しながら関数 "
"<code class=\"code\">setcar</code> を評価します。これは、3要素のリスト <code "
"class=\"code\">(setcar animals 'hippopotamus)</code> を記述し、それを通常の方"
"法で評価することで行います："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/setcar.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(setcar animals 'hippopotamus)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/setcar.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"After evaluating this expression, evaluate the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">animals</code> again.  You will see that the list of animals "
"has changed:"
msgstr ""
"この式を評価した後、変数 <code class=\"code\">animals</code> をもう一度評価し"
"てください。動物のリストが変わっていることがわかるはずです："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/setcar.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"animals\n"
"     &rArr; (hippopotamus giraffe lion tiger)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/setcar.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The first element on the list, <code class=\"code\">antelope</code> is "
"replaced by <code class=\"code\">hippopotamus</code>."
msgstr ""
"リストの最初の要素 <code class=\"code\">antelope</code> は <code "
"class=\"code\">hippopotamus</code> に置き換えられます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/setcar.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"So we can see that <code class=\"code\">setcar</code> did not add a new "
"element to the list as <code class=\"code\">cons</code> would have; it "
"replaced <code class=\"code\">antelope</code> with <code "
"class=\"code\">hippopotamus</code>; it <em class=\"emph\">changed</em> the "
"list."
msgstr ""
"このように、<code class=\"code\">setcar</code>は<code class=\"code\">cons</"
"code>のようにリストに新しい要素を追加したのではなく、<code "
"class=\"code\">antelope</code>を<code class=\"code\">hippopotamus</code>に置"
"き換え、リストを<em class=\"emph\">変更</em>したことがわかります。"

