# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/setcdr.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">setcdr</code> function is similar to the <code "
"class=\"code\">setcar</code> function, except that the function replaces the "
"second and subsequent elements of a list rather than the first element."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">setcdr</code> 関数は <code class=\"code\">setcar</code> "
"関数と似ていますが、リストの最初の要素ではなく、2番目以降の要素を置き換える点"
"が異なります。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/setcdr.html
msgid ""
"(To see how to change the last element of a list, look ahead to <a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"kill_002dnew-function.html\">The <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-new</code> function</a>, which uses the <code "
"class=\"code\">nthcdr</code> and <code class=\"code\">setcdr</code> "
"functions.)"
msgstr ""
"（リストの最後の要素を変更する方法については、<code class=\"code\">nthcdr</"
"code> 関数と <code class=\"code\">setcdr</code> 関数を使用している <a "
"class=\"ref\" href=\"kill_002dnew-function.html\"><code class=\"code\">kill-"
"new</code> 関数</a> を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/setcdr.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"To see how this works, set the value of the variable to a list of "
"domesticated animals by evaluating the following expression:"
msgstr ""
"この仕組みを確認するには、次の式を評価して変数の値に家畜のリストを代入してく"
"ださい。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/setcdr.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(setq domesticated-animals (list 'horse 'cow 'sheep 'goat))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/setcdr.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If you now evaluate the list, you will be returned the list <code "
"class=\"code\">(horse cow sheep goat)</code>:"
msgstr ""
"ここでリストを評価すると、リスト <code class=\"code\">(horse cow sheep "
"goat)</code> が返されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/setcdr.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"domesticated-animals\n"
"     &rArr; (horse cow sheep goat)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/setcdr.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Next, evaluate <code class=\"code\">setcdr</code> with two arguments, the "
"name of the variable which has a list as its value, and the list to which "
"the <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of the first list will be set;"
msgstr ""
"次に、<code class=\"code\">setcdr</code> を2つの引数、すなわちリストを値とす"
"る変数名と、最初のリストの <small class=\"sc\">CDR</small> が設定されるリスト"
"を用いて評価します。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/setcdr.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(setcdr domesticated-animals '(cat dog))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/setcdr.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"If you evaluate this expression, the list <code class=\"code\">(cat dog)</"
"code> will appear in the echo area.  This is the value returned by the "
"function.  The result we are interested in is the side effect, which we can "
"see by evaluating the variable <code class=\"code\">domesticated-animals</"
"code>:"
msgstr ""
"この式を評価すると、エコー領域にリスト <code class=\"code\">(cat dog)</code> "
"が表示されます。これが関数から返される値です。私たちが関心を寄せている結果は"
"副作用であり、これは変数 <code class=\"code\">domesticated-animals</code> を"
"評価することで確認できます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/setcdr.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"domesticated-animals\n"
"     &rArr; (horse cat dog)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/setcdr.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Indeed, the list is changed from <code class=\"code\">(horse cow sheep "
"goat)</code> to <code class=\"code\">(horse cat dog)</code>.  The <small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small> of the list is changed from <code "
"class=\"code\">(cow sheep goat)</code> to <code class=\"code\">(cat dog)</"
"code>."
msgstr ""
"確かに、リストは<code class=\"code\">(horse cow sheep goat)</code>から<code "
"class=\"code\">(horse cat dog)</code>に変更されています。リストの<small "
"class=\"sc\">CDR</small>は<code class=\"code\">(cow sheep goat)</code>から"
"<code class=\"code\">(cat dog)</code>に変更されています。"

