#: build/html/eintr/setq.html
msgid ""
"There are several ways by which a variable can be given a value.  One of the "
"ways is to use the special form <code class=\"code\">setq</code>.  Another "
"way is to use <code class=\"code\">let</code> (see <a class=\"pxref\" "
"href=\"let.html\"><code class=\"code\">let</code></a>).  (The jargon for "
"this process is to <em class=\"dfn\">bind</em> a variable to a value.)"
msgstr ""
