msgid ""
"The first of these lines is the expression, <code class=\"code\">(push-"
"mark)</code>.  When this expression is evaluated by the Lisp interpreter, it "
"sets a mark at the current position of the cursor, wherever that may be.  "
"The position of this mark is saved in the mark ring."
msgstr ""
"これらの行の1行目は、<code class=\"code\">(push-mark)</code> という式です。こ"
"の式がLispインタプリタによって評価されると、カーソルの現在位置（それがどこで"
"あっても）にマークが置かれます。このマークの位置は、マークリングに保存されま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/simplified_002dbeginning_002dof_002dbuffer.html
msgid ""
"The next line is <code class=\"code\">(goto-char (point-min))</code>.  This "
"expression jumps the cursor to the minimum point in the buffer, that is, to "
"the beginning of the buffer (or to the beginning of the accessible portion "
"of the buffer if it is narrowed.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"Narrowing-"
"_0026-Widening.html\">Narrowing and Widening</a>.)"
msgstr ""
"次の行は <code class=\"code\">(goto-char (point-min))</code> です。この式は、"
"カーソルをバッファ内の最小点、すなわちバッファの先頭（バッファが狭められてい"
"る場合は、アクセス可能な部分の先頭）に移動させます（<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"Narrowing-_0026-Widening.html\">狭めと広げ</a>を参照）。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/simplified_002dbeginning_002dof_002dbuffer.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">push-mark</code> command sets a mark at the place "
"where the cursor was located before it was moved to the beginning of the "
"buffer by the <code class=\"code\">(goto-char (point-min))</code> "
"expression.  Consequently, you can, if you wish, go back to where you were "
"originally by typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-x</kbd>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">push-mark</code> コマンドは、<code class=\"code\">(goto-"
"char (point-min))</code> 式によってカーソルがバッファの先頭に移動される前の位"
"置にマークを設定します。そのため、必要に応じて <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-x C-x</"
"kbd> と入力することで、元の位置に戻ることができます。"

