#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/the_002dthe.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"One can write more complicated expressions, but I found that this expression "
"is good enough, so I use it."
msgstr ""
"もっと複雑な式を書くこともできますが、この式で十分だと思ったので、これを使っ"
"ています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
