msgid ""
"Here is the <code class=\"code\">the-the</code> function, as I include it in "
"my <samp class=\"file\">.emacs</samp> file, along with a handy global key "
"binding:"
msgstr ""
"<samp class=\"file\">.emacs</samp>ファイルに含めている<code "
