#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In Lisp, <code class=\"code\">equal</code> is a function that determines "
"whether its first argument is equal to its second argument.  The second "
"argument is the string <code class=\"code\">&quot;fierce&quot;</code> and "
"the first argument is the value of the symbol <code "
"class=\"code\">characteristic</code>&mdash;in other words, the argument "
"passed to this function."
msgstr ""
"Lisp では、<code class=\"code\">equal</code> は第1引数が第2引数と等しいかどう"
"かを判定する関数です。第2引数は文字列 <code class=\"code\">&quot;fierce&quot;"
"</code> であり、第1引数はシンボル <code class=\"code\">characteristic</code> "
"の値――言い換えれば、この関数に渡された引数です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/type_002dof_002danimal-in-detail.html
#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"In the first exercise of <code class=\"code\">type-of-animal</code>, the "
"argument <code class=\"code\">&quot;fierce&quot;</code> is passed to <code "
"class=\"code\">type-of-animal</code>.  Since <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;fierce&quot;</code> is equal to <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;fierce&quot;</code>, the expression, <code "
"class=\"code\">(equal characteristic &quot;fierce&quot;)</code>, returns a "
"value of true.  When this happens, the <code class=\"code\">if</code> "
"evaluates the second argument or then-part of the <code class=\"code\">if</"
"code>: <code class=\"code\">(message &quot;It is a tiger!&quot;)</code>."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">type-of-animal</code> の最初の式では、引数 <code "
"class=\"code\">&quot;fierce&quot;</code> が <code class=\"code\">type-of-"
"animal</code> に渡されます。<code class=\"code\">&quot;fierce&quot;</code> "
"は <code class=\"code\">&quot;fierce&quot;</code> と等しいため、式 <code "
"class=\"code\">(equal characteristic &quot;fierce&quot;)</code> は true を返"
"します。このとき <code class=\"code\">if</code> は、<code class=\"code\">if</"
"code> の第2引数または then-part である <code class=\"code\">(message "
"&quot;It is a tiger!&quot;)</code> を評価します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
