# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/what_002dline.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-what_002dline\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-Widening_002c-example-of\"></a>"
msgstr ""
"<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-what_002dline\"></a> <a class=\"index-"
"entry-id\" id=\"index-Widening_002c-example-of\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/what_002dline.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">what-line</code> command tells you the number of "
"the line in which the cursor is located.  The function illustrates the use "
"of the <code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> commands.  Here is the original text of "
"the function:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">what-line</code> コマンドは、カーソルが位置する行番号を"
"表示します。この関数では、<code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> およ"
"び <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> コマンドの使い方を解説します。"
"以下は、この関数の元のテキストです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/what_002dline.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun what-line ()\n"
"  &quot;Print the current line number (in the buffer) of point.&quot;\n"
"  (interactive)\n"
"  (save-restriction\n"
"    (widen)\n"
"    (save-excursion\n"
"      (beginning-of-line)\n"
"      (message &quot;Line %d&quot;\n"
"               (1+ (count-lines 1 (point)))))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/what_002dline.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(In modern versions of GNU Emacs, the <code class=\"code\">what-line</code> "
"function has been expanded to tell you your line number in a narrowed buffer "
"as well as your line number in a widened buffer.  The modern version is more "
"complex than the version shown here.  If you feel adventurous, you might "
"want to look at it after figuring out how this version works.  You will "
"probably need to use <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h f</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">describe-function</code>).  The newer version uses a "
"conditional to determine whether the buffer has been narrowed."
msgstr ""
"（GNU Emacsの最新バージョンでは、<code class=\"code\">what-line</code> 関数が"
"拡張され、幅を狭めたバッファでの行番号だけでなく、幅を広げたバッファでの行番"
"号も表示されるようになっています。最新バージョンは、ここで示しているバージョ"
"ンよりも複雑です。挑戦してみたい方は、このバージョンの仕組みを理解した上で、"
"確認してみるとよいでしょう。おそらく <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h f</kbd> (<code "
"class=\"code\">describe-function</code>) を使う必要があるでしょう。新しいバー"
"ジョンでは、条件式を用いてバッファが狭められているかどうかを判定していま"
"す。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/what_002dline.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"Also, the modern version of <code class=\"code\">what-line</code> uses <code "
"class=\"code\">line-number-at-pos</code>, which among other simple "
"expressions, such as <code class=\"code\">(goto-char (point-min))</code>, "
"moves point to the beginning of the current line with <code "
"class=\"code\">(forward-line 0)</code> rather than <code "
"class=\"code\">beginning-of-line</code>.)"
msgstr ""
"また、<code class=\"code\">what-line</code> の現代版では <code "
"class=\"code\">line-number-at-pos</code> が用いられており、<code "
"class=\"code\">(goto-char (point-min))</code> などの他の単純な表現と同様に、"
"<code class=\"code\">beginning-of-line</code> ではなく <code "
"class=\"code\">(forward-line 0)</code> でポイントを現在の行の先頭に移動させま"
"す。)"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/what_002dline.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">what-line</code> function as shown here has a "
"documentation line and is interactive, as you would expect.  The next two "
"lines use the functions <code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> and "
"<code class=\"code\">widen</code>."
msgstr ""
"ここに示す<code class=\"code\">what-line</code>関数には、予想通りドキュメント"
"行があり、インタラクティブです。続く2行では、<code class=\"code\">save-"
"restriction</code>関数と<code class=\"code\">widen</code>関数を使用していま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/what_002dline.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> special form notes whatever "
"narrowing is in effect, if any, in the current buffer and restores that "
"narrowing after the code in the body of the <code class=\"code\">save-"
"restriction</code> has been evaluated."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> 特殊形式は、現在のバッファで適用"
"されているナローイング（もしあれば）を記録し、<code class=\"code\">save-"
"restriction</code> の本体内のコードが評価された後、そのナローイングを復元しま"
"す。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/what_002dline.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> special form is followed by "
"<code class=\"code\">widen</code>.  This function undoes any narrowing the "
"current buffer may have had when <code class=\"code\">what-line</code> was "
"called.  (The narrowing that was there is the narrowing that <code "
"class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> remembers.)  This widening makes it "
"possible for the line counting commands to count from the beginning of the "
"buffer.  Otherwise, they would have been limited to counting within the "
"accessible region.  Any original narrowing is restored just before the "
"completion of the function by the <code class=\"code\">save-restriction</"
"code> special form."
msgstr ""
"特殊形式 <code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> の後には <code "
"class=\"code\">widen</code> が続きます。この関数は、<code "
"class=\"code\">what-line</code> が呼び出された際に現在のバッファに生じていた"
"可能性のある狭めを解除します。（その狭めとは、<code class=\"code\">save-"
"restriction</code> が記憶している狭めのことです。）この広げ処理により、行数カ"
"ウントコマンドがバッファの先頭からカウントできるようになります。そうでなけれ"
"ば、アクセス可能な範囲内でのカウントに限定されていたでしょう。元の狭めは、関"
"数の終了直前に特殊形式 <code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> によって"
"復元されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/what_002dline.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The call to <code class=\"code\">widen</code> is followed by <code "
"class=\"code\">save-excursion</code>, which saves the location of the cursor "
"(i.e., of point), and restores it after the code in the body of the <code "
"class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> uses the <code class=\"code\">beginning-"
"of-line</code> function to move point."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">widen</code> への呼び出しに続いて <code "
"class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> が呼び出され、これによりカーソル（すなわ"
"ちポイント）の位置が保存され、<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> の本"
"体内のコードが <code class=\"code\">beginning-of-line</code> 関数を用いてポイ"
"ントを移動させた後にその位置が復元されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/what_002dline.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(Note that the <code class=\"code\">(widen)</code> expression comes between "
"the <code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> special forms.  When you write the two "
"<code class=\"code\">save- &hellip;</code> expressions in sequence, write "
"<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> outermost.)"
msgstr ""
"（なお、<code class=\"code\">(widen)</code> 式は <code class=\"code\">save-"
"restriction</code> と <code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> の特殊形式の"
"間に配置されます。2つの <code class=\"code\">save- &hellip;</code> 式を連続し"
"て記述する場合は、<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> を最外層に記述し"
"てください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/what_002dline.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The last two lines of the <code class=\"code\">what-line</code> function are "
"functions to count the number of lines in the buffer and then print the "
"number in the echo area."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">what-line</code> 関数の最後の2行は、バッファ内の行数をカ"
"ウントし、その数値をエコーエリアに出力するための関数です。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/what_002dline.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(message &quot;Line %d&quot;\n"
"         (1+ (count-lines 1 (point)))))))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/what_002dline.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">message</code> function prints a one-line message "
"at the bottom of the Emacs screen.  The first argument is inside of "
"quotation marks and is printed as a string of characters.  However, it may "
"contain a &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%d</samp>&rsquo; expression to print a "
"following argument.  &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%d</samp>&rsquo; prints the "
"argument as a decimal, so the message will say something such as &lsquo;"
"<samp class=\"samp\">Line 243</samp>&rsquo;."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">message</code> 関数は、Emacs 画面の下部に1行のメッセージ"
"を出力します。第1引数は引用符で囲まれ、文字列として出力されます。ただし、後続"
"の引数を出力するための &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%d</samp>&rsquo; 式を含め"
"ることができます。&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%d</samp>&rsquo; は引数を10進数"
"で出力するため、メッセージには &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">Line 243</"
"samp>&rsquo; のような内容が表示されます。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/what_002dline.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The number that is printed in place of the &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%d</"
"samp>&rsquo; is computed by the last line of the function:"
msgstr ""
"&lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">%d</samp>&rsquo; の代わりに表示される数値は、関数"
"の最終行によって算出されます："

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/what_002dline.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid "(1+ (count-lines 1 (point)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/what_002dline.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"What this does is count the lines from the first position of the buffer, "
"indicated by the <code class=\"code\">1</code>, up to <code "
"class=\"code\">(point)</code>, and then add one to that number.  (The <code "
"class=\"code\">1+</code> function adds one to its argument.)  We add one to "
"it because line 2 has only one line before it, and <code "
"class=\"code\">count-lines</code> counts only the lines <em "
"class=\"emph\">before</em> the current line."
msgstr ""
"これは、<code class=\"code\">1</code>で示されるバッファの先頭位置から<code "
"class=\"code\">(point)</code>までの行数を数え、そこに1を加えるものです。"
"（<code class=\"code\">1+</code>関数は、引数に1を加えます。）1を加えるのは、2"
"行目の前には1行しかなく、<code class=\"code\">count-lines</code>が現在の行の"
"<em class=\"emph\">前</em>にある行のみを数えるためです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/what_002dline.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"After <code class=\"code\">count-lines</code> has done its job, and the "
"message has been printed in the echo area, the <code class=\"code\">save-"
"excursion</code> restores point to its original position; and <code "
"class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> restores the original narrowing, if "
"any."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">count-lines</code> が処理を完了し、メッセージがエコー領"
"域に出力されると、<code class=\"code\">save-excursion</code> はポイントを元の"
"位置に戻し、<code class=\"code\">save-restriction</code> は（もしあれば）元の"
"幅制限を復元します。"

