# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/yank.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"After learning about <code class=\"code\">current-kill</code>, the code for "
"the <code class=\"code\">yank</code> function is almost easy."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">current-kill</code>について学んだ後なら、<code "
"class=\"code\">yank</code>関数のコードはほぼ簡単だ。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/yank.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">yank</code> function does not use the <code "
"class=\"code\">kill-ring-yank-pointer</code> variable directly.  It calls "
"<code class=\"code\">insert-for-yank</code> which calls <code "
"class=\"code\">current-kill</code> which sets the <code class=\"code\">kill-"
"ring-yank-pointer</code> variable."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">yank</code> 関数は <code class=\"code\">kill-ring-yank-"
"pointer</code> 変数を直接使用しません。<code class=\"code\">insert-for-yank</"
"code> を呼び出し、それが <code class=\"code\">current-kill</code> を呼び出"
"し、最終的に <code class=\"code\">kill-ring-yank-pointer</code> 変数を設定し"
"ます。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/yank.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun yank (&amp;optional arg)\n"
"  &quot;Reinsert (\\&quot;paste\\&quot;) the last stretch of killed text.\n"
"More precisely, reinsert the stretch of killed text most recently\n"
"killed OR yanked.  Put point at end, and set mark at beginning.\n"
"With just \\\\[universal-argument] as argument, same but put point at beginning (and mark at end).\n"
"With argument N, reinsert the Nth most recently killed stretch of killed\n"
"text.\n"
"\n"
"When this command inserts killed text into the buffer, it honors\n"
"`yank-excluded-properties' and `yank-handler' as described in the\n"
"doc string for `insert-for-yank-1', which see.\n"
"\n"
"See also the command `yank-pop' (\\\\[yank-pop]).&quot;\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/yank.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (interactive &quot;*P&quot;)\n"
"  (setq yank-window-start (window-start))\n"
"  ;; If we don't get all the way thru, make last-command indicate that\n"
"  ;; for the following command.\n"
"  (setq this-command t)\n"
"  (push-mark (point))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/yank.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (insert-for-yank (current-kill (cond\n"
"                                  ((listp arg) 0)\n"
"                                  ((eq arg '-) -2)\n"
"                                  (t (1- arg)))))\n"
"  (if (consp arg)\n"
"      ;; This is like exchange-point-and-mark, but doesn't activate the mark.\n"
"      ;; It is cleaner to avoid activation, even though the command\n"
"      ;; loop would deactivate the mark because we inserted text.\n"
"      (goto-char (prog1 (mark t)\n"
"                   (set-marker (mark-marker) (point) (current-buffer)))))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/yank.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  ;; If we do get all the way thru, make this-command indicate that.\n"
"  (if (eq this-command t)\n"
"      (setq this-command 'yank))\n"
"  nil)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/yank.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The key expression is <code class=\"code\">insert-for-yank</code>, which "
"inserts the string returned by <code class=\"code\">current-kill</code>, but "
"removes some text properties from it."
msgstr ""
"重要な式は <code class=\"code\">insert-for-yank</code> で、これは <code "
"class=\"code\">current-kill</code> が返す文字列を挿入しつつ、そこから一部のテ"
"キストプロパティを削除します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/yank.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"However, before getting to that expression, the function sets the value of "
"<code class=\"code\">yank-window-start</code> to the position returned by "
"the <code class=\"code\">(window-start)</code> expression, the position at "
"which the display currently starts.  The <code class=\"code\">yank</code> "
"function also sets <code class=\"code\">this-command</code> and pushes the "
"mark."
msgstr ""
"ただし、その式に至る前に、この関数は<code class=\"code\">yank-window-start</"
"code>の値を、<code class=\"code\">(window-start)</code>式が返す位置、すなわち"
"現在表示が始まる位置に設定します。また、<code class=\"code\">yank</code>関数"
"は<code class=\"code\">this-command</code>を設定し、マークをプッシュします。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/yank.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"After it yanks the appropriate element, if the optional argument is a <small "
"class=\"sc\">CONS</small> rather than a number or nothing, it puts point at "
"beginning of the yanked text and mark at its end."
msgstr ""
"該当する要素をヤンクした後、オプション引数が数値や未指定ではなく <small "
"class=\"sc\">CONS</small> である場合、point をヤンクしたテキストの先頭に、"
"mark をその末尾に配置します。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/yank.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"(The <code class=\"code\">prog1</code> function is like <code "
"class=\"code\">progn</code> but returns the value of its first argument "
"rather than the value of its last argument.  Its first argument is forced to "
"return the buffer&rsquo;s mark as an integer.  You can see the documentation "
"for these functions by placing point over them in this buffer and then "
"typing <kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h f</kbd> (<code class=\"code\">describe-"
"function</code>) followed by a <kbd class=\"kbd\">RET</kbd>; the default is "
"the function.)"
msgstr ""
"(<code class=\"code\">prog1</code> 関数は <code class=\"code\">progn</code> "
"と同様ですが、最後の引数ではなく最初の引数の値を返します。最初の引数は、バッ"
"ファのマークを整数として返すように強制されています。これらの関数のドキュメン"
"トを確認するには、このバッファ内でポイントを置き、<kbd class=\"kbd\">C-h f</"
"kbd> (<code class=\"code\">describe-function</code>) と入力した後に <kbd "
"class=\"kbd\">RET</kbd> と入力してください。デフォルトは関数です。)"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/yank.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The last part of the function tells what to do when it succeeds."
msgstr "関数の最後の部分は、成功したときに何をすべきかを記述しています。"

