msgstr ""
"<span>B.3 <code class=\"code\">yank-pop</code><a class=\"copiable-link\" "
"href=\"#yank_002dpop-1\"> &para;</a></span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div>
#: build/html/eintr/yank_002dpop.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-yank_002dpop\"></a>"
msgstr "<a class=\"index-entry-id\" id=\"index-yank_002dpop\"></a>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/yank_002dpop.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"After understanding <code class=\"code\">yank</code> and <code "
"class=\"code\">current-kill</code>, you know how to approach the <code "
"class=\"code\">yank-pop</code> function.  Leaving out the documentation to "
"save space, it looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">yank</code> と <code class=\"code\">current-kill</code> "
"を理解したことで、<code class=\"code\">yank-pop</code> 関数にどう取り組めばよ"
"いかが分かったはずです。スペース節約のためドキュメントは省略しますが、内容は"
"以下の通りです。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/yank_002dpop.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(defun yank-pop (&amp;optional arg)\n"
"  &quot;...&quot;\n"
"  (interactive &quot;*p&quot;)\n"
"  (if (not (eq last-command 'yank))\n"
"      (error &quot;Previous command was not a yank&quot;))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/yank_002dpop.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  (setq this-command 'yank)\n"
"  (unless arg (setq arg 1))\n"
"  (let ((inhibit-read-only t)\n"
"        (before (&lt; (point) (mark t))))\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/yank_002dpop.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    (if before\n"
"        (funcall (or yank-undo-function 'delete-region) (point) (mark t))\n"
"      (funcall (or yank-undo-function 'delete-region) (mark t) (point)))\n"
"    (setq yank-undo-function nil)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/yank_002dpop.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    (set-marker (mark-marker) (point) (current-buffer))\n"
"    (insert-for-yank (current-kill arg))\n"
"    ;; Set the window start back where it was in the yank command,\n"
"    ;; if possible.\n"
"    (set-window-start (selected-window) yank-window-start t)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/yank_002dpop.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    (if before\n"
"        ;; This is like exchange-point-and-mark,\n"
"        ;;     but doesn't activate the mark.\n"
"        ;; It is cleaner to avoid activation, even though the command\n"
"        ;; loop would deactivate the mark because we inserted text.\n"
"        (goto-char (prog1 (mark t)\n"
"                     (set-marker (mark-marker)\n"
"                                 (point)\n"
"                                 (current-buffer))))))\n"
"  nil)\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/yank_002dpop.html
msgid ""
"The function is interactive with a small &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">p</"
"samp>&rsquo; so the prefix argument is processed and passed to the "
"function.  The command can only be used after a previous yank; otherwise an "
"error message is sent.  This check uses the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">last-command</code> which is set by <code "
"class=\"code\">yank</code> and is discussed elsewhere.  (See <a "
"class=\"xref\" href=\"copy_002dregion_002das_002dkill.html\"><code "
"class=\"code\">copy-region-as-kill</code></a>.)"
msgstr ""
"この関数は小さな &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">p</samp>&rsquo; でインタラクティ"
"ブに動作するため、プレフィックス引数が処理され、関数に渡されます。このコマン"
"ドは、事前にヤンクを行った後でなければ使用できず、それ以外の場合はエラーメッ"
"セージが送信されます。このチェックでは、<code class=\"code\">yank</code> に"
"よって設定され、別の箇所で説明されている変数 <code class=\"code\">last-"
"command</code> が使用されます。（<a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"copy_002dregion_002das_002dkill.html\"><code class=\"code\">copy-"
"region-as-kill</code></a> を参照してください。）"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/yank_002dpop.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The <code class=\"code\">let</code> clause sets the variable <code "
"class=\"code\">before</code> to true or false depending whether point is "
"before or after mark and then the region between point and mark is deleted.  "
"This is the region that was just inserted by the previous yank and it is "
"this text that will be replaced."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">let</code> 節は、point が mark より前か後かに応じて変数 "
"<code class=\"code\">before</code> に true または false を設定し、その後 "
"point と mark の間の領域を削除します。これは直前の yank によって挿入されたば"
"かりの領域であり、置換対象となるのはこのテキストです。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/yank_002dpop.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">funcall</code> calls its first argument as a function, "
"passing remaining arguments to it.  The first argument is whatever the <code "
"class=\"code\">or</code> expression returns.  The two remaining arguments "
"are the positions of point and mark set by the preceding <code "
"class=\"code\">yank</code> command."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">funcall</code> は第1引数を関数として呼び出し、残りの引数"
"をその関数に渡します。第1引数は、<code class=\"code\">or</code> 式が返す値で"
"す。残りの2つの引数は、直前の <code class=\"code\">yank</code> コマンドで設定"
"された point と mark の位置です。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/yank_002dpop.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "There is more, but that is the hardest part."
msgstr "他にもあるが、そこが一番難しいところだ。"

