"class=\"copiable-link\" href=\"#The-Body-of-zap_002dto_002dchar\"> &para;</"
"a></span>"
msgstr ""
"<span>8.1.2 <code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code><a class=\"copiable-"
"link\" href=\"#The-Body-of-zap_002dto_002dchar\"> &para;</a> の本文</span>"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/zap_002dto_002dchar-body.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"The body of the <code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code> function contains "
"the code that kills (that is, removes) the text in the region from the "
"current position of the cursor up to and including the specified character."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code> 関数の本体には、カーソルの現在位置か"
"ら指定された文字まで（その文字を含む）の範囲にあるテキストを消去（すなわち削"
"除）するコードが含まれています。"

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><p>
#: build/html/eintr/zap_002dto_002dchar-body.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid "The first part of the code looks like this:"
msgstr "コードの前半部分は次のようになっています。"

#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><br><br><br><br><br><hr><div><hr><div><hr><div><div><pre>
#: build/html/eintr/zap_002dto_002dchar-body.html build/html/mono/eintr.html
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"(if (char-table-p translation-table-for-input)\n"
"    (setq char (or (aref translation-table-for-input char) char)))\n"
"(kill-region (point) (progn\n"
"                       (search-forward (char-to-string char) nil nil arg)\n"
"                       (point)))\n"
msgstr ""

# Machine-translated by PLaMo Translate.
#. type: Content of: <html><body><div><hr><p>
#: build/html/eintr/zap_002dto_002dchar-body.html
msgid ""
"<code class=\"code\">char-table-p</code> is a hitherto unseen function.  It "
"determines whether its argument is a character table.  When it is, it sets "
"the character passed to <code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code> to one of "
"them, if that character exists, or to the character itself.  (This becomes "
"important for certain characters in non-European languages.  The <code "
"class=\"code\">aref</code> function extracts an element from an array.  It "
"is an array-specific function that is not described in this document.  See "
"<a data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
"html_node/elisp/Arrays.html#Arrays\">Arrays</a> in <cite class=\"cite\">The "
"GNU Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite>.)"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"code\">char-table-p</code> はこれまで見られなかった関数です。こ"
"れは、引数が文字テーブルであるかどうかを判定します。文字テーブルである場合、"
"<code class=\"code\">zap-to-char</code> に渡された文字が存在すればそのいずれ"
"かを、存在しなければその文字自体を設定します。（これは、非ヨーロッパ言語の特"
"定の文字において重要になります。<code class=\"code\">aref</code> 関数は配列か"
"ら要素を抽出します。これは配列専用の関数であり、本ドキュメントでは説明しませ"
"ん。<cite class=\"cite\">The GNU Emacs Lisp Reference Manual</cite> の <a "
"data-manual=\"elisp\" href=\"https://www.gnu.org/software/emacs/manual/"
