msgid ""
"The next line is <code class=\"code\">(goto-char (point-min))</code>.  This "
"expression jumps the cursor to the minimum point in the buffer, that is, to "
"the beginning of the buffer (or to the beginning of the accessible portion "
"of the buffer if it is narrowed.  See <a class=\"xref\" href=\"#Narrowing-"
"_0026-Widening\">Narrowing and Widening</a>.)"
msgstr "次の行は <code class=\"code\">(goto-char (point-min))</code> です。この式は、カーソルをバッファ内の最小点、すなわちバッファの先頭（バッファが狭められている場合は、アクセス可能な部分の先頭）に移動させます（<a class=\"xref\" href=\"#Narrowing-_0026-Widening\">狭めと広げ</a>を参照）。"

