msgid ""
"The lower case &lsquo;<samp class=\"samp\">p</samp>&rsquo; in the <code "
"class=\"code\">interactive</code> declaration means that the processed "
"prefix argument, if any, is passed to the function.  This will be a number, "
"and is the repeat count of how many paragraphs point will move.  The <code "
"class=\"code\">or</code> expression in the next line handles the common case "
"when no argument is passed to the function, which occurs if the function is "
