#: build/html/mono/eintr.html
msgid ""
"You may want to walk through this function slowly, as we did with the <code "
"class=\"code\">forward-sentence</code> function.  (See <a class=\"xref\" "
"href=\"#forward_002dsentence\">The <code class=\"code\">forward-sentence</"
